إم سي بي","en":"airtable-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Airtable自动化技能包通过Rube MCP实现Airtable操作的自动化，简化开发流程","ja":"Airtable自動化スキルパックはRube MCPを使用してAirtable操作を自動化し、開発プロセスを簡素化する","ko":"에어테이블 자동화 스킬 패키지는 Rube MCP를 사용하여 에어테이블 운영을 자동화하고 개발 프로세스를 단순화합니다","es":"La automatización de Airtable con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores simplificar sus flujos de trabajo. Conecta Rube MCP y Airtable para mejorar tu produ...","fr":"L''automatisation d''Airtable avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs de simplifier leurs flux de travail. Connectez Rube MCP et Airtable pour améliorer votre pr...","de":"Die Automatisierung von Airtable mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, ihre Arbeitsabläufe zu vereinfachen. Verbinden Sie Rube MCP und Airtable, um Ihre Pr...","pt":"Automatize operações do Airtable com o toolkit da Composio via Rube MCP, conectando e usando de forma eficaz.","ru":"Автоматизируйте операции Airtable с помощью инструментария Composio через Rube MCP, подключая и используя эффективно.","ar":"أتمتة عمليات ايرتبل باستخدام أدوات كومبوسيو عبر روب إم سي بي، وتوصيل واستخدام فعال","en":"Drop-in skill pack that turns any AI coding agent into a full engineering team."},"definition":{"en":"Drop-in skill pack that turns any AI coding agent into a full engineering team."},"features":{"zh":["通过Rube MCP自动化Airtable操作","使用Composio的Airtable工具包","无需API密钥，简单配置","支持多种开发语言","提高开发效率，简化流程"],"ja":["Rube MCPを使用してAirtable操作を自動化する","ComposioのAirtableツールキットを使用する","APIキーなし、簡単な設定","複数の開発言語をサポートする","開発効率を向上させ、プロセスを簡素化する"],"ko":["Rube MCP를 사용하여 에어테이블 운영을 자동화합니다","Composio의 에어테이블 툴킷을 사용합니다","API 키가 필요하지 않으며, 단순한 설정","여러 개발 언어를 지원합니다","개발 효율성을 높이고 프로세스를 단순화합니다"],"es":["Conexión a Rube MCP","Automatización de operaciones en Airtable","Uso de la herramienta de Composio","Mejora de la productividad","Simplificación de flujos de trabajo","Integración con Airtable"],"fr":["Connexion à Rube MCP","Automatisation des opérations Airtable","Utilisation de l''outil Composio","Amélioration de la productivité","Simplification des flux de travail","Intégration avec Airtable"],"de":["Verbindung mit Rube MCP","Automatisierung von Airtable-Operationen","Verwendung des Composio-Tools","Steigerung der Produktivität","Vereinfachung von Arbeitsabläufen","Integration mit Airtable"],"pt":["Conexão com Rube MCP","Uso do toolkit da Composio","Automação de operações do Airtable","Configuração fácil","Sem necessidade de chaves de API"],"ru":["Подключение к Rube MCP","Использование инструментария Composio","Автоматизация операций Airtable","Простая настройка","Нет необходимости в ключах API"],"ar":["التوصيل بروب إم سي بي","استخدام أدوات كومبوسيو","أتمتة عمليات ايرتبل","إعداد سهل","لا حاجة لمفاتيح واجهة البرمجة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Airtable自动化","Rube MCP","Composio","Airtable工具包","自动化开发","开发效率","简化流程"],"ja":["Airtable自動化","Rube MCP","Composio","Airtableツールキット","自動化開発","開発効率","簡素化プロセス"],"ko":["에어테이블 자동화","Rube MCP","Composio","에어테이블 툴킷","자동화 개발","개발 효율성","단순화 프로세스"],"es":["automatización de Airtable","Rube MCP","Composio","desarrollo de software","productividad","flujos de trabajo","integración con Airtable","herramientas de automatización","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["automatisation d''Airtable","Rube MCP","Composio","développement de logiciels","productivité","flux de travail","intégration avec Airtable","outils d''automatisation","développement d''applications"],"de":["Automatisierung von Airtable","Rube MCP","Composio","Softwareentwicklung","Produktivität","Arbeitsabläufe","Integration mit Airtable","Automatisierungstools","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Airtable Automation","Rube MCP","Composio","Automação de operações","Conexão com Rube MCP","Toolkit da Composio"],"ru":["Автоматизация Airtable","Rube MCP","Composio","Автоматизация операций","Подключение к Rube MCP","Инструментарий Composio"],"ar":["أتمتة ايرتبل","روب إم سي بي","كومبوسيو","أتمتة عمليات","التوصيل بروب إم سي بي","أدوات كومبوسيو"]}},"owner":"SamarthaKV29","repo":"antigravity-god-mode","repoPath":"SamarthaKV29/antigravity-god-mode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.537Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"airtable-automation","description":"Automate Airtable tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): records, bases, tables, fields, views. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Airtable Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Airtable connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `airtable`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it wor","body":"# Airtable Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Airtable connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `airtable`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `airtable`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Airtable auth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Create and Manage Records\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create, read, update, or delete records\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_LIST_BASES` - Discover available bases [Prerequisite]\n2. `AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA` - Inspect table structure [Prerequisite]\n3. `AIRTABLE_LIST_RECORDS` - List/filter records [Optional]\n4. `AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORD` / `AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORDS` - Create records [Optional]\n5. `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_RECORD` / `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS` - Update records [Optional]\n6. `AIRTABLE_DELETE_RECORD` / `AIRTABLE_DELETE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS` - Delete records [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `baseId`: Base ID (starts with ''app'', e.g., ''appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX'')\n- `tableIdOrName`: Table ID (starts with ''tbl'') or table name\n- `fields`: Object mapping field names to values\n- `recordId`: Record ID (starts with ''rec'') for updates/deletes\n- `filterByFormula`: Airtable formula for filtering\n- `typecast`: Set true for automatic type conversion\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- pageSize capped at 100; uses offset pagination; changing filters between pages can skip/duplicate rows\n- CREATE_RECORDS hard limit of 10 records per request; chunk larger imports\n- Field names are CASE-SENSITIVE and must match schema exactly\n- 422 UNKNOWN_FIELD_NAME when field names are wrong; 403 for permission issues\n- INVALID_MULTIPLE_CHOICE_OPTIONS may require typecast=true\n\n### 2. Search and Filter Records\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find specific records using formulas\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA` - Verify field names and types [Prerequisite]\n2. `AIRTABLE_LIST_RECORDS` - Query with filterByFormula [Required]\n3. `AIRTABLE_GET_RECORD` - Get full record details [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `filterByFormula`: Airtable formula (e.g., `{Status}=''Done''`)\n- `sort`: Array of sort objects\n- `fields`: Array of field names to return\n- `maxRecords`: Max total records across all pages\n- `offset`: Pagination cursor from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Field names in formulas must be wrapped in `{}` and match schema exactly\n- String values must be quoted: `{Status}=''Active''` not `{Status}=Active`\n- 422 INVALID_FILTER_BY_FORMULA for bad syntax or non-existent fields\n- Airtable rate limit: ~5 requests/second per base; handle 429 with Retry-After\n\n### 3. Manage Fields and Schema\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create or modify table fields\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA` - Inspect current schema [Prerequisite]\n2. `AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD` - Create a new field [Optional]\n3. `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_FIELD` - Rename/describe a field [Optional]\n4. `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_TABLE` - Update table metadata [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Field name\n- `type`: Field type (singleLineText, number, singleSelect, etc.)\n- `options`: Type-specific options (choices for select, precision for number)\n- `description`: Field description\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- UPDATE_FIELD only changes name/description, NOT type/options; create a replacement field and migrate\n- Computed fields (formula, rollup, lookup) cannot be created via API\n- 422 when type options are missing or malformed\n\n### 4. Manage Comments\n\n**When to use**: User wants to view or add comments on records\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_LIST_COMMENTS` - List comments on a record [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `baseId`: Base ID\n- `tableIdOrName`: Table identifier\n- `recordId`: Record ID (17 chars, starts with ''rec'')\n- `pageSize`: Comments per page (max 100)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Record IDs must be exactly 17 characters starting with ''rec''\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Airtable Formula Syntax\n\n**Comparison**:\n- `{Status}=''Done''` - Equals\n- `{Priority}>1` - Greater than\n- `{Name}!=''''` - Not empty\n\n**Functions**:\n- `AND({A}=''x'', {B}=''y'')` - Both conditions\n- `OR({A}=''x'', {A}=''y'')` - Either condition\n- `FIND(''test'', {Name})>0` - Contains text\n- `IS_BEFORE({Due Date}, TODAY())` - Date comparison\n\n**Escape rules**:\n- Single quotes in values: double them (`{Name}=''John''''s Company''`)\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Set `pageSize` (max 100)\n- Check response for `offset` string\n- Pass `offset` to next request unchanged\n- Keep filters/sorts/view stable between pages\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**ID Formats**:\n- Base IDs: `appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n- Table IDs: `tblXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n- Record IDs: `recXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n- Field IDs: `fldXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n\n**Batch Limits**:\n- CREATE_RECORDS: max 10 per request\n- UPDATE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS: max 10 per request\n- DELETE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS: max 10 per request\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List bases | AIRTABLE_LIST_BASES | (none) |\n| Get schema | AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA | baseId |\n| List records | AIRTABLE_LIST_RECORDS | baseId, tableIdOrName |\n| Get record | AIRTABLE_GET_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId |\n| Create record | AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, fields |\n| Create records | AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORDS | baseId, tableIdOrName, records |\n| Update record | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId, fields |\n| Update records | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS | baseId, tableIdOrName, records |\n| Delete record | AIRTABLE_DELETE_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId |\n| Create field | AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD | baseId, tableIdOrName, name, type |\n| Update field | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_FIELD | baseId, tableIdOrName, fieldId |\n| Update table | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_TABLE | baseId, tableIdOrName, name |\n| List comments | AIRTABLE_LIST_COMMENTS | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T20:54:25.073Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP","zh":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP","ja":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP","ko":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP","es":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP","fr":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP","de":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP","pt":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP","ru":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP","ar":"Perfect for AI coding agents needing advanced Airtable automation capabilities via Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management","zh":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management","ja":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management","ko":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management","es":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management","fr":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management","de":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management","pt":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management","ru":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management","ar":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient data management"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"],"zh":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"],"ja":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"],"ko":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"],"es":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"],"fr":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"],"de":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"],"pt":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"],"ru":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"],"ar":["Automating Airtable workflows","Streamlining data entry via Airtable API","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Rube MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"zh":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"ja":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"ko":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"es":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"fr":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"de":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"pt":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"ru":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"],"ar":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to get current tool schemas"]},