n tiempo real","Integración con GreptimeDB","Mejora del rendimiento de las aplicaciones"],"fr":["Agrégation de données en temps réel","Traitement de flux de données","Création de vues materialisées","Analyse de données en temps réel","Intégration avec GreptimeDB","Amélioration des performances des applications"],"de":["Echtzeit-Aggregation von Daten","Verarbeitung von Datenflüssen","Erstellung von materialisierten Ansichten","Echtzeit-Analyse von Daten","Integration mit GreptimeDB","Leistungsverbesserung von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Agregação baseada em janelas de tempo em tempo real","Mecanismo de processamento de fluxo leve","Criação de definições de fluxo personalizadas","Integração com o GreptimeDB","Suporte a stream computing e materialized view"],"ru":["Агрегация на основе временных окон в режиме реального времени","Легкий механизм потоковой обработки","Создание пользовательских определений потока","Интеграция с GreptimeDB","Поддержка stream computing и materialized view"],"ar":["التحليل التجميعي القائم على النوافذ الزمنية في الوقت الفعلي","μηχανيزم معالجة التدفق الخفيف","إنشاء تعريفات التدفق المخصصة","التكامل مع قاعدة بيانات Greptime","دعم الحوسبة المتدفقة والتعريف المادي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GreptimeDB","流计算引擎","实时数据处理","时间窗口聚合","轻量级流计算","流计算","物化视图"],"ja":["GreptimeDB","フローコンピューティングエンジン","リアルタイムデータ処理","時間_window_集計","軽量ストリーミング","ストリーミングコンピューティング","マテリアライズドビュー"],"ko":["GreptimeDB","流 컴퓨팅 엔진","실시간 데이터 처리","시간 창별 집계","가벼운 스트리밍","스트리밍 컴퓨팅","물화된 뷰"],"es":["GreptimeDB Flow","agregación de datos en tiempo real","procesamiento de flujos de datos","vistas materializadas","análisis de datos en tiempo real","desarrollo de aplicaciones","bases de datos en tiempo real","ingeniería de datos","arquitectura de datos"],"fr":["GreptimeDB Flow","agrégation de données en temps réel","traitement de flux de données","vues materialisées","analyse de données en temps réel","développement d''applications","bases de données en temps réel","ingénierie de données","architecture de données"],"de":["GreptimeDB Flow","Echtzeit-Aggregation von Daten","Verarbeitung von Datenflüssen","materialisierte Ansichten","Echtzeit-Analyse von Daten","Anwendungsentwicklung","Echtzeit-Datenbanken","Dateningenieurwesen","Datenarchitektur"],"pt":["GreptimeDB","fluxo de dados","agregação em tempo real","janelas de tempo","stream computing","materialized view","processamento de fluxo leve"],"ru":["GreptimeDB","поток данных","агрегация в режиме реального времени","временные окна","stream computing","materialized view","легкий механизм потоковой обработки"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات Greptime","تدفق البيانات","التحليل التجميعي في الوقت الفعلي","النوافذ الزمنية","الحوسبة المتدفقة","التعريف المادي","μηχανيزم معالجة التدفق الخفيف"]}},"owner":"GreptimeTeam","repo":"docs","repoPath":"GreptimeTeam/docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.537Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"greptimedb-flow","description":"Guide for creating GreptimeDB flow tasks, for generates materialized view for continuous aggregation.","bodyPreview":"# GreptimeDB Flow Guide\n\nCreate GreptimeDB flow definition to do time window based aggregation on the fly\nwhile data ingested into GreptimeDB. This is how GreptimeDB''s lightweight\nstreaming engine works.\n\nFlow is also known as:\n\n1. Stream computing\n2. Materialized View\n3. Continuous aggregation\n\n## The workflow\n\nTo create GreptimeDB flow task, we should follow these phases:\n\n### Phase 1. Learn and understand GreptimeDB Flow\n\nFirst, we read GreptimeDB flow definitions and how it works from the\ndo","body":"# GreptimeDB Flow Guide\n\nCreate GreptimeDB flow definition to do time window based aggregation on the fly\nwhile data ingested into GreptimeDB. This is how GreptimeDB''s lightweight\nstreaming engine works.\n\nFlow is also known as:\n\n1. Stream computing\n2. Materialized View\n3. Continuous aggregation\n\n## The workflow\n\nTo create GreptimeDB flow task, we should follow these phases:\n\n### Phase 1. Learn and understand GreptimeDB Flow\n\nFirst, we read GreptimeDB flow definitions and how it works from the\ndocumentation.\n\nThere are doc pages available, use WebFetch to load and understand them:\n\n1. Overview and quick example:\n   https://docs.greptime.com/user-guide/flow-computation/overview/\n2. Examples for continuous aggregation:\n   https://docs.greptime.com/user-guide/flow-computation/continuous-aggregation/\n3. SQL DDL for flow, sink table and related concepts:\n   https://docs.greptime.com/user-guide/flow-computation/manage-flow/\n\n### Phase 2. Create flow tasks\n\nWe should try to understand:\n\n1. time window the user wants to use\n2. aggregation fields and group-by rules\n\nCreate the flow and sink table DDL. Note that we will always provide `CREATE\nTABLE` statement for sink table, together with the `CREATE FLOW` statement\nbecause it''s required.\n\n### Phase 3. Verify the tasks\n\nIf greptimedb-mcp-server is available, we can use its `execute_sql` tools to\nexecute the DDL. Try to generate some sample data, insert into source table,\nthen verify the sink table via SQL SELECT statements. We can use MySQL style\nSELECT statements on GreptimeDB for most cases.\n\n## Reference\n\n1. Aggregation functions of Flow:\n   https://docs.greptime.com/user-guide/flow-computation/expressions/\n2. A full list of aggregation functions\n   https://docs.greptime.com/reference/sql/functions/df-functions/#aggregate-functions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T23:55:34.823Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Time Series Analysis Agents needing advanced stream computing capabilities with GreptimeDB","zh":"非常适合需要使用GreptimeDB进行高级流计算的时间序列分析代理","ja":"GreptimeDBを使用した高度なストリームコンピューティング機能を必要とする時間シリーズ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"GreptimeDB를 사용한 고급 스트림 컴퓨팅 기능이 필요한 시간 시리즈 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de series temporales que necesitan capacidades de computación de flujo avanzadas con GreptimeDB","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de séries chronologiques nécessitant des capacités de calcul de flux avancées avec GreptimeDB","de":"Perfekt für Time-Reihen-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Stream-Computing-Funktionen mit GreptimeDB benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Séries Temporais que necessitam de capacidades de computação de fluxo avançadas com GreptimeDB","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа временных рядов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности потоковой обработки с GreptimeDB","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل السلاسل الزمنية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات الحوسبة المتقدمة للتدفق مع GreptimeDB"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform time window based aggregation on the fly using GreptimeDB''s lightweight streaming engine, enabling continuous aggregation and materialized views with stream computing protocols","zh":"使代理能够使用GreptimeDB的轻量级流媒体引擎实时执行基于时间窗口的聚合，从而实现连续聚合和物化视图以及流计算协议","ja":"エージェントがGreptimeDBの軽量ストリーミングエンジンを使用してリアルタイムで時間ウィンドウベースの集約を実行できるようにし、連続集約とマテリアライズドビュー、およびストリームコンピューティングプロトコルを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 GreptimeDB의 경량 스트리밍 엔진을 사용하여 실시간으로 시간 창 기반 집계를 수행할 수 있도록 해줌으로써 연속 집계와 물화된 뷰 및 스트림 컴퓨팅 프로토콜을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar agregaciones basadas en ventanas de tiempo en tiempo real utilizando el motor de flujo ligero de GreptimeDB, lo que permite la agregación continua y las vistas materializadas con protocolos de computación de flujo","fr":"Permet aux agents de effectuer des agrégations basées sur des fenêtres de temps en temps réel en utilisant le moteur de flux léger de GreptimeDB, permettant ainsi l''agrégation continue et les vues materialisées avec des protocoles de calcul de flux","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Zeitfenster-basierte Aggregationen in Echtzeit mit GreptimeDBs leichtem Streaming-Engine durchzuführen, wodurch kontinuierliche Aggregation und materialisierte Ansichten mit Stream-Computing-Protokollen ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar agregação baseada em janela de tempo em tempo real usando o motor de streaming leve do GreptimeDB, permitindo agregação contínua e vistas materializadas com protocolos de computação de fluxo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять агрегацию на основе временного окна на лету с помощью легкого потокового движка GreptimeDB, обеспечивая непрерывную агрегацию и материализованные представления с протоколами потоковой обработки","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أداء التجميع القائم على نافذة زمنية في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام محرك البث الخفيف من GreptimeDB، مما يتيح التجميع المستمر والمناظير الماديّة مع بروتوكولات الحوسبة المتدفقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating GreptimeDB flow definitions for real-time data ingestion","Implementing continuous aggregation for time series data","Building materialized views for efficient data querying"],"zh":["为实时数据摄取创建GreptimeDB流定义","实现时间序列数据的连续聚合","构建物化视图以高效查询数据"],"ja":["リアルタイムデータの取り込みのためにGreptimeDBフロー定義を作成する","時間シリーズデータの連続集約を実装する","効率的なデータ照会のためにマテリアライズドビューを構築する"],"ko":["실시간 데이터 수집을 위한 GreptimeDB 흐름 정의を作成","시간 시리즈 데이터에 대한 연속 집계 구현","효율적인 데이터 쿼리를 위한 물화된 뷰 구축"],"es":["Creación de definiciones de flujo de GreptimeDB para la ingesta de datos en tiempo real","Implementación de la agregación continua para datos de series temporales","Creación de vistas materializadas para una consulta de datos eficiente"],"fr":["Création de définitions de flux GreptimeDB pour l''ingestion de données en temps réel","Mise en œuvre de l''agrégation continue pour les données de séries chronologiques","Création de vues materialisées pour une interrogation de données efficace"],"de":["Erstellung von GreptimeDB-Flussdefinitionen für die Echtzeit-Dateneinbringung","Implementierung der kontinuierlichen Aggregation für Zeitreihendaten","Erstellung von materialisierten Ansichten für eine effiziente Datenabfrage"],"pt":["Criar definições de fluxo do GreptimeDB para ingestão de dados em tempo real","Implementar agregação contínua para dados de séries temporais","Construir vistas materializadas para consulta de dados eficiente"],"ru":["Создание определений потока GreptimeDB для реального времени ингести данных","Реализация непрерывной агрегации для данных временных рядов","Построение материализованных представлений для эффективного запроса данных"],"ar":["إنشاء تعريفات تدفق GreptimeDB لاستيعاب البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","تنفيذ التجميع المستمر للبيانات السلسلة الزمنية","بناء مناظير ماديّة لاستعلام البيانات الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GreptimeDB setup and configuration","Limited to time series data and GreptimeDB''s streaming engine capabilities"],"zh":["需要GreptimeDB的设置和配置","仅限于时间序列数据和GreptimeDB的流媒体引擎能力"],"ja":["GreptimeDBの設定と構成が必要","時間シリーズデータとGreptimeDBのストリーミングエンジンの機能に限定"],"ko":["GreptimeDB 설정 및 구성이 필요","시간 시리즈 데이터 및 GreptimeDB의 스트리밍 엔진 기능에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración y configuración de GreptimeDB","Limitado a datos de series temporales y capacidades del motor de flujo de GreptimeDB"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration et la configuration de GreptimeDB","Limité aux données de séries chronologiques et aux capacités du moteur de flux de GreptimeDB"],"de":["Benötigt GreptimeDB-Setup und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Zeitreihendaten und GreptimeDBs Streaming-Engine-Funktionen"],"pt":["Requer configuração e instalação do GreptimeDB","Limitado a dados de séries temporais e capacidades do motor de streaming do GreptimeDB"],"ru":["Требует настройки и конфигурации GreptimeDB","Ограничен данными временных рядов и возможностями потокового движка GreptimeDB"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد وتكوين GreptimeDB","محدود بالبيانات السلسلة الزمنية وسمات محرك البث من GreptimeDB"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('boisenoise/skills-collections/airtable-automation', 'community', 'boisenoise', 'skills-collections', 'boisenoise/skills-collections', 'airtable-automation', 0, 0, 25, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.537Z', '2026-02-18T23:55:39.279Z', NULL, '{"id":"boisenoise/skills-collections/airtable-automation","name":"airtable-automation","description":{"zh":"Airtable ","ja":"Airtable","ko":"Airtable ","es":"La automatización de Airtable con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores simplificar tareas y mejorar la eficiencia. Conecta y configura para empezar.","fr":"L''automatisation d''Airtable avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs de simplifier les tâches et d''améliorer l''efficacité. Connectez et configurez pour commencer.","de":"Die Airtable-Automatisierung mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Aufgaben zu vereinfachen und die Effizienz zu verbessern. Verbinden und konfigurieren Sie, um zu beginnen.","pt":"Automação de operações no Airtable via Rube MCP. Configure a conexão e aprenda a utilizar o toolkit da Composio.","ru":"Автоматизация операций в Airtable через Rube MCP. Настройте соединение и изучите инструментарий Composio.","ar":"توفير تطبيقات إيرتаблиц تلقائيًا عبر روب إم سي بي. قم بإعداد الاتصال وتعلم استخدام أداة كومبوسيو.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Airtable ","ja":"Airtable","ko":"Airtable ","es":"Automatización de Airtable con Rube MCP","fr":"Automatisation d''Airtable avec Rube MCP","de":"Airtable-Automatisierung mit Rube MCP","pt":"Automação Airtable via Rube MCP","ru":"Автоматизация Airtable через Rube MCP","ar":"توتير تطبيق إيرتаблиц عبر روب إم سي بي","en":"airtable-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Airtable ","ja":"Airtable","ko":"Airtable ","es":"La automatización de Airtable con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores simplificar tareas y mejorar la eficiencia. Conecta y configura para empezar.","fr":"L''automatisation d''Airtable avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs de simplifier les tâches et d''améliorer l''efficacité. Connectez et configurez pour commencer.","de":"Die Airtable-Automatisierung mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Aufgaben zu vereinfachen und die Effizienz zu verbessern. Verbinden und konfigurieren Si...","pt":"Automação de operações no Airtable via Rube MCP. Configure a conexão e aprenda a utilizar o toolkit da Composio.","ru":"Автоматизация операций в Airtable через Rube MCP. Настройте соединение и изучите инструментарий Composio.","ar":"توفير تطبيقات إيرتаблиц تلقائيًا عبر روب إم سي بي. قم بإعداد الاتصال وتعلم استخدام أداة كومبوسيو.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"zh":["Airtable ","Rube MCP","API","Airtable","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ja":["Airtable","Rube MCP","API","Airtable","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"ko":["Airtable ","Rube MCP","API","Airtable","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"],"es":["Conexión a Rube MCP","Herramienta de automatización de Airtable","Configuración sencilla","Mejora de la productividad","Tareas automatizadas","Integración con Airtable"],"fr":["Connexion à Rube MCP","Outil d''automatisation d''Airtable","Configuration simple","Amélioration de la productivité","Tâches automatisées","Intégration avec Airtable"],"de":["Verbindung mit Rube MCP","Airtable-Automatisierungstool","Einfache Konfiguration","Produktivitätssteigerung","Automatisierte Aufgaben","Integration mit Airtable"],"pt":["Automação de operações no Airtable","Conexão via Rube MCP","Utilização do toolkit da Composio","Configuração simples","Sem necessidade de chaves de API"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций в Airtable","Соединение через Rube MCP","Использование инструментария Composio","Простая настройка","Не требуется ключи API"],"ar":["توفير تطبيقات إيرتаблиц تلقائيًا","اتصال عبر روب إم سي بي","استخدام أداة كومبوسيو","إعدادات بسيطة","لا حاجة لمفاتيح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Airtable ","Rube MCP","Airtable API","Airtable ","automation","Airtable"],"ja":["Airtable","Rube MCP","Airtable API","Airtable","automation","Airtable"],"ko":["Airtable ","Rube MCP","Airtable API","Airtable ","automation","Airtable"],"es":["automatización de airtable","rube mcp","desarrollo de airtable","herramientas de automatización","productividad en airtable","tareas automatizadas","integración con airtable","configuración de airtable"],"fr":["automatisation d''airtable","rube mcp","développement d''airtable","outils d''automatisation","productivité dans airtable","tâches automatisées","intégration avec airtable","configuration d''airtable"],"de":["airtable-automatisierung","rube mcp","airtable-entwicklung","automatisierungstools","produktivität in airtable","automatisierte aufgaben","integration mit airtable","airtable-konfiguration"],"pt":["automação airtable","rube mcp","composio","toolkit airtable","automatizar operações","conexão airtable","desenvolvimento de software","integração de api"],"ru":["автоматизация airtable","rube mcp","composio","инструментарий airtable","автоматизировать операции","соединение airtable","разработка программного обеспечения","интеграция api"],"ar":["توتير تطبيق إيرتаблиц","روب إم سي بي","كومبوسيو","أداة إيرتаблиц","توفير تطبيقات تلقائيًا","اتصال إيرتаблиц","تطوير البرمجيات","دمج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.537Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"airtable-automation","description":"Automate Airtable tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): records, bases, tables, fields, views. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Airtable Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Airtable connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `airtable`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it wor","body":"# Airtable Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Airtable connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `airtable`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `airtable`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Airtable auth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Create and Manage Records\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create, read, update, or delete records\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_LIST_BASES` - Discover available bases [Prerequisite]\n2. `AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA` - Inspect table structure [Prerequisite]\n3. `AIRTABLE_LIST_RECORDS` - List/filter records [Optional]\n4. `AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORD` / `AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORDS` - Create records [Optional]\n5. `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_RECORD` / `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS` - Update records [Optional]\n6. `AIRTABLE_DELETE_RECORD` / `AIRTABLE_DELETE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS` - Delete records [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `baseId`: Base ID (starts with ''app'', e.g., ''appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX'')\n- `tableIdOrName`: Table ID (starts with ''tbl'') or table name\n- `fields`: Object mapping field names to values\n- `recordId`: Record ID (starts with ''rec'') for updates/deletes\n- `filterByFormula`: Airtable formula for filtering\n- `typecast`: Set true for automatic type conversion\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- pageSize capped at 100; uses offset pagination; changing filters between pages can skip/duplicate rows\n- CREATE_RECORDS hard limit of 10 records per request; chunk larger imports\n- Field names are CASE-SENSITIVE and must match schema exactly\n- 422 UNKNOWN_FIELD_NAME when field names are wrong; 403 for permission issues\n- INVALID_MULTIPLE_CHOICE_OPTIONS may require typecast=true\n\n### 2. Search and Filter Records\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find specific records using formulas\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA` - Verify field names and types [Prerequisite]\n2. `AIRTABLE_LIST_RECORDS` - Query with filterByFormula [Required]\n3. `AIRTABLE_GET_RECORD` - Get full record details [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `filterByFormula`: Airtable formula (e.g., `{Status}=''Done''`)\n- `sort`: Array of sort objects\n- `fields`: Array of field names to return\n- `maxRecords`: Max total records across all pages\n- `offset`: Pagination cursor from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Field names in formulas must be wrapped in `{}` and match schema exactly\n- String values must be quoted: `{Status}=''Active''` not `{Status}=Active`\n- 422 INVALID_FILTER_BY_FORMULA for bad syntax or non-existent fields\n- Airtable rate limit: ~5 requests/second per base; handle 429 with Retry-After\n\n### 3. Manage Fields and Schema\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create or modify table fields\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA` - Inspect current schema [Prerequisite]\n2. `AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD` - Create a new field [Optional]\n3. `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_FIELD` - Rename/describe a field [Optional]\n4. `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_TABLE` - Update table metadata [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Field name\n- `type`: Field type (singleLineText, number, singleSelect, etc.)\n- `options`: Type-specific options (choices for select, precision for number)\n- `description`: Field description\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- UPDATE_FIELD only changes name/description, NOT type/options; create a replacement field and migrate\n- Computed fields (formula, rollup, lookup) cannot be created via API\n- 422 when type options are missing or malformed\n\n### 4. Manage Comments\n\n**When to use**: User wants to view or add comments on records\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_LIST_COMMENTS` - List comments on a record [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `baseId`: Base ID\n- `tableIdOrName`: Table identifier\n- `recordId`: Record ID (17 chars, starts with ''rec'')\n- `pageSize`: Comments per page (max 100)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Record IDs must be exactly 17 characters starting with ''rec''\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Airtable Formula Syntax\n\n**Comparison**:\n- `{Status}=''Done''` - Equals\n- `{Priority}>1` - Greater than\n- `{Name}!=''''` - Not empty\n\n**Functions**:\n- `AND({A}=''x'', {B}=''y'')` - Both conditions\n- `OR({A}=''x'', {A}=''y'')` - Either condition\n- `FIND(''test'', {Name})>0` - Contains text\n- `IS_BEFORE({Due Date}, TODAY())` - Date comparison\n\n**Escape rules**:\n- Single quotes in values: double them (`{Name}=''John''''s Company''`)\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Set `pageSize` (max 100)\n- Check response for `offset` string\n- Pass `offset` to next request unchanged\n- Keep filters/sorts/view stable between pages\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**ID Formats**:\n- Base IDs: `appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n- Table IDs: `tblXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n- Record IDs: `recXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n- Field IDs: `fldXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n\n**Batch Limits**:\n- CREATE_RECORDS: max 10 per request\n- UPDATE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS: max 10 per request\n- DELETE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS: max 10 per request\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List bases | AIRTABLE_LIST_BASES | (none) |\n| Get schema | AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA | baseId |\n| List records | AIRTABLE_LIST_RECORDS | baseId, tableIdOrName |\n| Get record | AIRTABLE_GET_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId |\n| Create record | AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, fields |\n| Create records | AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORDS | baseId, tableIdOrName, records |\n| Update record | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId, fields |\n| Update records | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS | baseId, tableIdOrName, records |\n| Delete record | AIRTABLE_DELETE_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId |\n| Create field | AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD | baseId, tableIdOrName, name, type |\n| Update field | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_FIELD | baseId, tableIdOrName, fieldId |\n| Update table | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_TABLE | baseId, tableIdOrName, name |\n| List comments | AIRTABLE_LIST_COMMENTS | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T23:55:39.279Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing seamless Airtable integration via Rube MCP for advanced workflow automation.","zh":"非常适合需要通过Rube MCP实现无缝Airtable集成的自动化代理，用于高级工作流自动化。","ja":"Rube MCPを介してAirtableをシームレスに統合する必要がある自動化エージェントに最適です。高度なワークフローオートメーションに使用されます。","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 Airtable을无缝하게 통합해야 하는 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다. 고급 워크플로 자동화에 사용됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización que necesitan una integración perfecta con Airtable a través de Rube MCP para una automatización de flujo de trabajo avanzada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant une intégration transparente d''Airtable via Rube MCP pour une automatisation de workflow avancée.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Airtable-Integration über Rube MCP für eine erweiterte Workflow-Automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de integração perfeita com o Airtable via Rube MCP para automação de fluxo de trabalho avançada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с Airtable через Rube MCP для продвинутой автоматизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التutomatiون الذي يحتاج إلى دمج متكامل مع Airtable عبر Rube MCP من أجل تautomatiو نjobs المتقدمة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for efficient workflow management, all while leveraging the power of Airtable''s data management capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理人通过Composio的Airtable工具包自动化Airtable操作的能力，利用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS和RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS进行高效的工作流管理，同时利用Airtable的数据管理能力。","ja":"エージェントにComposioのAirtableツールキットを使用してAirtable操作を自動化する能力を与え、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSとRUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを利用して効率的なワークフローマネジメントを行い、同時にAirtableのデータ管理機能を活用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 Composio의 Airtable 툴킷을 사용하여 Airtable 작업을 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 활용하여 효율적인 워크플로 관리를 수행하며,同時に Airtable의 데이터 관리 기능을利用합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de Airtable a través de la herramienta de Airtable de Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una gestión de flujo de trabajo eficiente, aprovechando al mismo tiempo el poder de las capacidades de gestión de datos de Airtable.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations Airtable via la boîte à outils Airtable de Composio, en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une gestion de flux de travail efficace, tout en exploitant le pouvoir des capacités de gestion de données d''Airtable.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Airtable-Operationen über Composios Airtable-Toolkit zu automatisieren, indem RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung verwendet werden, während gleichzeitig die Leistungsfähigkeit von Airtables Datenmanagementfunktionen genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações do Airtable por meio da ferramenta Airtable da Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para gestão eficiente de fluxo de trabalho, aproveitando todo o poder das capacidades de gerenciamento de dados do Airtable.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции Airtable с помощью инструмента Airtable от Composio, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для эффективного управления рабочими процессами, используя все возможности функций управления данными Airtable.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تautomatiو نoperations Airtable من خلال أداة Airtable من Composio، باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS لإدارة كفؤة سير العمل، مع الاستفادة من جميع إمكانيات إدارة البيانات في Airtable"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Airtable data entry","Streamlining workflow processes via Rube MCP","Integrating Airtable with other tools using Composio''s toolkit"],"zh":["自动化Airtable数据输入","通过Rube MCP简化工作流程","使用Composio的工具包将Airtable与其他工具集成"],"ja":["Airtableデータ入力を自動化する","Rube MCPを介してワークフロープロセスを合理化する","Composioのツールキットを使用してAirtableを他のツールと統合する"],"ko":["Airtable 데이터 입력 자동화","Rube MCP를 통해 워크플로 프로세스簡素化","Composio의 툴킷을 사용하여 Airtable을 다른 툴과 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la entrada de datos en Airtable","Optimización de los procesos de flujo de trabajo a través de Rube MCP","Integración de Airtable con otras herramientas utilizando la herramienta de Composio"],"fr":["Automatisation de la saisie de données Airtable","Optimisation des processus de flux de travail via Rube MCP","Intégration d''Airtable avec d''autres outils à l''aide de la boîte à outils de Composio"],"de":["Automatisierung der Dateneingabe in Airtable","Optimierung der Workflow-Prozesse über Rube MCP","Integration von Airtable mit anderen Tools mithilfe des Composio-Toolkits"],"pt":["Automatizar entrada de dados do Airtable","Otizar processos de fluxo de trabalho via Rube MCP","Integrar Airtable com outras ferramentas usando a ferramenta da Composio"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ввод данных Airtable","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы через Rube MCP","Интегрировать Airtable с другими инструментами с помощью инструмента Composio"],"ar":["تautomatiو نادخال البيانات في Airtable","جعل عمليات سير العمل أكثر كفاءة من خلال Rube MCP","دمج Airtable مع أدوات أخرى باستخدام أداة Composio"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","Must call RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS first to get current tool schemas"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS激活Airtable连接","必须首先调用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS来获取当前工具架构"],"ja":["Rube MCP接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS経由でAirtable接続が必要","現在のツールスキーマを取得するために、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSを最初に呼び出す必要がある"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결이 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 Airtable 연결이 필요","현재 툴 스키마를 가져올 때 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 먼저 호출해야 함"],"es":["Requiere conexión Rube MCP","Conexión activa de Airtable a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necesaria","Debes llamar a RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS primero para obtener los esquemas de herramientas actuales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP","Connexion active Airtable via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS nécessaire","Vous devez appeler RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS en premier pour obtenir les schémas d''outils actuels"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung","Aktive Airtable-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS erforderlich","Sie müssen RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS zuerst aufrufen, um die aktuellen Toolschemas zu erhalten"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP","Conexão ativa do Airtable via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessária","Deve chamar RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS primeiro para obter esquemas de ferramentas atuais"],"ru":["Требуется подключение Rube MCP","Необходимо активное подключение Airtable через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Необходимо сначала вызвать RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS, чтобы получить текущие схемы инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال ب Rube MCP","الاتصال النشط ب Airtable عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS ضروري","يجب استدعاء RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS أولاً للحصول على مخططات الأدوات الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
