:["Автоматизируйте операции Airtable","Интеграция с Rube MCP","Не требует ключей API","Простая настройка","Поддержка инструмента Composio"],"ar":["تأتمة عمليات إيرتابل","التكامل مع روبي إم سي بي","لا يتطلب مفاتيح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","إعدادات بسيطة","دعم أداة كومبوسيو"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Airtable 自动化","Rube MCP","Composio","Airtable 工具包","自动化开发","开发效率","Airtable 操作"],"ja":["Airtable オートメーション","Rube MCP","Composio","Airtable ツールキット","自動化開発","開発効率","Airtable 操作"],"ko":["에어테이블 자동화","루베 MCP","컴포시오","에어테이블 툴킷","자동화 개발","개발 효율","에어테이블 작업"],"es":["automatización de Airtable","Rube MCP","Airtable toolkit","Composio","desarrollo de software","automatización de procesos","integración de Airtable","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["automatisation d''Airtable","Rube MCP","outil Airtable","Composio","développement de logiciels","automatisation de processus","intégration d''Airtable","outils de développement"],"de":["Airtable-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","Airtable-Toolkit","Composio","Software-Entwicklung","Prozessautomatisierung","Airtable-Integration","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Airtable Automation","Rube MCP","Composio","Automatização de operações","Integração de ferramentas","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Автоматизация Airtable","Rube MCP","Composio","Автоматизация операций","Интеграция инструментов","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تأتمة إيرتابل","روبي إم سي بي","كومبوسيو","تأتمة عمليات","تكامل أدوات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"kbarbel640-del","repo":"skills","repoPath":"kbarbel640-del/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.537Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"airtable-automation","description":"Automate Airtable tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): records, bases, tables, fields, views. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Airtable Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Airtable connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `airtable`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it wor","body":"# Airtable Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Airtable connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `airtable`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `airtable`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Airtable auth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Create and Manage Records\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create, read, update, or delete records\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_LIST_BASES` - Discover available bases [Prerequisite]\n2. `AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA` - Inspect table structure [Prerequisite]\n3. `AIRTABLE_LIST_RECORDS` - List/filter records [Optional]\n4. `AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORD` / `AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORDS` - Create records [Optional]\n5. `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_RECORD` / `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS` - Update records [Optional]\n6. `AIRTABLE_DELETE_RECORD` / `AIRTABLE_DELETE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS` - Delete records [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `baseId`: Base ID (starts with ''app'', e.g., ''appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX'')\n- `tableIdOrName`: Table ID (starts with ''tbl'') or table name\n- `fields`: Object mapping field names to values\n- `recordId`: Record ID (starts with ''rec'') for updates/deletes\n- `filterByFormula`: Airtable formula for filtering\n- `typecast`: Set true for automatic type conversion\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- pageSize capped at 100; uses offset pagination; changing filters between pages can skip/duplicate rows\n- CREATE_RECORDS hard limit of 10 records per request; chunk larger imports\n- Field names are CASE-SENSITIVE and must match schema exactly\n- 422 UNKNOWN_FIELD_NAME when field names are wrong; 403 for permission issues\n- INVALID_MULTIPLE_CHOICE_OPTIONS may require typecast=true\n\n### 2. Search and Filter Records\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find specific records using formulas\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA` - Verify field names and types [Prerequisite]\n2. `AIRTABLE_LIST_RECORDS` - Query with filterByFormula [Required]\n3. `AIRTABLE_GET_RECORD` - Get full record details [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `filterByFormula`: Airtable formula (e.g., `{Status}=''Done''`)\n- `sort`: Array of sort objects\n- `fields`: Array of field names to return\n- `maxRecords`: Max total records across all pages\n- `offset`: Pagination cursor from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Field names in formulas must be wrapped in `{}` and match schema exactly\n- String values must be quoted: `{Status}=''Active''` not `{Status}=Active`\n- 422 INVALID_FILTER_BY_FORMULA for bad syntax or non-existent fields\n- Airtable rate limit: ~5 requests/second per base; handle 429 with Retry-After\n\n### 3. Manage Fields and Schema\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create or modify table fields\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA` - Inspect current schema [Prerequisite]\n2. `AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD` - Create a new field [Optional]\n3. `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_FIELD` - Rename/describe a field [Optional]\n4. `AIRTABLE_UPDATE_TABLE` - Update table metadata [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `name`: Field name\n- `type`: Field type (singleLineText, number, singleSelect, etc.)\n- `options`: Type-specific options (choices for select, precision for number)\n- `description`: Field description\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- UPDATE_FIELD only changes name/description, NOT type/options; create a replacement field and migrate\n- Computed fields (formula, rollup, lookup) cannot be created via API\n- 422 when type options are missing or malformed\n\n### 4. Manage Comments\n\n**When to use**: User wants to view or add comments on records\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `AIRTABLE_LIST_COMMENTS` - List comments on a record [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `baseId`: Base ID\n- `tableIdOrName`: Table identifier\n- `recordId`: Record ID (17 chars, starts with ''rec'')\n- `pageSize`: Comments per page (max 100)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Record IDs must be exactly 17 characters starting with ''rec''\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Airtable Formula Syntax\n\n**Comparison**:\n- `{Status}=''Done''` - Equals\n- `{Priority}>1` - Greater than\n- `{Name}!=''''` - Not empty\n\n**Functions**:\n- `AND({A}=''x'', {B}=''y'')` - Both conditions\n- `OR({A}=''x'', {A}=''y'')` - Either condition\n- `FIND(''test'', {Name})>0` - Contains text\n- `IS_BEFORE({Due Date}, TODAY())` - Date comparison\n\n**Escape rules**:\n- Single quotes in values: double them (`{Name}=''John''''s Company''`)\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Set `pageSize` (max 100)\n- Check response for `offset` string\n- Pass `offset` to next request unchanged\n- Keep filters/sorts/view stable between pages\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**ID Formats**:\n- Base IDs: `appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n- Table IDs: `tblXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n- Record IDs: `recXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n- Field IDs: `fldXXXXXXXXXXXXXX` (17 chars)\n\n**Batch Limits**:\n- CREATE_RECORDS: max 10 per request\n- UPDATE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS: max 10 per request\n- DELETE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS: max 10 per request\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List bases | AIRTABLE_LIST_BASES | (none) |\n| Get schema | AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA | baseId |\n| List records | AIRTABLE_LIST_RECORDS | baseId, tableIdOrName |\n| Get record | AIRTABLE_GET_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId |\n| Create record | AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, fields |\n| Create records | AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORDS | baseId, tableIdOrName, records |\n| Update record | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId, fields |\n| Update records | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_MULTIPLE_RECORDS | baseId, tableIdOrName, records |\n| Delete record | AIRTABLE_DELETE_RECORD | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId |\n| Create field | AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD | baseId, tableIdOrName, name, type |\n| Update field | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_FIELD | baseId, tableIdOrName, fieldId |\n| Update table | AIRTABLE_UPDATE_TABLE | baseId, tableIdOrName, name |\n| List comments | AIRTABLE_LIST_COMMENTS | baseId, tableIdOrName, recordId |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T23:55:35.926Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing advanced Airtable workflow optimization capabilities via Rube MCP","zh":"非常适合需要通过 Rube MCP 实现高级 Airtable 工作流优化的自动化代理","ja":"Rube MCP を介して高度な Airtable ワークフロー最適化機能を必要とするオートメーション エージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 고급 Airtable 워크플로우 최적화를 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de flujos de trabajo de Airtable a través de Rube MCP","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation de flux de travail Airtable via Rube MCP","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Airtable-Workflow-Optimierungsfunktionen über Rube MCP benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de fluxo de trabalho do Airtable via Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым необходимы расширенные возможности оптимизации рабочих процессов Airtable через Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين سير عمل Airtable من خلال Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Airtable operations through Composio''s Airtable toolkit, utilizing RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS and RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS for seamless integration, and leveraging the airtable toolkit for efficient workflow management","zh":"赋予代理人通过 Composio 的 Airtable 工具包自动化 Airtable 操作的能力，利用 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 和 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 实现无缝集成，并利用 airtable 工具包进行高效的工作流管理","ja":"Composio の Airtable ツールキットを利用してエージェントが Airtable 操作を自動化できるようにし、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS と RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS を使用してシームレスな統合を実現し、airtable ツールキットを使用して効率的なワークフロー管理を実現する","ko":"Composio의 Airtable 툴킷을 사용하여 에이전트가 Airtable 작업을 자동화 할 수 있도록 하며, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS와 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현하며, airtable 툴킷을 사용하여 효율적인 워크플로우 관리를 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de Airtable a través de la herramienta de Airtable de Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS y RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para una integración sin problemas, y aprovechando la herramienta de Airtable para una gestión de flujos de trabajo eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations Airtable via l''outil Airtable de Composio, en utilisant RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS et RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS pour une intégration sans accroc, et en exploitant l''outil Airtable pour une gestion de flux de travail efficace","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Airtable-Operationen über das Airtable-Toolkit von Composio zu automatisieren, indem RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS und RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet werden und das Airtable-Toolkit für eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar operações do Airtable por meio da ferramenta Airtable da Composio, utilizando RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS e RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS para integração sem problemas e aproveitando a ferramenta Airtable para gerenciamento eficiente do fluxo de trabalho","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать операции Airtable с помощью инструмента Airtable от Composio, используя RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS и RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS для беспрепятственной интеграции и эффективного управления рабочими процессами с помощью инструмента Airtable","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تutomation عمليات Airtable من خلال مجموعة أدوات Airtable من Composio، باستخدام RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS و RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS من أجل التكامل السلس، وتوفير أداة Airtable لتحسين إدارة سير العمل بكفاءة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Airtable data entry","Streamlining Airtable workflow processes","Integrating Airtable with other tools via Rube MCP"],"zh":["自动化 Airtable 数据输入","简化 Airtable 工作流程","通过 Rube MCP 将 Airtable 与其他工具集成"],"ja":["Airtable データ入力を自動化する","Airtable ワークフロー プロセスを最適化する","Rube MCP を介して Airtable を他のツールと統合する"],"ko":["Airtable 데이터 입력 자동화","Airtable 워크플로우 프로세스 최적화","Rube MCP를 통해 Airtable을 다른 도구와 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la entrada de datos de Airtable","Optimización de los procesos de flujo de trabajo de Airtable","Integración de Airtable con otras herramientas a través de Rube MCP"],"fr":["Automatisation de la saisie de données Airtable","Optimisation des processus de flux de travail Airtable","Intégration d''Airtable avec d''autres outils via Rube MCP"],"de":["Automatisierung der Airtable-Dateneingabe","Optimierung der Airtable-Workflow-Prozesse","Integration von Airtable mit anderen Tools über Rube MCP"],"pt":["Automatizar a entrada de dados do Airtable","Otimizar os processos de fluxo de trabalho do Airtable","Integrar o Airtable com outras ferramentas via Rube MCP"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ввод данных Airtable","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы Airtable","Интегрировать Airtable с другими инструментами через Rube MCP"],"ar":["تأتمة إدخال بيانات Airtable","تبسيط عمليات سير عمل Airtable","دمج Airtable مع أدوات أخرى من خلال Rube MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Airtable connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","Dependent on RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS for current tool schemas"],"zh":["需要 Rube MCP 连接","需要通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 的活跃 Airtable 连接","依赖于 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 的当前工具架构"],"ja":["Rube MCP 接続が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 経由での Airtable 接続が必要","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS の現在のツール スキーマに依存"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결이 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 Airtable 연결이 필요","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS의 현재 툴 스키마에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conexión Rube MCP","Conexión activa de Airtable a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necesaria","Dependiente de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para los esquemas de herramientas actuales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP","Connexion active Airtable via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS nécessaire","Dépendant de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour les schémas d''outils actuels"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung","Aktive Airtable-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS erforderlich","Abhängig von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für aktuelle Toolschemas"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP","Conexão ativa do Airtable via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessária","Dependente de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para esquemas de ferramentas atuais"],"ru":["Требуется подключение Rube MCP","Необходимо активное подключение Airtable через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Зависит от RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS для текущих схем инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال ب Rube MCP","يتطلب الاتصال الفعّال بالبريد الجوي via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","يعتمد على RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS لمخططات الأدوات الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
