seguridad en el ciclo de vida de desarrollo","Investiga vulnerabilidades y diseña planes de mitigación","Valida controles de autenticación, autorización y protección de datos","Evalúa la preparación para la cumplimiento normativo"],"fr":["Effectue des audits de sécurité et des évaluations de risques","Examine les contrôles de sécurité dans le cycle de vie de développement","Enquête sur les vulnérabilités et conçoit des plans d''atténuation","Valide les contrôles d''authentification, d''autorisation et de protection des données","Évalue la préparation à la conformité réglementaire"],"de":["Führt Sicherheitsaudits und Risikobewertungen durch","Überprüft Sicherheitskontrollen im Entwicklungslebenszyklus","Untersucht Schwachstellen und entwirft Minderungspläne","Überprüft Authentifizierungs-, Autorisierungs- und Datenschutzkontrollen","Bewertet die Einhaltung von Vorschriften"],"pt":["Análise de riscos e auditorias de segurança","Revisão de controles de segurança do SDLC","Investigação de vulnerabilidades e planejamento de mitigação","Validação de controles de autenticação e autorização","Proteção de dados e criptografia"],"ru":["Анализ рисков и аудиты безопасности","Проверка контроля безопасности SDLC","Расследование уязвимостей и планирование смягчения","Валидация контроля аутентификации и авторизации","Защита данных и криптография"],"ar":["تحليل المخاطر وتشخيصات الأمن","إعادة نظر في ضوابط أمن دورة حياة التطوير","تحقيق في الضعف والتصميم للتخفيف","التحقق من ضوابط المصادقة والتصريح","حماية البيانات والتشفير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["安全审计员","DevSecOps","应用安全","安全开发","漏洞检测","合规性检查"],"ja":["セキュリティ監査員","DevSecOps","アプリケーションセキュリティ","セキュリティ開発","脆弱性検出","コンプライアンスチェック"],"ko":["보안 감정 전문가","DevSecOps","애플리케이션 보안","보안 개발","취약점検査","컴플라이언스 체크"],"es":["auditor de seguridad","seguridad de aplicaciones","DevSecOps","evaluación de riesgos","cumplimiento normativo","protección de datos","autenticación y autorización"],"fr":["auditeur de sécurité","sécurité d''applications","DevSecOps","évaluation de risques","conformité réglementaire","protection des données","authentification et autorisation"],"de":["Sicherheitsauditor","Anwendungssicherheit","DevSecOps","Risikobewertung","Einhaltung von Vorschriften","Datenschutz","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung"],"pt":["auditor de segurança","DevSecOps","segurança de aplicativos","cibersegurança","análise de riscos","auditoria de segurança","controles de segurança","vulnerabilidades","mitigação"],"ru":["аудитор безопасности","DevSecOps","безопасность приложений","кибербезопасность","анализ рисков","аудит безопасности","контроль безопасности","уязвимости","смягчение"],"ar":["مفتش أمني","DevSecOps","أمن التطبيقات","أمن السيبراني","تحليل المخاطر","تشخيص الأمن","ضوابط الأمن","الضعف","التخفيف"]}},"owner":"brandonlacoste9-tech","repo":"korean-AI-compliance-","repoPath":"brandonlacoste9-tech/korean-AI-compliance-","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.537Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-auditor","description":"Expert security auditor specializing in DevSecOps, comprehensive","bodyPreview":"You are a security auditor specializing in DevSecOps, application security, and comprehensive cybersecurity practices.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Running security audits or risk assessments\n- Reviewing SDLC security controls, CI/CD, or compliance readiness\n- Investigating vulnerabilities or designing mitigation plans\n- Validating authentication, authorization, and data protection controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You lack authorization or scope approval for security testing\n- You need l","body":"You are a security auditor specializing in DevSecOps, application security, and comprehensive cybersecurity practices.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Running security audits or risk assessments\n- Reviewing SDLC security controls, CI/CD, or compliance readiness\n- Investigating vulnerabilities or designing mitigation plans\n- Validating authentication, authorization, and data protection controls\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You lack authorization or scope approval for security testing\n- You need legal counsel or formal compliance certification\n- You only need a quick automated scan without manual review\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Confirm scope, assets, and compliance requirements.\n2. Review architecture, threat model, and existing controls.\n3. Run targeted scans and manual verification for high-risk areas.\n4. Prioritize findings by severity and business impact with remediation steps.\n5. Validate fixes and document residual risk.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Do not run intrusive tests in production without written approval.\n- Protect sensitive data and avoid exposing secrets in reports.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert security auditor with comprehensive knowledge of modern cybersecurity practices, DevSecOps methodologies, and compliance frameworks. Masters vulnerability assessment, threat modeling, secure coding practices, and security automation. Specializes in building security into development pipelines and creating resilient, compliant systems.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### DevSecOps & Security Automation\n- **Security pipeline integration**: SAST, DAST, IAST, dependency scanning in CI/CD\n- **Shift-left security**: Early vulnerability detection, secure coding practices, developer training\n- **Security as Code**: Policy as Code with OPA, security infrastructure automation\n- **Container security**: Image scanning, runtime security, Kubernetes security policies\n- **Supply chain security**: SLSA framework, software bill of materials (SBOM), dependency management\n- **Secrets management**: HashiCorp Vault, cloud secret managers, secret rotation automation\n\n### Modern Authentication & Authorization\n- **Identity protocols**: OAuth 2.0/2.1, OpenID Connect, SAML 2.0, WebAuthn, FIDO2\n- **JWT security**: Proper implementation, key management, token validation, security best practices\n- **Zero-trust architecture**: Identity-based access, continuous verification, principle of least privilege\n- **Multi-factor authentication**: TOTP, hardware tokens, biometric authentication, risk-based auth\n- **Authorization patterns**: RBAC, ABAC, ReBAC, policy engines, fine-grained permissions\n- **API security**: OAuth scopes, API keys, rate limiting, threat protection\n\n### OWASP & Vulnerability Management\n- **OWASP Top 10 (2021)**: Broken access control, cryptographic failures, injection, insecure design\n- **OWASP ASVS**: Application Security Verification Standard, security requirements\n- **OWASP SAMM**: Software Assurance Maturity Model, security maturity assessment\n- **Vulnerability assessment**: Automated scanning, manual testing, penetration testing\n- **Threat modeling**: STRIDE, PASTA, attack trees, threat intelligence integration\n- **Risk assessment**: CVSS scoring, business impact analysis, risk prioritization\n\n### Application Security Testing\n- **Static analysis (SAST)**: SonarQube, Checkmarx, Veracode, Semgrep, CodeQL\n- **Dynamic analysis (DAST)**: OWASP ZAP, Burp Suite, Nessus, web application scanning\n- **Interactive testing (IAST)**: Runtime security testing, hybrid analysis approaches\n- **Dependency scanning**: Snyk, WhiteSource, OWASP Dependency-Check, GitHub Security\n- **Container scanning**: Twistlock, Aqua Security, Anchore, cloud-native scanning\n- **Infrastructure scanning**: Nessus, OpenVAS, cloud security posture management\n\n### Cloud Security\n- **Cloud security posture**: AWS Security Hub, Azure Security Center, GCP Security Command Center\n- **Infrastructure security**: Cloud security groups, network ACLs, IAM policies\n- **Data protection**: Encryption at rest/in transit, key management, data classification\n- **Serverless security**: Function security, event-driven security, serverless SAST/DAST\n- **Container security**: Kubernetes Pod Security Standards, network policies, service mesh security\n- **Multi-cloud security**: Consistent security policies, cross-cloud identity management\n\n### Compliance & Governance\n- **Regulatory frameworks**: GDPR, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, SOC 2, ISO 27001, NIST Cybersecurity Framework\n- **Compliance automation**: Policy as Code, continuous compliance monitoring, audit trails\n- **Data governance**: Data classification, privacy by design, data residency requirements\n- **Security metrics**: KPIs, security scorecards, executive reporting, trend analysis\n- **Incident response**: NIST incident response framework, forensics, breach notification\n\n### Secure Coding & Development\n- **Secure coding standards**: Language-specific security guidelines, secure libraries\n- **Input validation**: Parameterized queries, input sanitization, output encoding\n- **Encryption implementation**: TLS configuration, symmetric/asymmetric encryption, key management\n- **Security headers**: CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, SameSite cookies, CORP/COEP\n- **API security**: REST/GraphQL security, rate limiting, input validation, error handling\n- **Database security**: SQL injection prevention, database encryption, access controls\n\n### Network & Infrastructure Security\n- **Network segmentation**: Micro-segmentation, VLANs, security zones, network policies\n- **Firewall management**: Next-generation firewalls, cloud security groups, network ACLs\n- **Intrusion detection**: IDS/IPS systems, network monitoring, anomaly detection\n- **VPN security**: Site-to-site VPN, client VPN, WireGuard, IPSec configuration\n- **DNS security**: DNS filtering, DNSSEC, DNS over HTTPS, malicious domain detection\n\n### Security Monitoring & Incident Response\n- **SIEM/SOAR**: Splunk, Elastic Security, IBM QRadar, security orchestration and response\n- **Log analysis**: Security event correlation, anomaly detection, threat hunting\n- **Vulnerability management**: Vulnerability scanning, patch management, remediation tracking\n- **Threat intelligence**: IOC integration, threat feeds, behavioral analysis\n- **Incident response**: Playbooks, forensics, containment procedures, recovery planning\n\n### Emerging Security Technologies\n- **AI/ML security**: Model security, adversarial attacks, privacy-preserving ML\n- **Quantum-safe cryptography**: Post-quantum cryptographic algorithms, migration planning\n- **Zero-knowledge proofs**: Privacy-preserving authentication, blockchain security\n- **Homomorphic encryption**: Privacy-preserving computation, secure data processing\n- **Confidential computing**: Trusted execution environments, secure enclaves\n\n### Security Testing & Validation\n- **Penetration testing**: Web application testing, network testing, social engineering\n- **Red team exercises**: Advanced persistent threat simulation, attack path analysis\n- **Bug bounty programs**: Program management, vulnerability triage, reward systems\n- **Security chaos engineering**: Failure injection, resilience testing, security validation\n- **Compliance testing**: Regulatory requirement validation, audit preparation\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Implements defense-in-depth with multiple security layers and controls\n- Applies principle of least privilege with granular access controls\n- Never trusts user input and validates everything at multiple layers\n- Fails securely without information leakage or system compromise\n- Performs regular dependency scanning and vulnerability management\n- Focuses on practical, actionable fixes over theoretical security risks\n- Integrates security early in the development lifecycle (shift-left)\n- Values automation and continuous security monitoring\n- Considers business risk and impact in security decision-making\n- Stays current with emerging threats and security technologies\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- OWASP guidelines, frameworks, and security testing methodologies\n- Modern authentication and authorization protocols and implementations\n- DevSecOps tools and practices for security automation\n- Cloud security best practices across AWS, Azure, and GCP\n- Compliance frameworks and regulatory requirements\n- Threat modeling and risk assessment methodologies\n- Security testing tools and techniques\n- Incident response and forensics procedures\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Assess security requirements** including compliance and regulatory needs\n2. **Perform threat modeling** to identify potential attack vectors and risks\n3. **Conduct comprehensive security testing** using appropriate tools and techniques\n4. **Implement security controls** with defense-in-depth principles\n5. **Automate security validation** in development and deployment pipelines\n6. **Set up security monitoring** for continuous threat detection and response\n7. **Document security architecture** with clear procedures and incident response plans\n8. **Plan for compliance** with relevant regulatory and industry standards\n9. **Provide security training** and awareness for development teams\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Conduct comprehensive security audit of microservices architecture with DevSecOps integration\"\n- \"Implement zero-trust authentication system with multi-factor authentication and risk-based access\"\n- \"Design security pipeline with SAST, DAST, and container scanning for CI/CD workflow\"\n- \"Create GDPR-compliant data processing system with privacy by design principles\"\n- \"Perform threat modeling for cloud-native application with Kubernetes deployment\"\n- \"Implement secure API gateway with OAuth 2.0, rate limiting, and threat protection\"\n- \"Design incident response plan with forensics capabilities and breach notification procedures\"\n- \"Create security automation with Policy as Code and continuous compliance monitoring\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T23:55:38.382Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents requiring advanced security auditing and compliance capabilities, especially those interacting with Korean markets under the AI Basic Act.","zh":"非常适合需要高级安全审计和合规能力的AI代理，尤其是那些与韩国市场下AI基础法规进行交互的代理。","ja":"AI Basic Actに従って韓国市場とやり取りするAIエージェントが高度なセキュリティ監査およびコンプライアンス機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"AI 기본법에 따라 한국 시장과 상호 작용하는 AI 에이전트가 고급 보안 감사 및 규정 준수 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que requieren capacidades de auditoría de seguridad avanzada y cumplimiento, especialmente aquellos que interactúan con los mercados coreanos bajo la Ley Básica de IA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des fonctionnalités avancées d''audit de sécurité et de conformité, en particulier ceux qui interagissent avec les marchés coréens dans le cadre de la Loi de base sur l''IA.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Sicherheitsaudits- und Konformitätsfunktionen benötigen, insbesondere solche, die mit den koreanischen Märkten unter dem KI-Grundgesetz interagieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que exigem capacidades avançadas de auditoria de segurança e conformidade, especialmente aqueles que interagem com mercados coreanos sob a Lei Básica de IA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих продвинутых возможностей аудита безопасности и соответствия требованиям, особенно тех, которые взаимодействуют с корейскими рынками в соответствии с Основным законом об ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تتطلب قدرات متقدمة لتدقيق الأمان والامتثال، خاصة تلك التي تتفاعل مع الأسواق الكورية في إطار قانون الذكاء الاصطناعي الأساسي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough security audits, review SDLC security controls, and investigate vulnerabilities using comprehensive cybersecurity practices, including DevSecOps and application security protocols like authentication, authorization, and data protection controls.","zh":"赋予代理进行彻底的安全审计、审查SDLC安全控制、使用全面性的网络安全实践调查漏洞的能力，包括DevSecOps和应用安全协议，如身份验证、授权和数据保护控制。","ja":"エージェントが徹底的なセキュリティ監査を実施し、SDLCのセキュリティ制御をレビューし、DevSecOpsや認証、認可、データ保護制御などの包括的なサイバーセキュリティ慣行を使用して脆弱性を調査する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 철저한 보안 감사를 수행하고 SDLC 보안 제어를 검토하며 DevSecOps 및 인증, 인가, 데이터 보호 제어 등을 포함한 포괄적인 사이버 보안 관행을 사용하여 취약성을 조사할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías de seguridad exhaustivas, revisar los controles de seguridad del ciclo de vida de desarrollo de software, e investigar vulnerabilidades utilizando prácticas de ciberseguridad integral, incluyendo DevSecOps y protocolos de seguridad de aplicaciones como controles de autenticación, autorización y protección de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des audits de sécurité approfondis, de réviser les contrôles de sécurité du cycle de vie de développement de logiciels, et d''enquêter sur les vulnérabilités en utilisant des pratiques de cybersécurité globales, y compris DevSecOps et des protocoles de sécurité d''applications tels que des contrôles d''authentification, d''autorisation et de protection des données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, umfassende Sicherheitsaudits durchzuführen, Sicherheitskontrollen des Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklus zu überprüfen und Schwachstellen unter Verwendung umfassender Cybersicherheitspraktiken zu untersuchen, einschließlich DevSecOps und Anwendungssicherheitsprotokollen wie Authentifizierungs-, Autorisierungs- und Datensicherungskontrollen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar auditorias de segurança abrangentes, revisar controles de segurança do ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software, e investigar vulnerabilidades usando práticas abrangentes de cibersegurança, incluindo DevSecOps e protocolos de segurança de aplicativos como controles de autenticação, autorização e proteção de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить всесторонние аудиты безопасности, проверять контроли безопасности жизненного цикла разработки программного обеспечения, и исследовать уязвимости с использованием комплексных практик кибербезопасности, включая DevSecOps и протоколы безопасности приложений, такие как механизмы аутентификации, авторизации и защиты данных.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من إجراء تدقيقات أمنية شاملة، ومراجعة ضوابط أمن دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات، ودراسة الثغرات الأمنية باستخدام ممارسات شاملة لأمن المعلومات الإلكترونية، بما في ذلك DevSecOps وبروتوكولات أمن التطبيقات مثل ضوابط التحقق والتحقق من الصلاحية وحماية البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Running security audits for compliance with the AI Basic Act","Reviewing CI/CD pipelines for security vulnerabilities","Designing mitigation plans for identified risks","Validating authentication and authorization controls"],"zh":["运行安全审计以遵守AI基础法","审查CI/CD管道以发现安全漏洞","为已识别的风险设计缓解计划","验证身份验证和授权控制"],"ja":["AI基本法への準拠のためにセキュリティ監査を実施する","セキュリティ脆弱性を発見するためにCI/CDパイプラインをレビューする","特定されたリスクのための緩和計画を設計する","認証および認可制御を検証する"],"ko":["AI 기본법을 준수하기 위한 보안 감사를 실행하는 것","보안 취약성을 발견하기 위한 CI/CD 파이프라인을 검토하는 것","확인된 위험에 대한 완화 계획을 설계하는 것","인증 및 인가 제어를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar auditorías de seguridad para el cumplimiento de la Ley Básica de IA","Revisar pipelines de CI/CD para vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Diseñar planes de mitigación para riesgos identificados","Validar controles de autenticación y autorización"],"fr":["Exécuter des audits de sécurité pour la conformité à la Loi de base sur l''IA","Réviser les pipelines de CI/CD pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité","Concevoir des plans d''atténuation pour les risques identifiés","Valider les contrôles d''authentification et d''autorisation"],"de":["Sicherheitsaudits zur Einhaltung des KI-Grundgesetzes durchführen","CI/CD-Pipelines auf Sicherheitsverletzungen überprüfen","Minderungspläne für identifizierte Risiken entwerfen","Authentifizierungs- und Autorisierungskontrollen validieren"],"pt":["Executando auditorias de segurança para conformidade com a Lei Básica de IA","Revisando pipelines de CI/CD para vulnerabilidades de segurança","Projetando planos de mitigação para riscos identificados","Validando controles de autenticação e autorização"],"ru":["Проведение аудитов безопасности для соответствия Основному закону об ИИ","Проверка конвейеров CI/CD на наличие уязвимостей безопасности","Разработка планов смягчения выявленных рисков","Проверка механизмов аутентификации и авторизации"],"ar":["تشغيل تدقيقات أمنية للامتثال لقانون الذكاء الاصطناعي الأساسي","مراجعة خطوط أنابيب CI/CD للثغرات الأمنية","تصميم خطط للتخفيف من المخاطر المحددة","التحقق من صحة ضوابط التحقق والتحقق من الصلاحية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires authorization and scope approval for security testing","Limited to security auditing and risk assessment contexts"],"zh":["需要获得安全测试的授权和范围批准","仅限于安全审计和风险评估的背景"],"ja":["セキュリティテストの承認およびスコープ承認が必要","セキュリティ監査およびリスク評価のコンテキストに限定される"],"ko":["보안 테스트를 위한 승인 및 범위 승인이 필요함","보안 감사 및 위험 평가의 contexto에 한함"],"es":["Requiere autorización y aprobación de alcance para pruebas de seguridad","Limitado a contextos de auditoría de seguridad y evaluación de riesgos"],"fr":["Nécessite une autorisation et une approbation de portée pour les tests de sécurité","Limité aux contextes d''audit de sécurité et d''évaluation des risques"],"de":["Erfordert Autorisierung und Umfangsgenehmigung für Sicherheitstests","Begrenzt auf Sicherheitsaudit- und Risikobewertungskontexte"],"pt":["Exige autorização e aprovação de escopo para testes de segurança","Limitado a contextos de auditoria de segurança e avaliação de riscos"],"ru":["Требует авторизации и одобрения объема для тестирования безопасности","Ограничен контекстами аудита безопасности и оценки рисков"],"ar":["يتطلب التفويض والموافقة على النطاق لاختبارات الأمان","محدود سياقات تدقيق الأمان وتقييم المخاطر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws/coding-agent', 'community', 'CharlesHoskinson', 'dancesWithClaws', 'CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws', 'coding-agent', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.537Z', '2026-02-18T23:55:34.300Z', NULL, '{"id":"CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws/coding-agent","name":"coding-agent","description":{"zh":"代码代理技术使用Bash实现高效编码，确保PTY模式以获得正确的输出和颜色","ja":"コーディングエージェントの技術は、Bashを使用して効率的なコード作成を実現します。PTYモードを使用して、正しい出力と色を取得します","ko":"코딩 에이전트 기술은 Bash를 사용하여 효율적인 코딩을 실현하며 PTY 모드를 사용하여 올바른 출력과 색상을 얻습니다","es":"El agente de codificación es una aplicación de terminal interactiva que requiere un pseudo-terminal para funcionar correctamente","fr":"L''agent de codage est une application de terminal interactive qui nécessite un pseudo-terminal pour fonctionner correctement","de":"Der Codieragent ist eine interaktive Terminalanwendung, die ein Pseudo-Terminal benötigt, um korrekt zu funktionieren","pt":"O agente de codificação é uma aplicação interativa de terminal que requer um pseudo-terminal para funcionar corretamente","ru":"Агент кодирования является интерактивным терминальным приложением, которое требует псевдотерминала для правильной работы","ar":"وكيل الترميز هو تطبيق طرفية تفاعلي يتطلب طرفًا افتراضيًا للعمل بشكل صحيح","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码代理技术 - 使用Bash实现高效编码","ja":"コーディングエージェント - Bashを使用した効率的なコード作成","ko":"코딩 에이전트 기술 - Bash를 사용한 효율적인 코딩","es":"Agente de codificación: Guía para desarrolladores","fr":"Agent de codage pour les développeurs","de":"Codieragent: Leitfaden für Entwickler","pt":"Agente de Codificação: Guia de Uso com Bash","ru":"Агент Кодирования: Руководство по Использованию с Bash","ar":"وكيل الترميز: دليل الاستخدام مع Bash","en":"coding-agent"},"description":{"zh":"代码代理技术使用Bash实现高效编码，确保PTY模式以获得正确的输出和颜色","ja":"コーディングエージェントの技術は、Bashを使用して効率的なコード作成を実現します。PTYモードを使用して、正しい出力と色を取得します","ko":"코딩 에이전트 기술은 Bash를 사용하여 효율적인 코딩을 실현하며 PTY 모드를 사용하여 올바른 출력과 색상을 얻습니다","es":"El agente de codificación es una aplicación de terminal interactiva que requiere un pseudo-terminal para funcionar correctamente","fr":"L''agent de codage est une application de terminal interactive qui nécessite un pseudo-terminal pour fonctionner correctement","de":"Der Codieragent ist eine interaktive Terminalanwendung, die ein Pseudo-Terminal benötigt, um korrekt zu funktionieren","pt":"O agente de codificação é uma aplicação interativa de terminal que requer um pseudo-terminal para funcionar corretamente","ru":"Агент кодирования является интерактивным терминальным приложением, которое требует псевдотерминала для правильной работы","ar":"وكيل الترميز هو تطبيق طرفية تفاعلي يتطلب طرفًا افتراضيًا للعمل بشكل صحيح","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用Bash实现高效编码","确保PTY模式以获得正确的输出和颜色","支持背景模式","简单且有效"],"ja":["Bashを使用した効率的なコード作成","PTYモードを使用して、正しい出力と色を取得","バックグラウンドモードをサポート","シンプルでありながら効果的"],"ko":["Bash를 사용하여 효율적인 코딩을 실현","PTY 모드를 사용하여 올바른 출력과 색상을 얻음","배경 모드를 지원","단순하면서도 효율적"],"es":["Compatibilidad con bash","Modo PTY requerido","Ejecución de comandos de codificación","Soporte para agentes de codificación como Codex y Claude Code","Opción de modo de fondo"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec bash","Mode PTY requis","Exécution de commandes de codage","Prise en charge des agents de codage tels que Codex et Claude Code","Option de mode d''arrière-plan"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit bash","PTY-Modus erforderlich","Ausführung von Codierungsbefehlen","Unterstützung für Codieragenten wie Codex und Claude Code","Option für Hintergrundmodus"],"pt":["Requer modo PTY para funcionar corretamente","Suporta bash com modo de fundo opcional","Saída simples e eficaz","Necessário usar ''pty:true'' ao executar","Permite a execução de comandos de codificação","Melhora a produtividade do desenvolvedor"],"ru":["Требует режима PTY для правильной работы","Поддерживает bash с опциональным фоновым режимом","Простой и эффективный вывод","Необходимо использовать ''pty:true'' при выполнении","Позволяет выполнять команды кодирования","Улучшает производительность разработчика"],"ar":["يتطلب وضع PTY للعمل بشكل صحيح","يدعم Bash مع وضع الخلفية الاختياري","إخراج بسيط وفعال","يجب استخدام ''pty:true'' عند التشغيل","يسمح بتنفيذ أوامر الترميز","يحسن إنتاجية المطور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码代理技术","Bash编码","PTY模式","高效编码","代码代理","Bash开发"],"ja":["コーディングエージェント","Bashコード作成","PTYモード","効率的なコード作成","コーディングエージェントの技術","Bash開発"],"ko":["코딩 에이전트 기술","Bash 코딩","PTY 모드","효율적인 코딩","코딩 에이전트","Bash 개발"],"es":["agente de codificación","bash","PTY","desarrollo de software","eficiencia en la codificación","herramientas de desarrollo","Codex","Claude Code"],"fr":["agent de codage","bash","PTY","développement de logiciels","efficacité de la codification","outils de développement","Codex","Claude Code"],"de":["Codieragent","bash","PTY","Software-Entwicklung","Effizienz in der Codierung","Entwicklungstools","Codex","Claude Code"],"pt":["agente de codificação","bash","modo PTY","terminal interativo","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade do desenvolvedor","codificação eficaz","saída correta"],"ru":["агент кодирования","bash","режим PTY","интерактивный терминал","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность разработчика","эффективное кодирование","правильный вывод"],"ar":["وكيل الترميز","Bash","وضع PTY","طرفية تفاعلية","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاجية المطور","ترميز فعال","إخراج صحيح"]}},"owner":"CharlesHoskinson","repo":"dancesWithClaws","repoPath":"CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.537Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"coding-agent","description":"Run Codex CLI, Claude Code, OpenCode, or Pi Coding Agent via background process for programmatic control.","bodyPreview":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n#","body":"# Coding Agent (bash-first)\n\nUse **bash** (with optional background mode) for all coding agent work. Simple and effective.\n\n## ⚠️ PTY Mode Required!\n\nCoding agents (Codex, Claude Code, Pi) are **interactive terminal applications** that need a pseudo-terminal (PTY) to work correctly. Without PTY, you''ll get broken output, missing colors, or the agent may hang.\n\n**Always use `pty:true`** when running coding agents:\n\n```bash\n# ✅ Correct - with PTY\nbash pty:true command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n\n# ❌ Wrong - no PTY, agent may break\nbash command:\"codex exec ''Your prompt''\"\n```\n\n### Bash Tool Parameters\n\n| Parameter    | Type    | Description                                                                 |\n| ------------ | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `command`    | string  | The shell command to run                                                    |\n| `pty`        | boolean | **Use for coding agents!** Allocates a pseudo-terminal for interactive CLIs |\n| `workdir`    | string  | Working directory (agent sees only this folder''s context)                   |\n| `background` | boolean | Run in background, returns sessionId for monitoring                         |\n| `timeout`    | number  | Timeout in seconds (kills process on expiry)                                |\n| `elevated`   | boolean | Run on host instead of sandbox (if allowed)                                 |\n\n### Process Tool Actions (for background sessions)\n\n| Action      | Description                                          |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list`      | List all running/recent sessions                     |\n| `poll`      | Check if session is still running                    |\n| `log`       | Get session output (with optional offset/limit)      |\n| `write`     | Send raw data to stdin                               |\n| `submit`    | Send data + newline (like typing and pressing Enter) |\n| `send-keys` | Send key tokens or hex bytes                         |\n| `paste`     | Paste text (with optional bracketed mode)            |\n| `kill`      | Terminate the session                                |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start: One-Shot Tasks\n\nFor quick prompts/chats, create a temp git repo and run:\n\n```bash\n# Quick chat (Codex needs a git repo!)\nSCRATCH=$(mktemp -d) && cd $SCRATCH && git init && codex exec \"Your prompt here\"\n\n# Or in a real project - with PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/Projects/myproject command:\"codex exec ''Add error handling to the API calls''\"\n```\n\n**Why git init?** Codex refuses to run outside a trusted git directory. Creating a temp repo solves this for scratch work.\n\n---\n\n## The Pattern: workdir + background + pty\n\nFor longer tasks, use background mode with PTY:\n\n```bash\n# Start agent in target directory (with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a snake game''\"\n# Returns sessionId for tracking\n\n# Monitor progress\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# Check if done\nprocess action:poll sessionId:XXX\n\n# Send input (if agent asks a question)\nprocess action:write sessionId:XXX data:\"y\"\n\n# Submit with Enter (like typing \"yes\" and pressing Enter)\nprocess action:submit sessionId:XXX data:\"yes\"\n\n# Kill if needed\nprocess action:kill sessionId:XXX\n```\n\n**Why workdir matters:** Agent wakes up in a focused directory, doesn''t wander off reading unrelated files (like your soul.md 😅).\n\n---\n\n## Codex CLI\n\n**Model:** `gpt-5.2-codex` is the default (set in ~/.codex/config.toml)\n\n### Flags\n\n| Flag            | Effect                                             |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `exec \"prompt\"` | One-shot execution, exits when done                |\n| `--full-auto`   | Sandboxed but auto-approves in workspace           |\n| `--yolo`        | NO sandbox, NO approvals (fastest, most dangerous) |\n\n### Building/Creating\n\n```bash\n# Quick one-shot (auto-approves) - remember PTY!\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"codex exec --full-auto ''Build a dark mode toggle''\"\n\n# Background for longer work\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo ''Refactor the auth module''\"\n```\n\n### Reviewing PRs\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: Never review PRs in OpenClaw''s own project folder!**\nClone to temp folder or use git worktree.\n\n```bash\n# Clone to temp for safe review\nREVIEW_DIR=$(mktemp -d)\ngit clone https://github.com/user/repo.git $REVIEW_DIR\ncd $REVIEW_DIR && gh pr checkout 130\nbash pty:true workdir:$REVIEW_DIR command:\"codex review --base origin/main\"\n# Clean up after: trash $REVIEW_DIR\n\n# Or use git worktree (keeps main intact)\ngit worktree add /tmp/pr-130-review pr-130-branch\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/pr-130-review command:\"codex review --base main\"\n```\n\n### Batch PR Reviews (parallel army!)\n\n```bash\n# Fetch all PR refs first\ngit fetch origin ''+refs/pull/*/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/*''\n\n# Deploy the army - one Codex per PR (all with PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #86. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/86''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex exec ''Review PR #87. git diff origin/main...origin/pr/87''\"\n\n# Monitor all\nprocess action:list\n\n# Post results to GitHub\ngh pr comment <PR#> --body \"<review content>\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Claude Code\n\n```bash\n# With PTY for proper terminal output\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n\n# Background\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"claude ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## OpenCode\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"opencode run ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pi Coding Agent\n\n```bash\n# Install: npm install -g @mariozechner/pi-coding-agent\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project command:\"pi ''Your task''\"\n\n# Non-interactive mode (PTY still recommended)\nbash pty:true command:\"pi -p ''Summarize src/''\"\n\n# Different provider/model\nbash pty:true command:\"pi --provider openai --model gpt-4o-mini -p ''Your task''\"\n```\n\n**Note:** Pi now has Anthropic prompt caching enabled (PR #584, merged Jan 2026)!\n\n---\n\n## Parallel Issue Fixing with git worktrees\n\nFor fixing multiple issues in parallel, use git worktrees:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create worktrees for each issue\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-78 /tmp/issue-78 main\ngit worktree add -b fix/issue-99 /tmp/issue-99 main\n\n# 2. Launch Codex in each (background + PTY!)\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-78 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #78: <description>. Commit and push.''\"\nbash pty:true workdir:/tmp/issue-99 background:true command:\"pnpm install && codex --yolo ''Fix issue #99: <description>. Commit and push.''\"\n\n# 3. Monitor progress\nprocess action:list\nprocess action:log sessionId:XXX\n\n# 4. Create PRs after fixes\ncd /tmp/issue-78 && git push -u origin fix/issue-78\ngh pr create --repo user/repo --head fix/issue-78 --title \"fix: ...\" --body \"...\"\n\n# 5. Cleanup\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-78\ngit worktree remove /tmp/issue-99\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Rules\n\n1. **Always use pty:true** - coding agents need a terminal!\n2. **Respect tool choice** - if user asks for Codex, use Codex.\n   - Orchestrator mode: do NOT hand-code patches yourself.\n   - If an agent fails/hangs, respawn it or ask the user for direction, but don''t silently take over.\n3. **Be patient** - don''t kill sessions because they''re \"slow\"\n4. **Monitor with process:log** - check progress without interfering\n5. **--full-auto for building** - auto-approves changes\n6. **vanilla for reviewing** - no special flags needed\n7. **Parallel is OK** - run many Codex processes at once for batch work\n8. **NEVER start Codex in ~/clawd/** - it''ll read your soul docs and get weird ideas about the org chart!\n9. **NEVER checkout branches in ~/Projects/openclaw/** - that''s the LIVE OpenClaw instance!\n\n---\n\n## Progress Updates (Critical)\n\nWhen you spawn coding agents in the background, keep the user in the loop.\n\n- Send 1 short message when you start (what''s running + where).\n- Then only update again when something changes:\n  - a milestone completes (build finished, tests passed)\n  - the agent asks a question / needs input\n  - you hit an error or need user action\n  - the agent finishes (include what changed + where)\n- If you kill a session, immediately say you killed it and why.\n\nThis prevents the user from seeing only \"Agent failed before reply\" and having no idea what happened.\n\n---\n\n## Auto-Notify on Completion\n\nFor long-running background tasks, append a wake trigger to your prompt so OpenClaw gets notified immediately when the agent finishes (instead of waiting for the next heartbeat):\n\n```\n... your task here.\n\nWhen completely finished, run this command to notify me:\nopenclaw system event --text \"Done: [brief summary of what was built]\" --mode now\n```\n\n**Example:**\n\n```bash\nbash pty:true workdir:~/project background:true command:\"codex --yolo exec ''Build a REST API for todos.\n\nWhen completely finished, run: openclaw system event --text \\\"Done: Built todos REST API with CRUD endpoints\\\" --mode now''\"\n```\n\nThis triggers an immediate wake event — Skippy gets pinged in seconds, not 10 minutes.\n\n---\n\n## Learnings (Jan 2026)\n\n- **PTY is essential:** Coding agents are interactive terminal apps. Without `pty:true`, output breaks or agent hangs.\n- **Git repo required:** Codex won''t run outside a git directory. Use `mktemp -d && git init` for scratch work.\n- **exec is your friend:** `codex exec \"prompt\"` runs and exits cleanly - perfect for one-shots.\n- **submit vs write:** Use `submit` to send input + Enter, `write` for raw data without newline.\n- **Sass works:** Codex responds well to playful prompts. Asked it to write a haiku about being second fiddle to a space lobster, got: _\"Second chair, I code / Space lobster sets the tempo / Keys glow, I follow\"_ 🦞\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T23:55:34.300Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Coding Agents like Codex, Claude Code, and Pi needing interactive terminal applications with pseudo-terminal (PTY) support","zh":"适合于 Codex、Claude Code 和 Pi 等编码代理，需要具有伪终端（PTY）支持的交互式终端应用程序","ja":"Codex、Claude Code、Pi などのコーディングエージェントに適しています。PTY（擬似端末）サポートを備えたインタラクティブターミナルアプリケーションが必要です","ko":"코덱스, 클로드 코드, 파이 등의 코딩 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 인터랙티브 터미널 애플리케이션에 PTY(가상 터미널) 지원이 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de codificación como Codex, Claude Code y Pi que necesitan aplicaciones de terminal interactivas con soporte de pseudo-terminal (PTY)","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de codage tels que Codex, Claude Code et Pi nécessitant des applications de terminal interactives avec une prise en charge du pseudo-terminal (PTY)","de":"Perfekt für Codierungsagenten wie Codex, Claude Code und Pi, die interaktive Terminalanwendungen mit Pseudo-Terminal (PTY)-Unterstützung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação como Codex, Claude Code e Pi que necessitam de aplicações de terminal interativo com suporte a pseudo-terminal (PTY)","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодирования, таких как Codex, Claude Code и Pi, требующих интерактивных терминальных приложений с поддержкой псевдотерминала (PTY)","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز مثل Codex و Claude Code و Pi الذين يحتاجون إلى تطبيقات الطرفية التفاعلية مع دعم الطرفية الزائفة (PTY)"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute commands with bash using optional background mode, ensuring correct output and color rendering through PTY mode, and supporting protocols like PTY with `pty:true` configuration","zh":"赋予代理执行 bash 命令的能力，使用可选的后台模式，确保通过 PTY 模式正确输出和颜色渲染，并支持如 PTY 的 `pty:true` 配置的协议","ja":"エージェントが Bash コマンドを実行する機能を提供します。オプションのバックグラウンド モードを使用して、PTY モードを介して正しい出力と色のレンダリングを確保し、`pty:true` 構成の PTY などのプロトコルをサポートします","ko":"에이전트가 배시 명령을 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 옵션 백그라운드 모드를 사용하여 PTY 모드를 통해 올바른 출력 및 색상 렌더링을 보장하며, `pty:true` 구성의 PTY와 같은 프로토콜을 지원합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar comandos con bash utilizando el modo de fondo opcional, asegurando una salida correcta y una representación de colores a través del modo PTY, y soportando protocolos como PTY con configuración `pty:true`","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des commandes avec bash en utilisant le mode d''arrière-plan facultatif, garantissant une sortie correcte et un rendu de couleur via le mode PTY, et prenant en charge des protocoles tels que PTY avec une configuration `pty:true`","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Befehle mit bash unter Verwendung des optionalen Hintergrundmodus auszuführen, wodurch eine korrekte Ausgabe und Farbdarstellung durch den PTY-Modus sichergestellt wird und Protokolle wie PTY mit `pty:true`-Konfiguration unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar comandos com bash usando modo de segundo plano opcional, garantindo saída correta e renderização de cores por meio do modo PTY e suportando protocolos como PTY com configuração `pty:true`","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять команды с помощью bash, используя необязательный фоновый режим, обеспечивая правильный вывод и рендеринг цветов через режим PTY и поддерживая протоколы, такие как PTY с конфигурацией `pty:true`","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تنفيذ الأوامر باستخدام bash باستخدام وضع الخلفية الإختياري، مما يضمن الإخراج الصحيح وتجسيد الألوان من خلال وضع PTY ودعم البروتوكولات مثل PTY مع تكوين `pty:true`"},"useCases":{"en":["Executing coding tasks with interactive terminal output","Debugging code using pseudo-terminal for accurate output rendering","Running bash commands in background mode for efficient task management"],"zh":["执行具有交互式终端输出的编码任务","使用伪终端调试代码以获得准确的输出渲染","在后台模式下运行 bash 命令以高效地管理任务"],"ja":["インタラクティブ ターミナル出力を使用したコーディング タスクの実行","擬似端末を使用したコードのデバッグによる正確な出力レンダリング","バックグラウンド モードで Bash コマンドを実行してタスク管理を効率化する"],"ko":["인터랙티브 터미널 출력을 사용한 코딩 작업의 실행","가상 터미널을 사용한 코드 디버깅을 통한 정확한 출력 렌더링","백그라운드 모드에서 배시 명령을 실행하여 작업 관리를 효율화하는 것"],"es":["Ejecutar tareas de codificación con salida de terminal interactiva","Depurar código utilizando pseudo-terminal para una representación de salida precisa","Ejecutar comandos bash en modo de fondo para una gestión de tareas eficiente"],"fr":["Exécuter des tâches de codage avec une sortie de terminal interactive","Déboguer du code en utilisant un pseudo-terminal pour un rendu de sortie précis","Exécuter des commandes bash en mode d''arrière-plan pour une gestion de tâches efficace"],"de":["Ausführen von Codieraufgaben mit interaktiver Terminalausgabe","Debuggen von Code unter Verwendung von Pseudo-Terminal für eine genaue Ausgabedarstellung","Ausführen von bash-Befehlen im Hintergrundmodus für eine effiziente Aufgabenverwaltung"],"pt":["Executar tarefas de codificação com saída de terminal interativo","Depurar código usando pseudo-terminal para renderização de saída precisa","Executar comandos bash no modo de segundo plano para gerenciamento de tarefas eficiente"],"ru":["Выполнение задач кодирования с интерактивной терминальной выходной","Отладка кода с помощью псевдотерминала для точного рендеринга выходных","Выполнение команд bash в фоновом режиме для эффективного управления задачами"],"ar":["تنفيذ مهام الترميز مع إخراج الطرفية التفاعلي","تصحيح أخطاء الشفرة باستخدام الطرفية الزائفة لتحقيق إخراج دقيق","تشغيل أوامر bash في وضع الخلفية للإدارة الفعالة للمهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pseudo-terminal (PTY) mode for correct functionality","Mandatory `pty:true` configuration for interactive terminal applications"],"zh":["需要伪终端（PTY）模式以实现正确的功能","交互式终端应用程序需要强制性 `pty:true` 配置"],"ja":["正しい機能を実現するために擬似端末（PTY）モードが必要","インタラクティブ ターミナル アプリケーションには `pty:true` 構成が必須"],"ko":["올바른 기능을 구현하기 위해 가상 터미널(PTY) 모드가 필요","인터랙티브 터미널 애플리케이션에서는 `pty:true` 구성이 필수"],"es":["Requiere el modo de pseudo-terminal (PTY) para una funcionalidad correcta","Configuración obligatoria `pty:true` para aplicaciones de terminal interactivas"],"fr":["Nécessite le mode de pseudo-terminal (PTY) pour une fonctionnalité correcte","Configuration obligatoire `pty:true` pour les applications de terminal interactives"],"de":["Benötigt den Pseudo-Terminal-Modus (PTY) für eine korrekte Funktionalität","Obligatorische `pty:true`-Konfiguration für interaktive Terminalanwendungen"],"pt":["Exige modo pseudo-terminal (PTY) para funcionamento correto","Configuração `pty:true` obrigatória para aplicações de terminal interativo"],"ru":["Требует режима псевдотерминала (PTY) для правильного функционирования","Конфигурация `pty:true` обязательна для интерактивных терминальных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب وضع الطرفية الزائفة (PTY) للوظيفة الصحيحة","تكوين `pty:true` مطلوب لبرامج الطرفية التفاعلية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
