成","统一的jsonResponse和errorResponse返回"],"ja":["バックエンド処理関数の追加","バックエンドルーティングの設定","フロントエンドのカプセル化","エラーハンドリングと認証機構の統合","統一されたjsonResponseとerrorResponseの返却"],"ko":["백엔드 처리 함수의 추가","백엔드 라우팅의 설정","프론트엔드의 캡슐화","오류 처리 및 인증 메커니즘의 통합","統一されたjsonResponse와 errorResponse의 반환"],"es":["Agregar una API de autenticación","Mejorar la seguridad del proyecto","Implementar autenticación con token","Crear un handler de autenticación","Agregar rutas de autenticación","Implementar errores y respuestas personalizadas"],"fr":["Ajouter une API d''authentification","Améliorer la sécurité du projet","Implémenter l''authentification avec token","Créer un handler d''authentification","Ajouter des routes d''authentification","Implémenter des erreurs et des réponses personnalisées"],"de":["Eine Authentifizierungs-API hinzufügen","Die Sicherheit des Projekts verbessern","Authentifizierung mit Token implementieren","Ein Authentifizierungshandler erstellen","Authentifizierungswege hinzufügen","Fehler und personalisierte Antworten implementieren"]},"keywords":{"zh":["添加API","后端开发","前端开发","错误处理","鉴权机制","API集成"],"ja":["API機能の追加","バックエンド開発","フロントエンド開発","エラーハンドリング","認証機構","API統合"],"ko":["API 기능 추가","백엔드 개발","프론트엔드 개발","오류 처리","인증 메커니즘","API 통합"],"es":["autenticación","API","seguridad","token","handler","rutas","errores","respuestas personalizadas","desarrollo web","programación"],"fr":["authentification","API","sécurité","token","handler","routes","erreurs","réponses personnalisées","développement web","programmation"],"de":["Authentifizierung","API","Sicherheit","Token","Handler","Wege","Fehler","personalisierte Antworten","Webentwicklung","Programmierung"]}},"owner":"zxj719","repo":"ai_wolf_game","repoPath":"zxj719/ai_wolf_game","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-api","description":"新增 Cloudflare Workers API 端点，并在前端封装调用。","bodyPreview":"目标：在后端 `workers/auth/*` 新增一个 API，并在前端 `src/services/authService.js` 增加调用封装，保持错误处理与鉴权一致。\n\n## 步骤\n\n1. 后端处理函数：`workers/auth/handlers.js`\n   - 新增 `export async function handleXxx(request, env) { ... }`\n   - 复用 `authMiddleware` 做登录校验\n   - 统一用 `jsonResponse` / `errorResponse` 返回\n\n2. 后端路由：`workers/auth/index.js`\n   - import 新增的 handler\n   - 在路由表里添加对应 URL 与 HTTP method\n\n3. 前端封装：`src/services/authService.js`\n   - 新增一个方法调用该 API（复用现有 token/header 逻辑）\n\n## 参考模板\n\n```js\n// workers/auth/handlers.js\nexport async","body":"目标：在后端 `workers/auth/*` 新增一个 API，并在前端 `src/services/authService.js` 增加调用封装，保持错误处理与鉴权一致。\n\n## 步骤\n\n1. 后端处理函数：`workers/auth/handlers.js`\n   - 新增 `export async function handleXxx(request, env) { ... }`\n   - 复用 `authMiddleware` 做登录校验\n   - 统一用 `jsonResponse` / `errorResponse` 返回\n\n2. 后端路由：`workers/auth/index.js`\n   - import 新增的 handler\n   - 在路由表里添加对应 URL 与 HTTP method\n\n3. 前端封装：`src/services/authService.js`\n   - 新增一个方法调用该 API（复用现有 token/header 逻辑）\n\n## 参考模板\n\n```js\n// workers/auth/handlers.js\nexport async function handleNewFeature(request, env) {\n  try {\n    const { user, error } = await authMiddleware(request, env);\n    if (error) return errorResponse(error, 401, env, request);\n\n    // business logic...\n\n    return jsonResponse({ success: true, data: result }, 200, env, request);\n  } catch (err) {\n    return errorResponse(''Failed: '' + err.message, 500, env, request);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:17:37.483Z","qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws/merge-pr', 'community', 'CharlesHoskinson', 'dancesWithClaws', 'CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws', 'merge-pr', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:58:18.484Z', '2026-02-19T07:17:37.485Z', NULL, '{"id":"CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws/merge-pr","name":"merge-pr","description":{"es":"La fusión de solicitudes de extracción es un proceso crucial para los desarrolladores. Nuestra guía te explica cómo hacerlo de manera segura y eficiente.","fr":"La fusion de pull requests est un processus crucial pour les développeurs. Notre guide vous explique comment le faire de manière sécurisée et efficace.","de":"Die Zusammenführung von Merge-Anfragen ist ein wichtiger Prozess für Entwickler. Unsere Anleitung erklärt, wie Sie dies sicher und effizient durchführen können.","pt":"A ferramenta Merge PR é uma solução para mesclar solicitações de pull request de forma segura e eficiente, após validação rigorosa.","ru":"Инструмент Merge PR представляет собой решение для слияния запросов на вытягивание изменений безопасным и эффективным способом после тщательной проверки.","ar":"أداة دمج طلبات السحب هي حل لدمج طلبات السحب بطريقة آمنة وفعالة بعد التحقق المeticulous.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Fusión de solicitudes de extracción","fr":"Fusion de pull request","de":"Merge-Anfrage","pt":"Merge PR: Ferramenta de Validação e Mesclagem","ru":"Merge PR: Инструмент для проверки и слияния","ar":"دمج طلبات السحب: أداة التحقق والدمج","en":"merge-pr"},"description":{"es":"La fusión de solicitudes de extracción es un proceso crucial para los desarrolladores. Nuestra guía te explica cómo hacerlo de manera segura y eficiente.","fr":"La fusion de pull requests est un processus crucial pour les développeurs. Notre guide vous explique comment le faire de manière sécurisée et efficace.","de":"Die Zusammenführung von Merge-Anfragen ist ein wichtiger Prozess für Entwickler. Unsere Anleitung erklärt, wie Sie dies sicher und effizient durchführen können.","pt":"A ferramenta Merge PR é uma solução para mesclar solicitações de pull request de forma segura e eficiente, após validação rigorosa.","ru":"Инструмент Merge PR представляет собой решение для слияния запросов на вытягивание изменений безопасным и эффективным способом после тщательной проверки.","ar":"أداة دمج طلبات السحب هي حل لدمج طلبات السحب بطريقة آمنة وفعالة بعد التحقق المeticulous.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Validación determinista","Uso de `.local/prep.env`","Requerimiento de `--match-head-commit`","Comandos cwd-agnósticos","Evitación de `gh pr merge --auto`"],"fr":["Validation déterministe","Utilisation de `.local/prep.env`","Exigence de `--match-head-commit`","Commandes cwd-agnostiques","Évitement de `gh pr merge --auto`"],"de":["Deterministische Validierung","Verwendung von `.local/prep.env`","Anforderung von `--match-head-commit`","Cwd-agnostische Befehle","Vermeidung von `gh pr merge --auto`"],"pt":["Validação determinística de solicitações de pull request","Mesclagem segura com verificação de HEAD","Suporte a execução em qualquer diretório","Evita uso de comandos de merge automático","Evita push direto para repositórios","Verificação de preparação de solicitações de pull request"],"ru":["Детерминированная проверка запросов на вытягивание изменений","Безопасное слияние с проверкой HEAD","Поддержка выполнения в любом каталоге","Избегает использования автоматических команд слияния","Избегает прямого 푸ша в репозитории","Проверка подготовки запросов на вытягивание изменений"],"ar":["التحقق المحدد لطلبات السحب","الدمج الآمن مع التحقق من HEAD","دعم التنفيذ في أي دليل","تجنب استخدام أوامر الدمج الآلي","تجنب الدفع المباشر إلى المستودعات","التحقق من إعداد طلبات السحب"]},"keywords":{"es":["fusión de solicitudes de extracción","desarrollo de software","git","pull requests","validación determinista","seguridad en el desarrollo"],"fr":["fusion de pull requests","développement de logiciels","git","pull requests","validation déterministe","sécurité dans le développement"],"de":["Zusammenführung von Merge-Anfragen","Software-Entwicklung","git","Merge-Anfragen","deterministische Validierung","Sicherheit in der Entwicklung"],"pt":["merge pr","validação de pull request","mesclagem segura","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","git","github","pull request","merge"],"ru":["merge pr","проверка запроса на вытягивание","безопасное слияние","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","git","github","запрос на вытягивание","слияние"],"ar":["دمج طلبات السحب","التحقق من طلبات السحب","الدمج الآمن","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","git","github","طلبات السحب","الدمج"]}},"owner":"CharlesHoskinson","repo":"dancesWithClaws","repoPath":"CharlesHoskinson/dancesWithClaws","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:58:18.484Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"merge-pr","description":"Script-first deterministic squash merge with strict required-check gating, head-SHA pinning, and reliable attribution/commenting.","bodyPreview":"# Merge PR\n\n## Overview\n\nMerge a prepared PR only after deterministic validation.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, use `.local/prep.env` from the PR worktree.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Never use `gh pr merge --auto` in this flow.\n- Never run `git push` directly.\n- Require `--match-head-commit` during merge.\n- Wrapper commands are cwd-agnostic; you can run them from repo root or inside the PR worktree.\n\n## Execution Contract\n\n1. Validate merge readiness:\n\n```sh\nscripts/pr-merge verify <P","body":"# Merge PR\n\n## Overview\n\nMerge a prepared PR only after deterministic validation.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Ask for PR number or URL.\n- If missing, use `.local/prep.env` from the PR worktree.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Never use `gh pr merge --auto` in this flow.\n- Never run `git push` directly.\n- Require `--match-head-commit` during merge.\n- Wrapper commands are cwd-agnostic; you can run them from repo root or inside the PR worktree.\n\n## Execution Contract\n\n1. Validate merge readiness:\n\n```sh\nscripts/pr-merge verify <PR>\n```\n\nBackward-compatible verify form also works:\n\n```sh\nscripts/pr-merge <PR>\n```\n\n2. Run one-shot deterministic merge:\n\n```sh\nscripts/pr-merge run <PR>\n```\n\n3. Ensure output reports:\n\n- `merge_sha=<sha>`\n- `merge_author_email=<email>`\n- `comment_url=<url>`\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Validate artifacts\n\n```sh\nrequire=(.local/review.md .local/review.json .local/prep.md .local/prep.env)\nfor f in \"${require[@]}\"; do\n  [ -s \"$f\" ] || { echo \"Missing artifact: $f\"; exit 1; }\ndone\n```\n\n2. Validate checks and branch status\n\n```sh\nscripts/pr-merge verify <PR>\nsource .local/prep.env\n```\n\n`scripts/pr-merge` treats “no required checks configured” as acceptable (`[]`), but fails on any required `fail` or `pending`.\n\n3. Merge deterministically (wrapper-managed)\n\n```sh\nscripts/pr-merge run <PR>\n```\n\n`scripts/pr-merge run` performs:\n\n- deterministic squash merge pinned to `PREP_HEAD_SHA`\n- reviewer merge author email selection with fallback candidates\n- one retry only when merge fails due to author-email validation\n- co-author trailers for PR author and reviewer\n- post-merge verification of both co-author trailers on commit message\n- PR comment retry (3 attempts), then comment URL extraction\n- cleanup after confirmed `MERGED`\n\n4. Manual fallback (only if wrapper is unavailable)\n\n```sh\nscripts/pr merge-run <PR>\n```\n\n5. Cleanup\n\nCleanup is handled by `run` after merge success.\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- End in `MERGED`, never `CLOSED`.\n- Cleanup only after confirmed merge.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:17:37.485Z","qualityScore":70}');
