على إخراج المجمع الإلكتروني وعقود الرسوم المتحركة والتحكم.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["交互式Three.js应用","iOS原生应用打包","浏览器和移动设备的无缝体验","Two Runtimes, One Contract架构","Vite和Capacitor集成"],"ja":["インタラクティブなThree.jsアプリ","iOSネイティブアプリのパッケージ化","ブラウザとモバイルデバイスのシームレスな体験","Two Runtimes, One Contractアーキテクチャ","ViteとCapacitorの統合"],"ko":["인터랙티브한 Three.js 애플리케이션","iOS 네이티브 앱 패키징","브라우저 및 모바일 디바이스의無縫体験","Two Runtimes, One Contract 아키텍처","Vite와 Capacitor의 통합"],"es":["Integración de la salida de compilación web","Contratos de animación y controles","Flujo de trabajo de sincronización nativa","Compatibilidad con Three.js y Vite","Compatibilidad con Capacitor iOS"],"fr":["Intégration de la sortie de build web","Contrats d''animation et contrôles","Workflow de synchronisation natif","Compatibilité avec Three.js et Vite","Compatibilité avec Capacitor iOS"],"de":["Integration der Web-Build-Ausgabe","Animationsverträge und Steuerungen","Native Synchronisations-Workflow","Kompatibilität mit Three.js und Vite","Kompatibilität mit Capacitor iOS"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos interativos","Integração com a renderização da web","Execução nativa em dispositivos iOS","Contratos de animação e controles","Saída de compilação da web personalizável","Suporte a Vite e Capacitor"],"ru":["Разработка интерактивных приложений","Интеграция с веб-рендерингом","Родная производительность на устройствах iOS","Анимационные контракты и контроль","Настраиваемый выход веб-компиляции","Поддержка Vite и Capacitor"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات تفاعلية","التكامل مع تقنيات العرض الإلكتروني","تشغيل الأصلي على أجهزة iOS","عقود الرسوم المتحركة والتحكم","إخراج المجمع الإلكتروني قابل للتعديل","دعم Vite و Capacitor"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Three.js","Capacitor","iOS","原生应用","交互式应用","Vite","Two Runtimes, One Contract"],"ja":["Three.js","Capacitor","iOS","ネイティブアプリ","インタラクティブアプリ","Vite","Two Runtimes, One Contract"],"ko":["Three.js","Capacitor","iOS","네이티브 앱","인터랙티브 애플리케이션","Vite","Two Runtimes, One Contract"],"es":["Three.js","Capacitor iOS","aplicaciones interactivas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","integración de tecnologías","animación y controles","flujo de trabajo de sincronización"],"fr":["Three.js","Capacitor iOS","applications interactives","développement d''applications","intégration de technologies","animation et contrôles","workflow de synchronisation"],"de":["Three.js","Capacitor iOS","interaktive Anwendungen","Anwendungsentwicklung","Integration von Technologien","Animation und Steuerungen","nativer Synchronisations-Workflow"],"pt":["Three.js","Capacitor","iOS","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Renderização da web","Execução nativa","Vite","Aplicativos interativos","Integração de tecnologias"],"ru":["Three.js","Capacitor","iOS","Разработка приложений","Веб-рендеринг","Родная производительность","Vite","Интерактивные приложения","Интеграция технологий"],"ar":["Three.js","Capacitor","iOS","تطوير التطبيقات","تقنيات العرض الإلكتروني","تشغيل الأصلي","Vite","تطبيقات تفاعلية","تكامل التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"chongdashu","repo":"threejs-capacitor-ios-game","repoPath":"chongdashu/threejs-capacitor-ios-game","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"threejs-capacitor-ios","description":"Build and ship Three.js apps on Capacitor iOS with Vite and Swift Package Manager: GLTF loading, assets_index animation UI, OrbitControls mouse/touch mappings, and iOS sync/run troubleshooting.","bodyPreview":"# Three.js Capacitor iOS\n\nBuild interactive Three.js apps that run in browser and ship in an iOS native shell via Capacitor.\nThis skill focuses on the integration boundary where most breakage happens: web build output, animation contracts, controls, and native sync/run workflow.\n\n## Philosophy: Two Runtimes, One Contract\n\nTreat the project as two systems that must agree:\n- A web renderer runtime (Three.js + Vite)\n- A native runtime wrapper (Capacitor iOS)\n\nMost failures happen when their contrac","body":"# Three.js Capacitor iOS\n\nBuild interactive Three.js apps that run in browser and ship in an iOS native shell via Capacitor.\nThis skill focuses on the integration boundary where most breakage happens: web build output, animation contracts, controls, and native sync/run workflow.\n\n## Philosophy: Two Runtimes, One Contract\n\nTreat the project as two systems that must agree:\n- A web renderer runtime (Three.js + Vite)\n- A native runtime wrapper (Capacitor iOS)\n\nMost failures happen when their contract is implicit.\nMake file paths, animation names, build output, and iOS package manager choices explicit and testable.\n\n**Before implementing, ask:**\n- What is the exact web output directory (`dist` or `www`) and does Capacitor `webDir` match it?\n- Are animation names loaded from data (`assets_index.json`) instead of hardcoded strings?\n- Is iOS using SPM or CocoaPods, and are plugin dependencies compatible with that choice?\n- Are desktop and touch controls intentionally mapped, or left to defaults that may not match product UX?\n\n**Core principles:**\n1. Contract-first data flow: UI and animation playback should derive from JSON metadata, not ad-hoc clip names in code.\n2. SPM-first iOS setup: on modern Capacitor, default to Swift Package Manager unless a specific plugin forces CocoaPods.\n3. Symmetric controls: define mouse and touch mappings together so desktop and mobile behavior stay aligned.\n4. Build-sync discipline: every native run depends on fresh web assets and sync.\n5. Fast diagnosis: prefer small runtime checks for paths, clip names, and action resolution before deep debugging.\n\n## Quick Start Workflow\n\n1. Build the Three.js app with Vite (`npm run build`).\n2. Keep static assets under `public/` and load via absolute URLs (`/assets/...`).\n3. Configure Capacitor with `webDir: \"dist\"`.\n4. Add iOS platform with SPM (`npx cap add ios --packagemanager SPM`).\n5. Repeat day-to-day loop:\n   - `npm run build`\n   - `npx cap sync ios`\n   - `npx cap run ios` or `npx cap open ios`\n\nFor command-level details, see `references/capacitor-ios-spm-workflow.md`.\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### 1) Project Shape\n\nPrefer this shape for minimal ambiguity:\n- `index.html` and `src/*` for app code\n- `public/assets/...` for GLBs and JSON contracts\n- `capacitor.config.ts` with `webDir: \"dist\"`\n\nIf using Vite, keep all runtime fetches compatible with both browser and WKWebView:\n- Good: `fetch(''/assets/assets_index.json'')`\n- Avoid: filesystem paths or environment-specific base URLs unless intentionally configured.\n\n### 2) Animation Contract via `assets_index.json`\n\nUse one source of truth:\n- Character skeleton URL\n- Animation source URL\n- `animations[]` entries with:\n  - stable app id (`idle`, `walk`, `run`)\n  - `sourceClipName` (exact `AnimationClip.name`)\n  - loop mode and defaults\n\nRuntime pattern:\n1. Load index JSON\n2. Load skeleton GLB and animation GLB\n3. Resolve each UI button to a clip by `sourceClipName`\n4. Build `AnimationAction` map keyed by app id\n5. Play default action from index\n\nSee `references/threejs-animation-index-pattern.md`.\n\n### 3) Controls: Desktop and Touch\n\nUse `OrbitControls` and set mappings explicitly:\n- Mouse:\n  - left = rotate\n  - wheel = dolly/zoom\n  - right = pan\n- Touch:\n  - one-finger = rotate\n  - two-finger = dolly + pan\n\nIf product requires vertical-only pan, constrain target/camera translation after `controls.update()` each frame.\nDo not silently change rotate/zoom semantics when adding this constraint.\n\n### 4) Performance and Stability Guardrails\n\n- Cap pixel ratio: `Math.min(devicePixelRatio, 2)`.\n- Reuse mixer/actions; do not recreate per click.\n- On resize, always update camera aspect, projection, and renderer size.\n- Keep animation switching with fade transitions from metadata defaults.\n\n### 5) Capacitor iOS Integration\n\nUse SPM by default with Capacitor 8+.\nFor existing CocoaPods projects, migrate intentionally (assistant or recreate iOS platform).\n\nAfter native-side changes or plugin changes, run `npx cap sync ios` again.\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n❌ **Hardcoding clip names in UI handlers**\nWhy bad: a renamed clip in GLB silently breaks buttons.\nBetter: map buttons from `assets_index.json` and resolve clip names once at startup.\n\n❌ **Mixing SPM and CocoaPods assumptions**\nWhy bad: dependency drift and broken Xcode project expectations.\nBetter: choose one package manager per project; for modern setups prefer SPM.\n\n❌ **Running iOS without rebuilding web assets**\nWhy bad: simulator shows stale JS/CSS and debugging becomes misleading.\nBetter: use scripts that always build before `cap sync`/`cap run`.\n\n❌ **Leaving control mappings implicit**\nWhy bad: desktop and mobile interaction diverge from UX requirements.\nBetter: set `mouseButtons` and `touches` explicitly in code.\n\n❌ **Debugging native first for web contract errors**\nWhy bad: wastes time in Xcode when issue is usually missing JSON keys, bad paths, or unresolved clips.\nBetter: add startup assertions/logs for index shape and clip resolution.\n\n## Variation Guidance\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Do not produce identical viewers by default.\nAdjust implementation to the product intent:\n- Character showcase: richer lighting, slower camera damping, emphasis on idle loop.\n- Gameplay prototype: fast transitions, state-driven animation switching, minimal UI chrome.\n- Asset QA tool: diagnostics overlay, clip length/track info, missing-clip warnings surfaced clearly.\n\nVary at least these dimensions intentionally:\n- Visual style (lighting/background/floor treatment)\n- Input tuning (damping/zoom/pan speeds)\n- Animation UX (buttons, keyboard shortcuts, auto-play strategy)\n\nAvoid converging on a single generic \"orbit + three buttons\" output when context calls for more.\n\n## Resource Map\n\n- `references/capacitor-ios-spm-workflow.md`\n  - canonical iOS setup, migration, and run commands\n- `references/threejs-animation-index-pattern.md`\n  - index contract and runtime loading pattern\n- `references/gotchas.md`\n  - high-frequency integration failures and fixes\n\n## Remember\n\nThree.js + Capacitor iOS succeeds when contracts are explicit and workflows are disciplined.\nBuild a clear metadata contract, map controls intentionally, prefer SPM on modern Capacitor, and keep build/sync/run deterministic.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T00:47:29.113Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing to build interactive 3D apps that run in browsers and on iOS devices via Capacitor","zh":"非常适合需要构建可以在浏览器和iOS设备上运行的交互式3D应用的前端代理，通过Capacitor实现","ja":"ブラウザとiOSデバイスで動作するインタラクティブな3Dアプリを構築する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、Capacitorを使用して実現します","ko":"브라우저와 iOS 기기에서 실행되는 인터랙티브 3D 앱을 구축해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, Capacitor를 통해 구현됩니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan crear aplicaciones 3D interactivas que se ejecutan en navegadores y dispositivos iOS a través de Capacitor","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de créer des applications 3D interactives qui s''exécutent dans les navigateurs et les appareils iOS via Capacitor","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die interaktive 3D-Apps erstellen müssen, die in Browsern und auf iOS-Geräten über Capacitor ausgeführt werden","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam criar aplicativos 3D interativos que funcionam em navegadores e dispositivos iOS via Capacitor","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимо создавать интерактивные 3D-приложения, работающие в браузерах и на устройствах iOS через Capacitor","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى بناء تطبيقات 3D تفاعلية تعمل في المتصفحات وأجهزة iOS من خلال Capacitor"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly integrate Three.js with Capacitor iOS, ensuring smooth web build output, animation contracts, and native sync/run workflow using Vite and Capacitor''s native runtime wrapper","zh":"赋予代理无缝集成Three.js与Capacitor iOS的能力，确保使用Vite和Capacitor的原生运行时包装器实现平滑的Web构建输出、动画契约和原生同步/运行工作流","ja":"Three.jsとCapacitor iOSをシームレスに統合するエージェントの能力を提供し、ViteとCapacitorのネイティブランタイムラッパーを使用してスムーズなWebビルド出力、アニメーション契約、ネイティブ同期/実行ワークフローを保証します","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js와 Capacitor iOS를 무결점으로 통합할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 Vite와 Capacitor의 네이티브 런타임 래퍼를 사용하여 웹 빌드 출력, 애니메이션 계약, 네이티브 동기화/실행 워크플로우가 원활하게 진행되도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar de manera transparente Three.js con Capacitor iOS, garantizando una salida de compilación web suave, contratos de animación y un flujo de trabajo de sincronización y ejecución nativa utilizando Vite y el wrapper de tiempo de ejecución nativo de Capacitor","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer de manière transparente Three.js avec Capacitor iOS, garantissant une sortie de build web fluide, des contrats d''animation et un flux de travail de synchronisation et d''exécution natif en utilisant Vite et le wrapper de runtime natif de Capacitor","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Three.js nahtlos mit Capacitor iOS zu integrieren, wodurch ein reibungsloser Webbuild-Ausgang, Animationsverträge und ein natives Synchronisations- und Ausführungs-Workflow mit Vite und dem nativen Laufzeit-Wrapper von Capacitor gewährleistet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar Three.js com Capacitor iOS de forma transparente, garantindo uma saída de compilação web suave, contratos de animação e fluxo de trabalho de sincronização/execução nativa usando Vite e o wrapper de tempo de execução nativo do Capacitor","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность бесшовно интегрировать Three.js с Capacitor iOS, обеспечивая плавный веб-выходной результат, контракты анимации и родной рабочий процесс синхронизации/выполнения, используя Vite и родной wrapper среды выполнения Capacitor","ar":"تمكن العملاء من دمج Three.js مع Capacitor iOS بشكل متوافق، مما يضمن مخرجات بناء الويب السلسة، وتصميمات الرسوم المتحركة، وتنفيذ سير العمل الأصلي باستخدام Vite وغلاف وقت تشغيل Capacitor الأصلي"},"useCases":{"en":["Building interactive 3D simulations for iOS","Deploying Three.js projects as native iOS apps using Capacitor","Debugging web and native runtime discrepancies in Three.js apps"],"zh":["为iOS构建交互式3D模拟","使用Capacitor将Three.js项目部署为原生iOS应用","调试Three.js应用中的Web和原生运行时差异"],"ja":["iOS用のインタラクティブな3Dシミュレーションを構築する","Capacitorを使用してThree.jsプロジェクトをネイティブiOSアプリとしてデプロイする","Three.jsアプリのWebとネイティブランタイムの不一致をデバッグする"],"ko":["iOS용 인터랙티브 3D 시뮬레이션을 구축하는 것","Capacitor를 사용하여 Three.js 프로젝트를 네이티브 iOS 앱으로 배포하는 것","Three.js 애플리케이션의 웹 및 네이티브 런타임 불일치를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Creación de simulaciones 3D interactivas para iOS","Implementación de proyectos Three.js como aplicaciones nativas de iOS mediante Capacitor","Depuración de discrepancias de tiempo de ejecución web y nativo en aplicaciones Three.js"],"fr":["Création de simulations 3D interactives pour iOS","Déploiement de projets Three.js en tant qu''applications natives iOS à l''aide de Capacitor","Débogage des écarts de runtime web et natif dans les applications Three.js"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver 3D-Simulationen für iOS","Bereitstellung von Three.js-Projekten als native iOS-Apps mit Capacitor","Fehlerbehebung bei Webbau- und Native-Laufzeit-Unterschieden in Three.js-Apps"],"pt":["Construir simulações 3D interativas para iOS","Implantar projetos Three.js como aplicativos nativos iOS usando Capacitor","Depurar discrepâncias de tempo de execução web e nativa em aplicativos Three.js"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных 3D-симуляций для iOS","Развертывание проектов Three.js в качестве родных приложений iOS с помощью Capacitor","Отладка несоответствий веб- и родной среды выполнения в приложениях Three.js"],"ar":["بناء محاكاة 3D تفاعلية لأجهزة iOS","نشر مشاريع Three.js كتطبيقات أصلية لأجهزة iOS باستخدام Capacitor","تصحيح أخطاء في تنفيذ الويب والتنفيذ الأصلي لتطبيقات Three.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Capacitor and Three.js setup","Limited to iOS native shell deployment","Dependent on Vite for web build output"],"zh":["需要Capacitor和Three.js的设置","仅限iOS原生外壳部署","依赖Vite进行Web构建输出"],"ja":["CapacitorとThree.jsの設定が必要","ネイティブシェルデプロイはiOSに限定される","Webビルド出力にはViteに依存する"],"ko":["Capacitor와 Three.js 설정이 필요함","네이티브 셸 배포는 iOS에만 국한됨","웹 빌드 출력에는 Vite에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Capacitor y Three.js","Limitado a la implementación de shell nativo de iOS","Dependiente de Vite para la salida de compilación web"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Capacitor et Three.js","Limité au déploiement de shell natif iOS","Dépendant de Vite pour la sortie de build web"],"de":["Benötigt Capacitor- und Three.js-Setup","Begrenzt auf native iOS-Shell-Bereitstellung","Abhängig von Vite für Webbuild-Ausgang"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Capacitor e Three.js","Limitado à implantação de shell nativa iOS","Dependente do Vite para saída de compilação web"],"ru":["Требует настройки Capacitor и Three.js","Ограничен развертыванием родного shell для iOS","Зависит от Vite для веб-выходного результата"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Capacitor و Three.js","محدود بنشر غلاف أصلية لأجهزة iOS","يعتمد على Vite لمخرجات بناء الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
