e développement","flux de travail intégré","compétences de codex","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Funktionenentwicklung","Codex-Fähigkeitsrahmen","Effizienz im Entwicklungsprozess","Entwicklungsvorlagen","integrierter Workflow","Codex-Fähigkeiten","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de funcionalidades","framework de desenvolvimento","alta eficiência","habilidades prontas para uso","modelos de desenvolvimento","fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["разработка функций","фреймворк для разработки","высокая эффективность","готовые навыки","шаблоны разработки","рабочий процесс разработки"],"ar":["تطوير الوظائف","إطار عمل لتطوير","فعالية عالية","مهارات جاهزة للاستخدام","طرازات تطوير","تدفق العمل التطويري"]}},"owner":"tygwan","repo":"ultra-codex-init","repoPath":"tygwan/ultra-codex-init","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"feature","description":"통합 기능 개발 워크플로우. Phase, Sprint, Git, 문서를 한 번에 관리합니다.","bodyPreview":"# /feature - 통합 기능 개발 워크플로우\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/feature <subcommand> [options]\n```\n\n### Subcommands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `start` | 새 기능 개발 시작 |\n| `progress` | 현재 기능 진행상황 확인 |\n| `complete` | 기능 개발 완료 및 PR 생성 |\n\n## /feature start\n\n새 기능 개발을 시작합니다.\n\n```bash\n/feature start \"사용자 인증\" --phase 2 --sprint current\n```\n\n### 실행 과정\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    /feature start WORKFLOW","body":"# /feature - 통합 기능 개발 워크플로우\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/feature <subcommand> [options]\n```\n\n### Subcommands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `start` | 새 기능 개발 시작 |\n| `progress` | 현재 기능 진행상황 확인 |\n| `complete` | 기능 개발 완료 및 PR 생성 |\n\n## /feature start\n\n새 기능 개발을 시작합니다.\n\n```bash\n/feature start \"사용자 인증\" --phase 2 --sprint current\n```\n\n### 실행 과정\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    /feature start WORKFLOW                          │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                     │\n│  1. Git Branch 생성                                                 │\n│     └── branch-manager: feature/user-authentication                │\n│                                                                     │\n│  2. Phase Task 연결                                                 │\n│     └── phase-tracker: docs/phases/phase-2/TASKS.md 업데이트       │\n│                                                                     │\n│  3. Sprint Item 추가 (선택)                                         │\n│     └── /sprint add: 현재 Sprint에 연결                            │\n│                                                                     │\n│  4. 진행상황 문서 초기화                                            │\n│     └── progress-tracker: PROGRESS.md 업데이트                     │\n│                                                                     │\n│  5. Context 로드                                                    │\n│     └── context-optimizer: 관련 파일 자동 로드                     │\n│                                                                     │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Options\n\n| Option | Description | Default |\n|--------|-------------|---------|\n| `--phase N` | 연결할 Phase 번호 | current |\n| `--sprint` | Sprint 연결 (current/N/none) | current |\n| `--from-task` | Phase Task ID로 시작 (예: T2-03) | - |\n| `--no-branch` | 브랜치 생성 생략 | false |\n\n### Output\n\n```\n🚀 FEATURE START: 사용자 인증\n\n📋 Setup Complete:\n   Branch:   feature/user-authentication\n   Phase:    Phase 2 - Core Features\n   Task:     T2-05 (newly created)\n   Sprint:   Sprint 3 (5 pts added)\n\n📁 Documents Updated:\n   ✅ docs/phases/phase-2/TASKS.md\n   ✅ docs/PROGRESS.md\n   ✅ docs/CONTEXT.md\n\n🎯 Next Steps:\n   1. Implement the feature\n   2. Run `/feature progress` to track\n   3. Run `/feature complete` when done\n```\n\n## /feature progress\n\n현재 기능 개발 진행상황을 확인합니다.\n\n```bash\n/feature progress\n```\n\n### Output\n\n```\n📊 FEATURE PROGRESS: 사용자 인증\n\n🔀 Branch: feature/user-authentication\n   Commits: 5 (ahead of main by 5)\n   Changed: 8 files (+342, -45)\n\n📈 Task Progress:\n   Phase 2 / T2-05: [████████░░░░░░░░░░░░] 40%\n   Sprint 3: 2/5 pts completed\n\n📝 Recent Activity:\n   • 2h ago: feat(auth): add login form\n   • 4h ago: feat(auth): setup auth service\n   • 1d ago: chore: initialize auth module\n\n⚠️ Reminders:\n   - Tests not yet written\n   - Documentation pending\n```\n\n## /feature complete\n\n기능 개발을 완료하고 PR을 생성합니다.\n\n```bash\n/feature complete [--no-pr]\n```\n\n### 실행 과정\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                   /feature complete WORKFLOW                        │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                     │\n│  1. Quality Gate 실행                                               │\n│     └── quality-gate: lint, test, coverage 검증                    │\n│                                                                     │\n│  2. Phase Task 완료 표시                                            │\n│     └── phase-tracker: T2-05 → ✅                                  │\n│                                                                     │\n│  3. Sprint Item 완료                                                │\n│     └── /sprint complete: 포인트 반영                              │\n│                                                                     │\n│  4. Commit 정리                                                     │\n│     └── commit-helper: 최종 커밋 메시지 생성                       │\n│                                                                     │\n│  5. PR 생성                                                         │\n│     └── pr-creator: GitHub PR 생성                                 │\n│                                                                     │\n│  6. 문서 업데이트                                                   │\n│     └── agile-sync: CHANGELOG, PROGRESS 동기화                     │\n│                                                                     │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Output\n\n```\n✅ FEATURE COMPLETE: 사용자 인증\n\n📋 Quality Checks:\n   ✅ Lint: passed\n   ✅ Tests: 12/12 passed\n   ✅ Coverage: 85% (threshold: 80%)\n\n📊 Updates:\n   ✅ Phase 2 / T2-05: marked complete\n   ✅ Sprint 3: +5 pts (now 24/40)\n   ✅ PROGRESS.md: updated to 65%\n   ✅ CHANGELOG.md: entry added\n\n🔗 Pull Request:\n   #42: feat(auth): add user authentication\n   https://github.com/user/repo/pull/42\n\n🎉 Feature complete! Awaiting review.\n```\n\n## Integration Map\n\n```\n/feature\n    │\n    ├── branch-manager (Git 브랜치)\n    ├── phase-tracker (Phase Task)\n    ├── /sprint (Sprint Item)\n    ├── progress-tracker (진행률)\n    ├── quality-gate (품질 검증)\n    ├── commit-helper (커밋 메시지)\n    ├── pr-creator (PR 생성)\n    └── agile-sync (문서 동기화)\n```\n\n## Related Commands\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `/bugfix` | 버그 수정 워크플로우 |\n| `/release` | 릴리스 워크플로우 |\n| `/phase` | Phase 관리 |\n| `/sprint` | Sprint 관리 |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T00:48:13.246Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates.","zh":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates.","ja":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates.","ko":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates.","es":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates.","fr":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates.","de":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates.","pt":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates.","ru":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates.","ar":"Perfect for Agile Development Agents needing streamlined feature development workflows with phase-based templates."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols.","zh":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols.","ja":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols.","ko":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols.","es":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols.","fr":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols.","de":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols.","pt":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols.","ru":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols.","ar":"Empowers agents to manage feature development lifecycles using subcommands like ''start'', ''progress'', and ''complete'', with integrated support for sprint tracking and pull request generation using Git protocols."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new feature development with custom phase settings","Tracking progress of ongoing features with automated status updates","Automating pull request creation upon feature completion"],"zh":["Initializing new feature development with custom phase settings","Tracking progress of ongoing features with automated status updates","Automating pull request creation upon feature completion"],"ja":["Initializing new feature development with custom phase settings","Tracking progress of ongoing features with automated status updates","Automating pull request creation upon feature completion"],"ko":["Initializing new feature development with custom phase settings","Tracking progress of ongoing features with automated status updates","Automating pull request creation upon feature completion"],"es":["Initializing new feature development with custom phase settings","Tracking progress of ongoing features with automated status updates","Automating pull request creation upon feature completion"],"fr":["Initializing new feature development with cus