аботки","ar":"Agile Sync: إطار عمل مرن للتنمية","en":"agile-sync"},"description":{"zh":"Agile Sync 是一个高效的 Codex 技能框架，提供 58 个即用技能、钩子和基于阶段的开发模板","ja":"Agile Sync は、高効率の Codex スキル フレームワークで、58 のレディースキル、フック、フェーズベースの開発テンプレートを提供します","ko":"Agile Sync는 효율적인 Codex 스킬 프레임워크로, 58개의 즉시 사용 가능한 스킬, 훅, 단계별 개발 템플릿을 제공합니다","es":"Agile Sync es un framework de Codex de alta eficiencia con 58 habilidades listas para usar y plantillas de desarrollo basadas en fases","fr":"Agile Sync est un cadre de Codex haute performance avec 58 compétences prêtes à l''emploi et des modèles de développement basés sur les phases","de":"Agile Sync ist ein Hochleistungs-Codex-Framework mit 58 sofort verwendbaren Fähigkeiten und phasenbasierten Entwicklungsvorlagen","pt":"O Agile Sync é um framework de desenvolvimento ágil de alta eficiência com 58 habilidades prontas para uso e templates de desenvolvimento baseados em fases.","ru":"Agile Sync - высокоэффективный фреймворк для agile-разработки с 58 готовыми навыками и шаблонами разработки на основе фаз.","ar":"Agile Sync هو إطار عمل مرن للتنمية ذو كفاءة عالية مع 58 مهارة جاهزة للاستخدام و قوالب تنمية على أساس المراحل.","en":"High-efficiency Codex skill framework with 58 ready-to-use skills, hooks, and phase-based development templates."},"definition":{"en":"High-efficiency Codex skill framework with 58 ready-to-use skills, hooks, and phase-based development templates."},"features":{"zh":["一键同步所有敏捷开发文档","58 个即用技能和钩子","基于阶段的开发模板","支持多种同步模式","高效的开发框架"],"ja":["すべてのアジャイル開発文書を一括して同期","58 のレディースキルとフック","フェーズベースの開発テンプレート","複数の同期モードをサポート","高効率の開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["모든 애자일 개발 문서를 일괄同步화","58개의 즉시 사용 가능한 스킬과 훅","단계별 개발 템플릿","다중同步 모드 지원","효율적인 개발 프레임워크"],"es":["Sincronización de artefactos de desarrollo ágil","58 habilidades listas para usar","Plantillas de desarrollo basadas en fases","Opciones de sincronización personalizables","Validación de artefactos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Synchronisation d''artefacts de développement agile","58 compétences prêtes à l''emploi","Modèles de développement basés sur les phases","Options de synchronisation personnalisables","Validation des artefacts de développement"],"de":["Synchronisierung von agilen Entwicklungsaufgaben","58 sofort verwendbare Fähigkeiten","Phasenbasierte Entwicklungsvorlagen","Anpassbare Synchronisierungsoptionen","Validierung von Entwicklungsaufgaben"],"pt":["58 habilidades prontas para uso","Templates de desenvolvimento baseados em fases","Sincronização de artefatos de desenvolvimento ágil","Opções de sincronização personalizáveis","Validação de inconsistências"],"ru":["58 готовых навыков","Шаблоны разработки на основе фаз","Синхронизация артефактов agile-разработки","Настраиваемые опции синхронизации","Проверка на несоответствия"],"ar":["58 مهارة جاهزة للاستخدام","قوالب تنمية على أساس المراحل","تنسيق مستندات التنمية المتنقلة","خيارات تنسيق قابلة للتعديل","تحقق من عدم التناسق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agile Sync","开发框架","敏捷开发","一键同步","高效开发","Codex 技能","开发模板"],"ja":["Agile Sync","開発フレームワーク","アジャイル開発","一括同期","高効率開発","Codex スキル","開発テンプレート"],"ko":["Agile Sync","개발 프레임워크","애자일 개발","일괄同步화","효율적인 개발","Codex 스킬","개발 템플릿"],"es":["agile sync","framework de codex","desarrollo ágil","sincronización de artefactos","plantillas de desarrollo","validación de artefactos"],"fr":["agile sync","cadre de codex","développement agile","synchronisation d''artefacts","modèles de développement","validation des artefacts"],"de":["agile sync","codex-framework","agiles entwickeln","synchronisierung von aufgaben","phasenbasierte entwicklungsmodelle","validierung von aufgaben"],"pt":["desenvolvimento ágil","framework de desenvolvimento","habilidades prontas para uso","templates de desenvolvimento","sincronização de artefatos","validação de inconsistências"],"ru":["agile-разработка","фреймворк для разработки","готовые навыки","шаблоны разработки","синхронизация артефактов","проверка на несоответствия"],"ar":["التنمية المتنقلة","إطار عمل التنمية","مهارات جاهزة للاستخدام","قوالب التنمية","تنسيق مستندات التنمية","تحقق من عدم التناسق"]}},"owner":"tygwan","repo":"ultra-codex-init","repoPath":"tygwan/ultra-codex-init","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agile-sync","description":"Synchronize all agile development artifacts in one command. Updates CHANGELOG, README stats, progress tracking, and validates documentation completeness.","bodyPreview":"# Agile Sync Skill\n\nOne-command synchronization of all agile development artifacts.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/agile-sync [--full|--quick|--validate]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--full` | Complete sync: changelog + readme + progress + validation |\n| `--quick` | Quick sync: readme stats + recent changes only |\n| `--validate` | Validate only: check for inconsistencies without changes |\n| (default) | Standard sync: changelog + readme + progress |\n\n## Workflow Steps\n\n| Step |","body":"# Agile Sync Skill\n\nOne-command synchronization of all agile development artifacts.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n/agile-sync [--full|--quick|--validate]\n```\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--full` | Complete sync: changelog + readme + progress + validation |\n| `--quick` | Quick sync: readme stats + recent changes only |\n| `--validate` | Validate only: check for inconsistencies without changes |\n| (default) | Standard sync: changelog + readme + progress |\n\n## Workflow Steps\n\n| Step | Action | Input | Output |\n|------|--------|-------|--------|\n| 1 | Analyze Git State | `git log`, `git status` | Branch, commits, uncommitted files |\n| 2 | Update CHANGELOG.md | Commits grouped by type | `feat`/`fix`/`refactor`/`docs` entries |\n| 3 | Sync README Stats | Component counts via `find` | Updated Stats table |\n| 4 | Update Progress | Phase TASKS.md scan | PROGRESS.md with progress bar |\n| 5 | Validate Docs | Link/file checks | Validation report |\n| 6 | Generate Report | All above | Sync summary with recommendations |\n\n### Step 2: CHANGELOG Groups\n\n| Commit Type | CHANGELOG Section |\n|-------------|------------------|\n| `feat` | Added |\n| `fix` | Fixed |\n| `refactor` | Changed |\n| `docs` | Documentation |\n\n### Step 3: README Stats\n\n```bash\nagents_count=$(find .codex/agents -name \"*.md\" | wc -l)\nskills_count=$(find .codex/skills -name \"SKILL.md\" -o -name \"*.md\" | wc -l)\n```\n\n### Step 4: Progress (Phase-Integrated)\n\nSource: `docs/phases/phase-*/TASKS.md`\nTarget: `docs/PROGRESS.md`\nFormat: `[████████████░░░░░░░░] 60% (Phase 2 of 5)`\n\n> Uses Phase system. Legacy `docs/progress/status.md` is deprecated.\n\n## Integration\n\n| Context | Command |\n|---------|---------|\n| After feature implementation | `/agile-sync` |\n| Before creating PR | `/agile-sync --full` |\n| Quick check before commit | `/agile-sync --validate` |\n| With active sprint | Auto-includes sprint metrics |\n| Auto-triggered by | `auto-doc-sync` hook, `.codex/` changes |\n\n## Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"agile\": {\n    \"auto_changelog\": true,\n    \"auto_readme_sync\": true,\n    \"sprint_tracking\": true,\n    \"velocity_tracking\": true,\n    \"sync_on_commit\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n| DO | DON''T |\n|----|-------|\n| Run before PR creation | Skip validation before releases |\n| Run `--validate` before releases | Manually edit generated sections |\n| Keep CHANGELOG under version control | Ignore sync warnings |\n| Use conventional commits | - |\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Error | Fix |\n|-------|-----|\n| CHANGELOG.md not found | `/agile-sync` creates automatically |\n| README stats section missing | Add `## Stats` table to README.md |\n| Progress tracking failed | `mkdir -p docs/progress && touch docs/progress/status.md` |\n\n## Related\n\n| Skill | Purpose |\n|-------|---------|\n| `/sprint` | Sprint lifecycle management |\n| `/readme-sync` | Detailed README synchronization |\n| `/changelog` | Manual changelog management |\n| `/doc-validate` | Comprehensive doc validation |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T00:48:18.060Z","qualityScore":80}');
