 및 블로커 등 정보를 제공합니다","es":"Create-hokoku es una herramienta que genera informes de estado actual para Slack, basándose en la información más reciente de TODO y el estado actual.","fr":"Create-hokoku est un outil qui génère des rapports de statut actuel pour Slack, basés sur les informations les plus récentes de TODO et de l''état actuel.","de":"Create-hokoku ist ein Tool, das Statusberichte für Slack generiert, basierend auf den neuesten Informationen von TODO und dem aktuellen Status.","pt":"O create-hokoku é uma habilidade que gera relatórios de status personalizados para o Slack","ru":"Create-hokoku - это навык, который генерирует индивидуальные отчеты о статусе для Slack","ar":"create-hokoku هو مهارة يولد تقارير حالة مخصصة لل슬اك","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["生成 Slack 报告","包括当前情况、任务和阻塞等信息","提高开发效率","支持多语言"],"ja":["Slack 投稿用のステータス報告を生成","現在の状況、タスク、ブロッカーなどを含む","開発効率を向上させる","多言語対応"],"ko":["슬랙 보고서 생성","현재 상황, 태스크, 블로커 등 정보를 포함","개발 효율성을 높임","다중 언어 지원"],"es":["Generación automática de informes de estado actual","Integración con Slack para envío de informes","Personalización de la estructura y el contenido de los informes","Compatibilidad con formato Markdown","Actualización en tiempo real de la información de TODO"],"fr":["Génération automatique de rapports de statut actuel","Intégration avec Slack pour l''envoi de rapports","Personnalisation de la structure et du contenu des rapports","Compatibilité avec le format Markdown","Mise à jour en temps réel des informations de TODO"],"de":["Automatisierte Erstellung von Statusberichten","Integration mit Slack für den Versand von Berichten","Anpassung der Struktur und des Inhalts der Berichte","Kompatibilität mit Markdown-Format","Echtzeit-Aktualisierung der TODO-Informationen"],"pt":["Geração de relatórios de status personalizados","Integração com o Slack","Leitura de arquivos Markdown","Formatação de texto personalizada"],"ru":["Генерация индивидуальных отчетов о статусе","Интеграция со Slack","Чтение файлов Markdown","Персонализированная форматировка текста"],"ar":["إنشاء تقارير الحالة المخصصة","التكامل مع Slack","قراءة ملفات Markdown","تنسيق نص مخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["create-hokoku","Slack 报告","开发效率","任务管理","阻塞","多语言"],"ja":["create-hokoku","Slack 投稿","開発効率","タスク管理","ブロッカー","多言語"],"ko":["create-hokoku","슬랙 보고서","개발 효율성","태스크 관리","블로커","다중 언어"],"es":["create-hokoku","generador de informes","estado actual","Slack","automatización","TODO","Markdown","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["create-hokoku","générateur de rapports","statut actuel","Slack","automatisation","TODO","Markdown","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["create-hokoku","Ersteller von Berichten","Statusbericht","Slack","Automatisierung","TODO","Markdown","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["relatórios de status","slack","create-hokoku","automatização","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","integração de api"],"ru":["отчеты о статусе","slack","create-hokoku","автоматизация","инструменты разработки","интеграция api"],"ar":["تقارير الحالة","slack","create-hokoku","أتمتة","أدوات التطوير","تكامل واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"miura-188cm","repo":"ai-send-todo","repoPath":"miura-188cm/ai-send-todo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-hokoku","description":"MarkdownのTODO/状況ファイルから現時点の状況報告文を作成する。現在タスク、今日やること、今後の予定、進捗、ブロッカーを送信前に整理するときに使う。","bodyPreview":"# create-hokoku\n\nSlack投稿向けの `current_status` 報告文を生成する。\n\n## 手順\n\n1. 最新のTODO/状況Markdownと直近更新を読む。\n2. 現在・今日・今後の観点で箇条書きを作る。\n3. 表現は具体的かつ短くする。\n4. `send-slack` skill（Slack MCP）に渡して送信確認を待つ。\n\n## 出力セクション\n\n- 現在の状況\n- 今持っているタスク\n- 今日やるタスク\n- 今後やるタスク\n- ブロッカー\n\n## 注意点\n\n- 自動送信しない。\n- 不確実な項目は明示する。\n- TODOパスは `TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md` を基準に読む。\n- 無駄な文言は必要ない\n\n## fomat\n\n```markdown\n## 現在の状況\n\n## 進行中のタスク\n\n### 今日やるタスク\n\n### 今後やるタスク\n\n### ブロッカー/懸念事項","body":"# create-hokoku\n\nSlack投稿向けの `current_status` 報告文を生成する。\n\n## 手順\n\n1. 最新のTODO/状況Markdownと直近更新を読む。\n2. 現在・今日・今後の観点で箇条書きを作る。\n3. 表現は具体的かつ短くする。\n4. `send-slack` skill（Slack MCP）に渡して送信確認を待つ。\n\n## 出力セクション\n\n- 現在の状況\n- 今持っているタスク\n- 今日やるタスク\n- 今後やるタスク\n- ブロッカー\n\n## 注意点\n\n- 自動送信しない。\n- 不確実な項目は明示する。\n- TODOパスは `TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md` を基準に読む。\n- 無駄な文言は必要ない\n\n## fomat\n\n```markdown\n## 現在の状況\n\n## 進行中のタスク\n\n### 今日やるタスク\n\n### 今後やるタスク\n\n### ブロッカー/懸念事項\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T00:48:14.989Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese","zh":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese","ja":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese","ko":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese","es":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese","fr":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese","de":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese","pt":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese","ru":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese","ar":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated status reporting in Japanese"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure","zh":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure","ja":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure","ko":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure","es":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure","fr":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure","de":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure","pt":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure","ru":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure","ar":"Empowers agents to generate concise status reports in Markdown format, leveraging TODO lists and sending updates to Slack via the send-slack skill, utilizing Markdown formatting and TODO/YYYY/MM/DD/TODO.md file structure"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"],"zh":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"],"ja":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"],"ko":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"],"es":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"],"fr":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"],"de":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"],"pt":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"],"ru":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"],"ar":["Automating daily status updates","Generating task summaries for Slack channels","Creating bullet-point lists for current and future tasks"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"],"zh":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"],"ja":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"],"ko":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"],"es":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"],"fr":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"],"de":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"],"pt":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"],"ru":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"],"ar":["Requires access to TODO markdown files","Slack MCP and send-slack skill integration needed","Manual review recommended before automatic sending"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
