tocolo de desarrollo es un conjunto de pasos que siguen los desarrolladores para crear nuevos proyectos de manera eficiente","fr":"Le protocole de développement est un ensemble d''étapes que les développeurs suivent pour créer de nouveaux projets de manière efficace","de":"Das Entwicklungprotokoll ist eine Reihe von Schritten, die Entwickler befolgen, um neue Projekte effizient zu erstellen","pt":"O protocolo de desenvolvimento de código é um conjunto de etapas para criar soluções de software eficazes, incluindo verificação de duplicatas e análise de t...","ru":"Протокол разработки кода - это набор шагов для создания эффективных решений программного обеспечения, включая проверку дубликатов и анализ задач","ar":"بروتوكول تطوير البرمجيات هو مجموعة من الخطوات لإنشاء حلول برمجية فعالة، بما في ذلك التحقق من التكرارات وتحليل المهام","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["重复检查","JTBD分析","用户需求分析","开发流程优化","代码重用"],"ja":["重複チェック","JTBD分析","ユーザーニーズ分析","開発プロセス最適化","コード再利用"],"ko":["중복 확인","JTBD 분석","사용자需求 분석","개발 프로세스 최적화","코드 재사용"],"es":["Verificación de duplicados","Análisis de JTBD para características orientadas al usuario","Creación de nuevos proyectos de manera eficiente","Extensión de proyectos existentes","Mejora de la colaboración en equipo"],"fr":["Vérification des doublons","Analyse de JTBD pour les fonctionnalités orientées utilisateur","Création de nouveaux projets de manière efficace","Extension de projets existants","Amélioration de la collaboration d''équipe"],"de":["Dopplungsprüfung","JTBD-Analyse für benutzerorientierte Funktionen","Erstellung neuer Projekte auf effiziente Weise","Erweiterung bestehender Projekte","Verbesserung der Teamzusammenarbeit"],"pt":["Verificação de duplicatas","Análise de tarefas","Criação de soluções personalizadas","Otimização de código","Testes e depuração"],"ru":["Проверка дубликатов","Анализ задач","Создание индивидуальных решений","Оптимизация кода","Тестирование и отладка"],"ar":["التحقق من التكرارات","تحليل المهام","إنشاء حلول مخصصة","تحسين الكود","اختبار وتصحيح الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["开发协议","开发流程","重复检查","JTBD分析","用户需求分析","代码重用"],"ja":["開発プロトコル","開発プロセス","重複チェック","JTBD分析","ユーザーニーズ分析","コード再利用"],"ko":["개발 프로토콜","개발 프로세스","중복 확인","JTBD 분석","사용자需求 분석","코드 재사용"],"es":["desarrollo de software","protocolo de desarrollo","verificación de duplicados","análisis de JTBD","colaboración en equipo","creación de proyectos","extensión de proyectos"],"fr":["développement de logiciel","protocole de développement","vérification des doublons","analyse de JTBD","collaboration d''équipe","création de projets","extension de projets"],"de":["Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungprotokoll","Dopplungsprüfung","JTBD-Analyse","Teamzusammenarbeit","Erstellung von Projekten","Erweiterung von Projekten"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de software","protocolo de desenvolvimento","verificação de duplicatas","análise de tarefas","criação de soluções","otimização de código","testes e depuração"],"ru":["разработка программного обеспечения","протоколы разработки","проверка дубликатов","анализ задач","создание решений","оптимизация кода","тестирование и отладка"],"ar":["تطوير البرمجيات","بروتوكولات التطوير","التحقق من التكرارات","تحليل المهام","إنشاء حلول","تحسين الكود","اختبار وتصحيح الأخطاء"]}},"owner":"dmitryprg-ai","repo":"cursor-develop-autorules","repoPath":"dmitryprg-ai/cursor-develop-autorules","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"development","description":"Develop new features, functionality, and enhancements. Use when creating new features, adding functionality, building components, or when user says add, create, build, develop, implement. Includes Duplicate Check, JTBD Analysis, TDD approach, UI pattern reuse, and service restart verification.","bodyPreview":"# Development Protocol\n\n## Pre-Action (MANDATORY before coding)\n\n### 1. Duplicate Check\n\n```markdown\n## DUPLICATE CHECK\n**Target:** [what I''m creating]\n**Search:** semantic/grep/file -> [found/not found]\n**Decision:** CREATE NEW / EXTEND EXISTING / ASK USER\n```\n\n### 2. JTBD Analysis (for user-facing features)\n\n```markdown\n## JTBD ANALYSIS\n**Job Story:** When [context], user wants [action], to get [result] and [benefit]\n**Questions:**\n1. What task are they solving? -> [answer]\n2. What''s blocking","body":"# Development Protocol\n\n## Pre-Action (MANDATORY before coding)\n\n### 1. Duplicate Check\n\n```markdown\n## DUPLICATE CHECK\n**Target:** [what I''m creating]\n**Search:** semantic/grep/file -> [found/not found]\n**Decision:** CREATE NEW / EXTEND EXISTING / ASK USER\n```\n\n### 2. JTBD Analysis (for user-facing features)\n\n```markdown\n## JTBD ANALYSIS\n**Job Story:** When [context], user wants [action], to get [result] and [benefit]\n**Questions:**\n1. What task are they solving? -> [answer]\n2. What''s blocking them? -> [answer]\n3. What change will help? -> [answer]\n```\n\n### 3. Find Working Example\n\nFor UI: find a working pattern in the project first. Copy the pattern, then adapt. Do NOT invent CSS classes without checking they work.\n\n### 4. Control File Size\n\nPlan logic across multiple files. Refer to `standard-file-size-limits-agent.mdc` rule.\n\n## Plan\n\n```markdown\n## DEVELOPMENT PLAN\n**Task:** [what to do]\n**Expected Output:** [artifacts]\n**Test Cases:** [input -> expected output]\n```\n\n## Execute (TDD approach)\n\nFollow the `tdd-workflow` skill for full TDD process (Red → Green → Refactor):\n1. Fill test cases table BEFORE code (Phase 0)\n2. Write failing tests (Phase 1 — RED)\n3. Write minimal code to pass (Phase 2 — GREEN)\n4. Refactor (Phase 3)\n5. Restart affected services and verify\n\n## Verify\n\n- [ ] 0 linter errors\n- [ ] Tests pass\n- [ ] JTBD: Job implemented, UI about benefits\n- [ ] Each file opened and verified\n- [ ] Services restarted if needed\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **UI Components**: Find working example in project first. Don''t use CSS classes without checking they work.\n- **Type Consistency**: Database types may differ from JSON (bigint -> string). Check actual types.\n- **Backend Modules**: Follow pattern: types -> repository -> service -> routes\n- **External APIs**: List/Enum fields may contain IDs, not text. Need mapping.\n- **Entry Points**: Use high-level orchestrator services, not low-level methods.\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nFor prompt preparation methodology, see [PREPARE-PROMPT.md](references/PREPARE-PROMPT.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:14:01.175Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis.","zh":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis.","ja":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis.","ko":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis.","es":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis.","fr":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis.","de":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis.","pt":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis.","ru":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis.","ar":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured protocol implementation for duplicate checks and JTBD analysis."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding.","zh":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding.","ja":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding.","ko":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding.","es":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding.","fr":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding.","de":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding.","pt":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding.","ru":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding.","ar":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using semantic search, grep, and file analysis, enabling informed decisions on creating new or extending existing features, and facilitating user-centric design through Job Story analysis and context understanding."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"],"zh":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"],"ja":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"],"ko":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"],"es":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"],"fr":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"],"de":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"],"pt":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"],"ru":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"],"ar":["Automating duplicate checks for new features","Conducting JTBD analysis for user-facing features","Generating job stories for context-specific user needs"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"],"zh":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"],"ja":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"],"ko":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"],"es":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"],"fr":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"],"de":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"],"pt":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"],"ru":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"],"ar":["Requires manual input for target and search parameters","Limited to markdown format for analysis and documentation"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('JustineDevs/Fyleris/blueprintkit-plugin', 'community', 'JustineDevs', 'Fyleris', 'JustineDevs/Fyleris', 'blueprintkit-plugin', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z', '2026-02-19T01:14:09.717Z', NULL, '{"id":"JustineDevs/Fyleris/blueprintkit-plugin","name":"blueprintkit-plugin","description":{"zh":"BlueprintKit插件提供安全可靠的AI助手云端家园，支持多个平台，适合小团队和独立创始人","ja":"BlueprintKitプラグインは、安全で信頼性の高いAIアシスタントのクラウドホームを提供し、複数のプラットフォームをサポートし、小規模チームとインディーファウンダーに適しています","ko":"BlueprintKit 플러그인은 안전하고 신뢰할 수 있는 AI 어시스턴트 클라우드 홈을 제공하며 여러 플랫폼을 지원하여 작은 팀과 독립 창업자에게 적합합니다","es":"El plugin BlueprintKit proporciona un entorno de control seguro y listo para la producción para asistentes AI en varias plataformas","fr":"Le plugin BlueprintKit fournit un environnement de contrôle sécurisé et prêt pour la production pour les assistants AI sur plusieurs plateformes","de":"Das BlueprintKit-Plugin bietet eine sichere und produktionsbereite Steuerungsumgebung für AI-Assistenten auf verschiedenen Plattformen","pt":"O BlueprintKit Plugin fornece uma plataforma de controle segura e escalável para assistentes de IA, permitindo que equipes pequenas e fundadores independente criem soluções de IA prontas para produção sem infraestrutura","ru":"BlueprintKit Плагин предоставляет безопасную и масштабируемую платформу контроля для помощников ИИ, позволяя небольшим командам и независимым основателям создавать решения ИИ, готовые к производству, без инфраструктуры","ar":"يوفر BlueprintKit Plugin منصة تحكم آمنة وموسعة النطاق للأداة الذكية، مما يسمح للفرق الصغيرة والمؤسسين المستقلين بإنشاء حلول ذكية جاهزة للإنتاج دون بنية تحتية","en":"A secure home and control plane for always‑on AI assistants that live across Slack, Discord, WhatsApp, Telegram, and WebChat, giving small teams and indie founders a production‑ready “Cloud Home” for their agents without touching infra. ​"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"BlueprintKit插件 - AI助手的安全云端家园","ja":"BlueprintKitプラグイン - AIアシスタントの安全なクラウドホーム","ko":"BlueprintKit 플러그인 - AI 어시스턴트의 보안 클라우드 홈","es":"BlueprintKit Plugin: Entorno de control para asistentes AI","fr":"BlueprintKit Plugin : Contrôle et sécurité pour les assis...","de":"BlueprintKit-Plugin: Sicherer Kontrollbereich für AI-Assi...","pt":"BlueprintKit Plugin: Plataforma de Controle para Assisten...","ru":"BlueprintKit Плагин: Безопасный дом и контрольная плоскос...","ar":"BlueprintKit Plugin: منصة التحكم للأداة الذكية","en":"blueprintkit-plugin"},"description":{"zh":"BlueprintKit插件提供安全可靠的AI助手云端家园，支持多个平台，适合小团队和独立创始人","ja":"BlueprintKitプラグインは、安全で信頼性の高いAIアシスタントのクラウドホームを提供し、複数のプラットフォームをサポートし、小規模チームとインディーファウンダーに適しています","ko":"BlueprintKit 플러그인은 안전하고 신뢰할 수 있는 AI 어시스턴트 클라우드 홈을 제공하며 여러 플랫폼을 지원하여 작은 팀과 독립 창업자에게 적합합니다","es":"El plugin BlueprintKit proporciona un entorno de control seguro y listo para la producción para asistentes AI en varias plataformas","fr":"Le plugin BlueprintKit fournit un environnement de contrôle sécurisé et prêt pour la production pour les assistants AI sur plusieurs plateformes","de":"Das BlueprintKit-Plugin bietet eine sichere und produktionsbereite Steuerungsumgebung für AI-Assistenten auf verschiedenen Plattformen","pt":"O BlueprintKit Plugin fornece uma plataforma de controle segura e escalável para assistentes de IA, permitindo que equipes pequenas e fundadores independente...","ru":"BlueprintKit Плагин предоставляет безопасную и масштабируемую платформу контроля для помощников ИИ, позволяя небольшим командам и независимым основателям соз...","ar":"يوفر BlueprintKit Plugin منصة تحكم آمنة وموسعة النطاق للأداة الذكية، مما يسمح للفرق الصغيرة والمؤسسين المستقلين بإنشاء حلول ذكية جاهزة للإنتاج دون بنية تحتية","en":"A secure home and control plane for always‑on AI assistants that live across Slack, Discord, WhatsApp, Telegram, and WebChat, giving small teams and indie fo..."},"definition":{"en":"A secure home and control plane for always‑on AI assistants that live across Slack, Discord, WhatsApp, Telegram, and WebChat, giving small teams and indie founders a production‑ready “Cloud Home” for their agents without touching infra. ​"},"features":{"zh":["支持多个平台，包括Slack、Discord、WhatsApp、Telegram和WebChat","提供安全可靠的AI助手云端家园","适合小团队和独立创始人","生产就绪的AI助手解决方案","简化AI助手开发和部署"],"ja":["複数のプラットフォームをサポートし、Slack、Discord、WhatsApp、Telegram、WebChatが含まれます","安全で信頼性の高いAIアシスタントのクラウドホームを提供します","小規模チームとインディーファウンダーに適しています","生产就绪のAIアシスタントソリューション","AIアシスタントの開発と展開を簡素化"],"ko":["여러 플랫폼을 지원하며 Slack, Discord, WhatsApp, Telegram 및 WebChat을 포함","안전하고 신뢰할 수 있는 AI 어시스턴트 클라우드 홈을 제공","작은 팀과 독립 창업자에게 적합","생산 준비된 AI 어시스턴트 솔루션","AI 어시스턴트 개발 및 배포를 단순화"],"es":["Entorno de control seguro para asistentes AI","Interfaz unificada para planificación y ejecución de proyectos","Compatibilidad con Slack, Discord, WhatsApp, Telegram y WebChat","Incluye 14 secciones de planificación y 9 habilidades especializadas","Listo para la producción y sin necesidad de infraestructura"],"fr":["Environnement de contrôle sécurisé pour les assistants AI","Interface unifiée pour la planification et l''exécution de projets","Compatibilité avec Slack, Discord, WhatsApp, Telegram et WebChat","Inclut 14 sections de planification et 9 compétences spécialisées","Prêt pour la production et sans besoin d''infrastructure"],"de":["Sichere Steuerungsumgebung für AI-Assistenten","Einheitliche Schnittstelle für Projektplanung und -ausführung","Kompatibilität mit Slack, Discord, WhatsApp, Telegram und WebChat","Inklusive 14 Planungsabschnitte und 9 spezialisierte Fähigkeiten","Produktionsbereit und ohne Infrastrukturbedarf"],"pt":["Plataforma de controle segura para assistentes de IA","Escalável e pronta para produção","Não requer infraestrutura","Inclui 14 seções de planejamento abrangentes","Inclui 9 habilidades especializadas de Claude","Interface unificada para planejamento e execução"],"ru":["Безопасная платформа контроля для помощников ИИ","Масштабируемая и готова к производству","Не требует инфраструктуры","Включает 14 всесторонних разделов планирования","Включает 9 специализированных навыков Claude","Унифицированный интерфейс для планирования и выполнения"],"ar":["منصة تحكم آمنة للأداة الذكية","موسعة النطاق وجاهزة للإنتاج","لا تتطلب بنية تحتية","تتضمن 14 قسمًا شاملاً للتخطيط","تتضمن 9 مهارات متخصصة من Claude","واجهة موحدة للتخطيط والتنفيذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["BlueprintKit插件","AI助手","云端家园","小团队","独立创始人","Slack","Discord","WhatsApp","Telegram","WebChat"],"ja":["BlueprintKitプラグイン","AIアシスタント","クラウドホーム","小規模チーム","インディーファウンダー","Slack","Discord","WhatsApp","Telegram","WebChat"],"ko":["BlueprintKit 플러그인","AI 어시스턴트","클라우드 홈","작은 팀","독립 창업자","Slack","Discord","WhatsApp","Telegram","WebChat"],"es":["asistentes AI","entorno de control","planificación de proyectos","ejecución de proyectos","Slack","Discord","WhatsApp","Telegram","WebChat"],"fr":["assistants AI","environnement de contrôle","planification de projets","exécution de projets","Slack","Discord","WhatsApp","Telegram","WebChat"],"de":["AI-Assistenten","Steuerungsumgebung","Projektplanung","Projektausführung","Slack","Discord","WhatsApp","Telegram","WebChat"],"pt":["BlueprintKit Plugin","assistente de IA","plataforma de controle","segurança","escalabilidade","planejamento","execução","IA pronta para produção"],"ru":["BlueprintKit Плагин","помощник ИИ","платформа контроля","безопасность","масштабируемость","планирование","выполнение","ИИ, готовый к производству"],"ar":["BlueprintKit Plugin","الأداة الذكية","منصة التحكم","الأمان","التوسع","التخطيط","التنفيذ","الذكاء الاصطناعي جاهز للإنتاج"]}},"owner":"JustineDevs","repo":"Fyleris","repoPath":"JustineDevs/Fyleris","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"blueprintkit-plugin","description":"BlueprintKit Plugin - Complete planning framework automatically including all 14 planning sections (.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/0-Master-Index.md through .claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/13-Lessons-Learned-Continuous-Improvement.md) plus all 9 Claude Skills (tech-stack-selector, architecture-decisions, code-standards-enforcer, ci-cd-pipeline-builder, agile-executor, project-risk-identifier, automation-orchestrator, webapp-testing, web-artifacts-builder). When installed, all files are immediately available.","bodyPreview":"# BlueprintKit Plugin\n\nThis plugin automatically includes the complete BlueprintKit framework: all 14 planning sections plus all 9 specialized Claude Skills. When installed, all planning templates and execution skills are immediately available in a single package.\n\n## Overview\n\nThe Project Planning Starter Pack Plugin provides a unified interface to a complete planning framework with 14 comprehensive planning sections plus nine specialized skills that cover the complete project lifecycle from pl","body":"# BlueprintKit Plugin\n\nThis plugin automatically includes the complete BlueprintKit framework: all 14 planning sections plus all 9 specialized Claude Skills. When installed, all planning templates and execution skills are immediately available in a single package.\n\n## Overview\n\nThe Project Planning Starter Pack Plugin provides a unified interface to a complete planning framework with 14 comprehensive planning sections plus nine specialized skills that cover the complete project lifecycle from planning through deployment and continuous improvement.\n\n## Complete Planning Framework\n\nThis plugin includes 14 comprehensive planning sections:\n\n1. **Master Index** - Complete navigation guide and overview\n2. **Executive Summary** - Vision, problem statement, expected outcomes\n3. **Objectives & Success Metrics** - Quantified success criteria and KPIs\n4. **Scope Definition** - What''s in/out, constraints, assumptions\n5. **System Architecture & Design** - Technical blueprint and architecture decisions\n6. **Technical Execution Workflow** - Complete technical implementation guide\n7. **Project Phases & Timeline** - Phases, milestones, and timeline\n8. **Resource Planning** - Team structure, skills, budget allocation\n9. **Risk Management** - Risk identification, mitigation, contingency planning\n10. **Execution Strategy** - Daily execution, ceremonies, quality assurance\n11. **Monitoring & Reporting** - Metrics tracking and status reporting\n12. **ROI & Value Realization** - Financial projections and value tracking\n13. **Governance & Decision-Making** - Decision authority and escalation procedures\n14. **Lessons Learned & Continuous Improvement** - Learning capture and process improvement\n\n## Bundled Skills\n\nThis plugin also includes nine specialized execution skills:\n\n1. **tech-stack-selector** - Technology decision framework with structured recommendations\n2. **architecture-decisions** - Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) documentation\n3. **code-standards-enforcer** - Comprehensive code review checklists and quality standards\n4. **ci-cd-pipeline-builder** - GitHub Actions workflow templates and automation\n5. **agile-executor** - Sprint planning, retrospectives, and Agile ceremony facilitation\n6. **project-risk-identifier** - Risk assessment frameworks and mitigation strategies\n7. **automation-orchestrator** - Script orchestration for setup, validation, and deployment\n8. **webapp-testing** - Playwright-based web application testing toolkit\n9. **web-artifacts-builder** - React + TypeScript artifact creation with shadcn/ui\n\n## Installation\n\n### For Claude Code Users\n\n1. Clone or copy this repository to your local machine\n2. Ensure the `.claude-plugin/` directory is in your project root\n3. Claude Code will automatically detect and load the plugin\n\n### For Skills.sh Users\n\nInstall BlueprintKit from skills.sh:\n\n```bash\nnpx skills add JustineDevs/blueprintkit\n```\n\nThis automatically installs:\n- All 14 planning sections from `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/` directory\n- All 9 Claude Skills from `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/` directory\n- Complete framework ready to use immediately\n\n## Usage\n\n### Individual Skill Access\n\nEach skill in `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/` can be accessed individually. Skills auto-activate based on natural language queries:\n\n- \"What tech stack should we use?\" → tech-stack-selector\n- \"Create an ADR\" → architecture-decisions\n- \"Code review checklist\" → code-standards-enforcer\n- \"Setup CI/CD\" → ci-cd-pipeline-builder\n- \"Plan sprint\" → agile-executor\n- \"Identify risks\" → project-risk-identifier\n- \"Set up Claude skills\" → automation-orchestrator\n- \"Test web application\" → webapp-testing\n- \"Build web artifact\" → web-artifacts-builder\n\n### Plugin-Level Usage\n\nThe plugin provides unified access to all skills. Ask Claude:\n\n- \"Help me plan this project\" - Activates multiple relevant skills\n- \"Set up project automation\" - Uses automation-orchestrator and related skills\n- \"Review project quality\" - Combines code-standards-enforcer with risk management\n\n## Automatic File Access\n\nWhen BlueprintKit is installed, the following files are automatically available:\n\n### Planning Sections (All 14 Files)\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/0-Master-Index.md` - Complete navigation guide\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/1-Executive-Summary.md` - Vision and problem statement\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/2-Objectives-Success-Metrics.md` - Success criteria and KPIs\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/3-Scope-Definition.md` - Project boundaries\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/4-System-Architecture-Design.md` - Technical blueprint\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/5-Technical-Execution-Workflow.md` - Implementation guide\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/6-Project-Phases-Timeline.md` - Phases and milestones\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/7-Resource-Planning.md` - Team and budget\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/8-Risk-Management.md` - Risk identification and mitigation\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/9-Execution-Strategy.md` - Daily execution and ceremonies\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/10-Monitoring-Reporting.md` - Metrics and reporting\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/11-ROI-Value-Realization.md` - Financial projections\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/12-Governance-Decision-Making.md` - Decision authority\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/13-Lessons-Learned-Continuous-Improvement.md` - Learning capture\n\n### Claude Skills (All 9 Skills)\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/tech-stack-selector/SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - Technology decisions\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/architecture-decisions/SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - ADR documentation\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/code-standards-enforcer/SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - Code quality\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/ci-cd-pipeline-builder/SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - CI/CD automation\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/agile-executor/SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - Agile ceremonies\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/project-risk-identifier/SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - Risk assessment\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/automation-orchestrator/SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - Script orchestration\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/webapp-testing/SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - Web testing toolkit\n- `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/web-artifacts-builder/SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - Artifact creation\n\nEach skill directory contains:\n- `SKILL-INTERNAL.md` - Internal skill definition (not detected by skills.sh, only accessible via blueprintkit)\n- `references/` - Detailed documentation and templates\n- `scripts/` - Utility scripts for automation\n\n## Integration with Project Planning\n\nThis plugin integrates with the Project Planning Starter Pack''s comprehensive planning framework:\n\n- **Planning Sections** (`.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/`) - 14 planning templates\n- **Technical Documentation** (`docs/reference/`) - Architecture and technical summaries\n- **Configuration Files** - CI/CD, linting, testing configurations\n- **Ready-to-Build Structure** - Organized application code directories\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Complete Project Setup\n\n**User**: \"Help me set up a new TypeScript project with CI/CD\"\n\n**Plugin Response**:\n1. Activates tech-stack-selector for technology recommendations\n2. Activates ci-cd-pipeline-builder for GitHub Actions setup\n3. Activates code-standards-enforcer for quality gates\n4. Activates automation-orchestrator for script setup\n5. Provides integrated workflow combining all skills\n\n### Example 2: Architecture Documentation\n\n**User**: \"Document our database choice and set up testing\"\n\n**Plugin Response**:\n1. Activates architecture-decisions for ADR creation\n2. Activates webapp-testing for test setup\n3. Links to planning sections for context\n4. Provides integrated documentation workflow\n\n## Configuration\n\nThe plugin is configured via `.claude-plugin/plugin.mdc` which defines:\n- Activation rules\n- File patterns to monitor\n- Related documentation references\n- Plugin metadata\n\n## Contributing\n\nTo contribute to this plugin:\n\n1. Review individual skill definitions in `.claude/skills/blueprintkit/`\n2. Follow the skill creation guidelines in `skills-reference/template/SKILL.md`\n3. Update this plugin''s SKILL.md when adding new skills\n4. Test plugin loading in Claude Code\n5. Submit improvements via pull request\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- [Main README](../README.md) - Project overview\n- [Claude Skills README](../.claude/README.md) - Skills documentation\n- [Planning Framework](../.claude/skills/blueprintkit/planning/) - Complete planning templates\n- [Technical Summary](../docs/reference/TECHNICAL-SUMMARY.md) - Technical reference\n\n## License\n\nMIT License - See [LICENSE](../LICENSE) file for details.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:14:09.717Z","qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ewei068/pokestar/add-event-listener', 'community', 'ewei068', 'pokestar', 'ewei068/pokestar', 'add-event-listener', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z', '2026-02-19T01:14:09.951Z', NULL, '{"id":"ewei068/pokestar/add-event-listener","name":"add-event-listener","description":{"zh":"添加事件监听器是Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot中实现自定义逻辑的核心机制。通过registerListenerFunction注册事件监听器","ja":"イベントリスナーを追加することは、ポケモンガチャディスコードボットでカスタムロジックを実装するための核心メカニズムです。registerListenerFunctionを使用してイベントリスナーを登録します","ko":"이벤트 리스너를 추가하는 것은 포켓몬 가차 디스코드 봇에서 사용자 지정 로직을 구현하는 핵심 메커니즘입니다. registerListenerFunction을 사용하여 이벤트 리스너를 등록합니다","es":"Los oyentes de eventos son el mecanismo principal para que las habilidades, efectos y objetos respondan a eventos de batalla en Pokestar","fr":"Les écouteurs d''événements sont le mécanisme principal pour que les capacités, les effets et les objets répondent aux événements de combat dans Pokestar","de":"Ereignis-Listener sind der primäre Mechanismus, damit Fähigkeiten, Effekte und Gegenstände auf Kampfevents in Pokestar reagieren","pt":"Ouvidores de eventos são mecanismos centrais para habilidades, efeitos e itens segurados responderem a eventos de batalha em Pokestar Battle System","ru":"Слушатели событий являются основным механизмом для способностей, эффектов и удерживаемых предметов для реагирования на события битвы в Pokestar Battle System","ar":"مستمعو الأحداث هم الآلية الأساسية للقدرات والأffects والأشياء المحمولة للاستجابة لأحداث المعركة في نظام معركة Pokestar","en":"Pokemon Gacha Discord Bot"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"添加事件监听器 - Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot","ja":"イベントリスナーを追加する - ポケモンガチャディスコードボット","ko":"이벤트 리스너 추가 - 포켓몬 가차 디스코드 봇","es":"Agregar Oyentes de Eventos en Pokestar","fr":"Ajouter des Écouteurs d''Événements dans Pokestar","de":"Hinzufügen von Ereignis-Listenern in Pokestar","pt":"Adicionar Ouvidor de Eventos em Pokestar","ru":"Добавление слушателя событий в Pokestar","ar":"إضافة مستمع للأحداث في Pokestar","en":"add-event-listener"},"description":{"zh":"添加事件监听器是Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot中实现自定义逻辑的核心机制。通过registerListenerFunction注册事件监听器","ja":"イベントリスナーを追加することは、ポケモンガチャディスコードボットでカスタムロジックを実装するための核心メカニズムです。registerListenerFunctionを使用してイベントリスナーを登録します","ko":"이벤트 리스너를 추가하는 것은 포켓몬 가차 디스코드 봇에서 사용자 지정 로직을 구현하는 핵심 메커니즘입니다. registerListenerFunction을 사용하여 이벤트 리스너를 등록합니다","es":"Los oyentes de eventos son el mecanismo principal para que las habilidades, efectos y objetos respondan a eventos de batalla en Pokestar","fr":"Les écouteurs d''événements sont le mécanisme principal pour que les capacités, les effets et les objets répondent aux événements de combat dans Pokestar","de":"Ereignis-Listener sind der primäre Mechanismus, damit Fähigkeiten, Effekte und Gegenstände auf Kampfevents in Pokestar reagieren","pt":"Ouvidores de eventos são mecanismos centrais para habilidades, efeitos e itens segurados responderem a eventos de batalha em Pokestar Battle System","ru":"Слушатели событий являются основным механизмом для способностей, эффектов и удерживаемых предметов для реагирования на события битвы в Pokestar Battle System","ar":"مستمعو الأحداث هم الآلية الأساسية للقدرات والأffects والأشياء المحمولة للاستجابة لأحداث المعركة في نظام معركة Pokestar","en":"Pokemon Gacha Discord Bot"},"definition":{"en":"Pokemon Gacha Discord Bot"},"features":{"zh":["注册事件监听器","响应战斗事件","实现自定义逻辑","使用registerListenerFunction注册事件监听器","支持条件回调函数"],"ja":["イベントリスナーを登録する","戦闘イベントに応じる","カスタムロジックを実装する","registerListenerFunctionを使用してイベントリスナーを登録する","条件コールバック関数をサポートする"],"ko":["이벤트 리스너를 등록한다","배틀 이벤트에 반응한다","사용자 지정 로직을 구현한다","registerListenerFunction을 사용하여 이벤트 리스너를 등록한다","조건 콜백 함수를 지원한다"],"es":["Registro de oyentes de eventos con registerListenerFunction","Respuesta a eventos de batalla como BEFORE_DAMAGE","Uso de condiciones de devolución de llamada para filtrar eventos","Integración con habilidades, efectos y objetos en el sistema de batalla","Compatibilidad con Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot"],"fr":["Enregistrement d''écouteurs d''événements avec registerListenerFunction","Réponse aux événements de combat tels que BEFORE_DAMAGE","Utilisation de callbacks de condition pour filtrer les événements","Intégration avec des capacités, des effets et des objets dans le système de combat","Compatibilité avec Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot"],"de":["Registrierung von Ereignis-Listenern mit registerListenerFunction","Reaktion auf Kampfevents wie BEFORE_DAMAGE","Verwendung von Bedingungsrückrufen zum Filtern von Ereignissen","Integration mit Fähigkeiten, Effekten und Gegenständen im Kampfsystem","Kompatibilität mit Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot"],"pt":["Registro de ouvidores de eventos usando registerListenerFunction","Suporte a eventos de batalha personalizados","Lógica condicional para ouvidores de eventos","Integração com habilidades, efeitos e itens segurados","Flexibilidade para criar lógicas personalizadas em batalhas de Pokémon"],"ru":["Регистрация слушателей событий с помощью registerListenerFunction","Поддержка пользовательских событий битвы","Условная логика для слушателей событий","Интеграция со способностями, эффектами и удерживаемыми предметами","Гибкость для создания пользовательской логики в битвах покемонов"],"ar":["تسجيل مستمعين للأحداث باستخدام registerListenerFunction","دعم أحداث المعركة المخصصة","منطق شرطي لمستمعي الأحداث","التكامل مع القدرات والأffects والأشياء المحمولة","المرونة لإنشاء منطق مخصص في معارك بوكيمون"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot","事件监听器","战斗事件","registerListenerFunction","自定义逻辑","条件回调函数"],"ja":["ポケモンガチャディスコードボット","イベントリスナー","戦闘イベント","registerListenerFunction","カスタムロジック","条件コールバック関数"],"ko":["포켓몬 가차 디스코드 봇","이벤트 리스너","배틀 이벤트","registerListenerFunction","사용자 지정 로직","조건 콜백 함수"],"es":["oyente de eventos","Pokestar","sistema de batalla","registro de oyentes de eventos","Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot","desarrollo de juegos","programación de juegos"],"fr":["écouteur d''événements","Pokestar","système de combat","enregistrement d''écouteurs d''événements","Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot","développement de jeux","programmation de jeux"],"de":["Ereignis-Listener","Pokestar","Kampfsystem","Registrierung von Ereignis-Listenern","Pokémon Gacha Discord Bot","Spieleentwicklung","Spieleprogrammierung"],"pt":["ouvidor de eventos","Pokestar Battle System","evento de batalha","lógica personalizada","registro de ouvidor","condição de ouvidor","habilidades pokémon","itens segurados","efeitos pokémon"],"ru":["слушатель событий","Pokestar Battle System","событие битвы","пользовательская логика","регистрация слушателя","условие слушателя","способности покемонов","удерживаемые предметы","эффекты покемонов"],"ar":["مستمع الحدث","نظام معركة Pokestar","حدث المعركة","منطق مخصص","تسجيل مستمع","شرط مستمع","قدرات بوكيمون","أشياء محمولة","أffects بوكيمون"]}},"owner":"ewei068","repo":"pokestar","repoPath":"ewei068/pokestar","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-event-listener","description":"Register and manage battle event listeners. Use when abilities, effects, or items need to respond to battle events.","bodyPreview":"# Adding Event Listeners in Pokestar Battle System\n\nEvent listeners are the core mechanism for abilities, effects, and held items to respond to battle events.\n\n## Registration Pattern\n\nAll battle components use `registerListenerFunction` to subscribe to events:\n\n```javascript\nconst listenerId = battle.registerListenerFunction({\n  eventName: battleEventEnum.BEFORE_DAMAGE,\n  callback: (args) => {\n    // Your logic here\n  },\n  conditionCallback: getIsTargetPokemonCallback(target),\n});\n```\n\n**Always","body":"# Adding Event Listeners in Pokestar Battle System\n\nEvent listeners are the core mechanism for abilities, effects, and held items to respond to battle events.\n\n## Registration Pattern\n\nAll battle components use `registerListenerFunction` to subscribe to events:\n\n```javascript\nconst listenerId = battle.registerListenerFunction({\n  eventName: battleEventEnum.BEFORE_DAMAGE,\n  callback: (args) => {\n    // Your logic here\n  },\n  conditionCallback: getIsTargetPokemonCallback(target),\n});\n```\n\n**Always store the listenerId and unregister in the remove function:**\n\n```javascript\nabilityAdd({ battle, target }) {\n  return {\n    listenerId: this.registerListenerFunction({...}),\n  };\n},\nabilityRemove({ battle, properties }) {\n  battle.unregisterListener(properties.listenerId);\n}\n```\n\n## Class-Level vs Battle-Level Registration\n\n### Class-Level (Recommended for Abilities/Held Items)\n\nAbilities and Held Items have `this.registerListenerFunction` which:\n\n- Automatically checks if the component is still active\n- Provides the component instance in callback args\n\n```javascript\n// In an Ability\nthis.registerListenerFunction({\n  battle,\n  target,\n  eventName: battleEventEnum.AFTER_DAMAGE_DEALT,\n  callback: ({ abilityInstance }) => {\n    // abilityInstance.data contains stored properties\n  },\n  conditionCallback: getIsSourcePokemonCallback(target),\n});\n```\n\n### Battle-Level (For Effects)\n\nEffects use `battle.registerListenerFunction` directly:\n\n```javascript\n// In an Effect\nbattle.registerListenerFunction({\n  eventName: battleEventEnum.BEFORE_DAMAGE,\n  callback: (args) => {\n    // Effect logic\n  },\n  conditionCallback: getIsTargetPokemonCallback(target),\n});\n```\n\n## Common Battle Events\n\n| Event                 | Description                     | Key Args                             |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `BATTLE_BEGIN`        | Start of battle                 | `battle`                             |\n| `TURN_BEGIN`          | Start of each turn              | `battle`                             |\n| `TURN_END`            | End of each turn                | `battle`                             |\n| `BEFORE_MOVE`         | Before a move executes          | `source`, `moveId`, `targets`        |\n| `AFTER_MOVE`          | After a move executes           | `source`, `moveId`, `targets`        |\n| `BEFORE_DAMAGE`       | Before damage is dealt          | `damage`, `target`, `source`, `type` |\n| `AFTER_DAMAGE_DEALT`  | After damage is dealt           | `damage`, `target`, `source`, `type` |\n| `BEFORE_EFFECT_ADD`   | Before an effect is applied     | `effectId`, `target`, `canAdd`       |\n| `AFTER_EFFECT_ADD`    | After an effect is applied      | `effectId`, `target`                 |\n| `BEFORE_STATUS_APPLY` | Before status condition applied | `statusId`, `target`, `canApply`     |\n| `AFTER_SKIP_TURN`     | After skipping a turn           | `source`                             |\n| `AFTER_FAINT`         | After a Pokemon faints          | `target`, `source`                   |\n\nIf an event isn''t strongly typed, search for where it is emitted in `BattlePokemon.js` or `Battle.js` and add its type to `battleEnums.js`.\n\n## Condition Callbacks\n\nImport from `../engine/eventConditions`:\n\n### Common Condition Callbacks\n\n| Callback                                 | Description                                  |\n| ---------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `getIsTargetPokemonCallback(pokemon)`    | Only triggers when pokemon is the target     |\n| `getIsSourcePokemonCallback(pokemon)`    | Only triggers when pokemon is the source     |\n| `getIsActivePokemonCallback(pokemon)`    | Only triggers when pokemon is the active one |\n| `getIsInstanceOfType(\"move\")`            | Only triggers for move-related damage        |\n| `getIsTargetSameTeamCallback(pokemon)`   | Target is on same team                       |\n| `getIsTargetOpponentCallback(pokemon)`   | Target is on opposing team                   |\n| `getIsSourceSameTeamCallback(pokemon)`   | Source is on same team                       |\n| `getIsNotSourcePokemonCallback(pokemon)` | Source is NOT this pokemon                   |\n| `getIsWeatherCondition(weatherId)`       | Current weather matches                      |\n\n### Composing Multiple Conditions\n\n```javascript\nconditionCallback: composeConditionCallbacks(\n  getIsTargetPokemonCallback(target),\n  getIsInstanceOfType(\"move\"),\n),\n```\n\n## Modifying Event Arguments\n\nRECOMMENDED: Return an object from the callback to modify event behavior:\n\n```javascript\ncallback: (args) => {\n  return {\n    damage: Math.floor(args.damage * 0.5), // reduce damange by 50%\n    canAdd: false, // prevent something from being applied\n  };\n};\n```\n\n## Common Gotchas\n\n1. **Always Unregister**: Store listenerId and call `battle.unregisterListener(listenerId)` in the remove function to prevent memory leaks.\n\n2. **Source vs Target**: Use the correct condition callback:\n   - `getIsSourcePokemonCallback` - when this Pokemon is dealing damage/using moves\n   - `getIsTargetPokemonCallback` - when this Pokemon is receiving damage/effects\n\n3. **Return vs Mutate**: When modifying arguments, ALWAYS return the new value instead of mutating. Mutating is an old, deprecated pattern.\n\n4. **Instance Check**: Class-level `registerListenerFunction` automatically checks if the component is still active before firing the callback.\n\n## References\n\n- `references/pattern-*.md` - Common event listener implementation patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:14:09.951Z","qualityScore":0}');
