для тестов","Помогает писать эффективные тесты","Улучшает производительность CI/CD","Руководство по миграции из Jest в Vitest"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","44 قاعدة في 8 فئات","أفضل الممارسات للاختبارات","مساعدة في كتابة الاختبارات الفعالة","تحسين أداء CI/CD","دليل للهجرة من Jest إلى Vitest"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vitest","Vitest","Jest Vitest","CI/CD ","PR","Vitest","Vitest","Vitest","Vitest"],"ja":["Vitest","Vitest","Jest Vitest","CI/CD ","PR","Vitest","Vitest","Vitest","Vitest"],"ko":["Vitest","Vitest","Jest Vitest","CI/CD ","PR","Vitest","Vitest","Vitest","Vitest"],"es":["Vitest","pruebas de rendimiento","mejores prácticas","optimización de pruebas","Jest","CI/CD","desarrollo de software","pruebas automatizadas"],"fr":["Vitest","tests de performance","meilleures pratiques","optimisation des tests","Jest","CI/CD","développement de logiciels","tests automatisés"],"de":["Vitest","Leistungstests","beste Praktiken","Testoptimierung","Jest","CI/CD","Softwareentwicklung","automatisierte Tests"],"pt":["Vitest","otimização de desempenho","melhores práticas","testes","CI/CD","Jest","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","testes de unidade"],"ru":["Vitest","оптимизация производительности","лучшие практики","тесты","CI/CD","Jest","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","юнит-тесты"],"ar":["Vitest","تحسين الأداء","أفضل الممارسات","الاختبارات","CI/CD","Jest","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","اختبارات الوحدة"]}},"owner":"allthingslinux","repo":"portal","repoPath":"allthingslinux/portal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.539Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vitest","description":"Vitest testing framework patterns for test setup, async testing, mocking with vi.*, snapshots, and test performance (formerly test-vitest). This skill should be used when writing or debugging Vitest tests. This skill does NOT cover TDD methodology (use test-tdd skill), API mocking with MSW (use test-msw skill), or Jest-specific APIs.","bodyPreview":"# Vitest Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization and best practices guide for Vitest testing framework. Contains 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide test writing, refactoring, and code review.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Vitest tests\n- Debugging flaky or slow tests\n- Setting up test configuration\n- Reviewing test code in PRs\n- Migrating from Jest to Vitest\n- Optimizing CI/CD test performance\n\n## Rule Categories by Prio","body":"# Vitest Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization and best practices guide for Vitest testing framework. Contains 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide test writing, refactoring, and code review.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Vitest tests\n- Debugging flaky or slow tests\n- Setting up test configuration\n- Reviewing test code in PRs\n- Migrating from Jest to Vitest\n- Optimizing CI/CD test performance\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Async Patterns | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Test Setup & Isolation | CRITICAL | `setup-` |\n| 3 | Mocking Patterns | HIGH | `mock-` |\n| 4 | Performance | HIGH | `perf-` |\n| 5 | Snapshot Testing | MEDIUM | `snap-` |\n| 6 | Environment | MEDIUM | `env-` |\n| 7 | Assertions | LOW-MEDIUM | `assert-` |\n| 8 | Test Organization | LOW | `org-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Async Patterns (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-await-assertions` - Await async assertions to prevent false positives\n- `async-return-promises` - Return promises from test functions\n- `async-fake-timers` - Use fake timers for time-dependent code\n- `async-waitfor-polling` - Use vi.waitFor for async conditions\n- `async-concurrent-expect` - Use test context expect in concurrent tests\n- `async-act-wrapper` - Await user events to avoid act warnings\n- `async-error-handling` - Test async error handling properly\n\n### 2. Test Setup & Isolation (CRITICAL)\n\n- `setup-beforeeach-cleanup` - Clean up state in afterEach hooks\n- `setup-restore-mocks` - Restore mocks after each test\n- `setup-avoid-shared-state` - Avoid shared mutable state between tests\n- `setup-beforeall-expensive` - Use beforeAll for expensive one-time setup\n- `setup-reset-modules` - Reset modules when testing module state\n- `setup-test-factories` - Use test factories for complex test data\n\n### 3. Mocking Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- `mock-vi-mock-hoisting` - Understand vi.mock hoisting behavior\n- `mock-spyon-vs-mock` - Choose vi.spyOn vs vi.mock appropriately\n- `mock-implementation-not-value` - Use mockImplementation for dynamic mocks\n- `mock-msw-network` - Use MSW for network request mocking\n- `mock-avoid-overmocking` - Avoid over-mocking\n- `mock-type-safety` - Maintain type safety in mocks\n- `mock-clear-between-tests` - Clear mock state between tests\n\n### 4. Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `perf-pool-selection` - Choose the right pool for performance\n- `perf-disable-isolation` - Disable test isolation when safe\n- `perf-happy-dom` - Use happy-dom over jsdom when possible\n- `perf-sharding` - Use sharding for CI parallelization\n- `perf-run-mode-ci` - Use run mode in CI environments\n- `perf-bail-fast-fail` - Use bail for fast failure in CI\n\n### 5. Snapshot Testing (MEDIUM)\n\n- `snap-inline-over-file` - Prefer inline snapshots for small values\n- `snap-avoid-large` - Avoid large snapshots\n- `snap-stable-serialization` - Ensure stable snapshot serialization\n- `snap-review-updates` - Review snapshot updates before committing\n- `snap-describe-intent` - Name snapshot tests descriptively\n\n### 6. Environment (MEDIUM)\n\n- `env-per-file-override` - Override environment per file when needed\n- `env-setup-files` - Use setup files for global configuration\n- `env-globals-config` - Configure globals consistently\n- `env-browser-api-mocking` - Mock browser APIs not available in test environment\n\n### 7. Assertions (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `assert-specific-matchers` - Use specific matchers over generic ones\n- `assert-edge-cases` - Test edge cases and boundaries\n- `assert-one-assertion-concept` - Test one concept per test\n- `assert-expect-assertions` - Use expect.assertions for async tests\n- `assert-toequal-vs-tobe` - Choose toBe vs toEqual correctly\n\n### 8. Test Organization (LOW)\n\n- `org-file-colocation` - Colocate test files with source files\n- `org-describe-nesting` - Use describe blocks for logical grouping\n- `org-test-naming` - Write descriptive test names\n- `org-test-skip-only` - Use skip and only appropriately\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual reference files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [Section definitions](references/_sections.md) - Category structure and impact levels\n- [Rule template](assets/templates/_template.md) - Template for adding new rules\n- [async-await-assertions](references/async-await-assertions.md) - Example rule file\n- [mock-vi-mock-hoisting](references/mock-vi-mock-hoisting.md) - Example rule file\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- For TDD methodology, see `test-tdd` skill\n- For API mocking with MSW, see `test-msw` skill\n- For TypeScript testing patterns, see `typescript` skill\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:14:04.164Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices.","zh":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices.","ja":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices.","ko":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices.","es":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices.","fr":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices.","de":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices.","pt":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices.","ru":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices.","ar":"Perfect for JavaScript Testing Agents needing advanced Vitest testing framework optimization and best practices."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest.","zh":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest.","ja":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest.","ko":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest.","es":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest.","fr":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest.","de":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest.","pt":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest.","ru":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest.","ar":"Empowers agents to write efficient Vitest tests, debug flaky or slow tests, and optimize CI/CD test performance using 44 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, including test configuration, code review, and migration from Jest to Vitest."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"],"zh":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"],"ja":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"],"ko":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"],"es":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"],"fr":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"],"de":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"],"pt":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"],"ru":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"],"ar":["Writing new Vitest tests with optimized performance","Debugging flaky or slow Vitest tests","Migrating existing Jest tests to Vitest","Reviewing and refactoring Vitest test code in PRs"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"],"zh":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"],"ja":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"],"ko":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"],"es":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"],"fr":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"],"de":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"],"pt":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"],"ru":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"],"ar":["Requires Vitest testing framework","JavaScript only","Migration from Jest may require additional configuration"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
