 layered (endpoints→services→repos), Celery+RabbitMQ RPC, PostgreSQL+Alembic. Built-in observability and quality (metrics, idempotency, Black, mypy, pre-commit). Cursor rules keep AI-generated code aligned so yo..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"FastAPI 最佳实践模板","ja":"FastAPI ベストプラクティス テンプレート","ko":"FastAPI 최적화 템플릿","es":"Mejores prácticas de FastAPI para desarrolladores","fr":"Bonnes pratiques de FastAPI pour les développeurs","de":"Best Practices für FastAPI-Entwickler","pt":"Melhores Práticas FastAPI para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Лучшие практики FastAPI для разработчиков","ar":"أفضل الممارسات ل FastAPI للمطورين","en":"fastapi-best-practices"},"description":{"zh":"FastAPI Cursor Starter Kit 是一个生产级后端模板，包括 API 设计、服务层和仓库。它还包含 Celery+RabbitMQ RPC 和 PostgreSQL+Alembic","ja":"FastAPI Cursor Starter Kit は、API 設計、サービス層、リポジトリを含むプロダクション レベルのバックエンド テンプレートです。Celery+RabbitMQ RPC と PostgreSQL+Alembic も含まれます","ko":"FastAPI Cursor Starter Kit는 API 설계, 서비스 계층, 리포지토리를 포함하는 프로덕션급 백엔드 템플릿입니다. Celery+RabbitMQ RPC와 PostgreSQL+Alembic도 포함됩니다","es":"Plantilla de backend de producción para equipos de Cursor/AI con FastAPI, Celery y PostgreSQL. Incluye observabilidad y calidad integradas.","fr":"Modèle de backend de production pour les équipes Cursor/AI avec FastAPI, Celery et PostgreSQL. Intègre l''observabilité et la qualité.","de":"Produktions-Backend-Vorlage für Cursor/AI-Teams mit FastAPI, Celery und PostgreSQL. Enthält integrierte Observierbarkeit und Qualität.","pt":"O kit de início FastAPI Cursor fornece um modelo de backend de produção para equipes de IA, com recursos como Camada de serviços e repositórios, além de obse...","ru":"Набор для быстрого начала работы FastAPI Cursor предоставляет шаблон бэкенда для команд ИИ, с функциями seperti слой сервисов и репозиториев, а также встроен...","ar":"حزمة بدء التشغيل السريع FastAPI Cursor توفر نموذجًا للخلفية الإنتاجية لفريق الذكاء الاصطناعي، مع ميزات مثل طبقة الخدمات والمخازن، بالإضافة إلى المراقبة والجو...","en":"FastAPI Cursor Starter Kit: production backend template for Cursor/AI teams. API-only, layered (endpoints→services→repos), Celery+RabbitMQ RPC, PostgreSQL+Al..."},"definition":{"en":"FastAPI Cursor Starter Kit: production backend template for Cursor/AI teams. API-only, layered (endpoints→services→repos), Celery+RabbitMQ RPC, PostgreSQL+Alembic. Built-in observability and quality (metrics, idempotency, Black, mypy, pre-commit). Cursor rules keep AI-generated code aligned so you extend without fighting the structure."},"features":{"zh":["API 设计","服务层","仓库","Celery+RabbitMQ RPC","PostgreSQL+Alembic"],"ja":["API 設計","サービス層","リポジトリ","Celery+RabbitMQ RPC","PostgreSQL+Alembic"],"ko":["API 설계","서비스 계층","리포지토리","Celery+RabbitMQ RPC","PostgreSQL+Alembic"],"es":["Arquitectura en capas para aplicaciones web escalables","Integración con Celery y RabbitMQ para RPC","Base de datos PostgreSQL con Alembic para migraciones","Observabilidad y calidad integradas con métricas e idempotencia","Reglas de Cursor para mantener el código organizado"],"fr":["Architecture en couches pour des applications web évolutives","Intégration avec Celery et RabbitMQ pour RPC","Base de données PostgreSQL avec Alembic pour les migrations","Observabilité et qualité intégrées avec des métriques et de l''idempotence","Règles de Cursor pour maintenir le code organisé"],"de":["Schichtenarchitektur für skalierbare Webanwendungen","Integration mit Celery und RabbitMQ für RPC","PostgreSQL-Datenbank mit Alembic für Migrationen","Integrierte Observierbarkeit und Qualität mit Metriken und Idempotenz","Cursor-Regeln für organisierten Code"],"pt":["Arquitetura em camadas (endpoints, serviços, repositórios)","Integração com Celery e RabbitMQ para RPC","Suporte a PostgreSQL e Alembic para gerenciamento de banco de dados","Observabilidade e qualidade embutidas (métricas, idempotência, Black, mypy, pre-commit)","Regras de estilo e padrões de codificação para manter a consistência"],"ru":["Слоистая архитектура (конечные точки, сервисы, репозитории)","Интеграция с Celery и RabbitMQ для RPC","Поддержка PostgreSQL и Alembic для управления базой данных","Встроенная наблюдаемость и качество (метрики, идемпотентность, Black, mypy, pre-commit)","Правила стиля и стандарты кодирования для поддержания согласованности"],"ar":["هيكل طبقي (نقاط النهاية، الخدمات، المخازن)","التكامل مع Celery و RabbitMQ لبروتوكول RPC","دعم PostgreSQL و Alembic لإدارة قاعدة البيانات","المراقبة والجودة المدمجة (المقاييس، اللامعتمادية، Black، mypy، pre-commit)","قواعد الشكل والمعايير التشفيرية للحفاظ على الاتساق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["FastAPI","后端开发","API 设计","服务层","仓库","Celery","RabbitMQ","PostgreSQL","Alembic"],"ja":["FastAPI","バックエンド開発","API 設計","サービス層","リポジトリ","Celery","RabbitMQ","PostgreSQL","Alembic"],"ko":["FastAPI","백엔드 개발","API 설계","서비스 계층","리포지토리","Celery","RabbitMQ","PostgreSQL","Alembic"],"es":["FastAPI","desarrollo web","aplicaciones escalables","backend de producción","Celery","RabbitMQ","PostgreSQL","Alembic","observabilidad","calidad del código"],"fr":["FastAPI","développement web","applications évolutives","backend de production","Celery","RabbitMQ","PostgreSQL","Alembic","observabilité","qualité du code"],"de":["FastAPI","Webentwicklung","skalierbare Anwendungen","Produktions-Backend","Celery","RabbitMQ","PostgreSQL","Alembic","Observierbarkeit","Code-Qualität"],"pt":["FastAPI","desenvolvimento web","API","backend","Celery","RabbitMQ","PostgreSQL","Alembic","observabilidade","qualidade"],"ru":["FastAPI","веб-разработка","API","бэкенд","Celery","RabbitMQ","PostgreSQL","Alembic","наблюдаемость","качество"],"ar":["FastAPI","تطوير الويب","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","الخلفية","Celery","RabbitMQ","PostgreSQL","Alembic","المراقبة","الجودة"]}},"owner":"vimalkodoth","repo":"fastapi-cursor-starterkit","repoPath":"vimalkodoth/fastapi-cursor-starterkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fastapi-best-practices","description":"FastAPI standards and best practices for this project. Use when adding or changing API routes, services, dependencies, or middleware so the team follows the same patterns and conventions.","bodyPreview":"## In this repository\n\n- **Scope:** FastAPI app lives in `backend/`. Python also in `services/`; same style applies. After edits run **`make format`** and **`make lint`** from repo root.\n- **Rules:** `.cursor/rules/fastapi-python-best-practices.md`, `.cursor/rules/fastapi-patterns.md`, `.cursor/rules/standards.md`, `.cursor/rules/project.md`.\n- Full context: `.cursor/skills/README.md`.\n\n---\n\n# FastAPI best practices (team standards)\n\nStandards derived from this project’s implementation. Follow t","body":"## In this repository\n\n- **Scope:** FastAPI app lives in `backend/`. Python also in `services/`; same style applies. After edits run **`make format`** and **`make lint`** from repo root.\n- **Rules:** `.cursor/rules/fastapi-python-best-practices.md`, `.cursor/rules/fastapi-patterns.md`, `.cursor/rules/standards.md`, `.cursor/rules/project.md`.\n- Full context: `.cursor/skills/README.md`.\n\n---\n\n# FastAPI best practices (team standards)\n\nStandards derived from this project’s implementation. Follow these so the codebase stays consistent and maintainable.\n\n## 1. Project structure and layers\n\n- **Endpoints (controllers):** `backend/app/api/v1/endpoints/` — one file per domain (e.g. `data.py`, `database.py`, `metrics.py`). Only HTTP concerns: parse request, call service/repo via `Depends`, return response or raise `HTTPException`. Use **command** service for write operations (POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE) and **query** service for read operations (GET). See `.cursor/rules/cqrs.md`.\n- **Business logic:** `backend/app/services/` — use **command** services for writes and **query** services for reads (CQRS). Services receive repositories via constructor; use `AsyncSession` for DB when in the API path. No raw request/response objects.\n- **Data access:** `backend/app/repositories/` — use **write** repositories (create/update/delete) and **read** repositories (get/list) per domain. Repositories receive `AsyncSession`; perform queries and commits. No business rules.\n- **Shared dependencies:** `backend/app/api/v1/deps.py` — define `get_*` functions that return service or repository instances (injecting `get_async_session`). Use these in route handlers via `Depends(...)`.\n- **Models:** `backend/app/models/database.py` (SQLModel table models), `backend/app/models/schemas.py` (Pydantic request/response). DB name is **fastapi_db**.\n\n**Do not:** Put SQL or business logic in endpoint files; put HTTP logic in services or repositories.\n\n## 2. Routers and API design\n\n- Use **APIRouter** with a **prefix** and **tags** for OpenAPI grouping:\n  ```python\n  router = APIRouter(prefix=\"/data\", tags=[\"data\"])\n  ```\n- Mount routers in `backend/app/api/v1/__init__.py` on the v1 router (`prefix=\"/api/v1\"`).\n- Prefer **explicit `response_model`** and **status_code** on route decorators:\n  ```python\n  @router.post(\"/process\", response_model=TaskResult, status_code=200)\n  async def process_data(request: DataRequest, service: DataService = Depends(get_data_service)) -> TaskResult:\n  ```\n- Use **async def** for handlers that do I/O (DB, external calls). Use **def** only for handlers that do no I/O (e.g. simple metrics that read in-memory state).\n- Document with short **docstrings** on each route; they appear in OpenAPI.\n\n## 3. Dependencies (Depends)\n\n- **Session:** Use `get_async_session` from `app.core.database` for any route or dependency that touches the DB. Never create a raw engine or session in an endpoint.\n- **Services and repositories:** Define factory functions in `app.api.v1.deps` that depend on `get_async_session` and return a service or repository instance. Use them in endpoints via `Depends(get_data_service)`, `Depends(get_task_repository)`, etc.\n\nExample (from `deps.py`):\n\n```python\ndef get_data_service(session: AsyncSession = Depends(get_async_session)) -> DataService:\n    \"\"\"Dependency that returns a DataService instance (async session).\"\"\"\n    return DataService(session)\n```\n\n- In endpoints, inject the **service** (or repository when the endpoint only needs data access) and call methods; do not instantiate services or repos inside the route.\n\n## 4. Request and response models\n\n- **Request bodies:** Use Pydantic models from `app.models.schemas` (e.g. `DataRequest`). Declare them as the route parameter; FastAPI validates and parses.\n- **Responses:** Use Pydantic response models (e.g. `TaskResult`, `RecordResponse`, `TaskLogResponse`) and set `response_model=` on the decorator. **Never** return a SQLModel/ORM instance directly; map to a schema and return that (e.g. `RecordResponse.model_validate(r)` or `RecordResponse(**record)`).\n- Prefer **model_validate(orm_instance)** (Pydantic v2) when building response models from ORM objects.\n\n## 5. Async in the request path\n\n- Use **async def** for route handlers that perform I/O (DB, HTTP, etc.). Use **AsyncSession** and async repository methods so the event loop is not blocked.\n- If you must call a **blocking** operation (e.g. sync RabbitMQ RPC), run it in a thread pool with **`await asyncio.to_thread(blocking_func, ...)`** and keep the rest of the flow async (e.g. DB write). See `DataService.process_data_sync_and_save` in `app.services.data_service`.\n- Sync engine/session are only for **Celery tasks** and **startup** (e.g. `init_db`). Do not use them in request handlers.\n\n## 6. Error handling\n\n- **API boundary:** Use **HTTPException** with the appropriate status code (400, 404, 503, etc.) and a clear `detail`. Do not let uncaught exceptions bubble to the client without mapping.\n- **Services/repositories:** Raise domain-friendly exceptions or return `None`/result; let the **endpoint** translate to HTTP (e.g. `if not record: raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Record not found\")`).\n- **External calls:** When a dependency (e.g. `call_service_via_rabbitmq`) raises `ValueError`, catch it in the endpoint and map to `HTTPException(status_code=503, detail=str(e))` (or another suitable code).\n- Handle errors and edge cases **first** (early returns, guard clauses); keep the happy path last. See `.cursor/rules/error-handling.md`.\n\n## 7. Middleware and app setup\n\n- **CORS:** Configure in `main.py` (e.g. `CORSMiddleware`). Keep origins/methods/headers explicit for production.\n- **Idempotency:** Optional `Idempotency-Key` header on POST endpoints that support it; implemented in middleware (`IdempotencyMiddleware`). Do not duplicate idempotency logic in services. Paths are listed in the middleware (e.g. `/api/v1/data/process`, `/api/v1/data/process-async`).\n- **Startup:** For simple one-off init (e.g. `init_db()`), `@app.on_event(\"startup\")` is acceptable. For multi-step startup/shutdown, prefer a **lifespan** context manager.\n\n## 8. Database (PostgreSQL, SQLModel, Alembic)\n\n- **In routes:** Always use **async** session via `get_async_session` and pass it to services/repositories. Use connection pooling (already configured in `app.core.database`).\n- **Repositories:** Accept `AsyncSession` in the constructor; use `await session.commit()`, `await session.refresh(record)` after writes; use `select(Model).where(...)` and `await session.execute()` / `session.get()` for reads. Avoid N+1; batch or eager load when needed.\n- **Migrations:** Add or change models in `app.models.database`; then from `backend/` run `alembic revision --autogenerate -m \"description\"` and `alembic upgrade head`. Do not change the database name from **fastapi_db**.\n\n## 9. Naming and style\n\n- **Files and modules:** Lowercase with underscores (e.g. `data_service.py`, `task_repository.py`, `data.py` for the data router).\n- **Routers:** Name the router variable `router`. Group related routes in one file (e.g. all `/data/*` in `data.py`).\n- **Schemas:** Clear names for request (e.g. `DataRequest`) and response (e.g. `TaskResult`, `RecordResponse`). Use type hints and optional fields where appropriate.\n- **Docstrings:** Short module docstring and route docstrings so OpenAPI and readers understand purpose. Document parameters and return values in Pydantic models if non-obvious.\n\n## 10. Team checklist (before merging)\n\n- [ ] New routes live under `backend/app/api/v1/endpoints/` and are mounted in `api/v1/__init__.py`.\n- [ ] Handlers use `Depends(get_async_session)` or `Depends(get_*_service)` / `Depends(get_*_repository)` from `deps.py`; no ad-hoc session or service creation in routes.\n- [ ] Request/response use Pydantic models from `schemas.py`; responses use `response_model=` and never return raw ORM instances.\n- [ ] I/O in the request path is **async** (AsyncSession, async repo methods); any blocking call is wrapped in `asyncio.to_thread`.\n- [ ] Errors are mapped to **HTTPException** in endpoints; services/repos do not raise HTTP-specific errors.\n- [ ] New or changed DB models have an Alembic migration; DB name remains **fastapi_db**.\n- [ ] `make format` and `make lint` have been run from repo root and pass.\n\n## Quick reference (this project)\n\n| Concern | Where / how |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Add route | `backend/app/api/v1/endpoints/<domain>.py` + include in `api/v1/__init__.py` |\n| Add dependency | `backend/app/api/v1/deps.py` (e.g. `get_*_service`, `get_*_repository`) |\n| Request/response models | `backend/app/models/schemas.py` |\n| DB models | `backend/app/models/database.py` + Alembic migration |\n| Business logic | `backend/app/services/` (accept session/repos in constructor) |\n| Data access | `backend/app/repositories/` (accept AsyncSession) |\n| Blocking in request path | `await asyncio.to_thread(sync_func, ...)` then continue async |\n| Idempotency | Middleware; add path to `IDEMPOTENT_PATHS` if needed |\n\nFor more detail, see `.cursor/rules/fastapi-python-best-practices.md` and `.cursor/rules/standards.md`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:58:33.535Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python API Agents needing high-performance, scalable backend development with FastAPI and Celery+RabbitMQ integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能、可扩展后端开发并集成FastAPI与Celery+RabbitMQ的Python API智能体。","ja":"FastAPIとCelery+RabbitMQ連携による高性能でスケーラブルなバックエンド開発を必要とするPython APIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"FastAPI와 Celery+RabbitMQ 통합을 통해 고성능 및 확장 가능한 백엔드 개발이 필요한 Python API 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de API de Python que necesitan desarrollo de backend de alto rendimiento y escalable con integración de FastAPI y Celery+RabbitMQ.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''API Python nécessitant un développement de backend haute performance et évolutif avec une intégration de FastAPI et Celery+RabbitMQ.","de":"Perfekt für Python-API-Agents, die eine hochleistungs- und skalierbare Backend-Entwicklung mit FastAPI- und Celery+RabbitMQ-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de API Python que necessitam de desenvolvimento de backend de alto desempenho e escalável com integração FastAPI e Celery+RabbitMQ.","ru":"Идеально подходит для API-агентов на Python, которым требуется высокопроизводительная и масштабируемая серверная разработка с интеграцией FastAPI и Celery+RabbitMQ.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء واجهة برمجة تطبيقات بايثون الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير خلفي عالي الأداء وقابل للتوسع مع تكامل FastAPI وCelery+RabbitMQ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build production-ready, layered APIs with endpoints, services, and repositories, leveraging PostgreSQL+Alembic for database management and observability features like metrics and idempotency, all while enforcing best practices with Black, mypy, and pre-commit.","zh":"赋能智能体构建生产就绪的分层API，包含端点、服务和存储库，利用PostgreSQL+Alembic进行数据库管理，并支持指标和幂等性等可观测性功能，同时通过Black、mypy和pre-commit强制执行最佳实践。","ja":"エンドポイント、サービス、リポジトリを備えたプロダクションレディな階層化APIの構築を可能にし、PostgreSQL+Alembicによるデータベース管理とメトリクスやべき等性などの観測性機能を活用します。さらにBlack、mypy、pre-commitを使用してベストプラクティスを強制します。","ko":"엔드포인트, 서비스 및 리포지토리를 갖춘 프로덕션 준비된 계층화된 API 구축을 가능하게 하며, PostgreSQL+Alembic을 활용한 데이터베이스 관리 및 메트릭과 멱등성과 같은 가시성 기능을 제공합니다. 동시에 Black, mypy 및 pre-commit을 통해 최적의 실천 방법을 적용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear API de producción listas, en capas, con puntos de conexión, servicios y repositorios, aprovechando PostgreSQL+Alembic para la gestión de bases de datos y características de observabilidad como métricas e idempotencia, todo mientras se aplican las mejores prácticas con Black, mypy y pre-commit.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des API de production prêtes, en couches, avec des points de terminaison, des services et des référentiels, en exploitant PostgreSQL+Alembic pour la gestion de base de données et les fonctionnalités d''observabilité comme les métriques et l''idempotence, le tout en appliquant les meilleures pratiques avec Black, mypy et pre-commit.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, produktionsbereite, geschichtete APIs mit Endpunkten, Diensten und Repositorys zu erstellen, indem PostgreSQL+Alembic für die Datenbankverwaltung und Observierungsmerkmale wie Metriken und Idempotenz genutzt werden, und gleichzeitig bewährte Verfahren mit Black, mypy und pre-commit durchsetzen.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a construir APIs em camadas prontas para produção com endpoints, serviços e repositórios, aproveitando PostgreSQL+Alembic para gerenciamento de banco de dados e recursos de observabilidade como métricas e idempotência, tudo enquanto aplica as melhores práticas com Black, mypy e pre-commit.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать готовые к промышленному использованию многоуровневые API с конечными точками, сервисами и репозиториями, используя PostgreSQL+Alembic для управления базами данных и функции наблюдаемости, такие как метрики и идемпотентность, одновременно применяя лучшие практики с Black, mypy и pre-commit.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من بناء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات ذات طبقات جاهزة للإنتاج مع نقاط النهاية والخدمات والمستودعات، والاستفادة من PostgreSQL+Alembic لإدارة قواعد البيانات وميزات المراقبة مثل المقاييس ومبدأ العدمية، كل ذلك مع فرض أفضل الممارسات باستخدام Black وmypy وpre-commit."},"useCases":{"en":["Building scalable, API-only backends with FastAPI","Integrating Celery+RabbitMQ for robust task queues and RPC","Implementing database migrations with Alembic and PostgreSQL","Enforcing code quality and standards with Black, mypy, and pre-commit"],"zh":["使用FastAPI构建可扩展的纯API后端","集成Celery+RabbitMQ实现健壮的任务队列和RPC","使用Alembic和PostgreSQL实施数据库迁移","使用Black、mypy和pre-commit强制执行代码质量和标准"],"ja":["FastAPIを使用したスケーラブルなAPI専用バックエンドの構築","堅牢なタスクキューとRPCのためのCelery+RabbitMQの統合","AlembicとPostgreSQLを使用したデータベースマイグレーションの実装","Black、mypy、pre-commitを使用したコード品質と標準の強制"],"ko":["FastAPI로 확장 가능한 API 전용 백엔드 구축","강력한 태스크 큐 및 RPC를 위한 Celery+RabbitMQ 통합","Alembic 및 PostgreSQL을 사용한 데이터베이스 마이그레이션 구현","Black, mypy, pre-commit을 사용한 코드 품질 및 표준 강제"],"es":["Creación de backends escalables y solo API con FastAPI","Integración de Celery+RabbitMQ para colas de tareas robustas y RPC","Implementación de migraciones de base de datos con Alembic y PostgreSQL","Aplicación de la calidad y los estándares del código con Black, mypy y pre-commit"],"fr":["Création de backends escalables et API uniquement avec FastAPI","Intégration de Celery+RabbitMQ pour des files d''attente de tâches robustes et RPC","Mise en œuvre de migrations de base de données avec Alembic et PostgreSQL","Application de la qualité et des normes de code avec Black, mypy et pre-commit"],"de":["Erstellung von skalierbaren, API-nur-Backends mit FastAPI","Integration von Celery+RabbitMQ für robuste Task-Queues und RPC","Implementierung von Datenbankmigrationen mit Alembic und PostgreSQL","Durchsetzung der Codequalität und -standards mit Black, mypy und pre-commit"],"pt":["Construção de backends escaláveis e exclusivos para API com FastAPI","Integração de Celery+RabbitMQ para filas de tarefas robustas e RPC","Implementação de migrações de banco de dados com Alembic e PostgreSQL","Aplicação de qualidade e padrões de código com Black, mypy e pre-commit"],"ru":["Создание масштабируемых серверных частей только для API с помощью FastAPI","Интеграция Celery+RabbitMQ для надежных очередей задач и RPC","Реализация миграций баз данных с Alembic и PostgreSQL","Обеспечение качества кода и стандартов с помощью Black, mypy и pre-commit"],"ar":["بناء أنظمة خلفية قابلة للتوسع ومخصصة لواجهات البرمجة فقط باستخدام FastAPI","دمج Celery+RabbitMQ لصفوف المهام القوية وRPC","تنفيذ ترحيل قواعد البيانات باستخدام Alembic وPostgreSQL","فرض جودة التعليمات البرمجية والمعايير باستخدام Black وmypy وpre-commit"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to FastAPI framework","Dependent on Celery+RabbitMQ for task queue management"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限于FastAPI框架","依赖Celery+RabbitMQ进行任务队列管理"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","FastAPIフレームワークに限定","タスクキュー管理にCelery+RabbitMQに依存"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","FastAPI 프레임워크로 제한됨","태스크 큐 관리에 Celery+RabbitMQ 의존"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de Python","Limitado al marco de FastAPI","Dependiente de Celery+RabbitMQ para la gestión de colas de tareas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité au cadre de FastAPI","Dépendant de Celery+RabbitMQ pour la gestion des files d''attente de tâches"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf das FastAPI-Framework","Abhängig von Celery+RabbitMQ für die Task-Queue-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado ao framework FastAPI","Dependente do Celery+RabbitMQ para gerenciamento de filas de tarefas"],"ru":["Требует среду Python","Ограничено фреймворком FastAPI","Зависит от Celery+RabbitMQ для управления очередями задач"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","مقتصر على إطار عمل FastAPI","يعتمد على Celery+RabbitMQ لإدارة طابور المهام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
