57 règles pour optimiser les performances","8 catégories pour prioriser l''optimisation","Guide pour la refactoring automatique et la génération de code","Optimisation du chargement de données sur le client et sur le serveur","Amélioration des performances des applications React et Next.js"],"de":["57 Regeln für die Leistungsoptimierung","8 Kategorien für die Priorisierung der Optimierung","Leitfaden für die automatische Refactoring und Codegenerierung","Optimierung der Datenladung auf dem Client und Server","Verbesserung der Leistung von React- und Next.js-Anwendungen"],"pt":["57 regras para otimização de desempenho","8 categorias para refatoração automática","Guia para implementação de busca de dados","Otimização de código para React e Next.js","Melhoria do desempenho do aplicativo"],"ru":["57 правил для оптимизации производительности","8 категорий для автоматической рефакторинга","Руководство по реализации поиска данных","Оптимизация кода для React и Next.js","Улучшение производительности приложения"],"ar":["57 قاعدة لتحسين الأداء","8 فئات لتحويل البرمجيات自動","دليل لتنفيذ بحث البيانات","تحسين رمز البرمجيات لتفاعل و Next.js","تحسين أداء التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React","React 最佳实践","Next.js 优化","性能优化","自动重构","代码生成","React 应用优化","Next.js 应用优化"],"ja":["Vercel React","React ベストプラクティス","Next.js 最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","自動リファクタリング","コード生成","React アプリ最適化","Next.js アプリ最適化"],"ko":["Vercel React","React 최적화","Next.js 최적화","성능 최적화","자동 리팩토링","코드 생성","React 애플리케이션 최적화","Next.js 애플리케이션 최적화"],"es":["React","Next.js","Vercel","optimización del rendimiento","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","refactorización automática","generación de código"],"fr":["React","Next.js","Vercel","optimisation des performances","bonnes pratiques","développement d''applications","refactoring automatique","génération de code"],"de":["React","Next.js","Vercel","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices","Anwendungsentwicklung","automatische Refactoring","Codegenerierung"],"pt":["Vercel React","Otimização de desempenho","React","Next.js","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Melhores práticas","Refatoração automática","Geração de código"],"ru":["Vercel React","Оптимизация производительности","React","Next.js","Разработка приложений","Лучшие практики","Автоматическая рефакторинга","Генерация кода"],"ar":["Vercel React","تحسين الأداء","React","Next.js","تنمية التطبيقات","أفضل الممارسات","تحويل البرمجيات自動","إنشاء رمز"]}},"owner":"gamingopgamingop","repo":"sarthak-skill-forge","repoPath":"gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundl","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Eliminating Waterfalls | CRITICAL | `async-` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size Optimization | CRITICAL | `bundle-` |\n| 3 | Server-Side Performance | HIGH | `server-` |\n| 4 | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-` |\n| 5 | Re-render Optimization | MEDIUM | `rerender-` |\n| 6 | Rendering Performance | MEDIUM | `rendering-` |\n| 7 | JavaScript Performance | LOW-MEDIUM | `js-` |\n| 8 | Advanced Patterns | LOW | `advanced-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-auth-actions` - Authenticate server actions like API routes\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-dedup-props` - Avoid duplicate serialization in RSC props\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n- `client-passive-event-listeners` - Use passive listeners for scroll\n- `client-localstorage-schema` - Version and minimize localStorage data\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-memo-with-default-value` - Hoist default non-primitive props\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-derived-state-no-effect` - Derive state during render, not effects\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-simple-expression-in-memo` - Avoid memo for simple primitives\n- `rerender-move-effect-to-event` - Put interaction logic in event handlers\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n- `rerender-use-ref-transient-values` - Use refs for transient frequent values\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-hydration-suppress-warning` - Suppress expected mismatches\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n- `rendering-usetransition-loading` - Prefer useTransition for loading state\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-init-once` - Initialize app once per app load\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n```\nrules/async-parallel.md\nrules/bundle-barrel-imports.md\n```\n\nEach rule file contains:\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded: `AGENTS.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:59:28.930Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React and Next.js performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 React 和 Next.js 性能优化能力的前端代理。","ja":"React および Next.js の高度なパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 React 및 Next.js 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React y Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React et Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Leistungs-Optimierungs-Funktionen für React und Next.js benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React e Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов фронтенда, которым необходимы расширенные возможности оптимизации производительности React и Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحسين أداء React و Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using 57 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact, and leveraging Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 57 条规则跨 8 个类别的 React 和 Next.js 应用程序自动重构和代码生成的能力，优先考虑影响，并利用 Vercel 的综合性能优化指南。","ja":"エージェントは、57 のルールを 8 つのカテゴリにわたって React および Next.js アプリケーションで自動リファクタリングおよびコード生成を行うことができ、影響度に基づいて優先順位付けし、Vercel の包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ガイドを利用します。","ko":"에이전트는 8개 카테고리에 걸친 57개의 규칙을 사용하여 리액트 및 넥스트.js 애플리케이션에서 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 수행할 수 있으며, 영향력에 따라 우선순위를 지정하고, Vercel의 종합적인 성능 최적화 가이드를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones de React y Next.js utilizando 57 reglas en 8 categorías, priorizadas por impacto y aprovechando la guía integral de optimización de rendimiento de Vercel.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js en utilisant 57 règles dans 8 catégories, priorisées par impact, et en exploitant le guide complet d''optimisation des performances de Vercel.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem sie 57 Regeln in 8 Kategorien verwenden, die nach Auswirkung priorisiert sind und auf Vercels umfassender Leistungs-Optimierungs-Anleitung basieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicativos React e Next.js usando 57 regras em 8 categorias, priorizadas por impacto, e aproveitando o guia abrangente de otimização de desempenho da Vercel.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js, используя 57 правил в 8 категориях, упорядоченных по степени воздействия, и используя всесторонний гид по оптимизации производительности от Vercel.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تutomation إعادة هيكلة وتوليد رمز التطبيقات React و Next.js باستخدام 57 قاعدة في 8 فئات، مصنفة حسب التأثير، وتستفيد من دليل تحسين الأداء الشامل من Vercel."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for performance issues","Generating optimized React components and Next.js pages","Refactoring existing React and Next.js code for better performance"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以查找性能问题","生成优化的 React 组件和 Next.js 页面","重构现有的 React 和 Next.js 代码以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの問題を検出するためのコードレビューの自動化","最適化された React コンポーネントおよび Next.js ページの生成","パフォーマンスの向上のための既存の React および Next.js コードのリファクタリング"],"ko":["성능 문제를 찾기 위한 코드 검토 자동화","최적화된 리액트 컴포넌트 및 넥스트.js 페이지 생성","보다 나은 성능을 위한 기존 리액트 및 넥스트.js 코드 리팩토링"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para problemas de rendimiento","Generar componentes de React y páginas de Next.js optimizados","Refactorizar el código existente de React y Next.js para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Automatiser les examens de code pour les problèmes de performances","Générer des composants React et des pages Next.js optimisés","Refactoriser le code existant de React et Next.js pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Leistungsprobleme","Generieren von optimierten React-Komponenten und Next.js-Seiten","Refaktorisieren von bestehendem React- und Next.js-Code für bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para problemas de desempenho","Gerar componentes React e páginas Next.js otimizados","Refatorar código React e Next.js existente para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Авт