,"ar":"اختبار الاتساق XFI - أداة التحقق من المواصفات","en":"xfi-consistency-testing"},"description":{"zh":"X-Fidelity CLI一致性测试是用于确保CLI和VSCode扩展程序产生相同分析结果的工具","ja":"X-Fidelity CLIの一貫性テストは、CLIとVSCode拡張機能が同じ分析結果を生成することを確認するツールです","ko":"X-Fidelity CLI 일관성 테스트는 CLI와 VSCode 확장 프로그램이 동일한 분석 결과를 생성하는지 확인하는 도구입니다","es":"Herramienta de línea de comandos para pruebas de consistencia de xfi. Asegura la coherencia entre resultados de análisis de CLI y VSCode","fr":"Outil en ligne de commande pour les tests de cohérence xfi. Assurez la cohérence entre les résultats d''analyse de CLI et VSCode","de":"Befehlszeilen-Tool für Xfi-Konsistenztests. Stellen Sie die Konsistenz zwischen den Analyseergebnissen von CLI und VSCode sicher","pt":"O teste de consistência XFI é uma ferramenta que garante a conformidade com o framework, detectando bugs e inconsistências entre a CLI e a extensão do VSCode.","ru":"Тестирование последовательности XFI - это инструмент, обеспечивающий соответствие фреймворку, обнаруживающий ошибки и несоответствия между CLI и расширением ...","ar":"اختبار الاتساق XFI هو أداة تضمن المطابقة مع الإطار، واكتشف الأخطاء وعدم الاتساق بين CLI وامتداد VSCode.","en":"cli for opinionated framework adherence checks"},"definition":{"en":"cli for opinionated framework adherence checks"},"features":{"zh":["确保CLI和VSCode扩展程序产生相同的分析结果","检测不一致性bug","支持快速一致性检查","相同的原型用于分析","相同的规则用于评估","相同的严重级别用于所有问题"],"ja":["CLIとVSCode拡張機能が同じ分析結果を生成することを確認する","一貫性のバグを検出する","クイック一貫性チェックをサポートする","同じアーキタイプを使用して分析する","同じルールを使用して評価する","同じ重大度レベルを使用してすべての問題を検出する"],"ko":["CLI와 VSCode 확장 프로그램이 동일한 분석 결과를 생성하는지 확인합니다","일관성 버그를检测합니다","빠른 일관성 검사를 지원합니다","同じ 아키타입을 사용하여 분석합니다","同じ 규칙을 사용하여 평가합니다","同じ 심각도 수준을 사용하여 모든 문제를 검출합니다"],"es":["Verificación de arquetipo","Evaluación de reglas","Detección de problemas","Niveles de gravedad para problemas"],"fr":["Vérification de l''archétype","Évaluation des règles","Détection des problèmes","Niveaux de gravité pour les problèmes"],"de":["Archetyp-Überprüfung","Regel-Auswertung","Problemerkennung","Schweregrade für Probleme"],"pt":["Verificação de conformidade com o framework","Detecção de bugs e inconsistências","Análise de resultados idênticos entre CLI e VSCode","Verificação de regras e arquétipos","Detecção de problemas com localização idêntica"],"ru":["Проверка соответствия фреймворку","Обнаружение ошибок и несоответствий","Анализ идентичных результатов между CLI и VSCode","Проверка правил и архетипов","Обнаружение проблем с идентичным местоположением"],"ar":["التحقق من مطابقة الإطار","اكتشاف الأخطاء وعدم الاتساق","تحليل النتائج المتطابقة بين CLI و VSCode","التحقق من القواعد والأنماط","اكتشاف المشكلات بموقع متطابق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["X-Fidelity CLI一致性测试","CLI一致性检查","VSCode扩展程序一致性","分析结果一致性","不一致性bug","快速一致性检查"],"ja":["X-Fidelity CLIの一貫性テスト","CLIの一貫性チェック","VSCode拡張機能の一貫性","分析結果の一貫性","一貫性のバグ","クイック一貫性チェック"],"ko":["X-Fidelity CLI 일관성 테스트","CLI 일관성 검사","VSCode 확장 프로그램 일관성","분석 결과 일관성","일관성 버그","빠른 일관성 검사"],"es":["pruebas de consistencia","xfi","herramienta de línea de comandos","análisis de cli","análisis de vscode","coherencia de resultados"],"fr":["tests de cohérence","xfi","outil en ligne de commande","analyse de cli","analyse de vscode","cohérence des résultats"],"de":["Konsistenztests","xfi","Befehlszeilen-Tool","CLI-Analyse","VSCode-Analyse","Konsistenz der Ergebnisse"],"pt":["teste de consistência","xfi","cli","vscode","framework","desenvolvimento de software","ferramenta de teste","padronização"],"ru":["тестирование последовательности","xfi","cli","vscode","фреймворк","разработка программного обеспечения","инструмент тестирования","стандартизация"],"ar":["اختبار الاتساق","xfi","cli","vscode","إطار","تطوير البرمجيات","أداة اختبار","مواصفات"]}},"owner":"zotoio","repo":"x-fidelity","repoPath":"zotoio/x-fidelity","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"xfi-consistency-testing","description":"Guide for ensuring CLI and VSCode extension produce identical analysis results. Use when verifying CLI-Extension parity, debugging output differences, or setting up consistency checks.","bodyPreview":"# CLI-Extension Consistency Testing\n\nThis skill guides you through ensuring X-Fidelity CLI and VSCode extension produce identical results.\n\n## Why Consistency Matters\n\nThe CLI and VSCode extension should always produce identical analysis results:\n- **Same archetype** used for analysis\n- **Same rules** evaluated\n- **Same issues** detected with identical locations\n- **Same severity levels** for all issues\n\nInconsistency indicates a bug that must be fixed before release.\n\n## Quick Consistency Check","body":"# CLI-Extension Consistency Testing\n\nThis skill guides you through ensuring X-Fidelity CLI and VSCode extension produce identical results.\n\n## Why Consistency Matters\n\nThe CLI and VSCode extension should always produce identical analysis results:\n- **Same archetype** used for analysis\n- **Same rules** evaluated\n- **Same issues** detected with identical locations\n- **Same severity levels** for all issues\n\nInconsistency indicates a bug that must be fixed before release.\n\n## Quick Consistency Check\n\n```\nConsistency Verification:\n- [ ] Build all packages\n- [ ] Run CLI analysis\n- [ ] Run VSCode extension analysis\n- [ ] Compare issue counts\n- [ ] Compare issue locations\n- [ ] Verify severity levels match\n```\n\n## Manual Consistency Testing\n\n### 1. Ensure Clean Build\n\n```bash\n# Build everything from workspace root\nyarn build\n\n# Or clean build\nyarn build:clean\n```\n\n### 2. Run CLI Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Navigate to test workspace\ncd packages/x-fidelity-fixtures/node-fullstack\n\n# Run CLI with vscode mode (clean JSON output)\nnpx xfi --mode vscode --archetype node-fullstack > cli-results.json\n\n# Or with human-readable output\nnpx xfi --mode cli --archetype node-fullstack\n```\n\n### 3. Run VSCode Extension Analysis\n\n1. Open `packages/x-fidelity-fixtures/node-fullstack` in VSCode\n2. Wait for extension to activate and analyze\n3. Check issues in tree view (lightning icon)\n4. View Output panel > \"X-Fidelity Analysis\" for details\n\n### 4. Compare Results\n\n**What to Compare**:\n\n| Aspect | CLI | VSCode |\n|--------|-----|--------|\n| Total issues | Count from JSON/output | Tree view count |\n| Issue files | File paths in results | Files in tree view |\n| Issue locations | Line:column in results | Diagnostic ranges |\n| Severity | warning/fatality | warning/error icons |\n\n**Expected Outcome**:\n- Identical issue counts\n- Identical file paths\n- Identical line numbers (column may vary slightly)\n- Matching severity levels\n\n## Integration Test Approach\n\n### Test File Structure\n\nIntegration tests for consistency live in:\n```\npackages/x-fidelity-vscode/src/test/integration/\n├── analysis-completion.test.ts   # Verifies analysis runs\n├── diagnostics.test.ts           # Verifies diagnostics match\n└── rule-validation.test.ts       # Verifies rules evaluate correctly\n```\n\n### Running Integration Tests\n\n```bash\n# Run VSCode extension integration tests\nyarn workspace x-fidelity-vscode test:integration\n\n# Run all VSCode tests\nyarn workspace x-fidelity-vscode test:all\n```\n\n### Writing Consistency Tests\n\n```typescript\nimport * as vscode from ''vscode'';\nimport { execSync } from ''child_process'';\n\ntest(''CLI and extension should produce matching results'', async function() {\n    // Run CLI analysis\n    const cliOutput = execSync(\n        ''npx xfi --mode vscode --archetype node-fullstack'',\n        { cwd: workspacePath, encoding: ''utf8'' }\n    );\n    const cliResults = JSON.parse(cliOutput);\n\n    // Get extension results\n    await vscode.commands.executeCommand(''xfidelity.runAnalysis'');\n    const extensionResults = await vscode.commands.executeCommand(\n        ''xfidelity.getTestResults''\n    );\n\n    // Compare\n    expect(extensionResults.summary.totalIssues)\n        .toBe(cliResults.summary.totalIssues);\n});\n```\n\n## Common Inconsistencies\n\n### 1. Different Issue Counts\n\n**Symptoms**: CLI finds more/fewer issues than extension\n\n**Causes**:\n- Different working directory\n- Different archetype detected\n- File system caching\n\n**Debug**:\n```bash\n# Check CLI working directory\npwd\n\n# Verify archetype in both\nxfi --debug 2>&1 | grep archetype\n# Check VSCode Output panel for archetype detection\n```\n\n### 2. Different File Paths\n\n**Symptoms**: Same issues but different paths\n\n**Causes**:\n- Absolute vs relative paths\n- Path separator differences (Windows)\n- Symlink resolution\n\n**Solution**:\nNormalize paths before comparison:\n```typescript\nconst normalize = (p: string) => path.resolve(p).toLowerCase();\n```\n\n### 3. Different Line Numbers\n\n**Symptoms**: Issues on different lines\n\n**Causes**:\n- Source map differences\n- AST parsing differences\n- Cached file content\n\n**Debug**:\n```bash\n# Ensure both use same file content\ngit status  # No uncommitted changes\nyarn build  # Fresh build\n```\n\n### 4. Missing Diagnostics in VSCode\n\n**Symptoms**: CLI finds issues, VSCode shows none\n\n**Causes**:\n- Extension not activated\n- Diagnostics not registered\n- File not in workspace\n\n**Check**:\n```typescript\n// Verify diagnostics collection\nconst diagnostics = vscode.languages.getDiagnostics();\nfor (const [uri, diags] of diagnostics) {\n    console.log(`${uri.path}: ${diags.length} issues`);\n}\n```\n\n## Test Workspace\n\nThe standard test workspace is:\n```\npackages/x-fidelity-fixtures/node-fullstack/\n```\n\nThis workspace contains:\n- Known issues for testing\n- Multiple file types\n- Various patterns to detect\n\n## CI Integration\n\n### GitHub Actions\n\nConsistency is checked in CI:\n- `.github/workflows/vscode-extension-ci.yml`\n- Runs on PRs and merges\n- Fails build on inconsistency\n\n### Artifacts\n\nConsistency test reports are saved as artifacts:\n- 30-day retention\n- Contains both CLI and extension output\n- Useful for debugging failures\n\n## Debugging Consistency Failures\n\n### 1. Get Detailed Output\n\n```bash\n# CLI with full debug\nxfi --debug --mode vscode 2>&1 | tee cli-debug.log\n\n# VSCode: Enable debug logging\n# Output panel > X-Fidelity Debug\n```\n\n### 2. Compare JSON Output\n\n```bash\n# Save both outputs\nxfi --mode vscode > cli.json\n# Export extension results via command\n\n# Diff the outputs\ndiff cli.json extension.json\n```\n\n### 3. Check Specific Issue\n\n```bash\n# Find issue in CLI output\ngrep \"specificRule\" cli.json\n\n# Find in VSCode\n# Tree view > expand issue > check details\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always test with fixtures workspace** - Known baseline\n2. **Build before testing** - Ensure latest code\n3. **Use same archetype** - Explicit in both contexts\n4. **Compare normalized output** - Handle path differences\n5. **Check after any core changes** - Engine, rules, plugins\n\n## Files Reference\n\n| Purpose | Location |\n|---------|----------|\n| Test workspace | `packages/x-fidelity-fixtures/node-fullstack/` |\n| Integration tests | `packages/x-fidelity-vscode/src/test/integration/` |\n| Test helpers | `packages/x-fidelity-vscode/src/test/helpers/testHelpers.ts` |\n| CI workflow | `.github/workflows/vscode-extension-ci.yml` |\n| Extension tests | `packages/x-fidelity-vscode/src/test/` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:58:38.918Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for QA Automation Agents specializing in developer tooling and cross-platform consistency validation.","zh":"适用于专注于开发工具和跨平台一致性验证的QA自动化代理的必备技能。","ja":"開発ツールとクロスプラットフォームの一貫性の検証を専門とするQA自動化エージェントに不可欠。","ko":"개발 도구 및 크로스 플랫폼 일관성 검증을 전문으로 하는 QA 자동화 에이전트에 필수적인 기술입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de automatización de QA que se especializan en herramientas de desarrollo y validación de consistencia entre plataformas.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''automatisation de QA spécialisés dans les outils de développement et la validation de la cohérence multiplateforme.","de":"Wesentlich für QA-Automatisierungsagenten, die sich auf Entwicklungstools und Konsistenzvalidierung zwischen Plattformen spezialisieren.","pt":"Essencial para agentes de automação de QA especializados em ferramentas de desenvolvedor e validação de consistência multiplataforma.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов автоматизации QA, специализирующихся на инструментах для разработчиков и проверке согласованности на нескольких платформах.","ar":"ضروري لموكلات自动ة QA التي تختص بأدوات المطورين وتصديق الاتساق عبر منصات متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated verification that CLI and VSCode extension implementations produce identical analysis results, ensuring the same archetype, rules, issue detection, locations, and severity levels across both platforms.","zh":"实现CLI和VSCode扩展实现产生相同分析结果的自动化验证，确保在两个平台上具有相同的原型、规则、问题检测、位置和严重性级别。","ja":"CLIとVSCode拡張機能の実装が同一の分析結果を生成することを自動的に検証し、両方のプラットフォームで同じアーキタイプ、ルール、問題の検出、場所、重大性レベルを保証する。","ko":"CLI 및 VSCode 확장 기능 구현이 동일한 분석 결과를 생성하는 자동 검증을 가능하게 하여 두 플랫폼 모두에서 동일한 원형, 규칙, 문제 감지, 위치 및 심각도 수준을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite la verificación automatizada de que las implementaciones de CLI y las extensiones de VSCode produzcan resultados de análisis idénticos, garantizando el mismo arquetipo, reglas, detección de problemas, ubicaciones y niveles de gravedad en ambas plataformas.","fr":"Permet la vérification automatisée que les implémentations CLI et les extensions VSCode produisent des résultats d''analyse identiques, garantissant le même archétype, règles, détection de problèmes, emplacements et niveaux de gravité sur les deux plateformes.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Überprüfung, dass CLI- und VSCode-Erweiterungsimplementierungen identische Analyseergebnisse produzieren, wodurch der gleiche Archetyp, Regeln, Problemverzeichnisse, Standorte und Schweregrade auf beiden Plattformen sichergestellt werden.","pt":"Permite a verificação automatizada de que as implementações de extensões CLI e VSCode produzam resultados de análise idênticos, garantindo o mesmo arquétipo, regras, detecção de problemas, locais e níveis de gravidade em ambas as plataformas.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически проверять, что реализации расширений CLI и VSCode производят идентичные результаты анализа, гарантируя одинаковый архетип, правила, обнаружение проблем, местоположения и уровни серьезности на обеих платформах.","ar":"تمكن من التحقق الآلي من أن تطبيقات الامتدادات CLI و VSCode تنتج نتائج تحليل متطابقة، مما يضمن نفس القالب، والقواعد، وكشف المشكلات، والأماكن، ومستويات الجدية على كلا المنصتين."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating regression testing for development tools","Validating cross-platform analysis consistency","Identifying implementation drift between CLI and IDE extensions","Ensuring release-ready quality for developer tools"],"zh":["为开发工具自动化回归测试","验证跨平台分析的一致性","在CLI和IDE扩展之间识别实现偏差","确保开发工具的发布就绪质量"],"ja":["開発ツールの自動回帰テストの実施","クロスプラットフォーム分析の一貫性の検証","CLIとIDE拡張機能間の実装の乖離の特定","開発ツールのリリース準備品質の確保"],"ko":["개발 도구를 위한 자동 회귀 테스트","크로스 플랫폼 분석의 일관성 검증","CLI 및 IDE 확장 기능 간의 구현 차이 식별","개발 도구의 릴리스 준비 품질 보장"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de regresión para herramientas de desarrollo","Validar la consistencia del análisis entre plataformas","Identificar la derivación de la implementación entre extensiones de CLI y IDE","Garantizar la calidad de lanzamiento para herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de régression pour les outils de développement","Valider la cohérence de l''analyse multiplateforme","Identifier la dérive d''implémentation entre les extensions CLI et IDE","Assurer la qualité de sortie pour les outils de développement"],"de":["Automatisieren von Regressions tests für Entwicklungstools","Validieren der Analyse-Konsistenz zwischen Plattformen","Ermitteln der Implementierungs-Abweichung zwischen CLI- und IDE-Erweiterungen","Sicherstellen der Release-Qualität für Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de regressão para ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Validar a consistência da análise multiplataforma","Identificar a deriva de implementação entre extensões CLI e IDE","Garantir a qualidade pronta para lançamento para ferramentas de desenvolvedor"],"ru":["Автоматизировать регрессионное тестирование для инструментов разработки","Проверять согласованность анализа на нескольких платформах","Выявлять отклонение реализации между расширениями CLI и IDE","Обеспечивать готовность к выпуску для инструментов разработки"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار الانحدار لادوات التطوير","تصديق الاتساق التحليلي عبر منصات متعددة","تحديد انحراف التنفيذ بين امتدادات CLI و IDE","ضمان جودة الإطلاق للادوات المطورة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires both CLI and VSCode extension implementations","Assumes identical input sources for comparison","Limited to X-Fidelity framework tooling"],"zh":["需要CLI和VSCode扩展实现","假设比较的输入源相同","仅限于X-Fidelity框架工具"],"ja":["CLIとVSCode拡張機能の実装が必要","比較の入力源は同一であると仮定","X-Fidelityフレームワークツールに限定"],"ko":["CLI 및 VSCode 확장 기능 구현이 필요","비교를 위한 입력 소스가 동일하다고 가정","X-Fidelity 프레임워크 툴로 제한"],"es":["Requiere implementaciones de CLI y extensiones de VSCode","Supone fuentes de entrada idénticas para la comparación","Limitado al conjunto de herramientas X-Fidelity"],"fr":["Nécessite des implémentations CLI et des extensions VSCode","Suppose des sources d''entrée identiques pour la comparaison","Limité au framework d''outils X-Fidelity"],"de":["Erfordert CLI- und VSCode-Erweiterungsimplementierungen","Geht von identischen Eingabequellen für den Vergleich aus","Begrenzt auf die X-Fidelity-Tool-Suite"],"pt":["Requer implementações de extensões CLI e VSCode","Pressupõe fontes de entrada idênticas para comparação","Limitado ao framework de ferramentas X-Fidelity"],"ru":["Требует реализаций расширений CLI и VSCode","Предполагает идентичные источники ввода для сравнения","Ограничен инструментарием фреймворка X-Fidelity"],"ar":["يتطلب تطبيقات امتدادات CLI و VSCode","يفترض مصادر المدخلات المتطابقة للمقارنة","محدود بأدوات إطار X-Fidelity"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop/parallel-agents', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'Synapse-Desktop', 'HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop', 'parallel-agents', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z', '2026-02-19T02:00:38.556Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop/parallel-agents","name":"parallel-agents","description":{"zh":"该技能使开发者能够协调多个专门的代理，安全地应用AI建议的代码修复，适用于复杂任务和代码分析","ja":"このスキルにより、開発者は複数の専門エージェントを調整し、安全にAIの提案されたコードの修正を適用できます。複雑なタスクやコード分析に適しています","ko":"이 기술은 개발자가 여러 전문 에이전트를 조정하여 안전하게 AI가 제안한 코드 수정을 적용할 수 있게 해줍니다. 복잡한 작업과 코드 분석에 적합합니다","es":"Los agentes paralelos permiten la orquestación de tareas complejas a través del sistema de agentes nativo de Antigravity, manteniendo todo dentro de su control","fr":"Les agents parallèles permettent l''orchestration de tâches complexes via le système d''agents natif d''Antigravity, en gardant tout sous son contrôle","de":"Parallele Agenten ermöglichen die Orchestrierung von komplexen Aufgaben über das native Agentensystem von Antigravity, wodurch alles unter seiner Kontrolle bleibt","pt":"Os agentes paralelos permitem a orquestração de tarefas complexas com múltiplas especializações, garantindo segurança e eficiência","ru":"Параллельные агенты позволяют оркестрировать сложные задачи с несколькими специализациями, обеспечивая безопасность и эффективность","ar":"الوكلاء الموازيون يسمحون بتنسيق المهام المعقدة مع تخصصات متعددة، مع ضمان الأمان والفعالية","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"并行代理技术 - AI 代码分析与修复","ja":"パラレルエージェント - AIコード分析と修復","ko":"병렬 에이전트 기술 - AI 코드 분석 및 수정","es":"Agentes Paralelos: Orquestación de Tareas Complejas","fr":"Agents Parallèles: Orchestration de Tâches Complexes","de":"Parallele Agenten: Orchestrierung von Komplexen Aufgaben","pt":"Agentes Paralelos: Orquestração de Tarefas Complexas","ru":"Параллельные Агенты: Оркестрация Сложных Задач","ar":"وكلاء موازيون: تنسيق المهام المعقدة","en":"parallel-agents"},"description":{"zh":"该技能使开发者能够协调多个专门的代理，安全地应用AI建议的代码修复，适用于复杂任务和代码分析","ja":"このスキルにより、開発者は複数の専門エージェントを調整し、安全にAIの提案されたコードの修正を適用できます。複雑なタスクやコード分析に適しています","ko":"이 기술은 개발자가 여러 전문 에이전트를 조정하여 안전하게 AI가 제안한 코드 수정을 적용할 수 있게 해줍니다. 복잡한 작업과 코드 분석에 적합합니다","es":"Los agentes paralelos permiten la orquestación de tareas complejas a través del sistema de agentes nativo de Antigravity, manteniendo todo dentro de su control","fr":"Les agents parallèles permettent l''orchestration de tâches complexes via le système d''agents natif d''Antigravity, en gardant tout sous son contrôle","de":"Parallele Agenten ermöglichen die Orchestrierung von komplexen Aufgaben über das native Agentensystem von Antigravity, wodurch alles unter seiner Kontrolle b...","pt":"Os agentes paralelos permitem a orquestração de tarefas complexas com múltiplas especializações, garantindo segurança e eficiência","ru":"Параллельные агенты позволяют оркестрировать сложные задачи с несколькими специализациями, обеспечивая безопасность и эффективность","ar":"الوكلاء الموازيون يسمحون بتنسيق المهام المعقدة مع تخصصات متعددة، مع ضمان الأمان والفعالية","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"definition":{"en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"features":{"zh":["AI代码分析","安全的代码修复","复杂任务支持","代码质量评估","安全性评估","性能优化"],"ja":["AIコード分析","安全なコード修正","複雑なタスクのサポート","コード品質の評価","セキュリティの評価","パフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["AI 코드 분석","안전한 코드 수정","복잡한 작업 지원","코드 품질 평가","보안성 평가","성능 최적화"],"es":["Orquestación de tareas complejas","Integración con el sistema de agentes nativo de Antigravity","Análisis de código desde perspectivas de seguridad, rendimiento y calidad","Revisión integral de la arquitectura","Aplicación segura de parches sugeridos por IA","Previsualización de parches antes de aplicarlos"],"fr":["Orchestration de tâches complexes","Intégration avec le système d''agents natif d''Antigravity","Analyse de code depuis des perspectives de sécurité, de performance et de qualité","Révision intégrale de l''architecture","Application sécurisée de correctifs suggérés par l''IA","Prévisualisation des correctifs avant de les appliquer"],"de":["Orchestrierung von komplexen Aufgaben","Integration mit dem nativen Agentensystem von Antigravity","Code-Analyse aus Sicherheits-, Leistungs- und Qualitätsperspektive","Umfassende Überprüfung der Architektur","Sichere Anwendung von von KI vorgeschlagenen Patches","Vorschau von Patches vor der Anwendung"],"pt":["Orquestração de tarefas complexas","Suporte a múltiplas especializações","Garantia de segurança e eficiência","Integração com o sistema de agentes nativo","Análise de código de segurança, desempenho e qualidade"],"ru":["Оркестрация сложных задач","Поддержка нескольких специализаций","Гарантия безопасности и эффективности","Интеграция с системой агентов по умолчанию","Анализ кода безопасности, производительности и качества"],"ar":["تنسيق المهام المعقدة","دعم التخصصات المتعددة","ضمان الأمان والفعالية","التكامل مع نظام الوكلاء الأصلي","تحليل код الأمان والأداء والجودة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["并行代理","AI代码分析","代码修复","Antigravity","原生代理系统","复杂任务","代码质量评估","安全性评估","性能优化"],"ja":["パラレルエージェント","AIコード分析","コード修正","Antigravity","ネイティブエージェントシステム","複雑なタスク","コード品質の評価","セキュリティの評価","パフォーマンスの最適化"],"ko":["병렬 에이전트","AI 코드 분석","코드 수정","Antigravity","네이티브 에이전트 시스템","복잡한 작업","코드 품질 평가","보안성 평가","성능 최적화"],"es":["agentes paralelos","orquestación de tareas","Antigravity","análisis de código","seguridad","rendimiento","calidad","arquitectura","IA","parches"],"fr":["agents parallèles","orchestration de tâches","Antigravity","analyse de code","sécurité","performance","qualité","architecture","IA","correctifs"],"de":["parallele Agenten","Orchestrierung von Aufgaben","Antigravity","Code-Analyse","Sicherheit","Leistung","Qualität","Architektur","KI","Patches"],"pt":["agentes paralelos","orquestração de tarefas","segurança e eficiência","análise de código","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["параллельные агенты","оркестрация задач","безопасность и эффективность","анализ кода","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["وكلاء موازيون","تنسيق المهام","أمان وفعالية","تحليل код","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"parallel-agents","description":"Multi-agent orchestration patterns. Use when multiple independent tasks can run with different domain expertise or when comprehensive analysis requires multiple perspectives.","bodyPreview":"# Native Parallel Agents\n\n> Orchestration through Antigravity''s built-in Agent Tool\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill enables coordinating multiple specialized agents through Antigravity''s native agent system. Unlike external scripts, this approach keeps all orchestration within Antigravity''s control.\n\n## When to Use Orchestration\n\n✅ **Good for:**\n- Complex tasks requiring multiple expertise domains\n- Code analysis from security, performance, and quality perspectives\n- Comprehensive reviews (architecture","body":"# Native Parallel Agents\n\n> Orchestration through Antigravity''s built-in Agent Tool\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill enables coordinating multiple specialized agents through Antigravity''s native agent system. Unlike external scripts, this approach keeps all orchestration within Antigravity''s control.\n\n## When to Use Orchestration\n\n✅ **Good for:**\n- Complex tasks requiring multiple expertise domains\n- Code analysis from security, performance, and quality perspectives\n- Comprehensive reviews (architecture + security + testing)\n- Feature implementation needing backend + frontend + database work\n\n❌ **Not for:**\n- Simple, single-domain tasks\n- Quick fixes or small changes\n- Tasks where one agent suffices\n\n---\n\n## Native Agent Invocation\n\n### Single Agent\n```\nUse the security-auditor agent to review authentication\n```\n\n### Sequential Chain\n```\nFirst, use the explorer-agent to discover project structure.\nThen, use the backend-specialist to review API endpoints.\nFinally, use the test-engineer to identify test gaps.\n```\n\n### With Context Passing\n```\nUse the frontend-specialist to analyze React components.\nBased on those findings, have the test-engineer generate component tests.\n```\n\n### Resume Previous Work\n```\nResume agent [agentId] and continue with additional requirements.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Orchestration Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Comprehensive Analysis\n```\nAgents: explorer-agent → [domain-agents] → synthesis\n\n1. explorer-agent: Map codebase structure\n2. security-auditor: Security posture\n3. backend-specialist: API quality\n4. frontend-specialist: UI/UX patterns\n5. test-engineer: Test coverage\n6. Synthesize all findings\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Feature Review\n```\nAgents: affected-domain-agents → test-engineer\n\n1. Identify affected domains (backend? frontend? both?)\n2. Invoke relevant domain agents\n3. test-engineer verifies changes\n4. Synthesize recommendations\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Security Audit\n```\nAgents: security-auditor → penetration-tester → synthesis\n\n1. security-auditor: Configuration and code review\n2. penetration-tester: Active vulnerability testing\n3. Synthesize with prioritized remediation\n```\n\n---\n\n## Available Agents\n\n| Agent | Expertise | Trigger Phrases |\n|-------|-----------|-----------------|\n| `orchestrator` | Coordination | \"comprehensive\", \"multi-perspective\" |\n| `security-auditor` | Security | \"security\", \"auth\", \"vulnerabilities\" |\n| `penetration-tester` | Security Testing | \"pentest\", \"red team\", \"exploit\" |\n| `backend-specialist` | Backend | \"API\", \"server\", \"Node.js\", \"Express\" |\n| `frontend-specialist` | Frontend | \"React\", \"UI\", \"components\", \"Next.js\" |\n| `test-engineer` | Testing | \"tests\", \"coverage\", \"TDD\" |\n| `devops-engineer` | DevOps | \"deploy\", \"CI/CD\", \"infrastructure\" |\n| `database-architect` | Database | \"schema\", \"Prisma\", \"migrations\" |\n| `mobile-developer` | Mobile | \"React Native\", \"Flutter\", \"mobile\" |\n| `api-designer` | API Design | \"REST\", \"GraphQL\", \"OpenAPI\" |\n| `debugger` | Debugging | \"bug\", \"error\", \"not working\" |\n| `explorer-agent` | Discovery | \"explore\", \"map\", \"structure\" |\n| `documentation-writer` | Documentation | \"write docs\", \"create README\", \"generate API docs\" |\n| `performance-optimizer` | Performance | \"slow\", \"optimize\", \"profiling\" |\n| `project-planner` | Planning | \"plan\", \"roadmap\", \"milestones\" |\n| `seo-specialist` | SEO | \"SEO\", \"meta tags\", \"search ranking\" |\n| `game-developer` | Game Development | \"game\", \"Unity\", \"Godot\", \"Phaser\" |\n\n---\n\n## Antigravity Built-in Agents\n\nThese work alongside custom agents:\n\n| Agent | Model | Purpose |\n|-------|-------|---------|\n| **Explore** | Haiku | Fast read-only codebase search |\n| **Plan** | Sonnet | Research during plan mode |\n| **General-purpose** | Sonnet | Complex multi-step modifications |\n\nUse **Explore** for quick searches, **custom agents** for domain expertise.\n\n---\n\n## Synthesis Protocol\n\nAfter all agents complete, synthesize:\n\n```markdown\n## Orchestration Synthesis\n\n### Task Summary\n[What was accomplished]\n\n### Agent Contributions\n| Agent | Finding |\n|-------|---------|\n| security-auditor | Found X |\n| backend-specialist | Identified Y |\n\n### Consolidated Recommendations\n1. **Critical**: [Issue from Agent A]\n2. **Important**: [Issue from Agent B]\n3. **Nice-to-have**: [Enhancement from Agent C]\n\n### Action Items\n- [ ] Fix critical security issue\n- [ ] Refactor API endpoint\n- [ ] Add missing tests\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Available agents** - 17 specialized agents can be orchestrated\n2. **Logical order** - Discovery → Analysis → Implementation → Testing\n3. **Share context** - Pass relevant findings to subsequent agents\n4. **Single synthesis** - One unified report, not separate outputs\n5. **Verify changes** - Always include test-engineer for code modifications\n\n---\n\n## Key Benefits\n\n- ✅ **Single session** - All agents share context\n- ✅ **AI-controlled** - Claude orchestrates autonomously\n- ✅ **Native integration** - Works with built-in Explore, Plan agents\n- ✅ **Resume support** - Can continue previous agent work\n- ✅ **Context passing** - Findings flow between agents\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:00:38.556Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents orchestrating multi-agent workflows across security, performance, and quality domains.","zh":"非常适合代码分析代理编排跨安全、性能和质量领域的多代理工作流。","ja":"コード分析エージェントがセキュリティ、パフォーマンス、品質の各ドメインにわたるマルチエージェントワークフローをオーケストレーションするのに最適です。","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트가 보안, 성능, 품질 도메인의 멀티 에이전트 워크플ロー 오케스트레이션에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que orquestan flujos de trabajo de multiagente en dominios de seguridad, rendimiento y calidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code orchestrant des flux de travail multi-agents à travers les domaines de sécurité, de performance et de qualité.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die Multi-Agent-Workflows in den Bereichen Sicherheit, Leistung und Qualität orchestrieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que orquestram fluxos de trabalho de multi-agente em domínios de segurança, desempenho e qualidade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которые оркестрируют рабочие процессы нескольких агентов в областях безопасности, производительности и качества.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الشفرة التي تحرك عمليات عمل متعددة للوكيل عبر مجالات الأمان والأداء والجودة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables native orchestration of multiple specialized agents through Antigravity''s built-in system for comprehensive codebase analysis. Extracts context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely applies AI-suggested patches with preview capabilities.","zh":"通过Antigravity的内置系统实现多个专用代理的本地编排，用于全面代码库分析。提取任何LLM（ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini）的上下文，并安全地应用AI建议的补丁，具有预览功能。","ja":"Antigravityのビルトインシステムを使用して、包括的なコードベース分析のための複数の専用エージェントをネイティブにオーケストレーションします。任意のLLM（ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini）のコンテキストを抽出し、安全にAIによるパッチをプレビュー機能付きで適用します。","ko":"Antigravity의 내장 시스템을 사용하여 포괄적인 코드베이스 분석을 위한 여러 전문 에이전트를 네이티브로 오케스트레이션합니다. 任意의 LLM(ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)의 컨텍스트를 추출하고 안전하게 AI가 제안한 패치를 미리 보기 기능과 함께 적용합니다.","es":"Habilita la orquestación nativa de múltiples agentes especializados a través del sistema integrado de Antigravity para un análisis exhaustivo de la base de código. Extrae el contexto para cualquier LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) y aplica de manera segura parches sugeridos por IA con capacidades de vista previa.","fr":"Permet l''orchestration native de plusieurs agents spécialisés via le système intégré d''Antigravity pour une analyse exhaustive de la base de code. Extrait le contexte pour n''importe quel LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) et applique de manière sécurisée des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec des capacités d''aperçu.","de":"Ermöglicht die native Orchestrierung mehrerer spezialisierter Agenten über das in Antigravity integrierte System für eine umfassende Codebase-Analyse. Extrahiert den Kontext für jedes LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) und wendet vorgeschlagene AI-Patches mit Vorschau-Funktionen sicher an.","pt":"Permite a orquestração nativa de vários agentes especializados por meio do sistema integrado da Antigravity para análise abrangente da base de código. Extrai o contexto para qualquer LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) e aplica patches sugeridos por IA com pré-visualização de forma segura.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять оркестрирование нескольких специализированных агентов с помощью встроенной системы Antigravity для комплексного анализа базы кода. Извлекает контекст для любой LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) и безопасно применяет патчи, предложенные ИИ, с возможностью предварительного просмотра.","ar":"تمكن من تنسيق الوكلاء المتخصصين المتعددين من خلال نظام أنتي جرافيتي المدمج لتحليل شامل لقاعدة الشفرة. يستخرج السياق لأي منصة LLM (ChatGPT، Claude، Gemini) ويطبق التصحيحات المقترحة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي بأمان مع إمكانية المعاينة."},"useCases":{"en":["Performing comprehensive architecture reviews with multiple expert agents","Applying AI-suggested code patches with safety previews","Extracting codebase context for multiple LLM platforms","Coordinating security and performance analysis simultaneously"],"zh":["使用多个专家代理进行全面架构审查","安全地应用AI建议的代码补丁，具有预览功能","提取多个LLM平台的代码库上下文","同时协调安全性和性能分析"],"ja":["複数のエキスパートエージェントを使用した包括的なアーキテクチャレビューの実施","安全にAIによるコードパッチをプレビュー機能付きで適用","複数のLLMプラットフォームのコードベースコンテキストの抽出","セキュリティとパフォーマンス分析を同時に調整"],"ko":["여러 전문가 에이전트를 사용한 포괄적인 아키텍처 리뷰 수행","安全하게 AI가 제안한 코드 패치를 미리 보기 기능과 함께 적용","여러 LLM 플랫폼의 코드베이스 컨텍스트 추출","보안 및 성능 분석을 동시에 조정"],"es":["Realizar revisiones de arquitectura exhaustivas con múltiples agentes expertos","Aplicar parches de código sugeridos por IA con vistas previas de seguridad","Extraer el contexto de la base de código para varias plataformas LLM","Coordinar análisis de seguridad y rendimiento simultáneamente"],"fr":["Réalisant des examens d''architecture complets avec plusieurs agents experts","Appliquant des correctifs de code suggérés par l''IA avec des aperçus de sécurité","Extrayant le contexte de la base de code pour plusieurs plateformes LLM","Coordinant l''analyse de sécurité et de performance simultanément"],"de":["Durchführen umfassender Architekturüberprüfungen mit mehreren Expertenagenten","Anwenden von AI-vorgeschlagenen Code-Patches mit Sicherheitsvorschau","Extrahieren des Kontexts der Codebase für mehrere LLM-Plattformen","Koordinieren von Sicherheits- und Leistungsanalysen gleichzeitig"],"pt":["Realizar revisões abrangentes de arquitetura com vários agentes especializados","Aplicar patches de código sugeridos por IA com pré-visualização de segurança","Extrair contexto da base de código para várias plataformas LLM","Coordenar análise de segurança e desempenho simultaneamente"],"ru":["Выполнять комплексные обзоры архитектуры с помощью нескольких специализированных агентов","Применять патчи кода, предложенные ИИ, с возможностью предварительного просмотра безопасности","Извлекать контекст базы кода для нескольких платформ LLM","Координировать анализ безопасности и производительности одновременно"],"ar":["إجراء مراجعات شاملة للهياكل باستخدام وكلاء متخصصين متعددين","تطبيق تصحيحات شفرة مقترحة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة أمان","استخراج سياق قاعدة الشفرة لمنصات LLM المتعددة","تنسيق تحليل الأمان والأداء في نفس الوقت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Antigravity''s native agent system","Limited to Antigravity''s orchestration capabilities","Dependent on built-in Agent Tool functionality"],"zh":["需要Antigravity的本地代理系统","仅限于Antigravity的编排能力","依赖于内置代理工具功能"],"ja":["Antigravityのネイティブエージェントシステムの必要性","Antigravityのオーケストレーション能力に限定","ビルトインエージェントツールの機能に依存"],"ko":["Antigravity의 네이티브 에이전트 시스템 필요","Antigravity의 오케스트레이션 기능에 한정","내장 에이전트 툴 기능에 의존"],"es":["Requiere el sistema de agentes nativo de Antigravity","Limitado a las capacidades de orquestación de Antigravity","Dependiente de la funcionalidad de la herramienta de agente integrada"],"fr":["Nécessite le système d''agents natif d''Antigravity","Limité aux capacités d''orchestration d''Antigravity","Dépendant de la fonctionnalité de l''outil d''agent intégré"],"de":["Benötigt das native Agentsystem von Antigravity","Begrenzt auf die Orchestrierungsfähigkeiten von Antigravity","Abhängig von der Funktionalität des integrierten Agenten-Tools"],"pt":["Exige o sistema de agente nativo da Antigravity","Limitado às capacidades de orquestração da Antigravity","Dependente da funcionalidade da Ferramenta de Agente integrada"],"ru":["Требует встроенной системы агентов Antigravity","Ограничен возможностями оркестрирования Antigravity","Зависит от функциональности встроенного инструмента агента"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام الوكيل الأصلي لأنتي جرافيتي","محدود بتقنيات تنسيق أنتي جرافيتي","يعتمد على وظيفة أداة الوكيل المدمجة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
