killMd":{"name":"react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization from Vercel Engineering. Use when building React components, optimizing performance, eliminating waterfalls, reducing bundle size, reviewing code for performance issues, or implementing server/client-side optimizations.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js & React Performance Expert\n\n> **From Vercel Engineering** - 57 optimization rules prioritized by impact\n> **Philosophy:** Eliminate waterfalls first, optimize bundles second, then micro-optimize.\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule (MANDATORY)\n\n**Read ONLY sections relevant to your task!** Check the content map below and load what you need.\n\n> 🔴 **For performance reviews: Start with CRITICAL sections (1-2), then move to HIGH/MEDIUM.**\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File","body":"# Next.js & React Performance Expert\n\n> **From Vercel Engineering** - 57 optimization rules prioritized by impact\n> **Philosophy:** Eliminate waterfalls first, optimize bundles second, then micro-optimize.\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule (MANDATORY)\n\n**Read ONLY sections relevant to your task!** Check the content map below and load what you need.\n\n> 🔴 **For performance reviews: Start with CRITICAL sections (1-2), then move to HIGH/MEDIUM.**\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File                                    | Impact             | Rules    | When to Read                                                    |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------ | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `1-async-eliminating-waterfalls.md`     | 🔴 **CRITICAL**    | 5 rules  | Slow page loads, sequential API calls, data fetching waterfalls |\n| `2-bundle-bundle-size-optimization.md`  | 🔴 **CRITICAL**    | 5 rules  | Large bundle size, slow Time to Interactive, First Load issues  |\n| `3-server-server-side-performance.md`   | 🟠 **HIGH**        | 7 rules  | Slow SSR, API route optimization, server-side waterfalls        |\n| `4-client-client-side-data-fetching.md` | 🟡 **MEDIUM-HIGH** | 4 rules  | Client data management, SWR patterns, deduplication             |\n| `5-rerender-re-render-optimization.md`  | 🟡 **MEDIUM**      | 12 rules | Excessive re-renders, React performance, memoization            |\n| `6-rendering-rendering-performance.md`  | 🟡 **MEDIUM**      | 9 rules  | Rendering bottlenecks, virtualization, image optimization       |\n| `7-js-javascript-performance.md`        | ⚪ **LOW-MEDIUM**  | 12 rules | Micro-optimizations, caching, loop performance                  |\n| `8-advanced-advanced-patterns.md`       | 🔵 **VARIABLE**    | 3 rules  | Advanced React patterns, useLatest, init-once                   |\n\n**Total: 57 rules across 8 categories**\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Quick Decision Tree\n\n**What''s your performance issue?**\n\n```\n🐌 Slow page loads / Long Time to Interactive\n  → Read Section 1: Eliminating Waterfalls\n  → Read Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization\n\n📦 Large bundle size (> 200KB)\n  → Read Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization\n  → Check: Dynamic imports, barrel imports, tree-shaking\n\n🖥️ Slow Server-Side Rendering\n  → Read Section 3: Server-Side Performance\n  → Check: Parallel data fetching, streaming\n\n🔄 Too many re-renders / UI lag\n  → Read Section 5: Re-render Optimization\n  → Check: React.memo, useMemo, useCallback\n\n🎨 Rendering performance issues\n  → Read Section 6: Rendering Performance\n  → Check: Virtualization, layout thrashing\n\n🌐 Client-side data fetching problems\n  → Read Section 4: Client-Side Data Fetching\n  → Check: SWR deduplication, localStorage\n\n✨ Need advanced patterns\n  → Read Section 8: Advanced Patterns\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📊 Impact Priority Guide\n\n**Use this order when doing comprehensive optimization:**\n\n```\n1️⃣ CRITICAL (Biggest Gains - Do First):\n   ├─ Section 1: Eliminating Waterfalls\n   │  └─ Each waterfall adds full network latency (100-500ms+)\n   └─ Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization\n      └─ Affects Time to Interactive and Largest Contentful Paint\n\n2️⃣ HIGH (Significant Impact - Do Second):\n   └─ Section 3: Server-Side Performance\n      └─ Eliminates server-side waterfalls, faster response times\n\n3️⃣ MEDIUM (Moderate Gains - Do Third):\n   ├─ Section 4: Client-Side Data Fetching\n   ├─ Section 5: Re-render Optimization\n   └─ Section 6: Rendering Performance\n\n4️⃣ LOW (Polish - Do Last):\n   ├─ Section 7: JavaScript Performance\n   └─ Section 8: Advanced Patterns\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Related Skills\n\n| Need                    | Skill                             |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| API design patterns     | `@[skills/api-patterns]`          |\n| Database optimization   | `@[skills/database-design]`       |\n| Testing strategies      | `@[skills/testing-patterns]`      |\n| UI/UX design principles | `@[skills/frontend-design]`       |\n| TypeScript patterns     | `@[skills/typescript-expert]`     |\n| Deployment & DevOps     | `@[skills/deployment-procedures]` |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Performance Review Checklist\n\nBefore shipping to production:\n\n**Critical (Must Fix):**\n\n- [ ] No sequential data fetching (waterfalls eliminated)\n- [ ] Bundle size < 200KB for main bundle\n- [ ] No barrel imports in app code\n- [ ] Dynamic imports used for large components\n- [ ] Parallel data fetching where possible\n\n**High Priority:**\n\n- [ ] Server components used where appropriate\n- [ ] API routes optimized (no N+1 queries)\n- [ ] Suspense boundaries for data fetching\n- [ ] Static generation used where possible\n\n**Medium Priority:**\n\n- [ ] Expensive computations memoized\n- [ ] List rendering virtualized (if > 100 items)\n- [ ] Images optimized with next/image\n- [ ] No unnecessary re-renders\n\n**Low Priority (Polish):**\n\n- [ ] Hot path loops optimized\n- [ ] RegExp patterns hoisted\n- [ ] Property access cached in loops\n\n---\n\n## ❌ Anti-Patterns (Common Mistakes)\n\n**DON''T:**\n\n- ❌ Use sequential `await` for independent operations\n- ❌ Import entire libraries when you need one function\n- ❌ Use barrel exports (`index.ts` re-exports) in app code\n- ❌ Skip dynamic imports for large components/libraries\n- ❌ Fetch data in useEffect without deduplication\n- ❌ Forget to memoize expensive computations\n- ❌ Use client components when server components work\n\n**DO:**\n\n- ✅ Fetch data in parallel with `Promise.all()`\n- ✅ Use dynamic imports: `const Comp = dynamic(() => import(''./Heavy''))`\n- ✅ Import directly: `import { specific } from ''library/specific''`\n- ✅ Use Suspense boundaries for better UX\n- ✅ Leverage React Server Components\n- ✅ Measure performance before optimizing\n- ✅ Use Next.js built-in optimizations (next/image, next/font)\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 How to Use This Skill\n\n### For New Features:\n\n1. Check **Section 1 & 2** while building (prevent waterfalls, keep bundle small)\n2. Use server components by default (Section 3)\n3. Apply memoization for expensive operations (Section 5)\n\n### For Performance Reviews:\n\n1. Start with **Section 1** (waterfalls = biggest impact)\n2. Then **Section 2** (bundle size)\n3. Then **Section 3** (server-side)\n4. Finally other sections as needed\n\n### For Debugging Slow Performance:\n\n1. Identify the symptom (slow load, lag, etc.)\n2. Use Quick Decision Tree above\n3. Read relevant section\n4. Apply fixes in priority order\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Learning Path\n\n**Beginner (Focus on Critical):**\n→ Section 1: Eliminating Waterfalls\n→ Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization\n\n**Intermediate (Add High Priority):**\n→ Section 3: Server-Side Performance\n→ Section 5: Re-render Optimization\n\n**Advanced (Full Optimization):**\n→ All sections + Section 8: Advanced Patterns\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 Validation Script\n\n| Script                                 | Purpose                     | Command                                                      |\n| -------------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `scripts/react_performance_checker.py` | Automated performance audit | `python scripts/react_performance_checker.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 📖 Section Details\n\n### Section 1: Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n**Impact:** Each waterfall adds 100-500ms+ latency\n**Key Concepts:** Parallel fetching, Promise.all(), Suspense boundaries, preloading\n\n### Section 2: Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n**Impact:** Directly affects Time to Interactive, Largest Contentful Paint\n**Key Concepts:** Dynamic imports, tree-shaking, barrel import avoidance\n\n### Section 3: Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n**Impact:** Faster server responses, better SEO\n**Key Concepts:** Parallel server fetching, streaming, API route optimization\n\n### Section 4: Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n**Impact:** Reduces redundant requests, better UX\n**Key Concepts:** SWR deduplication, localStorage caching, event listeners\n\n### Section 5: Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n**Impact:** Smoother UI, less wasted computation\n**Key Concepts:** React.memo, useMemo, useCallback, component structure\n\n### Section 6: Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n**Impact:** Better rendering efficiency\n**Key Concepts:** Virtualization, image optimization, layout thrashing\n\n### Section 7: JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n**Impact:** Incremental improvements in hot paths\n**Key Concepts:** Loop optimization, caching, RegExp hoisting\n\n### Section 8: Advanced Patterns (VARIABLE)\n\n**Impact:** Specific use cases\n**Key Concepts:** useLatest hook, init-once patterns, event handler refs\n\n---\n\n## 🎓 Best Practices Summary\n\n**Golden Rules:**\n\n1. **Measure first** - Use React DevTools Profiler, Chrome DevTools\n2. **Biggest impact first** - Waterfalls → Bundle → Server → Micro\n3. **Don''t over-optimize** - Focus on real bottlenecks\n4. **Use platform features** - Next.js has optimizations built-in\n5. **Think about users** - Real-world conditions matter\n\n**Performance Mindset:**\n\n- Every `await` in sequence = potential waterfall\n- Every `import` = potential bundle bloat\n- Every re-render = wasted computation (if unnecessary)\n- Server components = less JavaScript to ship\n- Measure, don''t guess\n\n---\n\n**Source:** Vercel Engineering\n**Date:** January 2026\n**Version:** 1.0.0\n**Total Rules:** 57 across 8 categories\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:00:50.356Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized React performance and best practices","zh":"非常适合需要优化React性能和最佳实践的前端代理","ja":"Reactのパフォーマンスとベストプラクティスを最適化する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"최적화된 React 성능과 최고의 실践이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un rendimiento optimizado de React y las mejores prácticas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''un rendement optimisé de React et des meilleures pratiques","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein optimiertes React-Performance und Best Practices benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de desempenho otimizado do React e melhores práticas","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный性能 React и лучшие практики","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامي الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء محسّن من React وأفضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply 57 optimization rules prioritized by impact, eliminating waterfalls and optimizing bundles using Next.js and React, with a focus on selective reading and content preview for efficient performance reviews","zh":"赋予代理应用57个优化规则，按影响力优先，消除瀑布并使用Next.js和React优化包，专注于选择性阅读和内容预览以进行高效的性能审查","ja":"エージェントに、影響力に基づいて優先順位付けされた57の最適化ルールを適用し、Next.jsとReactを使用してウォーターフォールを排除し、バンドルを最適化し、選択的読み取りとコンテンツプレビューに焦点を当てて効率的なパフォーマンスレビューを実施する","ko":"에이전트에게 57개의 최적화 규칙을 적용하여 영향력을 우선순위로 정렬하고, Next.js 및 React를 사용하여 폭포수를 제거하고 번들을 최적화하며, 선택적 읽기 및 콘텐츠 미리 보기에 중점을 두어 효율적인 성능 검토를 수행할 수 있게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar 57 reglas de optimización priorizadas por impacto, eliminando cascadas y optimizando paquetes utilizando Next.js y React, con un enfoque en la lectura selectiva y la vista previa de contenido para revisiones de rendimiento eficientes","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer 57 règles d''optimisation priorisées par impact, éliminant les cascades et optimisant les bundles en utilisant Next.js et React, avec un focus sur la lecture sélective et l''aperçu de contenu pour des examens de performance efficaces","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, 57 Optimierungsregeln priorisiert nach Auswirkung anzuwenden, Wasserfälle zu eliminieren und Bundles mit Next.js und React zu optimieren, mit Fokus auf selektives Lesen und Inhaltsvorschau für effiziente Leistungsprüfungen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar 57 regras de otimização priorizadas por impacto, eliminando cascata e otimizando pacotes usando Next.js e React, com foco em leitura seletiva e visualização de conteúdo para revisões de desempenho eficientes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять 57 правил оптимизации, отсортированных по воздействию, устраняя каскады и оптимизируя пакеты с использованием Next.js и React, с фокусом на избирательном чтении и предпросмотре контента для эффективных обзоров производительности","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطبيق 57 قاعدة لتحسين الأولويات حسب التأثير، وإزالة الشلالات وتحسين الحزم باستخدام Next.js و React، مع التركيز على القراءة الانتقائية وتحديد مسبق للمحتوى من أجل مراجعات أداء فعالة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating React codebase optimization","Generating performance patches with preview","Debugging Next.js applications using critical and high/medium priority rules"],"zh":["自动优化React代码库","生成带有预览的性能补丁","使用关键和高/中优先级规则调试Next.js应用程序"],"ja":["Reactコードベースの自動最適化","プレビュー付きのパフォーマンスパッチの生成","重要度と高/中優先度ルールを使用したNext.jsアプリケーションのデバッグ"],"ko":["React 코드베이스 자동 최적화","미리 보기가 포함된 성능 패치 생성","중요도 및 높은/중간 우선순위 규칙을 사용한 Next.js 애플리케이션 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la optimización de la base de código de React","Generación de parches de rendimiento con vista previa","Depuración de aplicaciones Next.js utilizando reglas críticas y de alta/mediana prioridad"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''optimisation de la base de code React","Génération de correctifs de performance avec aperçu","Débogage des applications Next.js en utilisant des règles critiques et de haute/moyenne priorité"],"de":["Automatisierung der Optimierung der React-Codebasis","Erzeugung von Leistungs-Patches mit Vorschau","Fehlerbehebung von Next.js-Anwendungen unter Verwendung kritischer und hoher/mittlerer Prioritätsregeln"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização da base de código React","Gerar patches de desempenho com visualização","Depurar aplicações Next.js usando regras críticas e de alta/média prioridade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию кодовой базы React","Генерировать патчи производительности с предпросмотром","Отлаживать приложения Next.js с использованием критических и высоко/средних правил"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي لتحسين قاعدة شفرة React","توليد تصحيحات للأداء مع معاينة","تصحيح أخطاء التطبيقات Next.js باستخدام قواعد حرجة وعالية/متوسطة الأهمية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and Next.js project setup","Limited to JavaScript and React ecosystem"],"zh":["需要React和Next.js项目设置","仅限于JavaScript和React生态系统"],"ja":["ReactとNext.jsのプロジェクト設定が必要","JavaScriptとReactのエコシステムのみ"],"ko":["React 및 Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요함","JavaScript 및 React 생태계에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto React y Next.js","Limitado al ecosistema JavaScript y React"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React et Next.js","Limité à l''écosystème JavaScript et React"],"de":["Benötigt React- und Next.js-Projektsetup","Begrenzt auf JavaScript- und React-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer configuração de projeto React e Next.js","Limitado ao ecossistema JavaScript e React"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта React и Next.js","Ограничен экосистемой JavaScript и React"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React و Next.js","محدود بنظام JavaScript و React"]},"version":3