اختيار محرك وأصول خاصة بالمنصة","en":"pc-games"},"description":{"zh":"游戏开发引擎选择是一个关键的决定，影响游戏的性能、可扩展性和开发效率","ja":"ゲーム開発エンジンの選択は、ゲームのパフォーマンス、拡張性、開発効率に大きな影響を与える重要な決定です","ko":"게임 개발 엔진 선택은 게임의 성능, 확장성 및 개발 효율성에 큰 영향을 미치는 중요한 결정입니다","es":"El desarrollo de juegos PC implica la selección de un motor de juego adecuado y la aplicación de principios de desarrollo específicos","fr":"Le développement de jeux PC implique la sélection d''un moteur de jeu adapté et l''application de principes de développement spécifiques","de":"Die Entwicklung von PC-Spielen beinhaltet die Auswahl einer geeigneten Spiel-Engine und die Anwendung spezifischer Entwicklungsprinzipien","pt":"O desenvolvimento de jogos PC e console requer a escolha certa de motor e consideração de princípios específicos da plataforma. Aqui está uma visão geral téc...","ru":"Разработка игр на ПК и консолях требует правильного выбора движка и учета платформо-специфических принципов. Вот технический обзор.","ar":"تطوير ألعاب الكمبيوتر والمنصّة يتطلب اختيار محرك مناسب ومراعاة أصول خاصة بالمنصة. هنا وصف تقني موجز.","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"definition":{"en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"features":{"zh":["2D和3D游戏开发支持","跨平台开发支持","高性能渲染引擎","物理引擎和动画支持","脚本语言和API支持"],"ja":["2Dおよび3Dゲーム開発のサポート","クロスプラットフォーム開発のサポート","高性能レンダリングエンジン","物理エンジンとアニメーションのサポート","スクリプト言語とAPIのサポート"],"ko":["2D 및 3D 게임 개발 지원","크로스 플랫폼 개발 지원","고성능 렌더링 엔진","물리 엔진 및 애니메이션 지원","스크립트 언어 및 API 지원"],"es":["Selección de motor de juego","Principios de desarrollo de juegos para PC y consola","Aplicación de principios de desarrollo específicos","Uso de herramientas de desarrollo de juegos","Optimización de rendimiento y calidad visual"],"fr":["Sélection du moteur de jeu","Principes de développement de jeux pour PC et console","Application de principes de développement spécifiques","Utilisation d''outils de développement de jeux","Optimisation des performances et de la qualité visuelle"],"de":["Auswahl der Spiel-Engine","Entwicklungsprinzipien für PC- und Konsolenspiele","Anwendung spezifischer Entwicklungsprinzipien","Verwendung von Entwicklungstools für Spiele","Optimierung von Leistung und visueller Qualität"],"pt":["Escolha de motor de jogo","Princípios de desenvolvimento 2D e 3D","Considerações de equipe e recursos","Otimização de desempenho","Suporte a plataformas cruzadas"],"ru":["Выбор игрового движка","Принципы разработки 2D и 3D","Учет команды и ресурсов","Оптимизация производительности","Поддержка кроссплатформенной разработки"],"ar":["اختيار محرك الألعاب","مبادئ تطوير 2D و 3D","مراعاة الفريق والموارد","تحسين الأداء","دعم التطوير عبر المنصات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["游戏开发引擎","Godot","Unity","Unreal Engine","游戏开发框架","跨平台开发","高性能渲染"],"ja":["ゲーム開発エンジン","Godot","Unity","Unreal Engine","ゲーム開発フレームワーク","クロスプラットフォーム開発","高性能レンダリング"],"ko":["게임 개발 엔진","Godot","Unity","Unreal Engine","게임 개발 프레임워크","크로스 플랫폼 개발","고성능 렌더링"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos PC","selección de motor de juego","principios de desarrollo de juegos","juegos para PC y consola","herramientas de desarrollo de juegos","optimización de rendimiento","calidad visual en juegos","Godot","Unity","Unreal Engine"],"fr":["développement de jeux PC","sélection du moteur de jeu","principes de développement de jeux","jeux pour PC et console","outils de développement de jeux","optimisation des performances","qualité visuelle dans les jeux","Godot","Unity","Unreal Engine"],"de":["PC-Spiel-Entwicklung","Auswahl der Spiel-Engine","Entwicklungsprinzipien für Spiele","Spiele für PC und Konsole","Entwicklungstools für Spiele","Optimierung von Leistung","visuelle Qualität in Spielen","Godot","Unity","Unreal Engine"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos PC","motores de jogo","2D","3D","equipe de desenvolvimento","recursos de desenvolvimento","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["разработка игр на ПК","игровые движки","2D","3D","команда разработки","ресурсы разработки","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["تطوير ألعاب الكمبيوتر","محركات الألعاب","2D","3D","فريق التطوير","موارد التطوير","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pc-games","description":"PC and console game development principles. Engine selection, platform features, optimization strategies.","bodyPreview":"# PC/Console Game Development\n\n> Engine selection and platform-specific principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Engine Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat are you building?\n│\n├── 2D Game\n│   ├── Open source important? → Godot\n│   └── Large team/assets? → Unity\n│\n├── 3D Game\n│   ├── AAA visual quality? → Unreal\n│   ├── Cross-platform priority? → Unity\n│   └── Indie/open source? → Godot 4\n│\n└── Specific Needs\n    ├── DOTS performance? → Unity\n    ├── Nanite/Lumen? → Unreal\n    └── Lightweight? → Godot\n```\n\n###","body":"# PC/Console Game Development\n\n> Engine selection and platform-specific principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Engine Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat are you building?\n│\n├── 2D Game\n│   ├── Open source important? → Godot\n│   └── Large team/assets? → Unity\n│\n├── 3D Game\n│   ├── AAA visual quality? → Unreal\n│   ├── Cross-platform priority? → Unity\n│   └── Indie/open source? → Godot 4\n│\n└── Specific Needs\n    ├── DOTS performance? → Unity\n    ├── Nanite/Lumen? → Unreal\n    └── Lightweight? → Godot\n```\n\n### Comparison\n\n| Factor | Unity 6 | Godot 4 | Unreal 5 |\n|--------|---------|---------|----------|\n| 2D | Good | Excellent | Limited |\n| 3D | Good | Good | Excellent |\n| Learning | Medium | Easy | Hard |\n| Cost | Revenue share | Free | 5% after $1M |\n| Team | Any | Solo-Medium | Medium-Large |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Platform Features\n\n### Steam Integration\n\n| Feature | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| Achievements | Player goals |\n| Cloud Saves | Cross-device progress |\n| Leaderboards | Competition |\n| Workshop | User mods |\n| Rich Presence | Show in-game status |\n\n### Console Requirements\n\n| Platform | Certification |\n|----------|--------------|\n| PlayStation | TRC compliance |\n| Xbox | XR compliance |\n| Nintendo | Lotcheck |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Controller Support\n\n### Input Abstraction\n\n```\nMap ACTIONS, not buttons:\n- \"confirm\" → A (Xbox), Cross (PS), B (Nintendo)\n- \"cancel\" → B (Xbox), Circle (PS), A (Nintendo)\n```\n\n### Haptic Feedback\n\n| Intensity | Use |\n|-----------|-----|\n| Light | UI feedback |\n| Medium | Impacts |\n| Heavy | Major events |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Performance Optimization\n\n### Profiling First\n\n| Engine | Tool |\n|--------|------|\n| Unity | Profiler Window |\n| Godot | Debugger → Profiler |\n| Unreal | Unreal Insights |\n\n### Common Bottlenecks\n\n| Bottleneck | Solution |\n|------------|----------|\n| Draw calls | Batching, atlases |\n| GC spikes | Object pooling |\n| Physics | Simpler colliders |\n| Shaders | LOD shaders |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Engine-Specific Principles\n\n### Unity 6\n\n- DOTS for performance-critical systems\n- Burst compiler for hot paths\n- Addressables for asset streaming\n\n### Godot 4\n\n- GDScript for rapid iteration\n- C# for complex logic\n- Signals for decoupling\n\n### Unreal 5\n\n- Blueprint for designers\n- C++ for performance\n- Nanite for high-poly environments\n- Lumen for dynamic lighting\n\n---\n\n## 6. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Choose engine by hype | Choose by project needs |\n| Ignore platform guidelines | Study certification requirements |\n| Hardcode input buttons | Abstract to actions |\n| Skip profiling | Profile early and often |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Engine is a tool. Master the principles, then adapt to any engine.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:02:45.544Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Game Development Agents needing informed engine selection and patch management for PC games.","zh":"非常适合需要进行游戏引擎选择和补丁管理的游戏开发代理，特别适用于PC游戏。","ja":"ゲーム開発エージェントがゲームエンジンの選択とPCゲームのパッチ管理を行う必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"게임 개발 에이전트가 게임 엔진 선택 및 PC 게임의 패치 관리를 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de juegos que necesitan una selección informada de motor y gestión de parches para juegos de PC.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement de jeux nécessitant une sélection éclairée de moteur et une gestion de correctifs pour les jeux PC.","de":"Perfekt für Game-Development-Agents, die eine informierte Motorauswahl und Patch-Verwaltung für PC-Spiele benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento de jogos que necessitam de seleção informada de motores e gerenciamento de patches para jogos de PC.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки игр, которым необходима информированная выбор двигателя и управление патчами для игр на ПК.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الألعاب التي تحتاج إلى اختيار محرك مدعوم وإدارة تصحيحات للألعاب على أجهزة الكمبيوتر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate engine selection decision trees, safely applying AI-suggested patches with preview for Unity, Unreal, and Godot, utilizing cross-platform principles and performance optimization techniques like DOTS.","zh":"赋予代理导航引擎选择决策树的能力，安全地应用AI建议的补丁，并支持Unity、Unreal和Godot的预览，利用跨平台原则和性能优化技术，如DOTS。","ja":"エージェントがエンジンの選択の決定木をナビゲートし、Unity、Unreal、Godotのプレビューを使用してAIによって提案されたパッチを安全に適用できるようにし、クロスプラットフォームの原則とDOTSなどのパフォーマンス最適化技術を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 엔진 선택 의사 결정 트리를 탐색하고 Unity, Unreal, Godot의 미리 보기와 함께 AI가 제안한 패치를 안전하게 적용할 수 있도록 하며, 크로스 플랫폼 원칙과 DOTS와 같은 성능 최적화 기술을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a navegar por árboles de decisión de selección de motor, aplicando parches sugeridos por IA de forma segura con vista previa para Unity, Unreal y Godot, utilizando principios de plataforma cruzada y técnicas de optimización de rendimiento como DOTS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans les arbres de décision de sélection de moteur, en appliquant en toute sécurité des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec aperçu pour Unity, Unreal et Godot, en utilisant des principes de plate-forme croisée et des techniques d''optimisation des performances comme DOTS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Entscheidungsbäume für die Motorauswahl zu navigieren, indem sie vorsichtig AI-vorgeschlagene Patches mit Vorschau für Unity, Unreal und Godot anwenden, unter Verwendung von Cross-Plattform-Prinzipien und Leistungs-Optimierungstechniken wie DOTS.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar em árvores de decisão de seleção de motores, aplicando patches sugeridos por IA com pré-visualização para Unity, Unreal e Godot, utilizando princípios de plataforma cruzada e técnicas de otimização de desempenho como DOTS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ориентироваться в деревьях решений по выбору двигателя, безопасно применяя патчи, предложенные ИИ, с предварительным просмотром для Unity, Unreal и Godot, используя принципы кроссплатформенной разработки и методы оптимизации производительности, такие как DOTS.","ar":"يمكن للعميل التنقل في شجرة اتخاذ القرار لاختيار المحرك، وتطبيق التصحيحات المقترحة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة مسبقة لUNITY وUnreal وGodot، واستخدام مبادئ التطوير عبر المنصات وتقنيات تحسين الأداء مثل DOTS."},"useCases":{"en":["Selecting optimal game engines for 2D and 3D game development","Applying performance patches for AAA visual quality and cross-platform priority","Debugging engine-specific issues with Nanite/Lumen and Godot 4"],"zh":["选择2D和3D游戏开发的最佳游戏引擎","应用性能补丁以实现AAA视觉质量和跨平台优先级","使用Nanite/Lumen和Godot 4调试引擎特定问题"],"ja":["2Dおよび3Dゲーム開発に最適なゲームエンジンの選択","AAA視覚品質とクロスプラットフォーム優先度を実現するためのパフォーマンスパッチの適用","Nanite/LumenおよびGodot 4を使用したエンジン特有の問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["2D 및 3D 게임 개발을 위한 최적의 게임 엔진 선택","AAA 시각적 품질 및 크로스 플랫폼 우선 순위를 위해 성능 패치 적용","Nanite/Lumen 및 Godot 4를 사용하여 엔진 특정 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Seleccionar motores de juego óptimos para el desarrollo de juegos 2D y 3D","Aplicar parches de rendimiento para una calidad visual AAA y prioridad de plataforma cruzada","Depurar problemas específicos del motor con Nanite/Lumen y Godot 4"],"fr":["Sélectionner des moteurs de jeu optimaux pour le développement de jeux 2D et 3D","Appliquer des correctifs de performances pour une qualité visuelle AAA et une priorité de plate-forme croisée","Déboguer des problèmes spécifiques au moteur avec Nanite/Lumen et Godot 4"],"de":["Auswahl optimaler Spiel-Engines für die Entwicklung von 2D- und 3D-Spielen","Anwenden von Leistungs-Patches für eine AAA-Visuelle Qualität und Cross-Plattform-Priorität","Fehlerbehebung von engine-spezifischen Problemen mit Nanite/Lumen und Godot 4"],"pt":["Selecionar motores de jogo ótimos para desenvolvimento de jogos 2D e 3D","Aplicar patches de desempenho para qualidade visual AAA e prioridade de plataforma cruzada","Depurar problemas específicos do motor com Nanite/Lumen e Godot 4"],"ru":["Выбирать оптимальные игровые двигатели для разработки 2D и 3D игр","Применять патчи производительности для качества визуальных эффектов AAA и приоритета кроссплатформенной разработки","Отлаживать проблемы, специфичные для двигателя, с Nanite/Lumen и Godot 4"],"ar":["اختيار محركات ألعاب مثالية لتطوير ألعاب 2D و 3D","تطبيق تصحيحات الأداء لجودة مرئية من فئة AAA وأولوية التطوير عبر المنصات","تصحيح مشاكل محرك محددة مع Nanite/Lumen وGodot 4"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of game development principles","Limited to PC game development","Engine compatibility issues may arise with certain patches"],"zh":["需要游戏开发原则的知识","仅限PC游戏开发","某些补丁可能会出现引擎兼容性问题"],"ja":["ゲーム開発の原則に関する知識が必要","PCゲーム開発のみ","特定のパッチではエンジンの互換性問題が発生する可能性がある"],"ko":["게임 개발 원칙에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","PC 게임 개발만 해당됩니다","특정 패치에서는 엔진 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los principios del desarrollo de juegos","Limitado al desarrollo de juegos de PC","Pueden surgir problemas de compatibilidad del motor con ciertos parches"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des principes de développement de jeux","Limité au développement de jeux PC","Des problèmes de compatibilité du moteur peuvent survenir avec certains correctifs"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Prinzipien der Spielentwicklung","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von PC-Spielen","Motor-Kompatibilitätsprobleme können mit bestimmten Patches auftreten"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento dos princípios de desenvolvimento de jogos","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de jogos para PC","Problemas de compatibilidade do motor podem surgir com certos patches"],"ru":["Требует знания принципов разработки игр","Ограничен разработкой игр для ПК","Проблемы совместимости двигателя могут возникнуть с определенными патчами"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمبادئ تطوير الألعاب","محدود بتطوير الألعاب على أجهزة الكمبيوتر","قد تطرأ مشاكل في توافق المحرك مع بعض التصحيحات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop/tailwind-patterns', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'Synapse-Desktop', 'HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop', 'tailwind-patterns', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z', '2026-02-19T02:04:02.159Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop/tailwind-patterns","name":"tailwind-patterns","description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS ,CSS-","ja":"Tailwind CSSCSS-","ko":"Tailwind CSS, CSS-","es":"Tailwind CSS es un framework de utilidades que permite a los desarrolladores crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas de manera eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un framework d''utilitaires qui permet aux développeurs de créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées de manière efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Utility-Framework, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen effizient zu erstellen","pt":"O Tailwind Patterns é uma ferramenta que permite extrair contexto de código e aplicar patches sugeridos por IA com segurança, utilizando a última versão do Tailwind CSS","ru":"Шаблоны Tailwind - это инструмент, который позволяет извлекать контекст кода и безопасно применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, используя последнюю версию Tailwind CSS","ar":"نماذج تايلويند هو أداة تسمح باستخراج سياق الكود وتطبيق التصحيحات المقترحة من الإصدارات الذكية بأمان، باستخدام الإصدار الأخير من تايلويند سي إس إس","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS ","ja":"Tailwind CSS","ko":"Tailwind CSS ","es":"Patrones de Tailwind CSS para desarrolladores","fr":"Modèles Tailwind CSS pour les développeurs","de":"Tailwind CSS-Muster für Entwickler","pt":"Padrões Tailwind: Otimização de CSS com IA","ru":"Шаблоны Tailwind: оптимизация CSS с помощью ИИ","ar":"نماذج تايلويند: تحسين CSS مع الإصدارات الذكية","en":"tailwind-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"Tailwind CSS ,CSS-","ja":"Tailwind CSSCSS-","ko":"Tailwind CSS, CSS-","es":"Tailwind CSS es un framework de utilidades que permite a los desarrolladores crear interfaces de usuario personalizadas de manera eficiente","fr":"Tailwind CSS est un framework d''utilitaires qui permet aux développeurs de créer des interfaces utilisateur personnalisées de manière efficace","de":"Tailwind CSS ist ein Utility-Framework, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen effizient zu erstellen","pt":"O Tailwind Patterns é uma ferramenta que permite extrair contexto de código e aplicar patches sugeridos por IA com segurança, utilizando a última versão do T...","ru":"Шаблоны Tailwind - это инструмент, который позволяет извлекать контекст кода и безопасно применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, используя последнюю версию Tailwin...","ar":"نماذج تايلويند هو أداة تسمح باستخراج سياق الكود وتطبيق التصحيحات المقترحة من الإصدارات الذكية بأمان، باستخدام الإصدار الأخير من تايلويند سي إس إس","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"definition":{"en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"features":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS v4","CSS-","PostCSS","Oxide","JIT","CSS-"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4","CSS-","PostCSS","Oxide","JIT","CSS-"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4","CSS-","PostCSS","Oxide","JIT","CSS-"],"es":["Arquitectura de Tailwind v4","Configuración nativa con @theme","Motor Oxide para un rendimiento 10 veces más rápido","Sistema de plugins con características CSS nativas","Compatibilidad con la directiva @apply"],"fr":["Architecture Tailwind v4","Configuration native avec @theme","Moteur Oxide pour une performance 10 fois plus rapide","Système de plugins avec des fonctionnalités CSS natives","Compatibilité avec la directive @apply"],"de":["Tailwind-v4-Architektur","Native Konfiguration mit @theme","Oxide-Motor für eine 10-mal schnellere Leistung","Plugin-System mit CSS-nativen Funktionen","Kompatibilität mit der @apply-Direktive"],"pt":["Extração de contexto de código","Aplicação de patches sugeridos por IA","Suporte à última versão do Tailwind CSS","Otimização de CSS com IA","Segurança na aplicação de patches"],"ru":["Извлечение контекста кода","Применение патчей, предложенных ИИ","Поддержка последней версии Tailwind CSS","Оптимизация CSS с помощью ИИ","Безопасность при применении патчей"],"ar":["استخراج سياق الكود","تطبيق التصحيحات المقترحة من الإصدارات الذكية","دعم الإصدار الأخير من تايلويند سي إس إس","تحسين سي إس إس مع الإصدارات الذكية","أمان التطبيق التصحيحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS","CSS-","Tailwind CSS v4","PostCSS","Oxide","JIT","CSS-","Front-end","Web"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS","CSS-","Tailwind CSS v4","PostCSS","Oxide","JIT","CSS-","Front-end","Web"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS","CSS-","Tailwind CSS v4","PostCSS","Oxide","JIT","CSS-","Front-end","Web"],"es":["Tailwind CSS","desarrollo frontend","utilidades CSS","configuración nativa","motor Oxide","sistema de plugins","directiva @apply","arquitectura v4"],"fr":["Tailwind CSS","développement frontend","utilitaires CSS","configuration native","moteur Oxide","système de plugins","directive @apply","architecture v4"],"de":["Tailwind CSS","Frontend-Entwicklung","CSS-Utility","native Konfiguration","Oxide-Motor","Plugin-System","Direktive @apply","v4-Architektur"],"pt":["Tailwind Patterns","Otimização de CSS","IA","Patches de código","Segurança","Tailwind CSS","Desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["Шаблоны Tailwind","Оптимизация CSS","ИИ","Патчи кода","Безопасность","Tailwind CSS","Веб-разработка"],"ar":["نماذج تايلويند","تحسين سي إس إس","الإصدارات الذكية","تصحيحات الكود","أمان","تايلويند سي إس إس","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwind-patterns","description":"Tailwind CSS v4 principles. CSS-first configuration, container queries, modern patterns, design token architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Patterns (v4 - 2025)\n\n> Modern utility-first CSS with CSS-native configuration.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Tailwind v4 Architecture\n\n### What Changed from v3\n\n| v3 (Legacy) | v4 (Current) |\n|-------------|--------------|\n| `tailwind.config.js` | CSS-based `@theme` directive |\n| PostCSS plugin | Oxide engine (10x faster) |\n| JIT mode | Native, always-on |\n| Plugin system | CSS-native features |\n| `@apply` directive | Still works, discouraged |\n\n### v4 Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Description |\n|---","body":"# Tailwind CSS Patterns (v4 - 2025)\n\n> Modern utility-first CSS with CSS-native configuration.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Tailwind v4 Architecture\n\n### What Changed from v3\n\n| v3 (Legacy) | v4 (Current) |\n|-------------|--------------|\n| `tailwind.config.js` | CSS-based `@theme` directive |\n| PostCSS plugin | Oxide engine (10x faster) |\n| JIT mode | Native, always-on |\n| Plugin system | CSS-native features |\n| `@apply` directive | Still works, discouraged |\n\n### v4 Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **CSS-first** | Configuration in CSS, not JavaScript |\n| **Oxide Engine** | Rust-based compiler, much faster |\n| **Native Nesting** | CSS nesting without PostCSS |\n| **CSS Variables** | All tokens exposed as `--*` vars |\n\n---\n\n## 2. CSS-Based Configuration\n\n### Theme Definition\n\n```\n@theme {\n  /* Colors - use semantic names */\n  --color-primary: oklch(0.7 0.15 250);\n  --color-surface: oklch(0.98 0 0);\n  --color-surface-dark: oklch(0.15 0 0);\n  \n  /* Spacing scale */\n  --spacing-xs: 0.25rem;\n  --spacing-sm: 0.5rem;\n  --spacing-md: 1rem;\n  --spacing-lg: 2rem;\n  \n  /* Typography */\n  --font-sans: ''Inter'', system-ui, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: ''JetBrains Mono'', monospace;\n}\n```\n\n### When to Extend vs Override\n\n| Action | Use When |\n|--------|----------|\n| **Extend** | Adding new values alongside defaults |\n| **Override** | Replacing default scale entirely |\n| **Semantic tokens** | Project-specific naming (primary, surface) |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Container Queries (v4 Native)\n\n### Breakpoint vs Container\n\n| Type | Responds To |\n|------|-------------|\n| **Breakpoint** (`md:`) | Viewport width |\n| **Container** (`@container`) | Parent element width |\n\n### Container Query Usage\n\n| Pattern | Classes |\n|---------|---------|\n| Define container | `@container` on parent |\n| Container breakpoint | `@sm:`, `@md:`, `@lg:` on children |\n| Named containers | `@container/card` for specificity |\n\n### When to Use\n\n| Scenario | Use |\n|----------|-----|\n| Page-level layouts | Viewport breakpoints |\n| Component-level responsive | Container queries |\n| Reusable components | Container queries (context-independent) |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Responsive Design\n\n### Breakpoint System\n\n| Prefix | Min Width | Target |\n|--------|-----------|--------|\n| (none) | 0px | Mobile-first base |\n| `sm:` | 640px | Large phone / small tablet |\n| `md:` | 768px | Tablet |\n| `lg:` | 1024px | Laptop |\n| `xl:` | 1280px | Desktop |\n| `2xl:` | 1536px | Large desktop |\n\n### Mobile-First Principle\n\n1. Write mobile styles first (no prefix)\n2. Add larger screen overrides with prefixes\n3. Example: `w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3`\n\n---\n\n## 5. Dark Mode\n\n### Configuration Strategies\n\n| Method | Behavior | Use When |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| `class` | `.dark` class toggles | Manual theme switcher |\n| `media` | Follows system preference | No user control |\n| `selector` | Custom selector (v4) | Complex theming |\n\n### Dark Mode Pattern\n\n| Element | Light | Dark |\n|---------|-------|------|\n| Background | `bg-white` | `dark:bg-zinc-900` |\n| Text | `text-zinc-900` | `dark:text-zinc-100` |\n| Borders | `border-zinc-200` | `dark:border-zinc-700` |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Modern Layout Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Classes |\n|---------|---------|\n| Center (both axes) | `flex items-center justify-center` |\n| Vertical stack | `flex flex-col gap-4` |\n| Horizontal row | `flex gap-4` |\n| Space between | `flex justify-between items-center` |\n| Wrap grid | `flex flex-wrap gap-4` |\n\n### Grid Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Classes |\n|---------|---------|\n| Auto-fit responsive | `grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr))]` |\n| Asymmetric (Bento) | `grid grid-cols-3 grid-rows-2` with spans |\n| Sidebar layout | `grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr]` |\n\n> **Note:** Prefer asymmetric/Bento layouts over symmetric 3-column grids.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Modern Color System\n\n### OKLCH vs RGB/HSL\n\n| Format | Advantage |\n|--------|-----------|\n| **OKLCH** | Perceptually uniform, better for design |\n| **HSL** | Intuitive hue/saturation |\n| **RGB** | Legacy compatibility |\n\n### Color Token Architecture\n\n| Layer | Example | Purpose |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| **Primitive** | `--blue-500` | Raw color values |\n| **Semantic** | `--color-primary` | Purpose-based naming |\n| **Component** | `--button-bg` | Component-specific |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Typography System\n\n### Font Stack Pattern\n\n| Type | Recommended |\n|------|-------------|\n| Sans | `''Inter'', ''SF Pro'', system-ui, sans-serif` |\n| Mono | `''JetBrains Mono'', ''Fira Code'', monospace` |\n| Display | `''Outfit'', ''Poppins'', sans-serif` |\n\n### Type Scale\n\n| Class | Size | Use |\n|-------|------|-----|\n| `text-xs` | 0.75rem | Labels, captions |\n| `text-sm` | 0.875rem | Secondary text |\n| `text-base` | 1rem | Body text |\n| `text-lg` | 1.125rem | Lead text |\n| `text-xl`+ | 1.25rem+ | Headings |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Animation & Transitions\n\n### Built-in Animations\n\n| Class | Effect |\n|-------|--------|\n| `animate-spin` | Continuous rotation |\n| `animate-ping` | Attention pulse |\n| `animate-pulse` | Subtle opacity pulse |\n| `animate-bounce` | Bouncing effect |\n\n### Transition Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Classes |\n|---------|---------|\n| All properties | `transition-all duration-200` |\n| Specific | `transition-colors duration-150` |\n| With easing | `ease-out` or `ease-in-out` |\n| Hover effect | `hover:scale-105 transition-transform` |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Component Extraction\n\n### When to Extract\n\n| Signal | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| Same class combo 3+ times | Extract component |\n| Complex state variants | Extract component |\n| Design system element | Extract + document |\n\n### Extraction Methods\n\n| Method | Use When |\n|--------|----------|\n| **React/Vue component** | Dynamic, JS needed |\n| **@apply in CSS** | Static, no JS needed |\n| **Design tokens** | Reusable values |\n\n---\n\n## 11. Anti-Patterns\n\n| Don''t | Do |\n|-------|-----|\n| Arbitrary values everywhere | Use design system scale |\n| `!important` | Fix specificity properly |\n| Inline `style=` | Use utilities |\n| Duplicate long class lists | Extract component |\n| Mix v3 config with v4 | Migrate fully to CSS-first |\n| Use `@apply` heavily | Prefer components |\n\n---\n\n## 12. Performance Principles\n\n| Principle | Implementation |\n|-----------|----------------|\n| **Purge unused** | Automatic in v4 |\n| **Avoid dynamism** | No template string classes |\n| **Use Oxide** | Default in v4, 10x faster |\n| **Cache builds** | CI/CD caching |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Tailwind v4 is CSS-first. Embrace CSS variables, container queries, and native features. The config file is now optional.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:04:02.159Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced CSS utility-first design patterns with Tailwind CSS v4","zh":"非常适合需要使用高级CSS实用程序优先设计模式的前端代理，特别是Tailwind CSS v4","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがAdvanced CSS utility-first設計パターンを使用する必要がある場合、特にTailwind CSS v4に最適","ko":"고급 CSS 유틸리티 우선 디자인 패턴이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 Tailwind CSS v4","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan patrones de diseño de utilidad primero avanzados con Tailwind CSS v4","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de modèles de conception de première utilité avancés avec Tailwind CSS v4","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte CSS-Nutzungsmuster mit Tailwind CSS v4 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de padrões de design de utilidade em primeiro lugar avançados com Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые шаблоны проектирования на основе утилит с Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"مثالي لعمال الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى أنماط تصميم متقدمة ذات أولوية للخدمة مع Tailwind CSS v4"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and apply AI-suggested CSS patches using the Oxide engine, with native support for CSS-native configuration and @theme directives, allowing for efficient and safe codebase updates","zh":"使代理能够使用Oxide引擎生成和应用AI建议的CSS补丁，并且支持CSS原生配置和@theme指令，从而实现高效且安全的代码库更新","ja":"Oxideエンジンを使用してAI提案のCSSパッチを生成し適用することができ、CSSネイティブ構成と@themeディレクティブをサポートし、効率的且つ安全なコードベースの更新を可能にする","ko":"oxide 엔진을 사용하여 에이아이 제안의 css 패치를 생성 및 적용할 수 있으며, css 네이티브 구성 및 @theme 지시문을 지원하여 효율적이고 안전한 코드베이스 업데이트를 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y aplicar parches de CSS sugeridos por IA utilizando el motor Oxide, con soporte nativo para la configuración nativa de CSS y directivas @theme, lo que permite actualizaciones de código base eficientes y seguras","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et d''appliquer des correctifs CSS suggérés par l''IA à l''aide du moteur Oxide, avec un support natif pour la configuration native CSS et les directives @theme, permettant des mises à jour de codebase efficaces et sécurisées","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, AI-vorgeschlagene CSS-Patches mit dem Oxide-Motor zu generieren und anzuwenden, mit nativer Unterstützung für CSS-native Konfiguration und @theme-Direktiven, was effiziente und sichere Codebase-Aktualisierungen ermöglicht","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e aplicar patches de CSS sugeridos por IA usando o motor Oxide, com suporte nativo para configuração nativa do CSS e diretivas @theme, permitindo atualizações eficientes e seguras do código","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и применять патчи CSS, предложенные ИИ, с помощью двигателя Oxide, с родной поддержкой конфигурации CSS и директив @theme, что позволяет выполнять эффективные и безопасные обновления кодовой базы","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من توليد وتطبيق تصحيحات CSS المقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام محرك أكسيد، مع دعم أصلي للتهيئة الأصلية لـ CSS وتوجيهات @theme، مما يسمح بالتحديثات الفعالة والأمنة لقاعدة الشفرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Applying AI-suggested patches to existing Tailwind CSS projects","Generating CSS code snippets with Tailwind v4''s utility-first approach","Debugging and optimizing CSS layouts using Tailwind''s native features"],"zh":["将AI建议的补丁应用于现有的Tailwind CSS项目","使用Tailwind v4的实用程序优先方法生成CSS代码片段","使用Tailwind的原生功能调试和优化CSS布局"],"ja":["既存のTailwind CSSプロジェクトにAI提案のパッチを適用する","Tailwind v4のユーティリティ優先アプローチを使用してCSSコードスニペットを生成する","Tailwindのネイティブ機能を使用してCSSレイアウトをデバッグして最適化する"],"ko":["기존의 Tailwind CSS 프로젝트에 에이아이 제안의 패치를 적용하는 것","Tailwind v4의 유틸리티 우선 접근 방식을 사용하여 css 코드 스니펫을 생성하는 것","Tailwind의 네이티브 기능을 사용하여 css 레이아웃을 디버깅하고 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Aplicar parches sugeridos por IA a proyectos de Tailwind CSS existentes","Generar fragmentos de código CSS con el enfoque de utilidad primero de Tailwind v4","Depurar y optimizar diseños CSS utilizando las características nativas de Tailwind"],"fr":["Appliquer des correctifs suggérés par l''IA à des projets Tailwind CSS existants","Générer des extraits de code CSS avec l''approche de première utilité de Tailwind v4","Déboguer et optimiser les dispositions CSS en utilisant les fonctionnalités natives de Tailwind"],"de":["AI-vorgeschlagene Patches auf bestehende Tailwind-CSS-Projekte anwenden","CSS-Codefragmente mit dem Nutzungsansatz von Tailwind v4 generieren","CSS-Layouts mithilfe der nativen Funktionen von Tailwind debuggen und optimieren"],"pt":["Aplicar patches sugeridos por IA em projetos Tailwind CSS existentes","Gerar trechos de código CSS com abordagem de utilidade em primeiro lugar do Tailwind v4","Depurar e otimizar layouts CSS usando recursos nativos do Tailwind"],"ru":["Применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, к существующим проектам Tailwind CSS","Генерировать фрагменты кода CSS с подходом на основе утилит Tailwind v4","Отлаживать и оптимизировать компоновку CSS с помощью родных функций Tailwind"],"ar":["تطبيق تصحيحات مقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي على مشاريع Tailwind CSS الحالية","توليد شفرات CSS باستخدام نهج الخدمة الأولى Tailwind v4","تصحيح أخطاء وتحسين تخطيطات CSS باستخدام الميزات الأصلية لبرنامج Tailwind"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS v4 compatibility","Limited to CSS-native configuration and @theme directives","Deprecation of @apply directive in favor of native CSS features"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS v4兼容性","仅限CSS原生配置和@theme指令","@apply指令已弃用，转而使用原生CSS功能"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4の互換性が必要","CSSネイティブ構成と@themeディレクティブのみ","@applyディレクティブは非推奨であり、代わりにネイティブのCSS機能を使用する"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4와의 호환성이 필요함","css 네이티브 구성 및 @theme 지시문만 지원","@apply 지시문은 더 이상 사용되지 않으며, 대신 네이티브 css 기능을 사용"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Tailwind CSS v4","Limitado a la configuración nativa de CSS y directivas @theme","Depreciación de la directiva @apply en favor de las características de CSS nativas"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Tailwind CSS v4","Limité à la configuration native CSS et aux directives @theme","Dépréciation de la directive @apply en faveur des fonctionnalités CSS natives"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit Tailwind CSS v4","Begrenzt auf CSS-native Konfiguration und @theme-Direktiven","Abgeschafft der @apply-Direktive zugunsten von nativen CSS-Funktionen"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com Tailwind CSS v4","Limitado à configuração nativa do CSS e diretivas @theme","Descontinuação da diretiva @apply em favor de recursos de CSS nativos"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Tailwind CSS v4","Ограничен конфигурацией CSS и директивами @theme","Устаревание директивы @apply в пользу родных функций CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع Tailwind CSS v4","محدود بالتهيئة الأصلية لـ CSS وتوجيهات @theme","التخلي عن توجيه @apply لصالح الميزات الأصلية لـ CSS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
