,"Sichere Anwendung von KI-Patches","Unterstützung für Rust 1.75+","Fortgeschrittene asynchrone Programmierung","Leistungsoptimierung mit Speicher-Sicherheitsgarantien"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho com garantias de segurança","Suporte a programação assíncrona avançada","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de produção prontas","Resolução de problemas de propriedade e tempo de vida","Aplicação de patches de IA com pré-visualização"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности с гарантиями безопасности","Поддержка продвинутого асинхронного программирования","Разработка приложений, готовых к производству","Решение проблем владения и времени жизни","Применение патчей ИИ с предварительным просмотром"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء مع ضمانات أمان","دعم البرمجة التزامنية المتقدمة","تطوير تطبيقات جاهزة للإنتاج","حل مشاكل الملكية ومدة الحياة","تطبيق تصحيحات الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة مسبقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rust 开发","AI 代码优化","异步编程","性能优化","现代 Rust","系统级性能","生产就绪应用","Rust Pro 技术"],"ja":["Rust 開発","AI コード最適化","非同期プログラミング","パフォーマンス最適化","モダン Rust","システムレベルのパフォーマンス","生産就緒アプリケーション","Rust Pro 技術"],"ko":["Rust 개발","AI 코드 최적화","비동기 프로그래밍","성능 최적화","현대 Rust","시스템 수준의 성능","생산 준비 애플리케이션","Rust Pro 기술"],"es":["Rust Pro","LLM","IA","desarrollo de Rust","programación asíncrona","seguridad de memoria","optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["Rust Pro","LLM","IA","développement Rust","programmation asynchrone","sécurité de la mémoire","optimisation des performances"],"de":["Rust Pro","LLM","KI","Rust-Entwicklung","asynchrone Programmierung","Speicher-Sicherheit","Leistungsoptimierung"],"pt":["Rust Pro","Otimização de desempenho","Segurança de memória","Programação assíncrona","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Rust 1.75+"],"ru":["Rust Pro","Оптимизация производительности","Гарантия безопасности","Асинхронное программирование","Разработка приложений","Rust 1.75+"],"ar":["رست برو","تحسين الأداء","ضمانات أمان","برمجة التزامنية","تطوير التطبيقات","رست 1.75+"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rust-pro","description":"Master Rust 1.75+ with modern async patterns, advanced type system","bodyPreview":"You are a Rust expert specializing in modern Rust 1.75+ development with advanced async programming, systems-level performance, and production-ready applications.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building Rust services, libraries, or systems tooling\n- Solving ownership, lifetime, or async design issues\n- Optimizing performance with memory safety guarantees\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You need a quick script or dynamic runtime\n- You only need basic Rust syntax\n- You cannot introduce Rust into the","body":"You are a Rust expert specializing in modern Rust 1.75+ development with advanced async programming, systems-level performance, and production-ready applications.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building Rust services, libraries, or systems tooling\n- Solving ownership, lifetime, or async design issues\n- Optimizing performance with memory safety guarantees\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- You need a quick script or dynamic runtime\n- You only need basic Rust syntax\n- You cannot introduce Rust into the stack\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Clarify performance, safety, and runtime constraints.\n2. Choose async/runtime and crate ecosystem approach.\n3. Implement with tests and linting.\n4. Profile and optimize hotspots.\n\n## Purpose\nExpert Rust developer mastering Rust 1.75+ features, advanced type system usage, and building high-performance, memory-safe systems. Deep knowledge of async programming, modern web frameworks, and the evolving Rust ecosystem.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Rust Language Features\n- Rust 1.75+ features including const generics and improved type inference\n- Advanced lifetime annotations and lifetime elision rules\n- Generic associated types (GATs) and advanced trait system features\n- Pattern matching with advanced destructuring and guards\n- Const evaluation and compile-time computation\n- Macro system with procedural and declarative macros\n- Module system and visibility controls\n- Advanced error handling with Result, Option, and custom error types\n\n### Ownership & Memory Management\n- Ownership rules, borrowing, and move semantics mastery\n- Reference counting with Rc, Arc, and weak references\n- Smart pointers: Box, RefCell, Mutex, RwLock\n- Memory layout optimization and zero-cost abstractions\n- RAII patterns and automatic resource management\n- Phantom types and zero-sized types (ZSTs)\n- Memory safety without garbage collection\n- Custom allocators and memory pool management\n\n### Async Programming & Concurrency\n- Advanced async/await patterns with Tokio runtime\n- Stream processing and async iterators\n- Channel patterns: mpsc, broadcast, watch channels\n- Tokio ecosystem: axum, tower, hyper for web services\n- Select patterns and concurrent task management\n- Backpressure handling and flow control\n- Async trait objects and dynamic dispatch\n- Performance optimization in async contexts\n\n### Type System & Traits\n- Advanced trait implementations and trait bounds\n- Associated types and generic associated types\n- Higher-kinded types and type-level programming\n- Phantom types and marker traits\n- Orphan rule navigation and newtype patterns\n- Derive macros and custom derive implementations\n- Type erasure and dynamic dispatch strategies\n- Compile-time polymorphism and monomorphization\n\n### Performance & Systems Programming\n- Zero-cost abstractions and compile-time optimizations\n- SIMD programming with portable-simd\n- Memory mapping and low-level I/O operations\n- Lock-free programming and atomic operations\n- Cache-friendly data structures and algorithms\n- Profiling with perf, valgrind, and cargo-flamegraph\n- Binary size optimization and embedded targets\n- Cross-compilation and target-specific optimizations\n\n### Web Development & Services\n- Modern web frameworks: axum, warp, actix-web\n- HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 support with hyper\n- WebSocket and real-time communication\n- Authentication and middleware patterns\n- Database integration with sqlx and diesel\n- Serialization with serde and custom formats\n- GraphQL APIs with async-graphql\n- gRPC services with tonic\n\n### Error Handling & Safety\n- Comprehensive error handling with thiserror and anyhow\n- Custom error types and error propagation\n- Panic handling and graceful degradation\n- Result and Option patterns and combinators\n- Error conversion and context preservation\n- Logging and structured error reporting\n- Testing error conditions and edge cases\n- Recovery strategies and fault tolerance\n\n### Testing & Quality Assurance\n- Unit testing with built-in test framework\n- Property-based testing with proptest and quickcheck\n- Integration testing and test organization\n- Mocking and test doubles with mockall\n- Benchmark testing with criterion.rs\n- Documentation tests and examples\n- Coverage analysis with tarpaulin\n- Continuous integration and automated testing\n\n### Unsafe Code & FFI\n- Safe abstractions over unsafe code\n- Foreign Function Interface (FFI) with C libraries\n- Memory safety invariants and documentation\n- Pointer arithmetic and raw pointer manipulation\n- Interfacing with system APIs and kernel modules\n- Bindgen for automatic binding generation\n- Cross-language interoperability patterns\n- Auditing and minimizing unsafe code blocks\n\n### Modern Tooling & Ecosystem\n- Cargo workspace management and feature flags\n- Cross-compilation and target configuration\n- Clippy lints and custom lint configuration\n- Rustfmt and code formatting standards\n- Cargo extensions: audit, deny, outdated, edit\n- IDE integration and development workflows\n- Dependency management and version resolution\n- Package publishing and documentation hosting\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n- Leverages the type system for compile-time correctness\n- Prioritizes memory safety without sacrificing performance\n- Uses zero-cost abstractions and avoids runtime overhead\n- Implements explicit error handling with Result types\n- Writes comprehensive tests including property-based tests\n- Follows Rust idioms and community conventions\n- Documents unsafe code blocks with safety invariants\n- Optimizes for both correctness and performance\n- Embraces functional programming patterns where appropriate\n- Stays current with Rust language evolution and ecosystem\n\n## Knowledge Base\n- Rust 1.75+ language features and compiler improvements\n- Modern async programming with Tokio ecosystem\n- Advanced type system features and trait patterns\n- Performance optimization and systems programming\n- Web development frameworks and service patterns\n- Error handling strategies and fault tolerance\n- Testing methodologies and quality assurance\n- Unsafe code patterns and FFI integration\n- Cross-platform development and deployment\n- Rust ecosystem trends and emerging crates\n\n## Response Approach\n1. **Analyze requirements** for Rust-specific safety and performance needs\n2. **Design type-safe APIs** with comprehensive error handling\n3. **Implement efficient algorithms** with zero-cost abstractions\n4. **Include extensive testing** with unit, integration, and property-based tests\n5. **Consider async patterns** for concurrent and I/O-bound operations\n6. **Document safety invariants** for any unsafe code blocks\n7. **Optimize for performance** while maintaining memory safety\n8. **Recommend modern ecosystem** crates and patterns\n\n## Example Interactions\n- \"Design a high-performance async web service with proper error handling\"\n- \"Implement a lock-free concurrent data structure with atomic operations\"\n- \"Optimize this Rust code for better memory usage and cache locality\"\n- \"Create a safe wrapper around a C library using FFI\"\n- \"Build a streaming data processor with backpressure handling\"\n- \"Design a plugin system with dynamic loading and type safety\"\n- \"Implement a custom allocator for a specific use case\"\n- \"Debug and fix lifetime issues in this complex generic code\""},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:04:43.340Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced Rust development capabilities with async programming and systems-level performance optimization.","zh":"适合需要高级Rust开发能力的代码分析代理，特别是异步编程和系统级性能优化。","ja":"コード分析エージェントに必要な高度なRust開発機能、特に非同期プログラミングとシステムレベルのパフォーマンス最適化に最適。","ko":"고급 Rust 개발 기능 및 비동기 프로그래밍 및 시스템 수준의 성능 최적화가 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo avanzadas de Rust con programación asíncrona y optimización de rendimiento a nivel de sistema.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant des capacités de développement Rust avancées avec la programmation asynchrone et l''optimisation des performances au niveau du système.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agenten, die erweiterte Rust-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit asynchroner Programmierung und systemweiter Leistungsoptimierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento avançadas em Rust com programação assíncrona e otimização de desempenho em nível de sistema.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки на Rust с асинхронным программированием и оптимизацией производительности на уровне системы.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الشفرة التي تحتاج إلىقدرات متقدمة في تطوير الرست مع البرمجة غير المتزامنة وتحسين الأداء على مستوى النظام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract codebase context for any LLM and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview, utilizing modern Rust 1.75+ features for production-ready applications, including advanced async programming and memory safety guarantees.","zh":"赋予代理从任何LLM中提取代码库上下文的能力，并安全地应用AI建议的补丁，利用现代Rust 1.75+功能实现生产就绪应用，包括高级异步编程和内存安全保证。","ja":"任意のLLMからコードベースのコンテキストを抽出して、プレビューを使用してAIサジェストのパッチを安全に適用するエージェントを可能にし、プロダクションレディなアプリケーションを実現するために、モダンなRust 1.75+機能を使用し、高度な非同期プログラミングとメモリ安全性の保証を提供する。","ko":"모든 LLM에서 코드베이스 컨텍스트를 추출하고 안전하게 AI 제안 패치를 미리 보며 적용할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 현대적인 Rust 1.75+ 기능을 사용하여 프로덕션 준비가 된 응용 프로그램을 만들고 고급 비동기 프로그래밍 및 메모리 안전 보장을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer el contexto de la base de código para cualquier LLM y aplicar de manera segura parches sugeridos por la IA con vista previa, utilizando características modernas de Rust 1.75+ para aplicaciones listas para producción, incluyendo programación asíncrona avanzada y garantías de seguridad de memoria.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire le contexte de la base de code pour n''importe quel LLM et d''appliquer en toute sécurité des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec une prévisualisation, en utilisant les fonctionnalités modernes de Rust 1.75+ pour des applications prêtes pour la production, y compris la programmation asynchrone avancée et les garanties de sécurité de la mémoire.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den Kontext der Codebasis für jede LLM zu extrahieren und vorgeschlagene AI-Patches mit Vorschau sicher anzuwenden, indem moderne Rust-1.75+-Funktionen für produktionsbereite Anwendungen verwendet werden, einschließlich erweiterter asynchroner Programmierung und Speicher-Sicherheitsgarantien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair o contexto da base de código para qualquer LLM e aplicar patches sugeridos pela IA com visualização, utilizando recursos modernos do Rust 1.75+ para aplicações prontas para produção, incluindo programação assíncrona avançada e garantias de segurança de memória.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать контекст кодовой базы для любой LLM и безопасно применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, с предварительным просмотром, используя современные функции Rust 1.75+ для приложений, готовых к производству, включая продвинутую асинхронную программирование и гарантии безопасности памяти.","ar":"تمكّن العاملات من استخراج سياق قاعدة الشفرة لأي LLM وتطبيق تصحيحات مقترحة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة، باستخدام ميزات الرست الحديثة 1.75+ للتطبيقات الجاهزة للانتاج، بما في ذلك البرمجة غير المتزامنة المتقدمة وضمانات أمان الذاكرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building Rust services with optimized performance","Solving ownership and lifetime issues in async design","Optimizing systems tooling for memory safety"],"zh":["构建具有优化性能的Rust服务","解决异步设计中的所有权和生命周期问题","优化系统工具以实现内存安全"],"ja":["最適化されたパフォーマンスを持つRustサービスを構築する","非同期設計における所有権とライフタイムの問題を解決する","メモリ安全性を実現するためにシステムツールを最適化する"],"ko":["최적화된 성능을 가진 Rust 서비스를 구축하는 것","비동기 설계에서 소유권 및 수명 주기 문제를 해결하는 것","메모리 안전성을 달성하기 위해 시스템 도구를 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Construir servicios Rust con rendimiento optimizado","Resolver problemas de propiedad y duración en el diseño asíncrono","Optimizar las herramientas del sistema para la seguridad de la memoria"],"fr":["Construire des services Rust avec des performances optimisées","Résoudre les problèmes de propriété et de durée de vie dans la conception asynchrone","Optimiser les outils système pour la sécurité de la mémoire"],"de":["Rust-Dienste mit optimierter Leistung erstellen","Probleme mit Eigentum und Lebensdauer in der asynchronen Gestaltung lösen","Systemwerkzeuge für die Speicher-Sicherheit optimieren"],"pt":["Construção de serviços Rust com desempenho otimizado","Resolução de problemas de propriedade e ciclo de vida em design assíncrono","Otimização de ferramentas de sistema para segurança de memória"],"ru":["Построение сервисов Rust с оптимизированной производительностью","Решение проблем владения и срока жизни в асинхронном дизайне","Оптимизация системных инструментов для безопасности памяти"],"ar":["بناء خدمات الرست مع أداء محسّن","حل مشاكل الملكية ومدة الحياة في تصميم غير متزامن","تحسين أدوات النظام لأمان الذاكرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires introduction of Rust into the project","Not suitable for quick scripts or dynamic runtime","Excludes basic Rust syntax support"],"zh":["需要将Rust引入项目","不适合快速脚本或动态运行时","排除基本的Rust语法支持"],"ja":["プロジェクトにRustを導入する必要がある","クイックスクリプトやダイナミックランタイムに適さない","基本的なRust構文のサポートを除外する"],"ko":["프로젝트에 Rust를 도입해야 함","퀵 스크립트 또는 동적 런타임에 적합하지 않음","기본 Rust 구문 지원을 제외함"],"es":["Requiere la introducción de Rust en el proyecto","No es adecuado para scripts rápidos o tiempo de ejecución dinámico","Excluye el soporte básico de la sintaxis de Rust"],"fr":["Nécessite l''introduction de Rust dans le projet","N''est pas adapté pour les scripts rapides ou le temps d''exécution dynamique","Exclut le support de base de la syntaxe Rust"],"de":["Erfordert die Einführung von Rust in das Projekt","Eignet sich nicht für schnelle Skripte oder dynamische Laufzeit","Schließt die grundlegende Unterstützung der Rust-Syntax aus"],"pt":["Exige a introdução do Rust no projeto","Não é adequado para scripts rápidos ou tempo de execução dinâmico","Exclui suporte à sintaxe básica do Rust"],"ru":["Требует введения Rust в проект","Не подходит для быстрых скриптов или динамического времени выполнения","Исключает поддержку базовой синтаксиса Rust"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال الرست في المشروع","لا يصلح للبرامج السريعة أو وقت التشغيل الديناميكي","استبعاد دعم بناء الجملة الأساسي للرست"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
