出正确的开发决策","ja":"Node.js ベストプラクティスのガイド、開発における正しい決断を下す方法を学ぶ","ko":"Node.js 최적화 가이드, 개발에서 올바른 결정을 내리는 방법을 배우세요","es":"Aprende las mejores prácticas de Node.js para desarrollar aplicaciones escalables y mantenibles. Principios y decisiones informadas para el desarrollo de Nod...","fr":"Apprenez les meilleures pratiques de Node.js pour développer des applications évolutives et maintenables. Principes et décisions éclairées pour le développem...","de":"Lernen Sie die besten Praktiken von Node.js, um skalierbare und wartbare Anwendungen zu entwickeln. Gründliche Prinzipien und Entscheidungen für die Node.js-...","pt":"Princípios e tomada de decisões para desenvolvimento Node.js em 2025. Aprenda a pensar, não apenas memorizar padrões de código.","ru":"Принципы и принятие решений для разработки Node.js в 2025 году. Научитесь думать, а не просто запоминать шаблоны кода.","ar":"مبادئ واتخاذ القرارات لتطوير NODE.js في 2025. تعلم التفكير، لا مجرد تذكر أنماط الكود","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"definition":{"en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"features":{"zh":["决策原则指导","框架选择决策树","代码安全性和优化","开发最佳实践","代码审查和测试"],"ja":["意思決定原則のガイド","フレームワーク選択の決断木","コードのセキュリティと最適化","開発のベストプラクティス","コードレビューとテスト"],"ko":["의사결정 원칙 가이드","프레임워크 선택 결정 트리","코드 보안성과 최적화","개발 최적화 가이드","코드 리뷰와 테스트"],"es":["Selección de framework informada","Principios de decisión para el desarrollo de Node.js","Desarrollo de aplicaciones escalables y mantenibles","Mejora de las habilidades de desarrollo","Aplicación de principios y decisiones informadas"],"fr":["Sélection de framework éclairée","Principes de décision pour le développement de Node.js","Développement d''applications évolutives et maintenables","Amélioration des compétences de développement","Application de principes et de décisions éclairées"],"de":["Informierte Framework-Auswahl","Entscheidungsprinzipien für die Node.js-Entwicklung","Entwicklung von skalierbaren und wartbaren Anwendungen","Verbesserung der Entwicklungsfähigkeiten","Anwendung von gründlichen Prinzipien und Entscheidungen"],"pt":["Princípios de tomada de decisões para desenvolvimento Node.js","Seleção de frameworks baseada no contexto","Evitar soluções padrão","Previsão de patches sugeridos por IA","Integração com LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)"],"ru":["Принципы принятия решений для разработки Node.js","Выбор фреймворка на основе контекста","Избегание стандартных решений","Предварительный просмотр патчей, предложенных ИИ","Интеграция с LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)"],"ar":["مبادئ اتخاذ القرارات لتطوير NODE.js","اختيار الإطار بناءً على السياق","تجنب الحلول المعتادة","معاينة تصحيحات مقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع LLM (ChatGPT، Claude، Gemini)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Node.js","最佳实践","开发指南","代码安全","代码优化","决策原则","框架选择","代码审查"],"ja":["Node.js","ベストプラクティス","開発ガイド","コードセキュリティ","コード最適化","意思決定原則","フレームワーク選択","コードレビュー"],"ko":["Node.js","최적화 가이드","개발 가이드","코드 보안","코드 최적화","의사결정 원칙","프레임워크 선택","코드 리뷰"],"es":["Node.js","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de aplicaciones","escalabilidad","mantenibilidad","principios de decisión","framework","desarrollo web"],"fr":["Node.js","bonnes pratiques","développement d''applications","évolutivité","maintenabilité","principes de décision","framework","développement web"],"de":["Node.js","Best-Practices","Anwendungsentwicklung","Skalierbarkeit","Wartbarkeit","Entscheidungsprinzipien","Framework","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["Node.js","Desenvolvimento Node.js","Melhores práticas Node.js","Princípios de desenvolvimento","Tomada de decisões","Frameworks Node.js","IA para desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Node.js","Разработка Node.js","Лучшие практики Node.js","Принципы разработки","Принятие решений","Фреймворки Node.js","ИИ для разработки"],"ar":["NODE.js","تطوير NODE.js","أفضل الممارسات لNODE.js","مبادئ التطوير","اتخاذ القرارات","إطارات عمل NODE.js","الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nodejs-best-practices","description":"Node.js development principles and decision-making. Framework selection, async patterns, security, and architecture. Teaches thinking, not copying.","bodyPreview":"# Node.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles and decision-making for Node.js development in 2025.\n> **Learn to THINK, not memorize code patterns.**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ How to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill teaches **decision-making principles**, not fixed code to copy.\n\n- ASK user for preferences when unclear\n- Choose framework/pattern based on CONTEXT\n- Don''t default to same solution every time\n\n---\n\n## 1. Framework Selection (2025)\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat are you building?\n│\n├── Edge/Serverless (Cloudflare","body":"# Node.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles and decision-making for Node.js development in 2025.\n> **Learn to THINK, not memorize code patterns.**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ How to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill teaches **decision-making principles**, not fixed code to copy.\n\n- ASK user for preferences when unclear\n- Choose framework/pattern based on CONTEXT\n- Don''t default to same solution every time\n\n---\n\n## 1. Framework Selection (2025)\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat are you building?\n│\n├── Edge/Serverless (Cloudflare, Vercel)\n│   └── Hono (zero-dependency, ultra-fast cold starts)\n│\n├── High Performance API\n│   └── Fastify (2-3x faster than Express)\n│\n├── Enterprise/Team familiarity\n│   └── NestJS (structured, DI, decorators)\n│\n├── Legacy/Stable/Maximum ecosystem\n│   └── Express (mature, most middleware)\n│\n└── Full-stack with frontend\n    └── Next.js API Routes or tRPC\n```\n\n### Comparison Principles\n\n| Factor | Hono | Fastify | Express |\n|--------|------|---------|---------|\n| **Best for** | Edge, serverless | Performance | Legacy, learning |\n| **Cold start** | Fastest | Fast | Moderate |\n| **Ecosystem** | Growing | Good | Largest |\n| **TypeScript** | Native | Excellent | Good |\n| **Learning curve** | Low | Medium | Low |\n\n### Selection Questions to Ask:\n1. What''s the deployment target?\n2. Is cold start time critical?\n3. Does team have existing experience?\n4. Is there legacy code to maintain?\n\n---\n\n## 2. Runtime Considerations (2025)\n\n### Native TypeScript\n\n```\nNode.js 22+: --experimental-strip-types\n├── Run .ts files directly\n├── No build step needed for simple projects\n└── Consider for: scripts, simple APIs\n```\n\n### Module System Decision\n\n```\nESM (import/export)\n├── Modern standard\n├── Better tree-shaking\n├── Async module loading\n└── Use for: new projects\n\nCommonJS (require)\n├── Legacy compatibility\n├── More npm packages support\n└── Use for: existing codebases, some edge cases\n```\n\n### Runtime Selection\n\n| Runtime | Best For |\n|---------|----------|\n| **Node.js** | General purpose, largest ecosystem |\n| **Bun** | Performance, built-in bundler |\n| **Deno** | Security-first, built-in TypeScript |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Architecture Principles\n\n### Layered Structure Concept\n\n```\nRequest Flow:\n│\n├── Controller/Route Layer\n│   ├── Handles HTTP specifics\n│   ├── Input validation at boundary\n│   └── Calls service layer\n│\n├── Service Layer\n│   ├── Business logic\n│   ├── Framework-agnostic\n│   └── Calls repository layer\n│\n└── Repository Layer\n    ├── Data access only\n    ├── Database queries\n    └── ORM interactions\n```\n\n### Why This Matters:\n- **Testability**: Mock layers independently\n- **Flexibility**: Swap database without touching business logic\n- **Clarity**: Each layer has single responsibility\n\n### When to Simplify:\n- Small scripts → Single file OK\n- Prototypes → Less structure acceptable\n- Always ask: \"Will this grow?\"\n\n---\n\n## 4. Error Handling Principles\n\n### Centralized Error Handling\n\n```\nPattern:\n├── Create custom error classes\n├── Throw from any layer\n├── Catch at top level (middleware)\n└── Format consistent response\n```\n\n### Error Response Philosophy\n\n```\nClient gets:\n├── Appropriate HTTP status\n├── Error code for programmatic handling\n├── User-friendly message\n└── NO internal details (security!)\n\nLogs get:\n├── Full stack trace\n├── Request context\n├── User ID (if applicable)\n└── Timestamp\n```\n\n### Status Code Selection\n\n| Situation | Status | When |\n|-----------|--------|------|\n| Bad input | 400 | Client sent invalid data |\n| No auth | 401 | Missing or invalid credentials |\n| No permission | 403 | Valid auth, but not allowed |\n| Not found | 404 | Resource doesn''t exist |\n| Conflict | 409 | Duplicate or state conflict |\n| Validation | 422 | Schema valid but business rules fail |\n| Server error | 500 | Our fault, log everything |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Async Patterns Principles\n\n### When to Use Each\n\n| Pattern | Use When |\n|---------|----------|\n| `async/await` | Sequential async operations |\n| `Promise.all` | Parallel independent operations |\n| `Promise.allSettled` | Parallel where some can fail |\n| `Promise.race` | Timeout or first response wins |\n\n### Event Loop Awareness\n\n```\nI/O-bound (async helps):\n├── Database queries\n├── HTTP requests\n├── File system\n└── Network operations\n\nCPU-bound (async doesn''t help):\n├── Crypto operations\n├── Image processing\n├── Complex calculations\n└── → Use worker threads or offload\n```\n\n### Avoiding Event Loop Blocking\n\n- Never use sync methods in production (fs.readFileSync, etc.)\n- Offload CPU-intensive work\n- Use streaming for large data\n\n---\n\n## 6. Validation Principles\n\n### Validate at Boundaries\n\n```\nWhere to validate:\n├── API entry point (request body/params)\n├── Before database operations\n├── External data (API responses, file uploads)\n└── Environment variables (startup)\n```\n\n### Validation Library Selection\n\n| Library | Best For |\n|---------|----------|\n| **Zod** | TypeScript first, inference |\n| **Valibot** | Smaller bundle (tree-shakeable) |\n| **ArkType** | Performance critical |\n| **Yup** | Existing React Form usage |\n\n### Validation Philosophy\n\n- Fail fast: Validate early\n- Be specific: Clear error messages\n- Don''t trust: Even \"internal\" data\n\n---\n\n## 7. Security Principles\n\n### Security Checklist (Not Code)\n\n- [ ] **Input validation**: All inputs validated\n- [ ] **Parameterized queries**: No string concatenation for SQL\n- [ ] **Password hashing**: bcrypt or argon2\n- [ ] **JWT verification**: Always verify signature and expiry\n- [ ] **Rate limiting**: Protect from abuse\n- [ ] **Security headers**: Helmet.js or equivalent\n- [ ] **HTTPS**: Everywhere in production\n- [ ] **CORS**: Properly configured\n- [ ] **Secrets**: Environment variables only\n- [ ] **Dependencies**: Regularly audited\n\n### Security Mindset\n\n```\nTrust nothing:\n├── Query params → validate\n├── Request body → validate\n├── Headers → verify\n├── Cookies → validate\n├── File uploads → scan\n└── External APIs → validate response\n```\n\n---\n\n## 8. Testing Principles\n\n### Test Strategy Selection\n\n| Type | Purpose | Tools |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| **Unit** | Business logic | node:test, Vitest |\n| **Integration** | API endpoints | Supertest |\n| **E2E** | Full flows | Playwright |\n\n### What to Test (Priorities)\n\n1. **Critical paths**: Auth, payments, core business\n2. **Edge cases**: Empty inputs, boundaries\n3. **Error handling**: What happens when things fail?\n4. **Not worth testing**: Framework code, trivial getters\n\n### Built-in Test Runner (Node.js 22+)\n\n```\nnode --test src/**/*.test.ts\n├── No external dependency\n├── Good coverage reporting\n└── Watch mode available\n```\n\n---\n\n## 10. Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n### ❌ DON''T:\n- Use Express for new edge projects (use Hono)\n- Use sync methods in production code\n- Put business logic in controllers\n- Skip input validation\n- Hardcode secrets\n- Trust external data without validation\n- Block event loop with CPU work\n\n### ✅ DO:\n- Choose framework based on context\n- Ask user for preferences when unclear\n- Use layered architecture for growing projects\n- Validate all inputs\n- Use environment variables for secrets\n- Profile before optimizing\n\n---\n\n## 11. Decision Checklist\n\nBefore implementing:\n\n- [ ] **Asked user about stack preference?**\n- [ ] **Chosen framework for THIS context?** (not just default)\n- [ ] **Considered deployment target?**\n- [ ] **Planned error handling strategy?**\n- [ ] **Identified validation points?**\n- [ ] **Considered security requirements?**\n\n---\n\n> **Remember**: Node.js best practices are about decision-making, not memorizing patterns. Every project deserves fresh consideration based on its requirements.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:05:06.544Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing Node.js best practices and AI-driven code optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要 Node.js 最佳实践和 AI 驱动代码优化的代码审查代理。","ja":"Node.js のベストプラクティスと AI ドリブンのコード最適化を必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Node.js 최적의 실제 및 AI 기반 코드 최적화를 필요로 하는 코드 검토 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan las mejores prácticas de Node.js y optimización de código impulsada por IA.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Révision de Code nécessitant les meilleures pratiques de Node.js et l''optimisation de code pilotée par l''IA.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die Node.js-Best-Practices und AI-getriebene Codeoptimierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de práticas recomendadas do Node.js e otimização de código impulsionada por IA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, которым необходимы лучшие практики Node.js и оптимизация кода на основе ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مراجعة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى أفضل الممارسات لNODE.js وضبط الشفرة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply context-aware Node.js development principles, safely integrating AI-suggested patches with preview, leveraging frameworks like Cloudflare for Edge/Serverless applications and decision-making trees for optimal framework selection.","zh":"赋予代理应用上下文感知的 Node.js 开发原则，安全地集成 AI 建议的补丁，并利用 Cloudflare 等框架进行 Edge/Serverless 应用和决策树进行最优框架选择。","ja":"エージェントに、コンテキスト認識可能な Node.js 開発原則を適用し、AI によって提案されたパッチをプレビューしながら安全に統合し、Cloudflare などのフレームワークを使用して Edge/Serverless アプリケーションと、決定木を使用して最適なフレームワークを選択することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 컨텍스트 인식 가능한 Node.js 개발 원칙을 적용하고, AI가 제안한 패치를 미리 보면서 안전하게 통합하며, Cloudflare와 같은 프레임워크를 사용하여 Edge/Serverless 애플리케이션과 결정 트리를 사용하여 최적의 프레임워크를 선택할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar principios de desarrollo de Node.js conscientes del contexto, integrando de manera segura parches sugeridos por IA con vista previa, aprovechando frameworks como Cloudflare para aplicaciones Edge/Serverless y árboles de decisión para la selección óptima de frameworks.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des principes de développement de Node.js conscients du contexte, en intégrant de manière sécurisée des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec aperçu, en exploitant des frameworks comme Cloudflare pour les applications Edge/Serverless et des arbres de décision pour la sélection optimale de frameworks.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, kontextbewusste Node.js-Entwicklungsprinzipien anzuwenden, indem sie vorsichtig AI-vorgeschlagene Patches mit Vorschau integrieren, Frameworks wie Cloudflare für Edge/Serverless-Anwendungen und Entscheidungsbäume für die optimale Framework-Auswahl nutzend.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar princípios de desenvolvimento do Node.js cientes do contexto, integrando com segurança patches sugeridos por IA com pré-visualização, aproveitando frameworks como Cloudflare para aplicações Edge/Serverless e árvores de decisão para seleção de framework otimizada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять контекстно-зависимые принципы разработки Node.js, безопасно интегрируя патчи, предложенные ИИ, с предварительным просмотром, используя фреймворки như Cloudflare для приложений Edge/Serverless и деревья решений для оптимального выбора фреймворка.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطبيق مبادئ开发 NODE.js الماهره بالسياق، ودمج باتشات مقترحة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي بأمان مع معاينة، واستخدام إطارات مثل Cloudflare لتطبيقات Edge/Serverless وأشجار القرار لاختيار الإطار الأمثل."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying decision-making principles for framework selection","Generating context-aware code patches","Previewing AI-suggested code optimizations"],"zh":["应用框架选择的决策原则","生成上下文感知的代码补丁","预览 AI 建议的代码优化"],"ja":["フレームワークの選択のための意思決定原則の適用","コンテキスト認識可能なコードパッチの生成","AI によって提案されたコード最適化のプレビュー"],"ko":["프레임워크 선택을 위한 의사결정 원칙 적용","컨텍스트 인식 가능한 코드 패치 생성","AI가 제안한 코드 최적화 미리 보기"],"es":["Aplicar principios de toma de decisiones para la selección de frameworks","Generar parches de código conscientes del contexto","Previsualizar optimizaciones de código sugeridas por IA"],"fr":["Appliquer des principes de prise de décision pour la sélection de frameworks","Générer des correctifs de code conscients du contexte","Prévisualiser les optimisations de code suggérées par l''IA"],"de":["Entscheidungsprinzipien für die Framework-Auswahl anwenden","Kontextbewusste Code-Patches generieren","Vorschau von AI-vorgeschlagenen Codeoptimierungen"],"pt":["Aplicar princípios de tomada de decisão para seleção de framework","Gerar patches de código cientes do contexto","Previsualizar otimizações de código sugeridas por IA"],"ru":["Применять принципы принятия решений для выбора фреймворка","Генерировать контекстно-зависимые патчи кода","Предварительно просматривать оптимизации кода, предложенные ИИ"],"ar":["تطبيق مبادئ اتخاذ القرار لاختيار الإطار","توليد باتشات شفرة ماهرة بالسياق","معاينة تحسينات الشفرة المقترحة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Limited to Node.js development context"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 环境","仅限 Node.js 开发上下文"],"ja":["Node.js 環境が必要","Node.js 開発コンテキストに限定される"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요","Node.js 개발 컨텍스트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Node.js","Limitado al contexto de desarrollo de Node.js"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Limité au contexte de développement de Node.js"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Node.js-Entwicklungskontext"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js","Limitado ao contexto de desenvolvimento do Node.js"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Ограничен контекстом разработки Node.js"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة NODE.js","محدود بالسياق تطوير NODE.js"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop/mobile-games', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'Synapse-Desktop', 'HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop', 'mobile-games', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z', '2026-02-19T02:05:14.948Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop/mobile-games","name":"mobile-games","description":{"zh":"移动游戏开发需要考虑平台约束和优化原则，包括触摸输入、电池寿命、热量、屏幕尺寸和中断等因素","ja":"モバイルゲーム開発では、プラットフォームの制約と最適化原則を考慮する必要があり、タッチ入力、バッテリー寿命、熱、画面サイズ、断続などが含まれる","ko":"모바일 게임 개발에서는 플랫폼 제약과 최적화 원리를 고려해야 하며, 터치 입력, 배터리 수명, 열, 화면 크기, 중단 등이 포함됨","es":"El desarrollo de juegos móviles requiere una optimización cuidadosa para superar las limitaciones de la plataforma. Nuestros principios y estrategias te ayudarán","fr":"Le développement de jeux mobiles nécessite une optimisation soignée pour surmonter les limites de la plateforme. Nos principes et stratégies vous aideront","de":"Die Entwicklung von Mobile Games erfordert eine sorgfältige Optimierung, um die Plattform-Beschränkungen zu überwinden. Unsere Prinzipien und Strategien helfen Ihnen","pt":"O desenvolvimento de jogos móveis requer otimização e considerações de plataforma. Aprenda a criar experiências de jogo mais suaves e eficientes.","ru":"Разработка мобильных игр требует оптимизации и учета платформы. Узнайте, как создать более плавные и эффективные игровые trải nghiệm.","ar":"تطوير الألعاب المحمولة يتطلب تحسينًا ومراعاة المنصة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء تجارب ألعاب أكثر سلاسة وفعالية.","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"移动游戏开发优化","ja":"モバイルゲーム開発の最適化","ko":"모바일 게임 개발 최적화","es":"Desarrollo de Juegos Móviles: Optimización y Principios","fr":"Développement de Jeux Mobiles: Optimisation et Principes","de":"Mobile Game-Entwicklung: Optimierung und Prinzipien","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Jogos Móveis: Otimização e Princípios","ru":"Разработка Мобильных Игр: Оптимизация и Принципы","ar":"تطوير الألعاب المحمولة: تحسين و مبادئ","en":"mobile-games"},"description":{"zh":"移动游戏开发需要考虑平台约束和优化原则，包括触摸输入、电池寿命、热量、屏幕尺寸和中断等因素","ja":"モバイルゲーム開発では、プラットフォームの制約と最適化原則を考慮する必要があり、タッチ入力、バッテリー寿命、熱、画面サイズ、断続などが含まれる","ko":"모바일 게임 개발에서는 플랫폼 제약과 최적화 원리를 고려해야 하며, 터치 입력, 배터리 수명, 열, 화면 크기, 중단 등이 포함됨","es":"El desarrollo de juegos móviles requiere una optimización cuidadosa para superar las limitaciones de la plataforma. Nuestros principios y estrategias te ayud...","fr":"Le développement de jeux mobiles nécessite une optimisation soignée pour surmonter les limites de la plateforme. Nos principes et stratégies vous aideront","de":"Die Entwicklung von Mobile Games erfordert eine sorgfältige Optimierung, um die Plattform-Beschränkungen zu überwinden. Unsere Prinzipien und Strategien helf...","pt":"O desenvolvimento de jogos móveis requer otimização e considerações de plataforma. Aprenda a criar experiências de jogo mais suaves e eficientes.","ru":"Разработка мобильных игр требует оптимизации и учета платформы. Узнайте, как создать более плавные и эффективные игровые trải nghiệm.","ar":"تطوير الألعاب المحمولة يتطلب تحسينًا ومراعاة المنصة. تعلم كيفية إنشاء تجارب ألعاب أكثر سلاسة وفعالية.","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"definition":{"en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"features":{"zh":["触摸输入优化","电池寿命优化","热量控制","响应式UI设计","中断处理"],"ja":["タッチ入力の最適化","バッテリー寿命の最適化","熱量の制御","レスポンシブUIデザイン","中断の処理"],"ko":["터치 입력 최적화","배터리 수명 최적화","열 제어","반응형 UI 디자인","중단 처리"],"es":["Principios de optimización para juegos móviles","Estrategias para superar limitaciones de plataforma","Diseño de interfaz de usuario responsiva","Gestión de la batería y el calor","Implementación de entrada táctil y gestos"],"fr":["Principes d''optimisation pour les jeux mobiles","Stratégies pour surmonter les limites de la plateforme","Conception d''interface utilisateur réactive","Gestion de la batterie et de la chaleur","Mise en œuvre de l''entrée tactile et des gestes"],"de":["Optimierungsprinzipien für Mobile Games","Strategien zur Überwindung von Plattform-Beschränkungen","Entwurf einer responsiven Benutzeroberfläche","Batterie- und Wärmemanagement","Implementierung von Touch-Eingabe und Gesten"],"pt":["Otimização de plataforma","Princípios de entrada por toque","Restrições de bateria e térmica","Interface de usuário responsiva","Pausa em segundo plano"],"ru":["Оптимизация платформы","Принципы ввода по касанию","Ограничения батареи и тепла","Отзывчивый интерфейс пользователя","Пауза на фоне"],"ar":["تحسين المنصة","مبادئ الإدخال باللمس","قيود البطارية والحرارة","واجهة المستخدم المتجاوبة","الإيقاف في الخلفية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动游戏开发","平台约束","优化原则","触摸输入","电池寿命","热量","屏幕尺寸","中断"],"ja":["モバイルゲーム開発","プラットフォームの制約","最適化原則","タッチ入力","バッテリー寿命","熱量","画面サイズ","中断"],"ko":["모바일 게임 개발","플랫폼 제약","최적화 원리","터치 입력","배터리 수명","열","화면 크기","중단"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos móviles","optimización de juegos","limitaciones de plataforma","entrada táctil","batería y calor","diseño de interfaz de usuario","gestos y movimiento","programación de juegos móviles"],"fr":["développement de jeux mobiles","optimisation de jeux","limites de la plateforme","entrée tactile","batterie et chaleur","conception d''interface utilisateur","gestes et mouvement","programmation de jeux mobiles"],"de":["Mobile Game-Entwicklung","Optimierung von Spielen","Plattform-Beschränkungen","Touch-Eingabe","Batterie und Wärme","Entwurf von Benutzeroberflächen","Gesten und Bewegung","Programmierung von Mobile Games"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos móveis","otimização de plataforma","princípios de entrada por toque","restrições de bateria","interface de usuário responsiva","jogos móveis eficientes"],"ru":["разработка мобильных игр","оптимизация платформы","принципы ввода по касанию","ограничения батареи","отзывчивый интерфейс пользователя","мобильные игры эффективные"],"ar":["تطوير الألعاب المحمولة","تحسين المنصة","مبادئ الإدخال باللمس","قيود البطارية","واجهة المستخدم المتجاوبة","ألعاب محمولة فعالة"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-games","description":"Mobile game development principles. Touch input, battery, performance, app stores.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Game Development\n\n> Platform constraints and optimization principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Platform Considerations\n\n### Key Constraints\n\n| Constraint | Strategy |\n|------------|----------|\n| **Touch input** | Large hit areas, gestures |\n| **Battery** | Limit CPU/GPU usage |\n| **Thermal** | Throttle when hot |\n| **Screen size** | Responsive UI |\n| **Interruptions** | Pause on background |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Touch Input Principles\n\n### Touch vs Controller\n\n| Touch | Desktop/Console |\n|-------|-----------","body":"# Mobile Game Development\n\n> Platform constraints and optimization principles.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Platform Considerations\n\n### Key Constraints\n\n| Constraint | Strategy |\n|------------|----------|\n| **Touch input** | Large hit areas, gestures |\n| **Battery** | Limit CPU/GPU usage |\n| **Thermal** | Throttle when hot |\n| **Screen size** | Responsive UI |\n| **Interruptions** | Pause on background |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Touch Input Principles\n\n### Touch vs Controller\n\n| Touch | Desktop/Console |\n|-------|-----------------|\n| Imprecise | Precise |\n| Occludes screen | No occlusion |\n| Limited buttons | Many buttons |\n| Gestures available | Buttons/sticks |\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Minimum touch target: 44x44 points\n- Visual feedback on touch\n- Avoid precise timing requirements\n- Support both portrait and landscape\n\n---\n\n## 3. Performance Targets\n\n### Thermal Management\n\n| Action | Trigger |\n|--------|---------|\n| Reduce quality | Device warm |\n| Limit FPS | Device hot |\n| Pause effects | Critical temp |\n\n### Battery Optimization\n\n- 30 FPS often sufficient\n- Sleep when paused\n- Minimize GPS/network\n- Dark mode saves OLED battery\n\n---\n\n## 4. App Store Requirements\n\n### iOS (App Store)\n\n| Requirement | Note |\n|-------------|------|\n| Privacy labels | Required |\n| Account deletion | If account creation exists |\n| Screenshots | For all device sizes |\n\n### Android (Google Play)\n\n| Requirement | Note |\n|-------------|------|\n| Target API | Current year''s SDK |\n| 64-bit | Required |\n| App bundles | Recommended |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Monetization Models\n\n| Model | Best For |\n|-------|----------|\n| **Premium** | Quality games, loyal audience |\n| **Free + IAP** | Casual, progression-based |\n| **Ads** | Hyper-casual, high volume |\n| **Subscription** | Content updates, multiplayer |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Desktop controls on mobile | Design for touch |\n| Ignore battery drain | Monitor thermals |\n| Force landscape | Support player preference |\n| Always-on network | Cache and sync |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile is the most constrained platform. Respect battery and attention.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:05:14.948Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Code Analysis Agents working on mobile game optimization and platform-specific implementations.","zh":"对于从事移动游戏优化和平台特定实现的代码分析智能体至关重要。","ja":"モバイルゲームの最適化とプラットフォーム固有の実装に取り組むコード分析エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"모바일 게임 최적화 및 플랫폼별 구현 작업을 수행하는 코드 분석 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de análisis de código que trabajan en la optimización de juegos móviles y implementaciones específicas de plataforma.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''analyse de code travaillant sur l''optimisation de jeux mobiles et les implémentations spécifiques à la plateforme.","de":"Wesentlich für Code-Analyse-Agents, die an der Optimierung von Mobile-Spielen und plattformspezifischen Implementierungen arbeiten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Análise de Código que trabalham com otimização de jogos móveis e implementações específicas de plataforma.","ru":"Необходим для агентов анализа кода, работающих над оптимизацией мобильных игр и платформо-специфическими реализациями.","ar":"ضروري للوكلاء تحليل الشفرة الذين يعملون على تحسين ألعاب الهاتف المحمول والتنفيذ المحدد للمنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to extract mobile-specific codebase context and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview functionality. Directly addresses touch input handling, battery optimization, thermal throttling, and interruption management for iOS and Android platforms.","zh":"使智能体能够提取移动特定的代码库上下文，并通过预览功能安全地应用AI建议的补丁。直接解决iOS和Android平台的触摸输入处理、电池优化、热节流和中断管理问题。","ja":"エージェントがモバイル固有のコードベースコンテキストを抽出し、プレビュー機能付きでAIが提案するパッチを安全に適用できるようにします。iOSおよびAndroidプラットフォームにおけるタッチ入力処理、バッテリー最適化、サーマルスロットリング、割り込み管理に直接対応します。","ko":"에이전트가 모바일 특화 코드베이스 컨텍스트를 추출하고 미리보기 기능으로 AI가 제안하는 패치를 안전하게 적용할 수 있게 합니다. iOS 및 Android 플랫폼의 터치 입력 처리, 배터리 최적화, 열 제한 및 인터럽션 관리를 직접적으로 해결합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes extraer el contexto de la base de código específica de móviles y aplicar de forma segura parches sugeridos por IA con funcionalidad de previsualización. Aborda directamente el manejo de entradas táctiles, la optimización de la batería, el estrangulamiento térmico y la gestión de interrupciones para las plataformas iOS y Android.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire le contexte de la base de code spécifique aux mobiles et d''appliquer en toute sécurité des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec une fonctionnalité d''aperçu. Aborde directement la gestion des entrées tactiles, l''optimisation de la batterie, le bridage thermique et la gestion des interruptions pour les plateformes iOS et Android.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, den Kontext der mobilespezifischen Codebasis zu extrahieren und vorgeschlagene AI-Patches mit Vorschau-Funktion sicher anzuwenden. Geht direkt auf die Behandlung von Touch-Eingaben, Batterie-Optimierung, thermisches Drosseln und Interrupt-Verwaltung für die Plattformen iOS und Android ein.","pt":"Permite que os agentes extraiam o contexto da base de código específica do móvel e apliquem patches sugeridos por IA com funcionalidade de pré-visualização. Aborda diretamente o tratamento de entrada de toque, otimização de bateria, limitação térmica e gestão de interrupções para as plataformas iOS e Android.","ru":"Позволяет агентам извлекать контекст мобильной кодовой базы и безопасно применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, с функцией предварительного просмотра. Прямо решает обработку сенсорного ввода, оптимизацию батареи, термическое ограничение и управление прерываниями для платформ iOS и Android.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء استخراج سياق قاعدة الشفرة المحددة للهاتف المحمول وتطبيق التصحيحات المقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي مع وظيفة المعاينة. يتناول مباشرة معالجة الإدخال التáctي، وتحسين البطارية، والتحكم في الحرارة، وإدارة الإيقاف للمنصات أندرويد وآي أو إس."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing CPU/GPU usage for battery conservation","Implementing responsive UI for varying screen sizes","Adding pause functionality for background interruptions","Applying touch input improvements with gesture support"],"zh":["优化CPU/GPU使用以节省电池","为不同屏幕尺寸实现响应式UI","为后台中断添加暂停功能","通过手势支持应用触摸输入改进"],"ja":["バッテリー節約のためのCPU/GPU使用率の最適化","様々な画面サイズに対応したレスポンシブUIの実装","バックグラウンド割り込みのための一時停止機能の追加","ジェスチャーサポートによるタッチ入力の改善の適用"],"ko":["배터리 보존을 위한 CPU/GPU 사용량 최적화","다양한 화면 크기에 대응하는 반응형 UI 구현","백그라운드 인터럽션을 위한 일시정지 기능 추가","제스처 지원으로 터치 입력 개선 사항 적용"],"es":["Optimizar el uso de CPU/GPU para la conservación de la batería","Implementar una interfaz de usuario receptiva para tamaños de pantalla variables","Agregar funcionalidad de pausa para interrupciones en segundo plano","Aplicar mejoras de entrada táctil con soporte de gestos"],"fr":["Optimiser l''utilisation de la CPU/GPU pour la conservation de la batterie","Mettre en œuvre une interface utilisateur réactive pour des tailles d''écran variables","Ajouter une fonctionnalité de pause pour les interruptions en arrière-plan","Appliquer des améliorations de saisie tactile avec prise en charge des gestes"],"de":["Optimieren des CPU/GPU-Gebrauchs für die Batterie-Einsparung","Implementieren einer responsiven Benutzeroberfläche für variable Bildschirmgrößen","Hinzufügen einer Pausenfunktion für Unterbrechungen im Hintergrund","Anwenden von Verbesserungen für Touch-Eingaben mit Gestenunterstützung"],"pt":["Otimizar o uso de CPU/GPU para conservação de bateria","Implementar UI responsiva para tamanhos de tela variados","Adicionar funcionalidade de pausa para interrupções em segundo plano","Aplicar melhorias de entrada de toque com suporte a gestos"],"ru":["Оптимизировать использование CPU/GPU для сохранения батареи","Реализовать отзывчивый UI для переменных размеров экрана","Добавить функцию паузы для фоновых прерываний","Применить улучшения сенсорного ввода с поддержкой жестов"],"ar":["تحسين استخدام وحدة المعالجة المركزية/وحدة معالجة الرسومات لتحسين البطارية","تطبيق واجهة مستخدم مرنة لأحجام الشاشة المختلفة","إضافة وظيفة الإيقاف المؤقت للاضطرابات في الخلفية","تطبيق تحسينات الإدخال التáctي مع دعم الإشارات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires mobile game codebase access","Platform-specific constraints (iOS/Android)","Performance optimization expertise needed"],"zh":["需要访问移动游戏代码库","平台特定约束（iOS/Android）","需要性能优化专业知识"],"ja":["モバイルゲームのコードベースへのアクセスが必要","プラットフォーム固有の制約（iOS/Android）","パフォーマンス最適化の専門知識が必要"],"ko":["모바일 게임 코드베이스 접근 권한 필요","플랫폼별 제약 조건(iOS/Android)","성능 최적화 전문 지식 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código del juego móvil","Restricciones específicas de la plataforma (iOS/Android)","Se necesita experiencia en optimización de rendimiento"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code du jeu mobile","Contraintes spécifiques à la plateforme (iOS/Android)","Une expertise en optimisation des performances est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis des Mobile-Spiels","Plattformspezifische Einschränkungen (iOS/Android)","Leistungsoptimierungs-Expertise ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código do jogo móvel","Restrições específicas de plataforma (iOS/Android)","Experiência em otimização de desempenho necessária"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе мобильной игры","Платформо-специфические ограничения (iOS/Android)","Необходим опыт в оптимизации производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة الخاصة بلعبة الهاتف المحمول","قيود محددة بالمنصة (أندرويد/آي أو إس)","مطلوب الخبرة في تحسين الأداء"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
