е M...","ar":"تكتيكات فريق الاحمر: محاكاة العدو باستخدام إطار عمل MITRE...","en":"red-team-tactics"},"description":{"zh":"红队战术是基于MITRE ATT&CK框架的代码安全技术，用于预防和检测潜在攻击","ja":"レッドチーム戦術は、MITRE ATT&CKフレームワークに基づくコードの安全性技術であり、潜在的な攻撃を防止および検出するために使用される","ko":"레드 팀 전술은 MITRE ATT&CK 프레임워크를 기반으로 하는 코드 보안 기술로 잠재적인 공격을 예방하고 탐지하는데 사용","es":"Simula ataques con tácticas de equipo rojo y aplica parches de IA de manera segura con nuestra guía técnica","fr":"Simulez des attaques avec des tactiques d''équipe rouge et appliquez des correctifs d''IA de manière sécurisée avec notre guide technique","de":"Simulieren Sie Angriffe mit Red-Team-Taktiken und wenden Sie AI-Patches sicher an mit unserer technischen Anleitung","pt":"As táticas de red team permitem simular ataques cibernéticos, enquanto o framework MITRE ATT&CK fornece uma estrutura para entender as fases de um ataque","ru":"Тактика красной команды позволяет симулировать кибератаки, а фреймворк MITRE ATT&CK предоставляет структуру для понимания фаз атаки","ar":"تكتيكات فريق الاحمر تسمح بمحاكاة الهجمات الإلكترونية، في حين يوفر إطار عمل MITRE ATT&CK هيكلاً لفهم مراحل الهجوم","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"definition":{"en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"features":{"zh":["基于MITRE ATT&CK框架","代码安全技术","预防和检测潜在攻击","模拟攻击者行为","提高代码安全性"],"ja":["MITRE ATT&CKフレームワークに基づく","コードの安全性技術","潜在的な攻撃の防止および検出","攻撃者の動作のシミュレート","コードの安全性の向上"],"ko":["MITRE ATT&CK 프레임워크를 기반으로","코드 보안 기술","잠재적인 공격의 예방 및 탐지","공격자의 행동 시뮬레이션","코드 보안성 향상"],"es":["Simulación de ataques con tácticas de equipo rojo","Aplicación segura de parches de IA","Basado en el marco MITRE ATT&CK","Análisis de ciclo de ataque","Privilegios de acceso y evasión de defensa"],"fr":["Simulation d''attaques avec des tactiques d''équipe rouge","Application sécurisée de correctifs d''IA","Basé sur le cadre MITRE ATT&CK","Analyse du cycle d''attaque","Privileges d''accès et évasion de défense"],"de":["Angriffssimulation mit Red-Team-Taktiken","Sichere Anwendung von AI-Patches","Basierend auf dem MITRE-ATT&CK-Rahmen","Analyse des Angriffszyklus","Zugriffsrechte und Verteidigungsevasion"],"pt":["Simulação de ataques cibernéticos","Análise de contexto de código","Aplicação de patches de IA","Segurança de sistemas","Framework MITRE ATT&CK"],"ru":["Симуляция кибератак","Анализ контекста кода","Применение патчей ИИ","Безопасность систем","Фреймворк MITRE ATT&CK"],"ar":["محاكاة الهجمات الإلكترونية","تحليل سياق الشفرة","تطبيق تصحيحات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أمن الأنظمة","إطار عمل MITRE ATT&CK"]},"keywords":{"zh":["红队战术","MITRE ATT&CK","代码安全","攻击者行为","代码漏洞","安全技术"],"ja":["レッドチーム戦術","MITRE ATT&CK","コードの安全性","攻撃者の動作","コードの脆弱性","安全技術"],"ko":["레드 팀 전술","MITRE ATT&CK","코드 보안","공격자의 행동","코드 취약성","보안 기술"],"es":["tácticas de equipo rojo","simulación de ataques","seguridad de código","MITRE ATT&CK","parches de IA","ciclo de ataque"],"fr":["tactiques d''équipe rouge","simulation d''attaques","sécurité de code","MITRE ATT&CK","correctifs d''IA","cycle d''attaque"],"de":["Red-Team-Taktiken","Angriffssimulation","Codesicherheit","MITRE ATT&CK","AI-Patches","Angriffszyklus"],"pt":["táticas de red team","simulação de ataques cibernéticos","MITRE ATT&CK","segurança de sistemas","análise de contexto de código","aplicação de patches de IA"],"ru":["тактика красной команды","симуляция кибератак","MITRE ATT&CK","безопасность систем","анализ контекста кода","применение патчей ИИ"],"ar":["تكتيكات فريق الاحمر","محاكاة الهجمات الإلكترونية","MITRE ATT&CK","أمن الأنظمة","تحليل سياق الشفرة","تطبيق تصحيحات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"red-team-tactics","description":"Red team tactics principles based on MITRE ATT&CK. Attack phases, detection evasion, reporting.","bodyPreview":"# Red Team Tactics\n\n> Adversary simulation principles based on MITRE ATT&CK framework.\n\n---\n\n## 1. MITRE ATT&CK Phases\n\n### Attack Lifecycle\n\n```\nRECONNAISSANCE → INITIAL ACCESS → EXECUTION → PERSISTENCE\n       ↓              ↓              ↓            ↓\n   PRIVILEGE ESC → DEFENSE EVASION → CRED ACCESS → DISCOVERY\n       ↓              ↓              ↓            ↓\nLATERAL MOVEMENT → COLLECTION → C2 → EXFILTRATION → IMPACT\n```\n\n### Phase Objectives\n\n| Phase | Objective |\n|-------|-----------|\n|","body":"# Red Team Tactics\n\n> Adversary simulation principles based on MITRE ATT&CK framework.\n\n---\n\n## 1. MITRE ATT&CK Phases\n\n### Attack Lifecycle\n\n```\nRECONNAISSANCE → INITIAL ACCESS → EXECUTION → PERSISTENCE\n       ↓              ↓              ↓            ↓\n   PRIVILEGE ESC → DEFENSE EVASION → CRED ACCESS → DISCOVERY\n       ↓              ↓              ↓            ↓\nLATERAL MOVEMENT → COLLECTION → C2 → EXFILTRATION → IMPACT\n```\n\n### Phase Objectives\n\n| Phase | Objective |\n|-------|-----------|\n| **Recon** | Map attack surface |\n| **Initial Access** | Get first foothold |\n| **Execution** | Run code on target |\n| **Persistence** | Survive reboots |\n| **Privilege Escalation** | Get admin/root |\n| **Defense Evasion** | Avoid detection |\n| **Credential Access** | Harvest credentials |\n| **Discovery** | Map internal network |\n| **Lateral Movement** | Spread to other systems |\n| **Collection** | Gather target data |\n| **C2** | Maintain command channel |\n| **Exfiltration** | Extract data |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Reconnaissance Principles\n\n### Passive vs Active\n\n| Type | Trade-off |\n|------|-----------|\n| **Passive** | No target contact, limited info |\n| **Active** | Direct contact, more detection risk |\n\n### Information Targets\n\n| Category | Value |\n|----------|-------|\n| Technology stack | Attack vector selection |\n| Employee info | Social engineering |\n| Network ranges | Scanning scope |\n| Third parties | Supply chain attack |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Initial Access Vectors\n\n### Selection Criteria\n\n| Vector | When to Use |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Phishing** | Human target, email access |\n| **Public exploits** | Vulnerable services exposed |\n| **Valid credentials** | Leaked or cracked |\n| **Supply chain** | Third-party access |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Privilege Escalation Principles\n\n### Windows Targets\n\n| Check | Opportunity |\n|-------|-------------|\n| Unquoted service paths | Write to path |\n| Weak service permissions | Modify service |\n| Token privileges | Abuse SeDebug, etc. |\n| Stored credentials | Harvest |\n\n### Linux Targets\n\n| Check | Opportunity |\n|-------|-------------|\n| SUID binaries | Execute as owner |\n| Sudo misconfiguration | Command execution |\n| Kernel vulnerabilities | Kernel exploits |\n| Cron jobs | Writable scripts |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Defense Evasion Principles\n\n### Key Techniques\n\n| Technique | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| LOLBins | Use legitimate tools |\n| Obfuscation | Hide malicious code |\n| Timestomping | Hide file modifications |\n| Log clearing | Remove evidence |\n\n### Operational Security\n\n- Work during business hours\n- Mimic legitimate traffic patterns\n- Use encrypted channels\n- Blend with normal behavior\n\n---\n\n## 6. Lateral Movement Principles\n\n### Credential Types\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Password | Standard auth |\n| Hash | Pass-the-hash |\n| Ticket | Pass-the-ticket |\n| Certificate | Certificate auth |\n\n### Movement Paths\n\n- Admin shares\n- Remote services (RDP, SSH, WinRM)\n- Exploitation of internal services\n\n---\n\n## 7. Active Directory Attacks\n\n### Attack Categories\n\n| Attack | Target |\n|--------|--------|\n| Kerberoasting | Service account passwords |\n| AS-REP Roasting | Accounts without pre-auth |\n| DCSync | Domain credentials |\n| Golden Ticket | Persistent domain access |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Reporting Principles\n\n### Attack Narrative\n\nDocument the full attack chain:\n1. How initial access was gained\n2. What techniques were used\n3. What objectives were achieved\n4. Where detection failed\n\n### Detection Gaps\n\nFor each successful technique:\n- What should have detected it?\n- Why didn''t detection work?\n- How to improve detection\n\n---\n\n## 9. Ethical Boundaries\n\n### Always\n\n- Stay within scope\n- Minimize impact\n- Report immediately if real threat found\n- Document all actions\n\n### Never\n\n- Destroy production data\n- Cause denial of service (unless scoped)\n- Access beyond proof of concept\n- Retain sensitive data\n\n---\n\n## 10. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Rush to exploitation | Follow methodology |\n| Cause damage | Minimize impact |\n| Skip reporting | Document everything |\n| Ignore scope | Stay within boundaries |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Red team simulates attackers to improve defenses, not to cause harm.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:04:56.369Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cybersecurity Agents needing advanced threat simulation and MITRE ATT&CK framework analysis capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级威胁模拟和MITRE ATT&CK框架分析能力的网络安全代理。","ja":"サイバーセキュリティエージェントが高度な脅威シミュレーションとMITRE ATT&CKフレームワーク分析機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 위협 시뮬레이션 및 MITRE ATT&CK 프레임워크 분석 기능이 필요한 사이버 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Ciberseguridad que necesitan simulación de amenazas avanzada y capacidades de análisis del marco de trabajo MITRE ATT&CK.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de cybersécurité ayant besoin d''une simulation de menace avancée et de capacités d''analyse du cadre de travail MITRE ATT&CK.","de":"Perfekt für Cybersicherheitsagenten, die erweiterte Bedrohungssimulation und MITRE ATT&CK-Framework-Analysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Cibersegurança que necessitam de simulação de ameaças avançadas e capacidades de análise do framework MITRE ATT&CK.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кибербезопасности, требующих продвинутой симуляции угроз и возможностей анализа фреймворка MITRE ATT&CK.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمنيين الإلكترونيين الذين يحتاجون إلى محاكاة تهديد متقدمة وقدرات تحليل إطار عمل MITRE ATT&CK."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to simulate adversary attacks using the MITRE ATT&CK framework, providing comprehensive phase objectives and attack lifecycle visualization, and enabling the safe application of AI-suggested patches with preview, leveraging libraries like Python for codebase context extraction.","zh":"赋予代理模拟对手攻击的能力，使用MITRE ATT&CK框架，提供全面阶段目标和攻击生命周期可视化，并能够安全地应用AI建议的补丁，同时预览，利用Python等库进行代码库上下文提取。","ja":"エージェントがMITRE ATT&CKフレームワークを使用して対手の攻撃をシミュレートする機能を提供し、包括的な段階的目標と攻撃ライフサイクルの視覚化を提供し、Pythonなどのライブラリを使用してコードベースのコンテキスト抽出を行い、プレビューを使用してAIによって提案されたパッチを安全に適用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 MITRE ATT&CK 프레임워크를 사용하여 공격者の 공격을 시뮬레이션 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 포괄적인 단계 목표와 공격 수명주기 시각화를 제공하며, Python 등의 라이브러리를 사용하여 코드베이스의 컨텍스트 추출을 수행하며, 미리 보기로 AI가 제안한 패치를 안전하게 적용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simular ataques de adversarios utilizando el marco de trabajo MITRE ATT&CK, proporcionando objetivos de fase y visualización del ciclo de vida del ataque, y permitiendo la aplicación segura de parches sugeridos por IA con vista previa, aprovechando bibliotecas como Python para la extracción de contexto de código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de simuler les attaques des adversaires en utilisant le cadre de travail MITRE ATT&CK, en fournissant des objectifs de phase et une visualisation du cycle de vie de l''attaque, et en permettant l''application sécurisée des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec aperçu, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme Python pour l''extraction de contexte de codebase.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Angriffe von Gegnern mit dem MITRE ATT&CK-Framework zu simulieren, umfassende Phasenobjekte und eine Visualisierung des Angriffslebenszyklus bereitzustellen und die sichere Anwendung von künstlich intelligente vorgeschlagenen Patches mit Vorschau zu ermöglichen, unter Nutzung von Bibliotheken wie Python zur Kontextextraktion der Codebasis.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a simular ataques de adversários usando o framework MITRE ATT&CK, fornecendo objetivos de fase abrangentes e visualização do ciclo de vida do ataque, e permitindo a aplicação segura de patches sugeridos por IA com visualização prévia, aproveitando bibliotecas como Python para extração de contexto de código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью симулировать атаки противников с использованием фреймворка MITRE ATT&CK, предоставляя всесторонние цели фаз и визуализацию цикла жизни атаки, и позволяя безопасно применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, с предварительным просмотром, используя библиотеки seperti Python для извлечения контекста кода.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من محاكاة هجمات الخصم باستخدام إطار عمل MITRE ATT&CK، وتوفير أهداف المرحلة الشاملة وتجسيد دورة حياة الهجوم، وتمكين تطبيق تصحيحات آمنة مقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي مع العرض المسبق، واستخدام مكتبات مثل بايثون لاستخراج سياق القاعدة البرمجية."},"useCases":{"en":["Simulating reconnaissance and initial access attacks","Analyzing privilege escalation and defense evasion techniques","Visualizing lateral movement and collection tactics"],"zh":["模拟侦察和初始访问攻击","分析特权提升和防御规避技术","可视化横向移动和收集战术"],"ja":["偵察と初期アクセス攻撃のシミュレーション","特権昇格と防御回避技術の分析","横方向移動と収集タクティクスの視覚化"],"ko":["정찰 및 초기 접근 공격 시뮬레이션","특권 상승 및 방어 회피 기술 분석","횡단 이동 및 수집 전술 시각화"],"es":["Simulación de ataques de reconocimiento y acceso inicial","Análisis de técnicas de escalada de privilegios y evasión de defensa","Visualización de tácticas de movimiento lateral y recolección"],"fr":["Simulation d''attaques de reconnaissance et d''accès initial","Analyse de techniques d''escalade de privilèges et d''évasion de défense","Visualisation de tactiques de mouvement latéral et de collecte"],"de":["Simulation von Aufklärungs- und Erstzugriffsangriffen","Analyse von Techniken zur Privilegienescalation und Verteidigungsvermeidung","Visualisierung von Taktiken zur lateralen Bewegung und Sammlung"],"pt":["Simulação de ataques de reconhecimento e acesso inicial","Análise de técnicas de escalada de privilégios e evasão de defesa","Visualização de táticas de movimentação lateral e coleta"],"ru":["Симуляция атак поиска и первоначального доступа","Анализ методов повышения привилегий и уклонения от защиты","Визуализация тактик бокового движения и сбора"],"ar":["محاكاة هجمات الاستطلاع والوصول الأولي","تحليل تقنيات تعزيز الامتيازات وتجنب الدفاع","تجسيد تكتيكات الحركة الجانبية والتحصيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of MITRE ATT&CK framework","Limited to adversary simulation principles","Needs access to codebase for context extraction"],"zh":["需要了解MITRE ATT&CK框架","仅限对手模拟原则","需要访问代码库以进行上下文提取"],"ja":["MITRE ATT&CKフレームワークの知識が必要","対手シミュレーションの原則に限定される","コードベースにアクセスしてコンテキスト抽出を行う必要がある"],"ko":["MITRE ATT&CK 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","적대자 시뮬레이션 원칙에만 제한됩니다.","컨텍스트 추출을 위해 코드베이스에 액세스해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del marco de trabajo MITRE ATT&CK","Limitado a principios de simulación de adversarios","Necesita acceso a la base de código para la extracción de contexto"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance du cadre de travail MITRE ATT&CK","Limité aux principes de simulation d''adversaires","Nécessite un accès à la base de code pour l''extraction de contexte"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des MITRE ATT&CK-Frameworks","Begrenzt auf Prinzipien der Gegnersimulation","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Codebasis für die Kontextextraktion"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do framework MITRE ATT&CK","Limitado a princípios de simulação de adversários","Necessita acesso à base de código para extração de contexto"],"ru":["Требует знания фреймворка MITRE ATT&CK","Ограничен принципами симуляции противников","Требует доступа к кодовой базе для извлечения контекста"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بإطار عمل MITRE ATT&CK","محدود بمبادئ محاكاة الخصم","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة البرمجية لاستخراج السياق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
