à appliquer des correctifs suggérés par l''IA de manière sécurisée","de":"Entdecken Sie die API-Muster, um effektive und sichere APIs zu entwerfen. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie von der KI vorgeschlagene Patches sicher anwenden","pt":"Desenvolva habilidades em design de API e tomada de decisões para 2025","ru":"Развивайте навыки проектирования API и принятия решений для 2025 года","ar":"طور مهاراتك في تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات واتخاذ القرارات لعام 2025","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"definition":{"en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"features":{"zh":["API","REST","GraphQL","tRPC","API"],"ja":["API","REST","GraphQL","tRPC","API"],"ko":["API","REST","GraphQL","tRPC","API"],"es":["Diseño de API efectivo","Aplicación segura de parches sugeridos por IA","Principios de diseño para 2025","Selección de patrones de API adecuados","Mejora de la seguridad y escalabilidad de las APIs"],"fr":["Conception d''API efficace","Application sécurisée de correctifs suggérés par l''IA","Principes de conception pour 2025","Sélection de modèles d''API appropriés","Amélioration de la sécurité et de l''évolutivité des API"],"de":["Effektives API-Design","Sichere Anwendung von von der KI vorgeschlagenen Patches","Designprinzipien für 2025","Auswahl geeigneter API-Muster","Verbesserung der Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit von APIs"],"pt":["Princípios de design de API","Tomada de decisões para API","REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC","Nomenclatura de recursos","Métodos HTTP e códigos de status"],"ru":["Принципы проектирования API","Принятие решений для API","REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC","Наименование ресурсов","Методы HTTP и коды состояния"],"ar":["مبادئ تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","اتخاذ القرارات لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات","REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC","تسمية الموارد","طرق HTTP وأكواد الحالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API","REST API","GraphQL API","tRPC API","API","API"],"ja":["API","REST API","GraphQL API","tRPC API","API","API"],"ko":["API","REST API","GraphQL API","tRPC API","API","API"],"es":["patrones de API","diseño de API","seguridad de API","escalabilidad de API","IA para desarrollo","desarrollo de software","principios de diseño","API efectiva"],"fr":["modèles d''API","conception d''API","sécurité d''API","évolutivité d''API","IA pour le développement","développement de logiciels","principes de conception","API efficace"],"de":["API-Muster","API-Design","API-Sicherheit","API-Skalierbarkeit","KI für Entwicklung","Software-Entwicklung","Designprinzipien","effektive API"],"pt":["padrões de API","design de API","desenvolvimento de API","REST","GraphQL","tRPC","nomenclatura de recursos","métodos HTTP"],"ru":["шаблоны API","проектирование API","разработка API","REST","GraphQL","tRPC","наименование ресурсов","методы HTTP"],"ar":["نماذج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","REST","GraphQL","tRPC","تسمية الموارد","طرق HTTP"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-patterns","description":"API design principles and decision-making. REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC selection, response formats, versioning, pagination.","bodyPreview":"# API Patterns\n\n> API design principles and decision-making for 2025.\n> **Learn to THINK, not copy fixed patterns.**\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `api-style.md` | REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC decision tree | Choosing API type |\n| `rest.md` | Resource naming, HTTP methods, status codes | Designing REST API |\n| `","body":"# API Patterns\n\n> API design principles and decision-making for 2025.\n> **Learn to THINK, not copy fixed patterns.**\n\n## 🎯 Selective Reading Rule\n\n**Read ONLY files relevant to the request!** Check the content map, find what you need.\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Content Map\n\n| File | Description | When to Read |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| `api-style.md` | REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC decision tree | Choosing API type |\n| `rest.md` | Resource naming, HTTP methods, status codes | Designing REST API |\n| `response.md` | Envelope pattern, error format, pagination | Response structure |\n| `graphql.md` | Schema design, when to use, security | Considering GraphQL |\n| `trpc.md` | TypeScript monorepo, type safety | TS fullstack projects |\n| `versioning.md` | URI/Header/Query versioning | API evolution planning |\n| `auth.md` | JWT, OAuth, Passkey, API Keys | Auth pattern selection |\n| `rate-limiting.md` | Token bucket, sliding window | API protection |\n| `documentation.md` | OpenAPI/Swagger best practices | Documentation |\n| `security-testing.md` | OWASP API Top 10, auth/authz testing | Security audits |\n\n---\n\n## 🔗 Related Skills\n\n| Need | Skill |\n|------|-------|\n| API implementation | `@[skills/backend-development]` |\n| Data structure | `@[skills/database-design]` |\n| Security details | `@[skills/security-hardening]` |\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Decision Checklist\n\nBefore designing an API:\n\n- [ ] **Asked user about API consumers?**\n- [ ] **Chosen API style for THIS context?** (REST/GraphQL/tRPC)\n- [ ] **Defined consistent response format?**\n- [ ] **Planned versioning strategy?**\n- [ ] **Considered authentication needs?**\n- [ ] **Planned rate limiting?**\n- [ ] **Documentation approach defined?**\n\n---\n\n## ❌ Anti-Patterns\n\n**DON''T:**\n- Default to REST for everything\n- Use verbs in REST endpoints (/getUsers)\n- Return inconsistent response formats\n- Expose internal errors to clients\n- Skip rate limiting\n\n**DO:**\n- Choose API style based on context\n- Ask about client requirements\n- Document thoroughly\n- Use appropriate status codes\n\n---\n\n## Script\n\n| Script | Purpose | Command |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `scripts/api_validator.py` | API endpoint validation | `python scripts/api_validator.py <project_path>` |\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:04:49.668Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for API-focused Agents seeking to master REST, GraphQL, and tRPC design principles","zh":"非常适合专注于API的智能体掌握REST、GraphQL和tRPC设计原则","ja":"APIに焦点を当てたエージェントがREST、GraphQL、tRPCの設計原則を習得するのに理想的です","ko":"API에 중점을 둔 에이전트가 REST, GraphQL 및 tRPC 설계 원칙을 숙달하기에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para agentes enfocados en API que buscan dominar los principios de diseño de REST, GraphQL y tRPC","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur l''API cherchant à maîtriser les principes de conception de REST, GraphQL et tRPC","de":"Ideal für API-fokussierte Agenten, die die Designprinzipien von REST, GraphQL und tRPC meistern möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes focados em API que buscam dominar os princípios de design de REST, GraphQL e tRPC","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на API, стремящихся овладеть принципами проектирования REST, GraphQL и tRPC","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتمحورين حول واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الراغبين في إتقان مبادئ تصميم REST وGraphQL وtRPC"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply API design principles, leveraging decision trees for choosing API types, such as REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC, and implementing best practices for resource naming, HTTP methods, and status codes","zh":"使智能体能够应用API设计原则，利用决策树选择API类型（如REST与GraphQL与tRPC），并实施资源命名、HTTP方法和状态代码的最佳实践","ja":"エージェントがAPI設計原則を適用し、意思決定ツリーを活用してREST対GraphQL対tRPCなどのAPIタイプを選択し、リソース命名、HTTPメソッド、ステータスコードのベストプラクティスを実装することを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 API 설계 원칙을 적용하고, 의사 결정 트리를 활용하여 REST 대 GraphQL 대 tRPC와 같은 API 유형을 선택하며, 리소스 명명, HTTP 메서드 및 상태 코드에 대한 모범 사례를 구현할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar principios de diseño de API, utilizando árboles de decisión para elegir tipos de API, como REST frente a GraphQL frente a tRPC, e implementar las mejores prácticas para el nombramiento de recursos, métodos HTTP y códigos de estado","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les principes de conception d''API, en utilisant des arbres de décision pour choisir les types d''API, tels que REST par rapport à GraphQL par rapport à tRPC, et en mettant en œuvre les meilleures pratiques pour le nommage des ressources, les méthodes HTTP et les codes d''état","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, API-Designprinzipien anzuwenden, indem Entscheidungsbäume zur Auswahl von API-Typen wie REST vs. GraphQL vs. tRPC verwendet werden und beste Praktiken für die Benennung von Ressourcen, HTTP-Methoden und Statuscodes implementiert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar princípios de design de API, utilizando árvores de decisão para escolher tipos de API, como REST vs GraphQL vs tRPC, e implementar as melhores práticas para nomeação de recursos, métodos HTTP e códigos de status","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять принципы проектирования API, используя деревья решений для выбора типов API, таких как REST против GraphQL против tRPC, и реализуя最佳 практики для именования ресурсов, методов HTTP и кодов состояния","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطبيق مبادئ تصميم واجهات برمجة التطبيقات، باستخدام أشجار القرار لاختيار أنواع واجهات برمجة التطبيقات، مثل REST مقابل GraphQL مقابل tRPC، وتنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لتحديد أسماء الموارد وأساليب HTTP وأكواد الحالة"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing scalable REST APIs with proper resource naming and HTTP methods","Evaluating when to use GraphQL vs REST for specific use cases","Applying selective reading rules for efficient API development"],"zh":["设计具有正确资源命名和HTTP方法的可扩展REST API","评估特定用例何时使用GraphQL与REST","应用选择性读取规则以实现高效的API开发"],"ja":["適切なリソース命名とHTTPメソッドを用いたスケーラブルなREST APIの設計","特定のユースケースにおけるGraphQLとRESTの使用タイミングの評価","効率的なAPI開発のための選択的読み取りルールの適用"],"ko":["적절한 리소스 명명 및 HTTP 메서드를 사용한 확장 가능한 REST API 설계","특정 사용 사례에 GraphQL과 REST 중 어떤 것을 사용할지 평가","효율적인 API 개발을 위한 선택적 읽기 규칙 적용"],"es":["Diseñar APIs REST escalables con un nombramiento de recursos y métodos HTTP adecuados","Evaluar cuándo usar GraphQL en lugar de REST para casos de uso específicos","Aplicar reglas de lectura selectiva para un desarrollo de API eficiente"],"fr":["Concevoir des API REST évolutives avec un nommage de ressources et des méthodes HTTP appropriés","Évaluer quand utiliser GraphQL au lieu de REST pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques","Appliquer des règles de lecture sélective pour un développement d''API efficace"],"de":["Entwerfen von skalierbaren REST-APIs mit ordnungsgemäßer Ressourcenbenennung und HTTP-Methoden","Bewerten, wann GraphQL anstelle von REST für bestimmte Anwendungsfälle verwendet werden soll","Anwenden von Regeln für selektives Lesen für eine effiziente API-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Projetar APIs REST escaláveis com nomeação de recursos apropriada e métodos HTTP","Avaliar quando usar GraphQL vs REST para casos de uso específicos","Aplicar regras de leitura seletiva para desenvolvimento eficiente de APIs"],"ru":["Проектировать масштабируемые REST API с правильным именованием ресурсов и методами HTTP","Оценивать, когда использовать GraphQL вместо REST для конкретных случаев использования","Применять правила выбора чтения для эффективного развития API"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST القابلة للتوسيع مع تحديد أسماء الموارد المناسبة وأساليب HTTP","تقييم متى استخدام GraphQL مقابل REST لحالات استخدام محددة","تطبيق قواعد القراءة الانتقائية لتطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات بشكل فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of API design principles","Limited to REST, GraphQL, and tRPC protocols"],"zh":["需要具备API设计原则的知识","仅限于REST、GraphQL和tRPC协议"],"ja":["API設計原則の知識が必要","REST、GraphQL、tRPCプロトコルに限定される"],"ko":["API 설계 원칙에 대한 지식 필요","REST, GraphQL 및 tRPC 프로토콜로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los principios de diseño de API","Limitado a los protocolos REST, GraphQL y tRPC"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en matière de principes de conception d''API","Limité aux protocoles REST, GraphQL et tRPC"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der API-Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf die Protokolle REST, GraphQL und tRPC"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos princípios de design de API","Limitado a protocolos REST, GraphQL e tRPC"],"ru":["Требует знания принципов проектирования API","Ограничен протоколами REST, GraphQL и tRPC"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمبادئ تصميم واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","محدود ببروتوكولات REST وGraphQL وtRPC"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
