de","Application sécurisée de correctifs suggérés par l''IA","Vérification des tâches avec des critères clairs","Ordre logique des tâches avec des dépendances identifiées"],"de":["Unterteilung der Arbeit in klare und überprüfbare Aufgaben","Extraktion des Kontexts der Codebasis","Sichere Anwendung von von der KI vorgeschlagenen Patches","Überprüfung von Aufgaben mit klaren Kriterien","Logische Reihenfolge von Aufgaben mit identifizierten Abhängigkeiten"],"pt":["Extração de contexto de código","Aplicação de patches sugeridos por IA","Verificação de critérios de conclusão","Ordem lógica de tarefas","Trabalho paralelo","Verificação independente"],"ru":["Извлечение контекста кода","Применение патчей, предложенных ИИ","Проверка критериев завершения","Логическая последовательность задач","Параллельная работа","Независимая верификация"],"ar":["استخراج سياق الكود","تطبيق تصحيحات مقترحة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي","التحقق من معايير الانتهاء","الترتيب المنطقي للمهام","العمل المتوازي","التحقق المستقل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["计划编写技能","AI 驱动的代码优化","代码库优化","AI 推荐的补丁","代码质量","效率优化","代码开发","软件开发"],"ja":["プランライティングスキル","AI ドリブンのコード最適化","コードベース最適化","AI 推奨のパッチ","コード品質","効率最適化","コード開発","ソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["계획 작성 스킬","AI 기반 코드 최적화","코드베이스 최적화","AI 추천 패치","코드 품질","효율성 최적화","코드 개발","소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["planificación de escritura de código","IA para desarrolladores","productividad de código","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","optimización de código"],"fr":["planification d''écriture de code","IA pour les développeurs","productivité de code","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","optimisation de code"],"de":["Code-Schreibplanung","KI für Entwickler","Code-Produktivität","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Code-Optimierung"],"pt":["planejamento de escrita","desenvolvimento de software","codificação","IA","extração de contexto","aplicação de patches","verificação de critérios","ordem lógica","trabalho paralelo","verificação independente"],"ru":["планирование написания","разработка программного обеспечения","кодирование","ИИ","извлечение контекста","применение патчей","проверка критериев","логическая последовательность","параллельная работа","независимая верификация"],"ar":["كتابة الخطة","تطوير البرمجيات","البرمجة","الذكاء الاصطناعي","استخراج السياق","تطبيق التصحيحات","التحقق من المعايير","الترتيب المنطقي","العمل المتوازي","التحقق المستقل"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan-writing","description":"Structured task planning with clear breakdowns, dependencies, and verification criteria. Use when implementing features, refactoring, or any multi-step work.","bodyPreview":"# Plan Writing\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a framework for breaking down work into clear, actionable tasks with verification criteria.\n\n## Task Breakdown Principles\n\n### 1. Small, Focused Tasks\n- Each task should take 2-5 minutes\n- One clear outcome per task\n- Independently verifiable\n\n### 2. Clear Verification\n- How do you know it''s done?\n- What can you check/test?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### 3. Logical Ordering\n- Dependencies identified\n- Parallel work w","body":"# Plan Writing\n\n> Source: obra/superpowers\n\n## Overview\nThis skill provides a framework for breaking down work into clear, actionable tasks with verification criteria.\n\n## Task Breakdown Principles\n\n### 1. Small, Focused Tasks\n- Each task should take 2-5 minutes\n- One clear outcome per task\n- Independently verifiable\n\n### 2. Clear Verification\n- How do you know it''s done?\n- What can you check/test?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### 3. Logical Ordering\n- Dependencies identified\n- Parallel work where possible\n- Critical path highlighted\n- **Phase X: Verification is always LAST**\n\n### 4. Dynamic Naming in Project Root\n- Plan files are saved as `{task-slug}.md` in the PROJECT ROOT\n- Name derived from task (e.g., \"add auth\" → `auth-feature.md`)\n- **NEVER** inside `.claude/`, `docs/`, or temp folders\n\n## Planning Principles (NOT Templates!)\n\n> 🔴 **NO fixed templates. Each plan is UNIQUE to the task.**\n\n### Principle 1: Keep It SHORT\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Right |\n|----------|----------|\n| 50 tasks with sub-sub-tasks | 5-10 clear tasks max |\n| Every micro-step listed | Only actionable items |\n| Verbose descriptions | One-line per task |\n\n> **Rule:** If plan is longer than 1 page, it''s too long. Simplify.\n\n---\n\n### Principle 2: Be SPECIFIC, Not Generic\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Right |\n|----------|----------|\n| \"Set up project\" | \"Run `npx create-next-app`\" |\n| \"Add authentication\" | \"Install next-auth, create `/api/auth/[...nextauth].ts`\" |\n| \"Style the UI\" | \"Add Tailwind classes to `Header.tsx`\" |\n\n> **Rule:** Each task should have a clear, verifiable outcome.\n\n---\n\n### Principle 3: Dynamic Content Based on Project Type\n\n**For NEW PROJECT:**\n- What tech stack? (decide first)\n- What''s the MVP? (minimal features)\n- What''s the file structure?\n\n**For FEATURE ADDITION:**\n- Which files are affected?\n- What dependencies needed?\n- How to verify it works?\n\n**For BUG FIX:**\n- What''s the root cause?\n- What file/line to change?\n- How to test the fix?\n\n---\n\n### Principle 4: Scripts Are Project-Specific\n\n> 🔴 **DO NOT copy-paste script commands. Choose based on project type.**\n\n| Project Type | Relevant Scripts |\n|--------------|------------------|\n| Frontend/React | `ux_audit.py`, `accessibility_checker.py` |\n| Backend/API | `api_validator.py`, `security_scan.py` |\n| Mobile | `mobile_audit.py` |\n| Database | `schema_validator.py` |\n| Full-stack | Mix of above based on what you touched |\n\n**Wrong:** Adding all scripts to every plan\n**Right:** Only scripts relevant to THIS task\n\n---\n\n### Principle 5: Verification is Simple\n\n| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Right |\n|----------|----------|\n| \"Verify the component works correctly\" | \"Run `npm run dev`, click button, see toast\" |\n| \"Test the API\" | \"curl localhost:3000/api/users returns 200\" |\n| \"Check styles\" | \"Open browser, verify dark mode toggle works\" |\n\n---\n\n## Plan Structure (Flexible, Not Fixed!)\n\n```\n# [Task Name]\n\n## Goal\nOne sentence: What are we building/fixing?\n\n## Tasks\n- [ ] Task 1: [Specific action] → Verify: [How to check]\n- [ ] Task 2: [Specific action] → Verify: [How to check]\n- [ ] Task 3: [Specific action] → Verify: [How to check]\n\n## Done When\n- [ ] [Main success criteria]\n```\n\n> **That''s it.** No phases, no sub-sections unless truly needed.\n> Keep it minimal. Add complexity only when required.\n\n## Notes\n[Any important considerations]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices (Quick Reference)\n\n1. **Start with goal** - What are we building/fixing?\n2. **Max 10 tasks** - If more, break into multiple plans\n3. **Each task verifiable** - Clear \"done\" criteria\n4. **Project-specific** - No copy-paste templates\n5. **Update as you go** - Mark `[x]` when complete\n\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New project from scratch\n- Adding a feature\n- Fixing a bug (if complex)\n- Refactoring multiple files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:04:59.502Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude, Gemini, or ChatGPT needing structured task management and verification criteria for efficient plan execution.","zh":"适合需要结构化任务管理和验证标准的AI代理，如Claude、Gemini或ChatGPT，以实现高效的计划执行。","ja":"Claude、Gemini、またはChatGPTのような、構造化されたタスク管理とバリデーション基準が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 작업 관리와 효율적인 계획 실행을 위한 검증 기준이 필요한 Claude, Gemini 또는 ChatGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude, Gemini o ChatGPT que necesitan una gestión de tareas estructurada y criterios de verificación para una ejecución de planes eficiente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude, Gemini ou ChatGPT nécessitant une gestion de tâches structurée et des critères de vérification pour une exécution de plans efficace.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude, Gemini oder ChatGPT, die eine strukturierte Aufgabenverwaltung und Überprüfungskriterien für eine effiziente Planausführung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude, Gemini ou ChatGPT que necessitam de gerenciamento de tarefas estruturado e critérios de verificação para execução de planos eficiente.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, Gemini или ChatGPT, которые нуждаются в структурированном управлении задачами и критериях проверки для эффективного выполнения планов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude و Gemini و ChatGPT الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مهام منظمة ومعايير التحقق لتنفيذ الخطة بكفاءة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to break down complex work into small, focused tasks with clear verification criteria, utilizing logical ordering and dependency identification for seamless execution, while safely applying AI-suggested patches with preview.","zh":"赋予代理人将复杂工作分解为小型、专注的任务的能力，并具有明确的验证标准，利用逻辑顺序和依赖关系识别以实现无缝执行，同时安全地应用AI建议的补丁并预览。","ja":"複雑な作業を小さなタスクに分解し、明確なバリデーション基準を設定するエージェントの能力を提供し、論理的な順序と依存関係の識別を利用して無停止の実行を実現し、AIの提案によるパッチを安全に適用し、プレビューする。","ko":"복잡한 작업을 작은 작업으로 분해하고 명확한 검증 기준을 설정하여 논리적 순서와 의존성 식별을 통해 무중단 실행을 가능하게 하며, AI가 제안한 패치를 안전하게 적용하고 미리 보는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes dividir el trabajo complejo en tareas pequeñas y enfocadas con criterios de verificación claros, utilizando un orden lógico y la identificación de dependencias para una ejecución sin problemas, al tiempo que aplica de manera segura parches sugeridos por la IA con vista previa.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diviser le travail complexe en tâches petites et ciblées avec des critères de vérification clairs, en utilisant un ordre logique et l''identification des dépendances pour une exécution sans problème, tout en appliquant de manière sécurisée des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec aperçu.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Arbeit in kleine, fokussierte Aufgaben mit klaren Überprüfungskriterien zu unterteilen, indem logische Reihenfolge und Abhängigkeitsidentifizierung für eine reibungslose Ausführung verwendet werden, während sichergestellt wird, dass von der KI vorgeschlagene Patches mit Vorschau sicher angewendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dividir o trabalho complexo em tarefas pequenas e focadas com critérios de verificação claros, utilizando ordenação lógica e identificação de dependência para execução sem interrupções, aplicando patches sugeridos por IA com pré-visualização de forma segura.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разбить сложную работу на небольшие, сосредоточенные задачи с четкими критериями проверки, используя логическую упорядоченность и определение зависимости для бесперебойного выполнения, а также безопасно применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, с предварительным просмотром.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تقسيم العمل المعقد إلى مهام صغيرة ومركزة مع معايير التحقق الواضحة، باستخدام الترتيب المنطقي وتحديد الاعتماد لتنفيذ بدون انقطاع، مع تطبيق التصحيحات المقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة بأمان."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task breakdown for large-scale projects","Generating verification criteria for independently verifiable tasks","Debugging task dependencies for parallel work optimization"],"zh":["大规模项目的自动任务分解","独立可验证任务的验证标准生成","并行工作优化的任务依赖调试"],"ja":["大規模プロジェクトの自動タスク分解","独立して検証可能なタスクのバリデーション基準の生成","並列作業の最適化のためのタスク依存関係のデバッグ"],"ko":["대규모 프로젝트의 자동 작업 분해","독립적으로 검증 가능한 작업의 검증 기준 생성","병렬 작업 최적화의 작업 의존성 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la descomposición de tareas para proyectos a gran escala","Generación de criterios de verificación para tareas verificables de forma independiente","Depuración de dependencias de tareas para la optimización del trabajo paralelo"],"fr":["Automatisation de la décomposition des tâches pour les projets à grande échelle","Génération de critères de vérification pour les tâches vérifiables de manière indépendante","Débogage des dépendances de tâches pour l''optimisation du travail parallèle"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgabenzerlegung für Großprojekte","Erzeugung von Überprüfungskriterien für unabhängig überprüfbare Aufgaben","Fehlerbehebung von Aufgabenabhängigkeiten für die Optimierung der Parallelarbeit"],"pt":["Automatizar a quebra de tarefas para projetos em larga escala","Gerar critérios de verificação para tarefas independentemente verificáveis","Depurar dependências de tarefas para otimização de trabalho paralelo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать разбиение задач для крупномасштабных проектов","Генерировать критерии проверки для независимо проверяемых задач","Отлаживать зависимости задач для оптимизации параллельной работы"],"ar":["أتمتة تقسيم المهام لمشاريع كبيرة النطاق","توليد معايير التحقق للمهام التي يمكن التحقق منها بشكل مستقل","تصحيح أخطاء зависимости المهام لتحسين العمل الموازي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear task outcomes and expected outputs","Dependent on logical ordering and dependency identification"],"zh":["需要明确的任务结果和预期输出","依赖于逻辑顺序和依赖关系识别"],"ja":["明確なタスクの結果と予想される出力が必要","論理的な順序と依存関係の識別に依存する"],"ko":["명확한 작업 결과와 예상 출력이 필요","논리적 순서와 의존성 식별에 의존"],"es":["Requiere resultados de tareas claros y salidas esperadas","Depende del orden lógico y la identificación de dependencias"],"fr":["Nécessite des résultats de tâches clairs et des sorties attendues","Dépend de l''ordre logique et de l''identification des dépendances"],"de":["Benötigt klare Aufgabenergebnisse und erwartete Ausgaben","Hängt von logischer Reihenfolge und Abhängigkeitsidentifizierung ab"],"pt":["Exige resultados de tarefas claros e saídas esperadas","Depende da ordenação lógica e identificação de dependência"],"ru":["Требует четких результатов задач и ожидаемых выходных данных","Зависит от логической упорядоченности и определения зависимости"],"ar":["يتطلب نتائج مهام واضحة ومخرجات متوقعة","يعتمد على الترتيب المنطقي وتحديد الاعتماد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
