スキルは、コードの品質とセキュリティを確保するための重要なステップであり、複数のエコシステムのコード検証とLintのベストプラクティスをカバーする","ko":"lint와 validate 기술은 코드 품질과 보안을 확보하기 위한 중요한 단계로 여러 생태계의 코드 검사와 유효성 검증 모범 사례를 다룹니다","es":"El skill de lint y validación garantiza que el código sea revisado y validado después de cada cambio, asegurando la calidad y seguridad del mismo","fr":"Le skill de linter et de validation garantit que le code est examiné et validé après chaque modification, assurant sa qualité et sa sécurité","de":"Das Lint- und Validierungsskill stellt sicher, dass der Code nach jedem Änderung überprüft und validiert wird, um dessen Qualität und Sicherheit zu gewährlei...","pt":"O skill de lint e validação ajuda a garantir a qualidade do código, executando ferramentas de validação após cada alteração","ru":"Навык линтинга и проверки помогает обеспечить качество кода, запуская инструменты проверки после каждого изменения","ar":"مهارة التنقيح و التحقق تساعد على ضمان جودة الشفرة، من خلال تشغيل أدوات التحقق بعد كل تعديل","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持Node.js和TypeScript生态系统","支持Python生态系统","代码检查和验证","安全性审计","自动修复代码错误"],"ja":["Node.jsとTypeScriptエコシステムをサポート","Pythonエコシステムをサポート","コード検証とLint","セキュリティオーディット","コードの自動修正"],"ko":["Node.js와 TypeScript 생태계 지원","Python 생태계 지원","코드 검사 및 유효성 검증","보안 감사","코드 자동 수정"],"es":["Revisión de código con herramientas de linter","Validación de tipos en Node.js y TypeScript","Análisis de seguridad con npm audit y Bandit","Soporte para Python con Ruff y MyPy","Integración con flujos de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["Révision de code avec des outils de linter","Validation de types dans Node.js et TypeScript","Analyse de sécurité avec npm audit et Bandit","Prise en charge de Python avec Ruff et MyPy","Intégration avec les flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Code-Überprüfung mit Linter-Tools","Typ-Validierung in Node.js und TypeScript","Sicherheitsanalyse mit npm audit und Bandit","Unterstützung für Python mit Ruff und MyPy","Integration in Entwicklungsworkflows"],"pt":["Execução de ferramentas de lint para Node.js e Python","Verificação de tipos com TypeScript e MyPy","Análise de segurança com npm audit e Bandit","Correção automática de erros com eslint e ruff","Suporte a múltiplos ecossistemas"],"ru":["Запуск инструментов линтинга для Node.js и Python","Проверка типов с помощью TypeScript и MyPy","Анализ безопасности с помощью npm audit и Bandit","Автоматическая исправление ошибок с помощью eslint и ruff","Поддержка нескольких экосистем"],"ar":["تشغيل أدوات التنقيح ل Node.js و Python","التحقق من الأنواع مع TypeScript و MyPy","تحليل الأمان مع npm audit و Bandit","تصحيح автомático للأخطاء مع eslint و ruff","دعم متعددة البيئات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码检查","代码验证","lint","validate","Node.js","TypeScript","Python","代码质量","代码安全性"],"ja":["コード検証","コードLint","validate","Node.js","TypeScript","Python","コード品質","コードセキュリティ"],"ko":["코드 검사","코드 유효성 검증","lint","validate","Node.js","TypeScript","Python","코드 품질","코드 보안"],"es":["lint y validación","calidad del código","seguridad del código","Node.js","TypeScript","Python","Ruff","MyPy","npm audit","Bandit"],"fr":["linter et validation","qualité du code","sécurité du code","Node.js","TypeScript","Python","Ruff","MyPy","npm audit","Bandit"],"de":["Lint und Validierung","Code-Qualität","Code-Sicherheit","Node.js","TypeScript","Python","Ruff","MyPy","npm audit","Bandit"],"pt":["lint","validação","código","qualidade","Node.js","Python","TypeScript","MyPy","npm audit","Bandit"],"ru":["линтинг","проверка","код","качество","Node.js","Python","TypeScript","MyPy","npm audit","Bandit"],"ar":["التنقيح","التحقق","الشفرة","الجودة","Node.js","Python","TypeScript","MyPy","npm audit","Bandit"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.541Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"lint-and-validate","description":"Automatic quality control, linting, and static analysis procedures. Use after every code modification to ensure syntax correctness and project standards. Triggers onKeywords: lint, format, check, validate, types, static analysis.","bodyPreview":"# Lint and Validate Skill\n\n> **MANDATORY:** Run appropriate validation tools after EVERY code change. Do not finish a task until the code is error-free.\n\n### Procedures by Ecosystem\n\n#### Node.js / TypeScript\n1. **Lint/Fix:** `npm run lint` or `npx eslint \"path\" --fix`\n2. **Types:** `npx tsc --noEmit`\n3. **Security:** `npm audit --audit-level=high`\n\n#### Python\n1. **Linter (Ruff):** `ruff check \"path\" --fix` (Fast & Modern)\n2. **Security (Bandit):** `bandit -r \"path\" -ll`\n3. **Types (MyPy):** `m","body":"# Lint and Validate Skill\n\n> **MANDATORY:** Run appropriate validation tools after EVERY code change. Do not finish a task until the code is error-free.\n\n### Procedures by Ecosystem\n\n#### Node.js / TypeScript\n1. **Lint/Fix:** `npm run lint` or `npx eslint \"path\" --fix`\n2. **Types:** `npx tsc --noEmit`\n3. **Security:** `npm audit --audit-level=high`\n\n#### Python\n1. **Linter (Ruff):** `ruff check \"path\" --fix` (Fast & Modern)\n2. **Security (Bandit):** `bandit -r \"path\" -ll`\n3. **Types (MyPy):** `mypy \"path\"`\n\n## The Quality Loop\n1. **Write/Edit Code**\n2. **Run Audit:** `npm run lint && npx tsc --noEmit`\n3. **Analyze Report:** Check the \"FINAL AUDIT REPORT\" section.\n4. **Fix & Repeat:** Submitting code with \"FINAL AUDIT\" failures is NOT allowed.\n\n## Error Handling\n- If `lint` fails: Fix the style or syntax issues immediately.\n- If `tsc` fails: Correct type mismatches before proceeding.\n- If no tool is configured: Check the project root for `.eslintrc`, `tsconfig.json`, `pyproject.toml` and suggest creating one.\n\n---\n**Strict Rule:** No code should be committed or reported as \"done\" without passing these checks.\n\n---\n\n## Scripts\n\n| Script | Purpose | Command |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| `scripts/lint_runner.py` | Unified lint check | `python scripts/lint_runner.py <project_path>` |\n| `scripts/type_coverage.py` | Type coverage analysis | `python scripts/type_coverage.py <project_path>` |\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:06:18.765Z","qualityScore":25}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/copywriting', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'IzaCenter', 'claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter', 'copywriting', 0, 0, 20, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.541Z', '2026-02-19T02:22:42.149Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/copywriting","name":"copywriting","description":{"zh":"copywriting","ja":"copywriting","ko":"copywriting","es":"La redacción de copias publicitarias es el proceso de crear contenido de marketing claro y creíble que se alinea con las metas del negocio","fr":"La création de copies publicitaires est le processus de création de contenu de marketing clair et crédible qui correspond aux objectifs de l''entreprise","de":"Die Erstellung von Werbekopien ist der Prozess der Erstellung von klarer und glaubwürdiger Marketinginhalte, die mit den Geschäftszielen übereinstimmen","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"copywriting","ja":"copywriting","ko":"copywriting","es":"Redacción de copias publicitarias efectivas","fr":"Création de copies publicitaires efficaces","de":"Erstellung von effektiven Werbekopien","en":"copywriting"},"description":{"zh":"copywriting","ja":"copywriting","ko":"copywriting","es":"La redacción de copias publicitarias es el proceso de crear contenido de marketing claro y creíble que se alinea con las metas del negocio","fr":"La création de copies publicitaires est le processus de création de contenu de marketing clair et crédible qui correspond aux objectifs de l''entreprise","de":"Die Erstellung von Werbekopien ist der Prozess der Erstellung von klarer und glaubwürdiger Marketinginhalte, die mit den Geschäftszielen übereinstimmen","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["clear","credible","action-oriented marketing copy","aligns with user intent and business goals","prevents vague or hype-driven messaging","prevents misaligned CTAs"],"ja":["clear","credible","action-oriented marketing copy","aligns with user intent and business goals","prevents vague or hype-driven messaging","prevents misaligned CTAs"],"ko":["clear","credible","action-oriented marketing copy","aligns with user intent and business goals","prevents vague or hype-driven messaging","prevents misaligned CTAs"],"es":["Contenido de marketing claro y creíble","Orientado a la acción y al éxito del negocio","Evita la escritura vaga o engañosa","No permite la fabricación de reclamos o estadísticas","Se centra en el usuario y sus necesidades"],"fr":["Contenu de marketing clair et crédible","Orienté vers l''action et le succès de l''entreprise","Évite l''écriture vague ou trompeuse","N''autorise pas la fabrication de réclames ou de statistiques","Se concentre sur l''utilisateur et ses besoins"],"de":["Klarer und glaubwürdiger Marketinginhalt","Orientiert an der Aktion und dem Erfolg des Geschäfts","Vermeidet vage oder irreführende Schreibweise","Erlaubt keine Erfindung von Ansprüchen oder Statistiken","Konzentriert sich auf den Benutzer und seine Bedürfnisse"]},"keywords":{"zh":["copywriting","marketing copy","user intent","business goals","conversion copywriter","action-oriented marketing"],"ja":["copywriting","marketing copy","user intent","business goals","conversion copywriter","action-oriented marketing"],"ko":["copywriting","marketing copy","user intent","business goals","conversion copywriter","action-oriented marketing"],"es":["redacción de copias publicitarias","contenido de marketing","copywriting","marketing digital","publicidad en línea","escritura para negocios"],"fr":["création de copies publicitaires","contenu de marketing","copywriting","marketing digital","publicité en ligne","écriture pour les entreprises"],"de":["Erstellung von Werbekopien","Marketinginhalt","Copywriting","Digitales Marketing","Online-Werbung","Schreiben für Unternehmen"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.541Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"copywriting","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Copywriting\n\n## Purpose\n\nProduce **clear, credible, and action-oriented marketing copy** that aligns with\nuser intent and business goals.\n\nThis skill exists to prevent:\n- writing before understanding the audience\n- vague or hype-driven messaging\n- misaligned CTAs\n- overclaiming or fabricated proof\n- untestable copy\n\nYou may **not** fabricate claims, statistics, testimonials, or guarantees.\n\n---\n\n## Operating Mode\n\nYou are operating as an **expert conversion copywriter**, not a brand poet.\n\n- C","body":"# Copywriting\n\n## Purpose\n\nProduce **clear, credible, and action-oriented marketing copy** that aligns with\nuser intent and business goals.\n\nThis skill exists to prevent:\n- writing before understanding the audience\n- vague or hype-driven messaging\n- misaligned CTAs\n- overclaiming or fabricated proof\n- untestable copy\n\nYou may **not** fabricate claims, statistics, testimonials, or guarantees.\n\n---\n\n## Operating Mode\n\nYou are operating as an **expert conversion copywriter**, not a brand poet.\n\n- Clarity beats cleverness\n- Outcomes beat features\n- Specificity beats buzzwords\n- Honesty beats hype\n\nYour job is to **help the right reader take the right action**.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1 — Context Gathering (Mandatory)\n\nBefore writing any copy, gather or confirm the following.\nIf information is missing, ask for it **before proceeding**.\n\n### 1️⃣ Page Purpose\n- Page type (homepage, landing page, pricing, feature, about)\n- ONE primary action (CTA)\n- Secondary action (if any)\n\n### 2️⃣ Audience\n- Target customer or role\n- Primary problem they are trying to solve\n- What they have already tried\n- Main objections or hesitations\n- Language they use to describe the problem\n\n### 3️⃣ Product / Offer\n- What is being offered\n- Key differentiator vs alternatives\n- Primary outcome or transformation\n- Available proof (numbers, testimonials, case studies)\n\n### 4️⃣ Context\n- Traffic source (ads, organic, email, referrals)\n- Awareness level (unaware, problem-aware, solution-aware, product-aware)\n- What visitors already know or expect\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2 — Copy Brief Lock (Hard Gate)\n\nBefore writing any copy, you MUST present a **Copy Brief Summary** and pause.\n\n### Copy Brief Summary\nSummarize in 4–6 bullets:\n- Page goal\n- Target audience\n- Core value proposition\n- Primary CTA\n- Traffic / awareness context\n\n### Assumptions\nList any assumptions explicitly (e.g. awareness level, urgency, sophistication).\n\nThen ask:\n\n> “Does this copy brief accurately reflect what we’re trying to achieve?\n> Please confirm or correct anything before I write copy.”\n\n**Do NOT proceed until confirmation is given.**\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3 — Copywriting Principles\n\n### Core Principles (Non-Negotiable)\n\n- **Clarity over cleverness**\n- **Benefits over features**\n- **Specificity over vagueness**\n- **Customer language over company language**\n- **One idea per section**\n\nAlways connect:\n> Feature → Benefit → Outcome\n\n---\n\n## Writing Style Rules\n\n### Style Guidelines\n- Simple over complex\n- Active over passive\n- Confident over hedged\n- Show outcomes instead of adjectives\n- Avoid buzzwords unless customers use them\n\n### Claim Discipline\n- No fabricated data or testimonials\n- No implied guarantees unless explicitly stated\n- No exaggerated speed or certainty\n- If proof is missing, mark placeholders clearly\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4 — Page Structure Framework\n\n### Above the Fold\n\n**Headline**\n- Single most important message\n- Specific value proposition\n- Outcome-focused\n\n**Subheadline**\n- Adds clarity or context\n- 1–2 sentences max\n\n**Primary CTA**\n- Action-oriented\n- Describes what the user gets\n\n---\n\n### Core Sections (Use as Appropriate)\n\n- Social proof (logos, stats, testimonials)\n- Problem / pain articulation\n- Solution & key benefits (3–5 max)\n- How it works (3–4 steps)\n- Objection handling (FAQ, comparisons, guarantees)\n- Final CTA with recap and risk reduction\n\nAvoid stacking features without narrative flow.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5 — Writing the Copy\n\nWhen writing copy, provide:\n\n### Page Copy\nOrganized by section with clear labels:\n- Headline\n- Subheadline\n- CTAs\n- Section headers\n- Body copy\n\n### Alternatives\nProvide 2–3 options for:\n- Headlines\n- Primary CTAs\n\nEach option must include a brief rationale.\n\n### Annotations\nFor key sections, explain:\n- Why this copy was chosen\n- Which principle it applies\n- What alternatives were considered\n\n---\n\n## Testability Guidance\n\nWrite copy with testing in mind:\n- Clear, isolated value propositions\n- Headlines and CTAs that can be A/B tested\n- Avoid combining multiple messages into one element\n\nIf the copy is intended for experimentation, recommend next-step testing.\n\n---\n\n## Completion Criteria (Hard Stop)\n\nThis skill is complete ONLY when:\n- Copy brief has been confirmed\n- Page copy is delivered in structured form\n- Headline and CTA alternatives are provided\n- Assumptions are documented\n- Copy is ready for review, editing, or testing\n\n---\n\n## Key Principles (Summary)\n\n- Understand before writing\n- Make assumptions explicit\n- One page, one goal\n- One section, one idea\n- Benefits before features\n- Honest claims only\n\n---\n\n## Final Reminder\n\nGood copy does not persuade everyone.\nIt persuades **the right person** to take **the right action**.\n\nIf the copy feels clever but unclear,  \nrewrite it until it feels obvious.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:22:42.149Z","qualityScore":20}');
