"es":"Implementa metodologías de seguridad y herramientas de investigación para una ciberseguridad efectiva","fr":"Mettez en œuvre des méthodologies de sécurité et des outils de recherche pour une cybersécurité efficace","de":"Implementieren Sie Sicherheitsmethoden und -werkzeuge für eine effektive Cybersicherheit","pt":"Implemente metodologias de segurança comprovadas para reconhecimento e descoberta de vulnerabilidades","ru":"Реализуйте проверенные методологии безопасности для разведки и обнаружения уязвимостей","ar":"نفذ metodologias أمان موثوقة للكشف عن الثغرات والاختراقات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["实现有效的侦察和漏洞发现","自动化常见任务","维持对攻击面的彻底覆盖","支持 Linux 基础的攻击机器","支持 Bug 赏金狩猎"],"ja":["効果的な偵察と脆弱性の発見を実現","一般的なタスクの自動化","攻撃面の徹底的なカバーを維持","Linux ベースの攻撃マシンのサポート","バグバウンティハンティングのサポート"],"ko":["효과적인 정찰과 취약점 발견을 수행","일반적인 작업의 자동화","공격面的 철저한 커버리를 유지","Linux 기반 공격 머신 지원","버그 바운티 헌팅 지원"],"es":["Automatización de tareas comunes","Cobertura exhaustiva de superficies de ataque","Herramientas de investigación de seguridad","Metodologías de seguridad probadas","Detección de vulnerabilidades"],"fr":["Automatisation des tâches courantes","Couverture exhaustive des surfaces d''attaque","Outils de recherche de sécurité","Méthodologies de sécurité éprouvées","Détection de vulnérabilités"],"de":["Automatisierung häufiger Aufgaben","Umfassende Abdeckung von Angriffsoberflächen","Sicherheitsforschungstools","Erprobte Sicherheitsmethoden","Schwachstellenerkennung"],"pt":["Reconhecimento de alvos","Descoberta de vulnerabilidades","Caça a bugs","Automatização de tarefas comuns","Cobertura completa de superfícies de ataque"],"ru":["Разведка целей","Обнаружение уязвимостей","Охота за багами","Автоматизация общих задач","Полное покрытие поверхностей атаки"],"ar":["كشف عن الأهداف","اكتشاف الثغرات","البحث عن الأخطاء","توفير المهام الشائعة","التغطية الكاملة لسطح الهجوم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["红队工具","网络安全测试","渗透测试","Bug 赏金狩猎","Linux 基础的攻击机器","自动化安全测试"],"ja":["レッドチームツール","ネットワークセキュリティテスト","ペネトレーションテスト","バグバウンティハンティング","Linux ベースの攻撃マシン","自動化セキュリティテスト"],"ko":["레드 팀 도구","네트워크 보안 테스트","침투 테스트","버그 바운티 헌팅","Linux 기반 공격 머신","자동화 보안 테스트"],"es":["seguridad cibernética","metodología de Red Team","herramientas de seguridad","investigación de seguridad","vulnerabilidades","bug bounty"],"fr":["cybersécurité","méthodologie d''Équipe Rouge","outils de sécurité","recherche de sécurité","vulnérabilités","chasse aux bugs"],"de":["Cybersicherheit","Red-Team-Methodik","Sicherheitstools","Sicherheitsforschung","Schwachstellen","Bug-Bounty-Programme"],"pt":["Red Team","Segurança cibernética","Reconhecimento","Vulnerabilidades","Caça a bugs","Automatização","Superfícies de ataque"],"ru":["Red Team","Кибербезопасность","Разведка","Уязвимости","Охота за багами","Автоматизация","Поверхности атаки"],"ar":["فريق红","أمان السيبراني","كشف","الثغرات","البحث عن الأخطاء","توفير","سطح الهجوم"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.541Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Red Team Tools and Methodology","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to follow red team methodology, perform bug bounty hunting, automate reconnaissance, hunt for XSS vulnerabilities, enumerate subdomains, or needs security researcher techniques and tool configurations from top bug bounty hunters.","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"# Red Team Tools and Methodology\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement proven methodologies and tool workflows from top security researchers for effective reconnaissance, vulnerability discovery, and bug bounty hunting. Automate common tasks while maintaining thorough coverage of attack surfaces.\n\n## Inputs/Prerequisites\n\n- Target scope definition (domains, IP ranges, applications)\n- Linux-based attack machine (Kali, Ubuntu)\n- Bug bounty program rules and scope\n- Tool dependencies installed (Go, Python, Ruby)","body":"# Red Team Tools and Methodology\n\n## Purpose\n\nImplement proven methodologies and tool workflows from top security researchers for effective reconnaissance, vulnerability discovery, and bug bounty hunting. Automate common tasks while maintaining thorough coverage of attack surfaces.\n\n## Inputs/Prerequisites\n\n- Target scope definition (domains, IP ranges, applications)\n- Linux-based attack machine (Kali, Ubuntu)\n- Bug bounty program rules and scope\n- Tool dependencies installed (Go, Python, Ruby)\n- API keys for various services (Shodan, Censys, etc.)\n\n## Outputs/Deliverables\n\n- Comprehensive subdomain enumeration\n- Live host discovery and technology fingerprinting\n- Identified vulnerabilities and attack vectors\n- Automated recon pipeline outputs\n- Documented findings for reporting\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### 1. Project Tracking and Acquisitions\n\nSet up reconnaissance tracking:\n\n```bash\n# Create project structure\nmkdir -p target/{recon,vulns,reports}\ncd target\n\n# Find acquisitions using Crunchbase\n# Search manually for subsidiary companies\n\n# Get ASN for targets\namass intel -org \"Target Company\" -src\n\n# Alternative ASN lookup\ncurl -s \"https://bgp.he.net/search?search=targetcompany&commit=Search\"\n```\n\n### 2. Subdomain Enumeration\n\nComprehensive subdomain discovery:\n\n```bash\n# Create wildcards file\necho \"target.com\" > wildcards\n\n# Run Amass passively\namass enum -passive -d target.com -src -o amass_passive.txt\n\n# Run Amass actively\namass enum -active -d target.com -src -o amass_active.txt\n\n# Use Subfinder\nsubfinder -d target.com -silent -o subfinder.txt\n\n# Asset discovery\ncat wildcards | assetfinder --subs-only | anew domains.txt\n\n# Alternative subdomain tools\nfindomain -t target.com -o\n\n# Generate permutations with dnsgen\ncat domains.txt | dnsgen - | httprobe > permuted.txt\n\n# Combine all sources\ncat amass_*.txt subfinder.txt | sort -u > all_subs.txt\n```\n\n### 3. Live Host Discovery\n\nIdentify responding hosts:\n\n```bash\n# Check which hosts are live with httprobe\ncat domains.txt | httprobe -c 80 --prefer-https | anew hosts.txt\n\n# Use httpx for more details\ncat domains.txt | httpx -title -tech-detect -status-code -o live_hosts.txt\n\n# Alternative with massdns\nmassdns -r resolvers.txt -t A -o S domains.txt > resolved.txt\n```\n\n### 4. Technology Fingerprinting\n\nIdentify technologies for targeted attacks:\n\n```bash\n# Whatweb scanning\nwhatweb -i hosts.txt -a 3 -v > tech_stack.txt\n\n# Nuclei technology detection\nnuclei -l hosts.txt -t technologies/ -o tech_nuclei.txt\n\n# Wappalyzer (if available)\n# Browser extension for manual review\n```\n\n### 5. Content Discovery\n\nFind hidden endpoints and files:\n\n```bash\n# Directory bruteforce with ffuf\nffuf -ac -v -u https://target.com/FUZZ -w /usr/share/seclists/Discovery/Web-Content/raft-medium-directories.txt\n\n# Historical URLs from Wayback\nwaybackurls target.com | tee wayback.txt\n\n# Find all URLs with gau\ngau target.com | tee all_urls.txt\n\n# Parameter discovery\ncat all_urls.txt | grep \"=\" | sort -u > params.txt\n\n# Generate custom wordlist from historical data\ncat all_urls.txt | unfurl paths | sort -u > custom_wordlist.txt\n```\n\n### 6. Application Analysis (Jason Haddix Method)\n\n**Heat Map Priority Areas:**\n\n1. **File Uploads** - Test for injection, XXE, SSRF, shell upload\n2. **Content Types** - Filter Burp for multipart forms\n3. **APIs** - Look for hidden methods, lack of auth\n4. **Profile Sections** - Stored XSS, custom fields\n5. **Integrations** - SSRF through third parties\n6. **Error Pages** - Exotic injection points\n\n**Analysis Questions:**\n- How does the app pass data? (Params, API, Hybrid)\n- Where does the app talk about users? (UID, UUID endpoints)\n- Does the site have multi-tenancy or user levels?\n- Does it have a unique threat model?\n- How does the site handle XSS/CSRF?\n- Has the site had past writeups/exploits?\n\n### 7. Automated XSS Hunting\n\n```bash\n# ParamSpider for parameter extraction\npython3 paramspider.py --domain target.com -o params.txt\n\n# Filter with Gxss\ncat params.txt | Gxss -p test\n\n# Dalfox for XSS testing\ncat params.txt | dalfox pipe --mining-dict params.txt -o xss_results.txt\n\n# Alternative workflow\nwaybackurls target.com | grep \"=\" | qsreplace ''\"><script>alert(1)</script>'' | while read url; do\n    curl -s \"$url\" | grep -q ''alert(1)'' && echo \"$url\"\ndone > potential_xss.txt\n```\n\n### 8. Vulnerability Scanning\n\n```bash\n# Nuclei comprehensive scan\nnuclei -l hosts.txt -t ~/nuclei-templates/ -o nuclei_results.txt\n\n# Check for common CVEs\nnuclei -l hosts.txt -t cves/ -o cve_results.txt\n\n# Web vulnerabilities\nnuclei -l hosts.txt -t vulnerabilities/ -o vuln_results.txt\n```\n\n### 9. API Enumeration\n\n**Wordlists for API fuzzing:**\n\n```bash\n# Enumerate API endpoints\nffuf -u https://target.com/api/FUZZ -w /usr/share/seclists/Discovery/Web-Content/api/api-endpoints.txt\n\n# Test API versions\nffuf -u https://target.com/api/v1/FUZZ -w api_wordlist.txt\nffuf -u https://target.com/api/v2/FUZZ -w api_wordlist.txt\n\n# Check for hidden methods\nfor method in GET POST PUT DELETE PATCH; do\n    curl -X $method https://target.com/api/users -v\ndone\n```\n\n### 10. Automated Recon Script\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\ndomain=$1\n\nif [[ -z $domain ]]; then\n    echo \"Usage: ./recon.sh <domain>\"\n    exit 1\nfi\n\nmkdir -p \"$domain\"\n\n# Subdomain enumeration\necho \"[*] Enumerating subdomains...\"\nsubfinder -d \"$domain\" -silent > \"$domain/subs.txt\"\n\n# Live host discovery\necho \"[*] Finding live hosts...\"\ncat \"$domain/subs.txt\" | httpx -title -tech-detect -status-code > \"$domain/live.txt\"\n\n# URL collection\necho \"[*] Collecting URLs...\"\ncat \"$domain/live.txt\" | waybackurls > \"$domain/urls.txt\"\n\n# Nuclei scanning\necho \"[*] Running Nuclei...\"\nnuclei -l \"$domain/live.txt\" -o \"$domain/nuclei.txt\"\n\necho \"[+] Recon complete!\"\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Essential Tools\n\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| Amass | Subdomain enumeration |\n| Subfinder | Fast subdomain discovery |\n| httpx/httprobe | Live host detection |\n| ffuf | Content discovery |\n| Nuclei | Vulnerability scanning |\n| Burp Suite | Manual testing |\n| Dalfox | XSS automation |\n| waybackurls | Historical URL mining |\n\n### Key API Endpoints to Check\n\n```\n/api/v1/users\n/api/v1/admin\n/api/v1/profile\n/api/users/me\n/api/config\n/api/debug\n/api/swagger\n/api/graphql\n```\n\n### XSS Filter Testing\n\n```html\n<!-- Test encoding handling -->\n<h1><img><table>\n<script>\n%3Cscript%3E\n%253Cscript%253E\n%26lt;script%26gt;\n```\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Respect program scope boundaries\n- Avoid DoS or fuzzing on production without permission\n- Rate limit requests to avoid blocking\n- Some tools may generate false positives\n- API keys required for full functionality of some tools\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Quick Subdomain Recon\n\n```bash\nsubfinder -d target.com | httpx -title | tee results.txt\n```\n\n### Example 2: XSS Hunting Pipeline\n\n```bash\nwaybackurls target.com | grep \"=\" | qsreplace \"test\" | httpx -silent | dalfox pipe\n```\n\n### Example 3: Comprehensive Scan\n\n```bash\n# Full recon chain\namass enum -d target.com | httpx | nuclei -t ~/nuclei-templates/\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Rate limited | Use proxy rotation, reduce concurrency |\n| Too many results | Focus on specific technology stacks |\n| False positives | Manually verify findings before reporting |\n| Missing subdomains | Combine multiple enumeration sources |\n| API key errors | Verify keys in config files |\n| Tools not found | Install Go tools with `go install` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:23:35.597Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cybersecurity Agents needing advanced reconnaissance and vulnerability discovery capabilities using Linux-based attack machines and tools like Go, Python, and Ruby.","zh":"非常适合需要使用基于Linux的攻击机和Go、Python、Ruby等工具进行高级侦察和漏洞发现的网络安全代理。","ja":"Linuxベースの攻撃マシンとGo、Python、Rubyなどのツールを使用して高度な偵察と脆弱性の発見を行う必要があるサイバーセキュリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 정찰 및 취약점 발견 기능을 사용하는 리눅스 기반 공격 기계 및 Go, Python 및 Ruby와 같은 도구가 필요한 사이버 보안 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Cybersecurity Agents needing advanced reconnaissance and vulnerability discovery capabilities using Linux-based attack machines and tools like Go, Python, and Ruby.","fr":"Perfect for Cybersecurity Agents needing advanced reconnaissance and vulnerability discovery capabilities using Linux-based attack machines and tools like Go, Python, and Ruby.","de":"Perfect for Cybersecurity Agents needing advanced reconnaissance and vulnerability discovery capabilities using Linux-based attack machines and tools like Go, Python, and Ruby.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Cibersegurança que precisam de capacidades avançadas de reconhecimento e descoberta de vulnerabilidades usando máquinas e ferramentas baseadas em Linux, como Go, Python e Ruby.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кибербезопасности, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разведки и обнаружения уязвимостей с использованием машин и инструментов на основе Linux, таких как Go, Python и Ruby.","ar":"مثالي لعميل أمن السيبراني الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للاستطلاع واكتشاف الثغرات الأمنية باستخدام أجهزة وأدوات تعمل بنظام لينكس مثل Go و Python و Ruby."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate common tasks in bug bounty hunting, maintain thorough coverage of attack surfaces, and implement proven methodologies from top security researchers using protocols and tool workflows tailored for effective vulnerability discovery.","zh":"赋予代理自动化漏洞赏金狩猎中的常见任务、维护对攻击表面的彻底覆盖、使用顶级安全研究人员的成熟方法论，并使用为有效漏洞发现量身定制的协议和工具工作流程。","ja":"エージェントに、バグバウンティハンティングの一般的なタスクの自動化、攻撃表面の徹底的なカバーの維持、トップセキュリティリサーチャーの実証済みの方法論の実装、および効果的な脆弱性発見のためのプロトコルとツールワークフローのカスタマイズを実行する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 버그 바운티 사냥의 일반적인 작업을 자동화하고 공격 표面的 철저한 다루기를 유지하며 최상의 보안 연구원들의 검증된 방법론을 구현하며 효과적인 취약점 발견을 위한 프로토콜 및 툴 워크플로우를 맞춤 설정할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to automate common tasks in bug bounty hunting, maintain thorough coverage of attack surfaces, and implement proven methodologies from top security researchers using protocols and tool workflows tailored for effective vulnerability discovery.","fr":"Empowers agents to automate common tasks in bug bounty hunting, maintain thorough coverage of attack surfaces, and implement proven methodologies from top security researchers using protocols and tool workflows tailored for effective vulnerability discovery.","de":"Empowers agents to automate common tasks in bug bounty hunting, maintain thorough coverage of attack surfaces, and implement proven methodologies from top security researchers using protocols and tool workflows tailored for effective vulnerability discovery.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar tarefas comuns na caça a bugs, manter uma cobertura completa das superfícies de ataque e implementar metodologias comprovadas de principais pesquisadores de segurança usando protocolos e fluxos de trabalho de ferramentas personalizados para descoberta eficaz de vulnerabilidades.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать общие задачи при охоте за ошибками, поддерживать полное покрытие поверхностей атаки и реализовывать проверенные методологии лучших исследователей безопасности с использованием протоколов и рабочих потоков инструментов, адаптированных для эффективного обнаружения уязвимостей.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من توفير المهام الشائعة في صيد العيوب، والحفاظ على تغطية شاملة لسطوح الهجوم، وتنفيذ منهجيات مثبتة من قبل الباحثين الأمنيين الرائدين باستخدام بروتوكولات وعمليات عمل أدوات مخصصة لاكتشاف الثغرات الأمنية بشكل فعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating reconnaissance tasks for target scope definition","Discovering vulnerabilities in domains, IP ranges, and applications","Streamlining bug bounty hunting with automated workflows and tool dependencies"],"zh":["自动化目标范围定义的侦察任务","发现域、IP范围和应用程序中的漏洞","使用自动化工作流程和工具依赖关系简化漏洞赏金狩猎"],"ja":["ターゲットスコープ定義のための偵察タスクの自動化","ドメイン、IPレンジ、アプリケーション内の脆弱性の発見","自動化されたワークフローとツール依存関係を使用したバグバウンティハンティングの簡素化"],"ko":["대상 범위 정의를 위한 정찰 작업 자동화","도메인, IP 범위, 애플리케이션 내의 취약점 발견","자동화된 워크플로 및 툴 종속성을 사용한 버그 바운티 사냥의 간소화"],"es":["Automating reconnaissance tasks for target scope definition","Discovering vulnerabilities in domains, IP ranges, and applications","Streamlining bug bounty hunting with automated workflows and tool dependencies"],"fr":["Automating reconnaissance tasks for target scope definition","Discovering vulnerabilities in domains, IP ranges, and applications","Streamlining bug bounty hunting with automated workflows and tool dependencies"],"de":["Automating reconnaissance tasks for target scope definition","Discovering vulnerabilities in domains, IP ranges, and applications","Streamlining bug bounty hunting with automated workflows and tool dependencies"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de reconhecimento para definição de escopo de alvo","Descobrir vulnerabilidades em domínios, intervalos de IP e aplicações","Otimizar a caça a bugs com fluxos de trabalho automatizados e dependências de ferramentas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать задачи разведки для определения целевого объёма","Обнаруживать уязвимости в доменах, диапазонах IP и приложениях","Оптимизировать охоту за ошибками с автоматизированными рабочими потоками и зависимостями инструментов"],"ar":["توفير مهام الاستطلاع لتعريف نطاق الهدف","اكتشاف الثغرات الأمنية في المجالات ومدى IP والتطبيقات","تحسين صيد العيوب مع عمليات العمل المتوفرة تلقائيًا والاعتماد على الأدوات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Linux-based attack machine with Kali or Ubuntu","Needs bug bounty program rules and scope","Dependent on tool dependencies like Go, Python, and Ruby"],"zh":["需要基于Linux的攻击机，使用Kali或Ubuntu","需要漏洞赏金计划规则和范围","依赖于Go、Python、Ruby等工具依赖"],"ja":["KaliまたはUbuntuを使用したLinuxベースの攻撃マシンが必要","バグバウンティプログラムのルールとスコープが必要","Go、Python、Rubyなどのツール依存関係に依存"],"ko":["Kali 또는 Ubuntu를 사용하는 리눅스 기반 공격 기계가 필요함","버그 바운티 프로그램 규칙 및 범위 필요","Go, Python, Ruby 등 툴