証します","ko":"코어 컴포넌트는 일관된 사용자 인터페이스를 구축하는 기초であり, 디자인 토큰을 사용하여 스타일과 행동의 일관성을 보장합니다","es":"Utiliza componentes de tu biblioteca para asegurar una experiencia de usuario coherente y consistente","fr":"Utilisez des composants de votre bibliothèque pour assurer une expérience utilisateur cohérente et constante","de":"Verwenden Sie Komponenten aus Ihrer Bibliothek, um eine konsistente und einheitliche Benutzererfahrung zu gewährleisten","pt":"Os componentes centrais são fundamentais para manter a consistência em projetos de desenvolvimento. Eles garantem estilização e comportamento uniformes.","ru":"Основные компоненты являются фундаментальными для поддержания последовательности в проектах разработки. Они обеспечивают.uniform стиль и поведение.","ar":"المكونات الأساسية هي أساسية لضمان الاتساق في مشاريع التطوير. أنها تضمنスタイル وسلوك متسقين.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["使用核心组件","设计令牌","一致的样式和行为","提高开发效率","简化代码维护"],"ja":["コアコンポーネントの使用","デザイントークン","一貫したスタイルと動作","開発の効率化","コードの保守の簡素化"],"ko":["코어 컴포넌트 사용","디자인 토큰","일관된 스타일과 행동","개발 효율성 향상","코드 유지 보수 간소화"],"es":["Utiliza tokens de diseño para valores consistentes","Evita valores codificados en duro","Mejora la experiencia de usuario con componentes coherentes","Utiliza la biblioteca de componentes para una mayor eficiencia","Asegura la consistencia en la aplicación con tokens de diseño"],"fr":["Utilisez des jetons de conception pour des valeurs cohérentes","Évitez les valeurs codées en dur","Améliorez l''expérience utilisateur avec des composants cohérents","Utilisez la bibliothèque de composants pour une plus grande efficacité","Assurez la cohérence dans l''application avec des jetons de conception"],"de":["Verwenden Sie Design-Tokens für konsistente Werte","Vermeiden Sie hartcodierte Werte","Verbessern Sie die Benutzererfahrung mit konsistenten Komponenten","Verwenden Sie die Bibliothek von Komponenten für eine höhere Effizienz","Stellen Sie die Konsistenz in der Anwendung mit Design-Tokens sicher"],"pt":["Uso de componentes de biblioteca central","Estilização e comportamento consistentes","Evitação de valores hardcoded","Uso de tokens de design","Tokens de espaçamento personalizados"],"ru":["Использование компонентов из центрального хранилища","Последовательный стиль и поведение","Избежание жёстко закодированных значений","Использование токенов дизайна","Настраиваемые токены间距"],"ar":["استخدام المكونات من المكتبة المركزية","スタイル وسلوك متسقين","تجنب القيم المحakkدة","استخدام رموز التصميم","رموز المسافة المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["核心组件","设计令牌","一致性","开发效率","代码维护","用户界面","可重用组件"],"ja":["コアコンポーネント","デザイントークン","一貫性","開発の効率化","コードの保守","ユーザーインターフェイス","再利用可能なコンポーネント"],"ko":["코어 컴포넌트","디자인 토큰","일관성","개발 효율성","코드 유지 보수","사용자 인터페이스","재사용 가능한 컴포넌트"],"es":["componentes básicos","diseño de sistema","tokens de diseño","experiencia de usuario","biblioteca de componentes","desarrollo de software","diseño de interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["composants de base","conception de système","jetons de conception","expérience utilisateur","bibliothèque de composants","développement de logiciels","conception d''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Kernkomponenten","Systemdesign","Design-Tokens","Benutzererfahrung","Bibliothek von Komponenten","Software-Entwicklung","Benutzeroberflächen-Design"],"pt":["componentes centrais","desenvolvimento de software","estilização consistente","comportamento uniforme","tokens de design","desenvolvedores","biblioteca central","projetos de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["основные компоненты","разработка программного обеспечения","последовательный стиль","унифицированное поведение","токены дизайна","разработчики","центральное хранилище","проекты разработки"],"ar":["المكونات الأساسية","تطوير البرمجيات","スタイル متسق","سلوك متماسك","رموز التصميم","المطورون","المكتبة المركزية","مشاريع التطوير"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.541Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"core-components","description":"Core component library and design system patterns. Use when building UI, using design tokens, or working with the component library.","bodyPreview":"# Core Components\n\n## Design System Overview\n\nUse components from your core library instead of raw platform components. This ensures consistent styling and behavior.\n\n## Design Tokens\n\n**NEVER hard-code values. Always use design tokens.**\n\n### Spacing Tokens\n\n```tsx\n// CORRECT - Use tokens\n<Box padding=\"$4\" marginBottom=\"$2\" />\n\n// WRONG - Hard-coded values\n<Box padding={16} marginBottom={8} />\n```\n\n| Token | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| `$1` | 4px |\n| `$2` | 8px |\n| `$3` | 12px |\n| `$4` | 16px |","body":"# Core Components\n\n## Design System Overview\n\nUse components from your core library instead of raw platform components. This ensures consistent styling and behavior.\n\n## Design Tokens\n\n**NEVER hard-code values. Always use design tokens.**\n\n### Spacing Tokens\n\n```tsx\n// CORRECT - Use tokens\n<Box padding=\"$4\" marginBottom=\"$2\" />\n\n// WRONG - Hard-coded values\n<Box padding={16} marginBottom={8} />\n```\n\n| Token | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| `$1` | 4px |\n| `$2` | 8px |\n| `$3` | 12px |\n| `$4` | 16px |\n| `$6` | 24px |\n| `$8` | 32px |\n\n### Color Tokens\n\n```tsx\n// CORRECT - Semantic tokens\n<Text color=\"$textPrimary\" />\n<Box backgroundColor=\"$backgroundSecondary\" />\n\n// WRONG - Hard-coded colors\n<Text color=\"#333333\" />\n<Box backgroundColor=\"rgb(245, 245, 245)\" />\n```\n\n| Semantic Token | Use For |\n|----------------|---------|\n| `$textPrimary` | Main text |\n| `$textSecondary` | Supporting text |\n| `$textTertiary` | Disabled/hint text |\n| `$primary500` | Brand/accent color |\n| `$statusError` | Error states |\n| `$statusSuccess` | Success states |\n\n### Typography Tokens\n\n```tsx\n<Text fontSize=\"$lg\" fontWeight=\"$semibold\" />\n```\n\n| Token | Size |\n|-------|------|\n| `$xs` | 12px |\n| `$sm` | 14px |\n| `$md` | 16px |\n| `$lg` | 18px |\n| `$xl` | 20px |\n| `$2xl` | 24px |\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Box\n\nBase layout component with token support:\n\n```tsx\n<Box\n  padding=\"$4\"\n  backgroundColor=\"$backgroundPrimary\"\n  borderRadius=\"$lg\"\n>\n  {children}\n</Box>\n```\n\n### HStack / VStack\n\nHorizontal and vertical flex layouts:\n\n```tsx\n<HStack gap=\"$3\" alignItems=\"center\">\n  <Icon name=\"user\" />\n  <Text>Username</Text>\n</HStack>\n\n<VStack gap=\"$4\" padding=\"$4\">\n  <Heading>Title</Heading>\n  <Text>Content</Text>\n</VStack>\n```\n\n### Text\n\nTypography with token support:\n\n```tsx\n<Text\n  fontSize=\"$lg\"\n  fontWeight=\"$semibold\"\n  color=\"$textPrimary\"\n>\n  Hello World\n</Text>\n```\n\n### Button\n\nInteractive button with variants:\n\n```tsx\n<Button\n  onPress={handlePress}\n  variant=\"solid\"\n  size=\"md\"\n  isLoading={loading}\n  isDisabled={disabled}\n>\n  Click Me\n</Button>\n```\n\n| Variant | Use For |\n|---------|---------|\n| `solid` | Primary actions |\n| `outline` | Secondary actions |\n| `ghost` | Tertiary/subtle actions |\n| `link` | Inline actions |\n\n### Input\n\nForm input with validation:\n\n```tsx\n<Input\n  value={value}\n  onChangeText={setValue}\n  placeholder=\"Enter text\"\n  error={touched ? errors.field : undefined}\n  label=\"Field Name\"\n/>\n```\n\n### Card\n\nContent container:\n\n```tsx\n<Card padding=\"$4\" gap=\"$3\">\n  <CardHeader>\n    <Heading size=\"sm\">Card Title</Heading>\n  </CardHeader>\n  <CardBody>\n    <Text>Card content</Text>\n  </CardBody>\n</Card>\n```\n\n## Layout Patterns\n\n### Screen Layout\n\n```tsx\nconst MyScreen = () => (\n  <Screen>\n    <ScreenHeader title=\"Page Title\" />\n    <ScreenContent padding=\"$4\">\n      {/* Content */}\n    </ScreenContent>\n  </Screen>\n);\n```\n\n### Form Layout\n\n```tsx\n<VStack gap=\"$4\" padding=\"$4\">\n  <Input label=\"Name\" {...nameProps} />\n  <Input label=\"Email\" {...emailProps} />\n  <Button isLoading={loading}>Submit</Button>\n</VStack>\n```\n\n### List Item Layout\n\n```tsx\n<HStack\n  padding=\"$4\"\n  gap=\"$3\"\n  alignItems=\"center\"\n  borderBottomWidth={1}\n  borderColor=\"$borderLight\"\n>\n  <Avatar source={{ uri: imageUrl }} size=\"md\" />\n  <VStack flex={1}>\n    <Text fontWeight=\"$semibold\">{title}</Text>\n    <Text color=\"$textSecondary\" fontSize=\"$sm\">{subtitle}</Text>\n  </VStack>\n  <Icon name=\"chevron-right\" color=\"$textTertiary\" />\n</HStack>\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n```tsx\n// WRONG - Hard-coded values\n<View style={{ padding: 16, backgroundColor: ''#fff'' }}>\n\n// CORRECT - Design tokens\n<Box padding=\"$4\" backgroundColor=\"$backgroundPrimary\">\n\n\n// WRONG - Raw platform components\nimport { View, Text } from ''react-native'';\n\n// CORRECT - Core components\nimport { Box, Text } from ''components/core'';\n\n\n// WRONG - Inline styles\n<Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: ''600'' }}>\n\n// CORRECT - Token props\n<Text fontSize=\"$lg\" fontWeight=\"$semibold\">\n```\n\n## Component Props Pattern\n\nWhen creating components, use token-based props:\n\n```tsx\ninterface CardProps {\n  padding?: ''$2'' | ''$4'' | ''$6'';\n  variant?: ''elevated'' | ''outlined'' | ''filled'';\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n}\n\nconst Card = ({ padding = ''$4'', variant = ''elevated'', children }: CardProps) => (\n  <Box\n    padding={padding}\n    backgroundColor=\"$backgroundPrimary\"\n    borderRadius=\"$lg\"\n    {...variantStyles[variant]}\n  >\n    {children}\n  </Box>\n);\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **react-ui-patterns**: Use core components for UI states\n- **testing-patterns**: Mock core components in tests\n- **storybook**: Document component variants\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:23:44.082Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries.","zh":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries.","ja":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries.","ko":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries.","es":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries.","fr":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries.","de":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries.","pt":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries.","ru":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries.","ar":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring consistent styling and behavior across platforms through core component libraries."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration.","zh":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration.","ja":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration.","ko":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration.","es":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration.","fr":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration.","de":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration.","pt":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration.","ru":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration.","ar":"Empowers agents to utilize design tokens for spacing, ensuring consistency and avoiding hard-coded values, while leveraging core components for a unified design system, incorporating libraries like TSX for seamless integration."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"],"zh":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"],"ja":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"],"ko":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"],"es":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"],"fr":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"],"de":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"],"pt":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"],"ru":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"],"ar":["Implementing consistent spacing using design tokens","Standardizing component styling across applications","Enforcing design system guidelines through core component usage"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"],"zh":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"],"ja":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"],"ko":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"],"es":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"],"fr":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"],"de":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"],"pt":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"],"ru":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"],"ar":["Requires design token implementation","Limited to TSX-compatible environments"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
