,"Redução de bugs e erros"],"ru":["Применение патчей ИИ безопасно","Поддержание кода организованным и эффективным","Принципы программирования как SRP и DRY","Улучшение качества кода","Снижение количества багов и ошибок"],"ar":["تطبيق تصحيحات الذكاء الاصطناعي بأمان","الحفاظ على الكود منظم وفعال","مبادئ الترميز مثل SRP و DRY","تحسين جودة الكود","تقليل الأخطاء والعيوب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Clean Code","AI","LLM","ChatGPT","Claude","Gemini","SRP","DRY","KISS","YAGNI"],"ja":["Clean Code","AI","LLM","ChatGPT","Claude","Gemini","SRP","DRY","KISS","YAGNI"],"ko":["Clean Code","AI","LLM","ChatGPT","Claude","Gemini","SRP","DRY","KISS","YAGNI"],"es":["código limpio","desarrollo de software","IA","estándares de codificación","calidad del código","seguridad del código","mejora del código"],"fr":["code propre","développement de logiciels","IA","normes de codage","qualité du code","sécurité du code","amélioration du code"],"de":["Clean Code","Software-Entwicklung","KI","Codierungsstandards","Code-Qualität","Code-Sicherheit","Code-Optimierung"],"pt":["código limpo","padrões de codificação","IA","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","eficiência","segurança"],"ru":["чистый код","стандарты программирования","ИИ","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","эффективность","безопасность"],"ar":["كود نظيف","معايير الترميز","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","الفعالية","الأمان"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clean-code","description":"Pragmatic coding standards - concise, direct, no over-engineering, no unnecessary comments","version":"2.0","bodyPreview":"# Clean Code - Pragmatic AI Coding Standards\n\n> **CRITICAL SKILL** - Be **concise, direct, and solution-focused**.\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n| Principle | Rule |\n|-----------|------|\n| **SRP** | Single Responsibility - each function/class does ONE thing |\n| **DRY** | Don''t Repeat Yourself - extract duplicates, reuse |\n| **KISS** | Keep It Simple - simplest solution that works |\n| **YAGNI** | You Aren''t Gonna Need It - don''t build unused features |\n| **Boy Scout** | Leave code cleaner than you fo","body":"# Clean Code - Pragmatic AI Coding Standards\n\n> **CRITICAL SKILL** - Be **concise, direct, and solution-focused**.\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n| Principle | Rule |\n|-----------|------|\n| **SRP** | Single Responsibility - each function/class does ONE thing |\n| **DRY** | Don''t Repeat Yourself - extract duplicates, reuse |\n| **KISS** | Keep It Simple - simplest solution that works |\n| **YAGNI** | You Aren''t Gonna Need It - don''t build unused features |\n| **Boy Scout** | Leave code cleaner than you found it |\n\n---\n\n## Naming Rules\n\n| Element | Convention |\n|---------|------------|\n| **Variables** | Reveal intent: `userCount` not `n` |\n| **Functions** | Verb + noun: `getUserById()` not `user()` |\n| **Booleans** | Question form: `isActive`, `hasPermission`, `canEdit` |\n| **Constants** | SCREAMING_SNAKE: `MAX_RETRY_COUNT` |\n\n> **Rule:** If you need a comment to explain a name, rename it.\n\n---\n\n## Function Rules\n\n| Rule | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| **Small** | Max 20 lines, ideally 5-10 |\n| **One Thing** | Does one thing, does it well |\n| **One Level** | One level of abstraction per function |\n| **Few Args** | Max 3 arguments, prefer 0-2 |\n| **No Side Effects** | Don''t mutate inputs unexpectedly |\n\n---\n\n## Code Structure\n\n| Pattern | Apply |\n|---------|-------|\n| **Guard Clauses** | Early returns for edge cases |\n| **Flat > Nested** | Avoid deep nesting (max 2 levels) |\n| **Composition** | Small functions composed together |\n| **Colocation** | Keep related code close |\n\n---\n\n## AI Coding Style\n\n| Situation | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| User asks for feature | Write it directly |\n| User reports bug | Fix it, don''t explain |\n| No clear requirement | Ask, don''t assume |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns (DON''T)\n\n| ❌ Pattern | ✅ Fix |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Comment every line | Delete obvious comments |\n| Helper for one-liner | Inline the code |\n| Factory for 2 objects | Direct instantiation |\n| utils.ts with 1 function | Put code where used |\n| \"First we import...\" | Just write code |\n| Deep nesting | Guard clauses |\n| Magic numbers | Named constants |\n| God functions | Split by responsibility |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 Before Editing ANY File (THINK FIRST!)\n\n**Before changing a file, ask yourself:**\n\n| Question | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| **What imports this file?** | They might break |\n| **What does this file import?** | Interface changes |\n| **What tests cover this?** | Tests might fail |\n| **Is this a shared component?** | Multiple places affected |\n\n**Quick Check:**\n```\nFile to edit: UserService.ts\n└── Who imports this? → UserController.ts, AuthController.ts\n└── Do they need changes too? → Check function signatures\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Rule:** Edit the file + all dependent files in the SAME task.\n> 🔴 **Never leave broken imports or missing updates.**\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n| Do | Don''t |\n|----|-------|\n| Write code directly | Write tutorials |\n| Let code self-document | Add obvious comments |\n| Fix bugs immediately | Explain the fix first |\n| Inline small things | Create unnecessary files |\n| Name things clearly | Use abbreviations |\n| Keep functions small | Write 100+ line functions |\n\n> **Remember: The user wants working code, not a programming lesson.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 Self-Check Before Completing (MANDATORY)\n\n**Before saying \"task complete\", verify:**\n\n| Check | Question |\n|-------|----------|\n| ✅ **Goal met?** | Did I do exactly what user asked? |\n| ✅ **Files edited?** | Did I modify all necessary files? |\n| ✅ **Code works?** | Did I test/verify the change? |\n| ✅ **No errors?** | Lint and TypeScript pass? |\n| ✅ **Nothing forgotten?** | Any edge cases missed? |\n\n> 🔴 **Rule:** If ANY check fails, fix it before completing.\n\n---\n\n## Verification Scripts (MANDATORY)\n\n> 🔴 **CRITICAL:** Each agent runs ONLY their own skill''s scripts after completing work.\n\n### Agent → Script Mapping\n\n| Agent | Script | Command |\n|-------|--------|---------|\n| **frontend-specialist** | UX Audit | `python .agent/skills/frontend-design/scripts/ux_audit.py .` |\n| **frontend-specialist** | A11y Check | `python .agent/skills/frontend-design/scripts/accessibility_checker.py .` |\n| **backend-specialist** | API Validator | `python .agent/skills/api-patterns/scripts/api_validator.py .` |\n| **mobile-developer** | Mobile Audit | `python .agent/skills/mobile-design/scripts/mobile_audit.py .` |\n| **database-architect** | Schema Validate | `python .agent/skills/database-design/scripts/schema_validator.py .` |\n| **security-auditor** | Security Scan | `python .agent/skills/vulnerability-scanner/scripts/security_scan.py .` |\n| **seo-specialist** | SEO Check | `python .agent/skills/seo-fundamentals/scripts/seo_checker.py .` |\n| **seo-specialist** | GEO Check | `python .agent/skills/geo-fundamentals/scripts/geo_checker.py .` |\n| **performance-optimizer** | Lighthouse | `python .agent/skills/performance-profiling/scripts/lighthouse_audit.py <url>` |\n| **test-engineer** | Test Runner | `python .agent/skills/testing-patterns/scripts/test_runner.py .` |\n| **test-engineer** | Playwright | `python .agent/skills/webapp-testing/scripts/playwright_runner.py <url>` |\n| **Any agent** | Lint Check | `python .agent/skills/lint-and-validate/scripts/lint_runner.py .` |\n| **Any agent** | Type Coverage | `python .agent/skills/lint-and-validate/scripts/type_coverage.py .` |\n| **Any agent** | i18n Check | `python .agent/skills/i18n-localization/scripts/i18n_checker.py .` |\n\n> ❌ **WRONG:** `test-engineer` running `ux_audit.py`\n> ✅ **CORRECT:** `frontend-specialist` running `ux_audit.py`\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 Script Output Handling (READ → SUMMARIZE → ASK)\n\n**When running a validation script, you MUST:**\n\n1. **Run the script** and capture ALL output\n2. **Parse the output** - identify errors, warnings, and passes\n3. **Summarize to user** in this format:\n\n```markdown\n## Script Results: [script_name.py]\n\n### ❌ Errors Found (X items)\n- [File:Line] Error description 1\n- [File:Line] Error description 2\n\n### ⚠️ Warnings (Y items)\n- [File:Line] Warning description\n\n### ✅ Passed (Z items)\n- Check 1 passed\n- Check 2 passed\n\n**Should I fix the X errors?**\n```\n\n4. **Wait for user confirmation** before fixing\n5. **After fixing** → Re-run script to confirm\n\n> 🔴 **VIOLATION:** Running script and ignoring output = FAILED task.\n> 🔴 **VIOLATION:** Auto-fixing without asking = Not allowed.\n> 🔴 **Rule:** Always READ output → SUMMARIZE → ASK → then fix.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:59:30.129Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced clean code standards and automated patching capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级清洁代码标准和自动补丁功能的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが高度なクリーンコード規格と自動パッチ適用機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 클린 코드 표준 및 자동 패치 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan estándares de código limpio avanzados y capacidades de parcheo automatizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant des normes de code propre avancées et des capacités de correction automatique.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die erweiterte saubere Code-Standards und automatisierte Patch-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de padrões de código limpo avançados e capacidades de patch automático.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым необходимы передовые стандарты чистого кода и автоматические возможности патчинга.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المراجعة الكودية الذين يحتاجون إلى معايير الكود النظيف المتقدمة وقدرات التصحيح التلقائي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce Single Responsibility Principle (SRP), Don''t Repeat Yourself (DRY), and Keep It Simple (KISS) standards, while safely applying AI-suggested patches with preview using LLMs like ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini.","zh":"赋予代理人执行单一责任原则（SRP）、不要重复自己（DRY）和保持简单（KISS）标准的能力，同时使用LLM（如ChatGPT、Claude或Gemini）安全地应用人工智能建议的补丁并预览。","ja":"エージェントが単一責任の原則（SRP）、自己を繰り返すな（DRY）、およびシンプルに保つ（KISS）規格を施行し、LLM（例：ChatGPT、Claude、またはGemini）を使用して安全にAI提案のパッチを適用し、プレビューする能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 단일 책임 원칙(SRP), 자신을 반복하지 마세요(DRY) 및 간단하게 유지하기(KISS) 표준을 시행하고 LLM(예: ChatGPT, Claude 또는 Gemini)을 사용하여 안전하게 AI 제안 패치를 적용하고 미리 보는 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar el principio de responsabilidad única (SRP), no te repitas (DRY) y manténlo simple (KISS), mientras se aplican de manera segura parches sugeridos por IA con vista previa utilizando LLM como ChatGPT, Claude o Gemini.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer le principe de responsabilité unique (SRP), ne te répète pas (DRY) et garde-le simple (KISS), tout en appliquant en toute sécurité des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec aperçu à l''aide de LLM comme ChatGPT, Claude ou Gemini.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das Prinzip der einzelnen Verantwortung (SRP), Wiederholung vermeiden (DRY) und Einfach halten (KISS) durchzusetzen, während sie vorsichtig AI-vorgeschlagene Patches mit Vorschau mithilfe von LLM wie ChatGPT, Claude oder Gemini anwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor o Princípio da Responsabilidade Única (SRP), Não Se Repita (DRY) e Mantenha-o Simples (KISS) padrões, enquanto aplica com segurança patches sugeridos por IA com pré-visualização usando LLMs como ChatGPT, Claude ou Gemini.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение принципа единственной ответственности (SRP), не повторяй себя (DRY) и держи это просто (KISS) стандартов, а также безопасно применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, с предварительным просмотром с использованием LLM, таких как ChatGPT, Claude или Gemini.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من فرض مبدأ المسؤولية الواحدة (SRP) ، لا تكرر نفسك (DRY) ومبدأ الحفاظ على البساطة (KISS) معايير ، في حين ينطبق بشكل آمن تصحيحات مقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة باستخدام LLMs مثل ChatGPT ، Claude أو Gemini."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code refactoring for SRP compliance","Generating duplicate code extracts for DRY enforcement","Debugging complex codebases using KISS principle"],"zh":["自动化代码重构以符合SRP合规性","生成重复代码提取以执行DRY强制","使用KISS原则调试复杂代码库"],"ja":["SRPコンプライアンスのためにコードを自動再構成する","DRY強制のために重複コード抽出を生成する","KISS原則を使用して複雑なコードベースをデバッグする"],"ko":["SRP 준수를 위해 코드 자동 리팩토링하기","DRY 강제를 위해 중복 코드 추출 생성하기","KISS 원칙을 사용하여 복잡한 코드베이스 디버깅하기"],"es":["Automatización de la refactorización de código para cumplir con SRP","Generación de extractos de código duplicado para aplicar DRY","Depuración de bases de código complejas utilizando el principio KISS"],"fr":["Automatisation de la refactorisation de code pour la conformité SRP","Génération d''extraits de code dupliqués pour l''application de DRY","Débogage de bases de code complexes à l''aide du principe KISS"],"de":["Automatisierung der Code-Refaktorierung für die Einhaltung von SRP","Erzeugung von Duplikat-Code-Auszügen zur Durchsetzung von DRY","Fehlersuche in komplexen Codebasen unter Verwendung des KISS-Prinzips"],"pt":["Automatizar a refatoração de código para conformidade com SRP","Gerar extratos de código duplicado para aplicação de DRY","Depurar código de bases de código complexas usando o princípio KISS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рефакторинг кода для соблюдения SRP","Генерировать дубликаты кода для обеспечения DRY","Отлаживать сложные кодовые базы с использованием принципа KISS"],"ar":["توفير автоматизации إعادة هيكلة الكود لامتثال SRP","إنتاج مستخرج من الكود المكرر لتطبيق DRY","تصحيح أخطاء قواعد الكود المعقدة باستخدام مبدأ KISS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LLM API access (e.g., ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)","Limited to codebases compatible with AI-suggested patches"],"zh":["需要LLM API访问权限（例如ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini）","仅限与AI建议补丁兼容的代码库"],"ja":["LLM APIアクセス（例：ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini）が必要","AI提案パッチと互換性のあるコードベースのみに限定"],"ko":["LLM API 액세스(예: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)가 필요함","AI 제안 패치와 호환되는 코드베이스만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de LLM (por ejemplo, ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)","Limitado a bases de código compatibles con parches sugeridos por IA"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API LLM (par exemple, ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)","Limité aux bases de code compatibles avec les correctifs suggérés par l''IA"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die LLM-API (z. B. ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)","Begrenzt auf Codebasen, die mit AI-vorgeschlagenen Patches kompatibel sind"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API LLM (por exemplo, ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)","Limitado a bases de código compatíveis com patches sugeridos por IA"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к API LLM (например, ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini)","Ограничен кодовыми базами, совместимыми с патчами, предложенными ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات LLM (على سبيل المثال ChatGPT ، Claude ، Gemini)","محدود بقواعد الكود المتوافقة مع تصحيحات الذكاء الاصطناعي المُقترَحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
