":["Execução de scripts de runtime para testes automatizados","Geração de screenshots para análise visual","Verificação de acessibilidade para garantir conformidade","Aplicação de patches sugeridos por IA de forma segura","Testes de funcionalidade para garantir estabilidade","Análise de desempenho para otimização"],"ru":["Выполнение скриптов runtime для автоматизированного тестирования","Генерация скриншотов для визуального анализа","Проверка доступности для обеспечения соответствия","Применение патчей, предложенных ИИ, безопасно","Тестирование функциональности для обеспечения стабильности","Анализ производительности для оптимизации"],"ar":["تشغيل سكريبتات زمن التشغيل للاختبارات الآلية","توليد لقطات شاشة للتحليل البصري","فحص إمكانية الوصول لضمان المطابقة","تطبيق التصحيحات المقترحة بالذكاء الاصطناعي بأمان","اختبار الوظيفة لضمان الثبات","تحليل الأداء للتطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web应用测试","自动化浏览器测试","Playwright","功能测试","性能测试","安全性测试","Web应用程序测试"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションテスト","自動化ブラウザーテスト","Playwright","機能テスト","パフォーマンステスト","セキュリティテスト","Webアプリケーション테スト"],"ko":["웹애플리케이션 테스트","자동화 브라우저 테스트","Playwright","기능 테스트","성능 테스트","보안 테스트","웹 애플리케이션 테스트"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones web","tests automatizados","inteligencia artificial","accesibilidad web","desarrollo de aplicaciones","pruebas de navegador","seguridad web","optimización de aplicaciones"],"fr":["tests d''applications web","tests automatisés","intelligence artificielle","accessibilité web","développement d''applications","tests de navigateur","sécurité web","optimisation d''applications"],"de":["Webanwendungstests","automatisierte Tests","künstliche Intelligenz","Barrierefreiheit im Web","Anwendungsentwicklung","Browser-Tests","Web-Sicherheit","Anwendungsoptimierung"],"pt":["teste de aplicativos web","desenvolvimento de software","segurança de aplicativos","testes automatizados","ia em desenvolvimento","otimização de desempenho","acessibilidade web","desenvolvimento ágil","qualidade de software"],"ru":["тестирование веб-приложений","разработка программного обеспечения","безопасность приложений","автоматизированное тестирование","искусственный интеллект в разработке","оптимизация производительности","доступность веб-приложений","гибкая разработка","качество программного обеспечения"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب","تطوير البرمجيات","أمان التطبيقات","اختبارات آلية","الذكاء الاصطناعي في التطوير","تحسين الأداء","إمكانية الوصول إلى الويب","تطوير مرن","جودة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Web application testing principles. E2E, Playwright, deep audit strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Web App Testing\n\n> Discover and test everything. Leave no route untested.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for automated browser testing:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/playwright_runner.py` | Basic browser test | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py https://example.com` |\n| | With screenshot | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --screenshot` |\n| | Accessibility check | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --a11y` |\n\n**Requires:** `","body":"# Web App Testing\n\n> Discover and test everything. Leave no route untested.\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for automated browser testing:**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/playwright_runner.py` | Basic browser test | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py https://example.com` |\n| | With screenshot | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --screenshot` |\n| | Accessibility check | `python scripts/playwright_runner.py <url> --a11y` |\n\n**Requires:** `pip install playwright && playwright install chromium`\n\n---\n\n## 1. Deep Audit Approach\n\n### Discovery First\n\n| Target | How to Find |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Routes | Scan app/, pages/, router files |\n| API endpoints | Grep for HTTP methods |\n| Components | Find component directories |\n| Features | Read documentation |\n\n### Systematic Testing\n\n1. **Map** - List all routes/APIs\n2. **Scan** - Verify they respond\n3. **Test** - Cover critical paths\n\n---\n\n## 2. Testing Pyramid for Web\n\n```\n        /\\          E2E (Few)\n       /  \\         Critical user flows\n      /----\\\n     /      \\       Integration (Some)\n    /--------\\      API, data flow\n   /          \\\n  /------------\\    Component (Many)\n                    Individual UI pieces\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. E2E Test Principles\n\n### What to Test\n\n| Priority | Tests |\n|----------|-------|\n| 1 | Happy path user flows |\n| 2 | Authentication flows |\n| 3 | Critical business actions |\n| 4 | Error handling |\n\n### E2E Best Practices\n\n| Practice | Why |\n|----------|-----|\n| Use data-testid | Stable selectors |\n| Wait for elements | Avoid flaky tests |\n| Clean state | Independent tests |\n| Avoid implementation details | Test user behavior |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Playwright Principles\n\n### Core Concepts\n\n| Concept | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Page Object Model | Encapsulate page logic |\n| Fixtures | Reusable test setup |\n| Assertions | Built-in auto-wait |\n| Trace Viewer | Debug failures |\n\n### Configuration\n\n| Setting | Recommendation |\n|---------|----------------|\n| Retries | 2 on CI |\n| Trace | on-first-retry |\n| Screenshots | on-failure |\n| Video | retain-on-failure |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Visual Testing\n\n### When to Use\n\n| Scenario | Value |\n|----------|-------|\n| Design system | High |\n| Marketing pages | High |\n| Component library | Medium |\n| Dynamic content | Lower |\n\n### Strategy\n\n- Baseline screenshots\n- Compare on changes\n- Review visual diffs\n- Update intentional changes\n\n---\n\n## 6. API Testing Principles\n\n### Coverage Areas\n\n| Area | Tests |\n|------|-------|\n| Status codes | 200, 400, 404, 500 |\n| Response shape | Matches schema |\n| Error messages | User-friendly |\n| Edge cases | Empty, large, special chars |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Test Organization\n\n### File Structure\n\n```\ntests/\n├── e2e/           # Full user flows\n├── integration/   # API, data\n├── component/     # UI units\n└── fixtures/      # Shared data\n```\n\n### Naming Convention\n\n| Pattern | Example |\n|---------|---------|\n| Feature-based | `login.spec.ts` |\n| Descriptive | `user-can-checkout.spec.ts` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. CI Integration\n\n### Pipeline Steps\n\n1. Install dependencies\n2. Install browsers\n3. Run tests\n4. Upload artifacts (traces, screenshots)\n\n### Parallelization\n\n| Strategy | Use |\n|----------|-----|\n| Per file | Playwright default |\n| Sharding | Large suites |\n| Workers | Multiple browsers |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Test implementation | Test behavior |\n| Hardcode waits | Use auto-wait |\n| Skip cleanup | Isolate tests |\n| Ignore flaky tests | Fix root cause |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** E2E tests are expensive. Use them for critical paths only.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:59:48.356Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automated Testing Agents needing advanced web application testing capabilities with Playwright and Python","zh":"适合需要使用Playwright和Python进行高级Web应用程序测试的自动化测试代理","ja":"PlaywrightとPythonを使用した高度なWebアプリケーションテスト機能を必要とする自動テストエージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright와 Python을 사용한 고급 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 기능이 필요한 자동화 테스트 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de pruebas automatizadas que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de pruebas de aplicaciones web con Playwright y Python","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de test automatisés ayant besoin de capacités avancées de test d''applications web avec Playwright et Python","de":"Perfekt für automatisierte Testagenten, die erweiterte Webanwendungstestfunktionen mit Playwright und Python benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Testes Automatizados que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de teste de aplicativos web com Playwright e Python","ru":"Идеально подходит для автоматизированных агентов тестирования, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности тестирования веб-приложений с помощью Playwright и Python","ar":"مثالي لعميل اختبار التطبيق التلقائي الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لاختبار التطبيقات الويب مع Playwright و Python"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute automated browser tests with screenshot and accessibility check capabilities using Playwright, while safely applying AI-suggested patches with preview, leveraging libraries like Playwright and Python scripts","zh":"赋予代理执行自动浏览器测试的能力，具有截图和无障碍检查功能，使用Playwright，同时安全地应用AI建议的补丁并预览，利用Playwright和Python脚本等库","ja":"Playwrightを使用してスクリーンショットとアクセシビリティ確認機能を備えた自動ブラウザーテストを実行する機能をエージェントに与え、AIが提案したパッチを安全に適用しプレビューすることができる、PlaywrightやPythonスクリプトなどのライブラリを利用","ko":"Playwright를 사용하여 스크린샷 및 접근성 확인 기능을 갖춘 자동 브라우저 테스트를 수행할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, AI가 제안한 패치를 안전하게 적용하고 미리 볼 수 있으며, Playwright 및 Python 스크립트와 같은 라이브러리를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas de navegador automatizadas con capacidad de captura de pantalla y comprobación de accesibilidad utilizando Playwright, mientras se aplican de manera segura parches sugeridos por IA con vista previa, aprovechando bibliotecas como Playwright y scripts de Python","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests de navigateur automatisés avec des fonctionnalités de capture d''écran et de vérification d''accessibilité en utilisant Playwright, tout en appliquant de manière sécurisée des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec aperçu, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme Playwright et des scripts Python","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, automatisierte Browser-Tests mit Screenshot- und Barrierefreiheitsprüffunktionen mit Playwright auszuführen, während sie vorsichtig von KI vorgeschlagene Patches mit Vorschau anwenden, indem sie Bibliotheken wie Playwright und Python-Skripte nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes automatizados de navegador com capacidades de captura de tela e verificação de acessibilidade usando Playwright, aplicando corretamente patches sugeridos por IA com visualização, aproveitando bibliotecas como Playwright e scripts Python","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять автоматизированные тесты браузера с функциями截ографии и проверки доступности, используя Playwright, а также безопасно применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, с предварительным просмотром, используя библиотеки, такие как Playwright и скрипты Python","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على تشغيل اختبارات متصفح الآلي مع إمكانيات لقطة الشاشة واختبار إمكانية الوصول باستخدام Playwright، مع تطبيق تصحيحات مقترحة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة، واستخدام مكتبات مثل Playwright وبرامج Python"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser testing for web applications","Generating screenshots for visual regression testing","Debugging accessibility issues with a11y checks"],"zh":["自动化浏览器测试用于Web应用程序","生成截图用于视觉回归测试","使用a11y检查调试无障碍问题"],"ja":["Webアプリケーション用の自動ブラウザーテスト","視覚回帰テスト用のスクリーンショットの生成","a11yチェックを使用したアクセシビリティ問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 자동화된 브라우저 테스트","시각적 회귀 테스트를 위한 스크린샷 생성","a11y 체크를 사용한 접근성 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de navegador para aplicaciones web","Generar capturas de pantalla para pruebas de regresión visual","Depurar problemas de accesibilidad con comprobaciones de a11y"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de navigateur pour les applications web","Générer des captures d''écran pour les tests de régression visuelle","Déboguer les problèmes d''accessibilité avec des vérifications a11y"],"de":["Automatisierung von Browser-Tests für Webanwendungen","Erzeugen von Screenshots für visuelle RegressionsTests","Fehlerbehebung von Barrierefreiheitsproblemen mit a11y-Prüfungen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de navegador para aplicativos web","Gerar capturas de tela para testes de regressão visual","Depurar problemas de acessibilidade com verificações a11y"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование браузера для веб-приложений","Генерировать снимки экрана для визуального тестирования регрессии","Отладить проблемы доступности с помощью проверок a11y"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار متصفح لتنفيذ تطبيقات الويب","إنتاج لقطات شاشة لاختبار الانحدار المرئي","إصلاح مشاكل إمكانية الوصول مع فحوصات a11y"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Playwright installation needed","Limited to HTTP/HTTPS protocols"],"zh":["需要Python环境","需要Playwright安装","仅限HTTP/HTTPS协议"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Playwrightのインストールが必要","HTTP/HTTPSプロトコルに限定"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요","Playwright 설치가 필요","HTTP/HTTPS 프로토콜에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Se necesita instalación de Playwright","Limitado a protocolos HTTP/HTTPS"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","L''installation de Playwright est nécessaire","Limité aux protocoles HTTP/HTTPS"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Playwright-Installation erforderlich","Begrenzt auf HTTP/HTTPS-Protokolle"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Instalação do Playwright necessária","Limitado a protocolos HTTP/HTTPS"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Необходима установка Playwright","Ограничен протоколами HTTP/HTTPS"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","تثبيت Playwright ضروري","محدود ببروتوكоли HTTP/HTTPS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
