niques d''apprentissage automatique","Amélioration de l''expérience du joueur avec l''analyse de données","Développement de jeux pour plusieurs plates-formes","Intégration de l''IA dans le cycle de développement de jeux"],"de":["Anwendung von KI-Prinzipien in der Spielentwicklung","Erstellung von innovativen Spielen mit Machine-Learning-Techniken","Verbesserung der Spielererfahrung durch Datenanalyse","Entwicklung von Spielen für mehrere Plattformen","Integration von KI in den Entwicklungszyklus von Spielen"],"pt":["Princípios de desenvolvimento de jogos","Rotas para sub-habilidades especializadas","Criação de jogos para web e dispositivos móveis","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Otimização de desempenho e segurança"],"ru":["Основы разработки игр","Маршруты к специализированным поднавыкам","Создание игр для веба и мобильных устройств","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Оптимизация производительности и безопасности"],"ar":["مبادئ تطوير الألعاب","طرق إلى المهارات الفرعية المتخصصة","إنشاء ألعاب للويب والأجهزة المحمولة","التكامل مع تقنيات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الأداء والأمان"]},"keywords":{"zh":["游戏开发","AI驱动开发","游戏开发技术","子技能路由","Web游戏开发","游戏开发工具"],"ja":["ゲーム開発","AI駆動開発","ゲーム開発技術","サブスキルルーティング","Webゲーム開発","ゲーム開発ツール"],"ko":["게임 개발","AI 기반 개발","게임 개발 기술","하위 기술 라우팅","웹 게임 개발","게임 개발 도구"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos","inteligencia artificial","aprendizaje automático","análisis de datos","experiencia del jugador","plataformas de juego","desarrollo de juegos con IA"],"fr":["développement de jeux","intelligence artificielle","apprentissage automatique","analyse de données","expérience du joueur","plates-formes de jeu","développement de jeux avec IA"],"de":["Spielentwicklung","künstliche Intelligenz","Machine Learning","Datenanalyse","Spielererfahrung","Spielplattformen","Spielentwicklung mit KI"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos","criação de jogos","jogos eletrônicos","programação de jogos","design de jogos","testes de jogos","otimização de desempenho","segurança de jogos"],"ru":["разработка игр","создание игр","электронные игры","программирование игр","дизайн игр","тестирование игр","оптимизация производительности","безопасность игр"],"ar":["تطوير الألعاب","إنشاء ألعاب","ألعاب إلكترونية","برمجة ألعاب","تصميم ألعاب","اختبار ألعاب","تحسين الأداء","أمان الألعاب"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"game-development","description":"Game development orchestrator. Routes to platform-specific skills based on project needs.","bodyPreview":"# Game Development\n\n> **Orchestrator skill** that provides core principles and routes to specialized sub-skills.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nYou are working on a game development project. This skill teaches the PRINCIPLES of game development and directs you to the right sub-skill based on context.\n\n---\n\n## Sub-Skill Routing\n\n### Platform Selection\n\n| If the game targets... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|------------------------|---------------|\n| Web browsers (HTML5, WebGL) | `game-development/web-game","body":"# Game Development\n\n> **Orchestrator skill** that provides core principles and routes to specialized sub-skills.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nYou are working on a game development project. This skill teaches the PRINCIPLES of game development and directs you to the right sub-skill based on context.\n\n---\n\n## Sub-Skill Routing\n\n### Platform Selection\n\n| If the game targets... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|------------------------|---------------|\n| Web browsers (HTML5, WebGL) | `game-development/web-games` |\n| Mobile (iOS, Android) | `game-development/mobile-games` |\n| PC (Steam, Desktop) | `game-development/pc-games` |\n| VR/AR headsets | `game-development/vr-ar` |\n\n### Dimension Selection\n\n| If the game is... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|-------------------|---------------|\n| 2D (sprites, tilemaps) | `game-development/2d-games` |\n| 3D (meshes, shaders) | `game-development/3d-games` |\n\n### Specialty Areas\n\n| If you need... | Use Sub-Skill |\n|----------------|---------------|\n| GDD, balancing, player psychology | `game-development/game-design` |\n| Multiplayer, networking | `game-development/multiplayer` |\n| Visual style, asset pipeline, animation | `game-development/game-art` |\n| Sound design, music, adaptive audio | `game-development/game-audio` |\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles (All Platforms)\n\n### 1. The Game Loop\n\nEvery game, regardless of platform, follows this pattern:\n\n```\nINPUT  → Read player actions\nUPDATE → Process game logic (fixed timestep)\nRENDER → Draw the frame (interpolated)\n```\n\n**Fixed Timestep Rule:**\n- Physics/logic: Fixed rate (e.g., 50Hz)\n- Rendering: As fast as possible\n- Interpolate between states for smooth visuals\n\n---\n\n### 2. Pattern Selection Matrix\n\n| Pattern | Use When | Example |\n|---------|----------|---------|\n| **State Machine** | 3-5 discrete states | Player: Idle→Walk→Jump |\n| **Object Pooling** | Frequent spawn/destroy | Bullets, particles |\n| **Observer/Events** | Cross-system communication | Health→UI updates |\n| **ECS** | Thousands of similar entities | RTS units, particles |\n| **Command** | Undo, replay, networking | Input recording |\n| **Behavior Tree** | Complex AI decisions | Enemy AI |\n\n**Decision Rule:** Start with State Machine. Add ECS only when performance demands.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Input Abstraction\n\nAbstract input into ACTIONS, not raw keys:\n\n```\n\"jump\"  → Space, Gamepad A, Touch tap\n\"move\"  → WASD, Left stick, Virtual joystick\n```\n\n**Why:** Enables multi-platform, rebindable controls.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Performance Budget (60 FPS = 16.67ms)\n\n| System | Budget |\n|--------|--------|\n| Input | 1ms |\n| Physics | 3ms |\n| AI | 2ms |\n| Game Logic | 4ms |\n| Rendering | 5ms |\n| Buffer | 1.67ms |\n\n**Optimization Priority:**\n1. Algorithm (O(n²) → O(n log n))\n2. Batching (reduce draw calls)\n3. Pooling (avoid GC spikes)\n4. LOD (detail by distance)\n5. Culling (skip invisible)\n\n---\n\n### 5. AI Selection by Complexity\n\n| AI Type | Complexity | Use When |\n|---------|------------|----------|\n| **FSM** | Simple | 3-5 states, predictable behavior |\n| **Behavior Tree** | Medium | Modular, designer-friendly |\n| **GOAP** | High | Emergent, planning-based |\n| **Utility AI** | High | Scoring-based decisions |\n\n---\n\n### 6. Collision Strategy\n\n| Type | Best For |\n|------|----------|\n| **AABB** | Rectangles, fast checks |\n| **Circle** | Round objects, cheap |\n| **Spatial Hash** | Many similar-sized objects |\n| **Quadtree** | Large worlds, varying sizes |\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns (Universal)\n\n| Don''t | Do |\n|-------|-----|\n| Update everything every frame | Use events, dirty flags |\n| Create objects in hot loops | Object pooling |\n| Cache nothing | Cache references |\n| Optimize without profiling | Profile first |\n| Mix input with logic | Abstract input layer |\n\n---\n\n## Routing Examples\n\n### Example 1: \"I want to make a browser-based 2D platformer\"\n→ Start with `game-development/web-games` for framework selection\n→ Then `game-development/2d-games` for sprite/tilemap patterns\n→ Reference `game-development/game-design` for level design\n\n### Example 2: \"Mobile puzzle game for iOS and Android\"\n→ Start with `game-development/mobile-games` for touch input and stores\n→ Use `game-development/game-design` for puzzle balancing\n\n### Example 3: \"Multiplayer VR shooter\"\n→ `game-development/vr-ar` for comfort and immersion\n→ `game-development/3d-games` for rendering\n→ `game-development/multiplayer` for networking\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Great games come from iteration, not perfection. Prototype fast, then polish.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:59:38.942Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents focused on interactive applications needing core game development principles and sub-skills routing for specialized tasks","zh":"非常适合专注于交互式应用程序的AI代理，需要核心游戏开发原则和子技能路由以执行专门任务","ja":"インタラクティブなアプリケーションに焦点を当てたAIエージェントに最適で、コアのゲーム開発原則と特化したタスクのためのサブスキルルーティングが必要","ko":"인터랙티브 애플리케이션에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 핵심 게임 개발 원칙과 전문 작업을 위한 하위 스킬 라우팅이 필요","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA centrados en aplicaciones interactivas que necesitan principios de desarrollo de juegos y sub-habilidades de enrutamiento para tareas especializadas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA axés sur les applications interactives nécessitant des principes de développement de jeux et des sous-compétences de routage pour des tâches spécialisées","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die auf interaktive Anwendungen ausgerichtet sind und Kernprinzipien der Spielentwicklung sowie Subfähigkeiten für spezialisierte Aufgaben benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA focados em aplicações interativas que necessitam de princípios de desenvolvimento de jogos e sub-habilidades de roteamento para tarefas especializadas","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на интерактивные приложения, требующие основных принципов разработки игр и навыков маршрутизации для специализированных задач","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكية الذين يركزون على التطبيقات التفاعلية التي تحتاج إلى مبادئ أساسية لتطوير الألعاب و مهارات فرعية لتحويل المسارات إلى مهام متخصصة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract codebase context for Large Language Models and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview, utilizing HTML5, WebGL, and other game development technologies","zh":"使代理能够提取大型语言模型的代码库上下文，并安全地使用预览功能应用AI建议的补丁，利用HTML5、WebGL和其他游戏开发技术","ja":"エージェントが大規模言語モデルからのコードベースコンテキストを抽出し、プレビュー機能を使用してAIが提案したパッチを安全に適用することを可能にし、HTML5、WebGL、その他のゲーム開発技術を活用","ko":"에이전트가 대형 언어 모델의 코드베이스 컨텍스트를 추출하고, 미리보기 기능을 사용하여 AI가 제안한 패치를 안전하게 적용할 수 있도록 하며, HTML5, WebGL 및 기타 게임 개발 기술을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer el contexto de la base de código para Modelos de Lenguaje Grande y aplicar de manera segura parches sugeridos por la IA con vista previa, utilizando tecnologías de desarrollo de juegos como HTML5, WebGL y otras","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire le contexte du codebase pour les Modèles de Langage Grande et d''appliquer en toute sécurité les correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec une fonction de prévisualisation, en utilisant des technologies de développement de jeux telles que HTML5, WebGL et d''autres","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, den Kontext der Codebasis für Large Language Modelle zu extrahieren und vorgeschlagene KI-Patches mit Vorschau sicher anzuwenden, unter Verwendung von Spielentwicklungstechnologien wie HTML5, WebGL und anderen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair o contexto do código-fonte para Modelos de Linguagem Grande e aplicar patches sugeridos por IA com visualização, utilizando HTML5, WebGL e outras tecnologias de desenvolvimento de jogos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать контекст кодовой базы для Больших Моделей Языка и безопасно применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, с функцией предварительного просмотра, используя HTML5, WebGL и другие технологии разработки игр","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استخراج سياق قاعدة الشفرة لنموذج اللغة الكبيرة وتطبيق تصحيحات مقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة، باستخدام HTML5 وWebGL وتكنولوجيا تطوير الألعاب الأخرى"},"useCases":{"en":["Routing game development projects to specialized sub-skills based on target platforms","Applying AI-suggested patches for game development projects with preview functionality","Directing agents to the right sub-skills for web browser-based game development using HTML5 and WebGL"],"zh":["根据目标平台将游戏开发项目路由到专门的子技能","为游戏开发项目应用AI建议的补丁，具有预览功能","使用HTML5和WebGL的Web浏览器基于游戏开发，将代理引导至正确的子技能"],"ja":["ターゲットプラットフォームに基づいてゲーム開発プロジェクトを特化したサブスキルにルーティングする","ゲーム開発プロジェクトにAIが提案したパッチを適用する、プレビュー機能付き","HTML5とWebGLを使用したWebブラウザベースのゲーム開発のためのエージェントを適切なサブスキルに導く"],"ko":["타겟 플랫폼을 기반으로 게임 개발 프로젝트를 전문 하위 스킬로 라우팅","게임 개발 프로젝트에 AI가 제안한 패치를 미리보기 기능과 함께 적용","HTML5 및 WebGL을 사용하는 웹 브라우저 기반 게임 개발을 위한 에이전트를 올바른 하위 스킬로 안내"],"es":["Enrutamiento de proyectos de desarrollo de juegos a sub-habilidades especializadas en función de las plataformas de destino","Aplicación de parches sugeridos por la IA para proyectos de desarrollo de juegos con función de previsualización","Dirección de agentes a las sub-habilidades adecuadas para el desarrollo de juegos basados en navegadores web que utilizan HTML5 y WebGL"],"fr":["Acheminement de projets de développement de jeux à des sous-compétences spécialisées en fonction des plates-formes cibles","Application de correctifs suggérés par l''IA pour les projets de développement de jeux avec fonction de prévisualisation","Orientation des agents vers les sous-compétences appropriées pour le développement de jeux basés sur les navigateurs Web utilisant HTML5 et WebGL"],"de":["Weiterleitung von Spielentwicklungsprojekten an spezialisierte Subfähigkeiten in Abhängigkeit von den Zielplattformen","Anwendung von KI-vorgeschlagenen Patches für Spielentwicklungsprojekte mit Vorschaufunktion","Weiterleitung von Agenten an die richtigen Subfähigkeiten für die Entwicklung von Webbrowser-basierten Spielen unter Verwendung von HTML5 und WebGL"],"pt":["Encaminhar projetos de desenvolvimento de jogos para sub-habilidades especializadas com base em plataformas de destino","Aplicar patches sugeridos por IA para projetos de desenvolvimento de jogos com funcionalidade de pré-visualização","Direcionar agentes para as sub-habilidades certas para desenvolvimento de jogos baseados em navegador da web usando HTML5 e WebGL"],"ru":["Маршрутизация проектов разработки игр для специализированных поднавыков на основе целевых платформ","Применение патчей, предложенных ИИ, для проектов разработки игр с функцией предварительного просмотра","Направление агентов к правильным поднавыкам для разработки игр на основе веб-браузера с использованием HTML5 и WebGL"],"ar":["تحويل مشاريع تطوير الألعاب إلى مهارات فرعية متخصصة استنادًا إلى منصات الوجهة","تطبيق تصحيحات مقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي لمشاريع تطوير الألعاب مع وظيفة المعاينة","توجيه الوكلاء إلى المهارات الفرعية المناسبة لتطوير الألعاب المستندة إلى متصفح الويب باستخدام HTML5 وWebGL"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of game development principles and target platforms","Limited to orchestrating sub-skills and routing, not a comprehensive game development framework"],"zh":["需要游戏开发原则和目标平台的知识","仅限于编排子技能和路由，不是综合游戏开发框架"],"ja":["ゲーム開発原則とターゲットプラットフォームの知識が必要","サブスキルのオーケストレーションとルーティングに限定され、包括的なゲーム開発フレームワークではない"],"ko":["게임 개발 원칙과 타겟 플랫폼에 대한 지식이 필요","하위 스킬의 오케스트레이션과 라우팅에만 제한되며, 포괄적인 게임 개발 프레임워크가 아님"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los principios de desarrollo de juegos y las plataformas de destino","Limitado a la orquestación de sub-habilidades y enrutamiento, no es un marco de desarrollo de juegos integral"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en principes de développement de jeux et en plates-formes cibles","Limité à l''orchestration des sous-compétences et au routage, ce n''est pas un cadre de développement de jeux complet"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Spielentwicklungsprinzipien und Zielplattformen","Begrenzt auf die Orchestrierung von Subfähigkeiten und Weiterleitung, kein umfassendes Spielentwicklungsframework"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de princípios de desenvolvimento de jogos e plataformas de destino","Limitado à orquestração de sub-habilidades e roteamento, não é um framework de desenvolvimento de jogos abrangente"],"ru":["Требует знания принципов разработки игр и целевых платформ","Ограничен оркестровкой поднавыков и маршрутизацией, не является комплексным фреймворком разработки игр"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة مبادئ تطوير الألعاب ومنصات الوجهة","محدود بorchestration المهارات الفرعية وتحويل المسارات، وليس إطار عمل شاملة لتطوير الألعاب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop/mobile-design', 'community', 'HaoNgo232', 'Synapse-Desktop', 'HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop', 'mobile-design', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z', '2026-02-19T01:59:57.699Z', NULL, '{"id":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop/mobile-design","name":"mobile-design","description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种 Touch-first 的开发方法，注重移动设备的特点和限制。通过这种方法，开发者可以创建更好的移动应用","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、タッチファーストの開発方法であり、モバイルデバイスの特性と制約に焦点を当てています。この方法により、開発者はより良いモバイルアプリを作成できます","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 터치 우선의 개발 방법으로, 모바일 디바이스의 특성과 제약을 중점적으로 다룹니다. 이 방법을 통해 개발자는 더好的 모바일 애플리케이션을 생성할 수 있습니다","pt":"O sistema de design móvel é baseado em filosofias de toque, conscientização da bateria e respeito à plataforma. Melhore a experiência do usuário móvel.","ru":"Система мобильного дизайна основана на философиях осязания, осведомленности о батарее и уважении к платформе. Улучшите опыт мобильного пользователя.","ar":"نظام التصميم المتنقل يعتمد على فلسفات اللمس والوعي بالبطارية والاحترام للمنصة. تحسين تجربة المستخدم المتنقل.","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"移动设计系统：Touch-first 的开发指南","ja":"モバイルデザインシステム：タッチファーストの開発ガイド","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템: 터치 우선의 개발 가이드","pt":"Desenvolvimento Móvel: Crie Interfaces Úteis","ru":"Мобильная Разработка: Создавайте Эффективные Интерфейсы","ar":"تصميم الهاتف المحمول: قم بإنشاء واجهات مستخدم فعالة","en":"mobile-design"},"description":{"zh":"移动设计系统是一种 Touch-first 的开发方法，注重移动设备的特点和限制。通过这种方法，开发者可以创建更好的移动应用","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムは、タッチファーストの開発方法であり、モバイルデバイスの特性と制約に焦点を当てています。この方法により、開発者はより良いモバイルアプリを作成できます","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 터치 우선의 개발 방법으로, 모바일 디바이스의 특성과 제약을 중점적으로 다룹니다. 이 방법을 통해 개발자는 더好的 모바일 애플리케이션을 생성할 수 있습니다","pt":"O sistema de design móvel é baseado em filosofias de toque, conscientização da bateria e respeito à plataforma. Melhore a experiência do usuário móvel.","ru":"Система мобильного дизайна основана на философиях осязания, осведомленности о батарее и уважении к платформе. Улучшите опыт мобильного пользователя.","ar":"نظام التصميم المتنقل يعتمد على فلسفات اللمس والوعي بالبطارية والاحترام للمنصة. تحسين تجربة المستخدم المتنقل.","en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"definition":{"en":"Extract codebase context for any LLM (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini) and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview,"},"features":{"zh":["Touch-first 的开发方法","移动设备的特点和限制","平台尊重的设计","离线能力的支持","移动 UX 和 Touch 审计"],"ja":["タッチファーストの開発方法","モバイルデバイスの特性と制約","プラットフォーム尊重のデザイン","オフライン能力のサポート","モバイル UX とタッチ審計"],"ko":["터치 우선의 개발 방법","모바일 디바이스의 특성과 제약","플랫폼尊重의 디자인","오프라인 능력의 지원","모바일 UX와 터치 감사"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de interfaces de usuário móveis","Otimização para dispositivos móveis","Filosofia de toque e conscientização da bateria","Respeito à plataforma","Execução de scripts de validação"],"ru":["Разработка мобильных интерфейсов пользователя","Оптимизация для мобильных устройств","Философия осязания и осведомленности о батарее","Уважение к платформе","Выполнение скриптов валидации"],"ar":["تطوير واجهات المستخدم المتنقلة","تحسين الأداء لاجهزة الهاتف المحمول","فلسفات اللمس والوعي بالبطارية","الاحترام للمنصة","تشغيل سكريبتات التحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["移动设计系统","Touch-first","移动设备","平台尊重","离线能力","移动 UX","移动开发"],"ja":["モバイルデザインシステム","タッチファースト","モバイルデバイス","プラットフォーム尊重","オフライン能力","モバイル UX","モバイル開発"],"ko":["모바일 디자인 시스템","터치 우선","모바일 디바이스","플랫폼尊重","오프라인 능력","모바일 UX","모바일 개발"],"pt":["desenvolvimento móvel","design móvel","interfaces de usuário móveis","otimização para dispositivos móveis","filosofia de toque","conscientização da bateria"],"ru":["мобильная разработка","мобильный дизайн","мобильные интерфейсы пользователя","оптимизация для мобильных устройств","философия осязания","осведомленность о батарее"],"ar":["تصميم الهاتف المحمول","تطوير الهاتف المحمول","واجهات المستخدم المتنقلة","تحسين الأداء لاجهزة الهاتف المحمول","فلسفات اللمس","الوعي بالبطارية"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T01:59:57.699Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing touch-first and platform-respectful mobile design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要触摸优先和平台尊重的移动设计能力的前端代理。","ja":"タッチ優先とプラットフォームに配慮したモバイル設計能力が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"터치 우선 및 플랫폼을尊重하는 모바일 디자인 능력이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan capacidades de diseño móvil de primera generación y respetuosas con la plataforma.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin de capacités de conception mobile de première génération et respectueuses de la plateforme.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die touch-first- und plattformrespektierende Mobile-Design-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades de design móvel touch-first e respeitosas com a plataforma.","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы возможности проектирования мобильных устройств с первоочередным вниманием к сенсорному управлению и уважением к платформе.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم التي تحتاج إلى قدرات تصميم الهاتف المحمول التي تعمل باللمس وأحترام المنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply AI-suggested patches with preview, respecting mobile constraints and platform choices, utilizing Python scripts like mobile_audit.py for validation and UX audits.","zh":"赋予代理应用人工智能建议的补丁，预览，尊重移动约束和平台选择，利用Python脚本，如mobile_audit.py进行验证和用户体验审计。","ja":"エージェントに、プレビューを使用してAIによるパッチを適用し、モバイルの制約とプラットフォームの選択を尊重し、mobile_audit.pyなどのPythonスクリプトを使用して検証とユーザーエクスペリエンスの監査を行う機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트에 AI가 제안한 패치를 미리 보기로 적용하고 모바일 제약 및 플랫폼 선택을尊重하며 mobile_audit.py와 같은 Python 스크립트를 사용하여 유효성 검사 및 사용자 경험 감사를 수행할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aplicar parches sugeridos por IA con vista previa, respetando las limitaciones y opciones de plataforma móvil, utilizando scripts de Python como mobile_audit.py para validación y auditorías de UX.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec aperçu, en respectant les contraintes et les choix de plateforme mobile, en utilisant des scripts Python tels que mobile_audit.py pour la validation et les audits d''UX.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, AI-vorgeschlagene Patches mit Vorschau anzuwenden, mobile Einschränkungen und Plattformwahl respektierend, indem Python-Skripte wie mobile_audit.py für Validierung und UX-Audits verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes apliquem patches sugeridos pela IA com visualização, respeitando as restrições móveis e as escolhas de plataforma, utilizando scripts Python como mobile_audit.py para validação e auditorias de UX.","ru":"Позволяет агентам применять патчи, предложенные ИИ, с предварительным просмотром, уважая мобильные ограничения и выбор платформы, используя скрипты Python, такие как mobile_audit.py, для проверки и аудита UX.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بتطبيق التصحيحات المقترحة من قبل الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة ، احترام القيود المتنقلة وخيارات المنصة ، باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون مثل mobile_audit.py للتحقق والتدقيق على UX."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating mobile UX and touch interactions","Applying platform-respectful design principles","Auditing mobile projects for battery-conscious and offline-capable design"],"zh":["验证移动UX和触摸交互","应用平台尊重的设计原则","审计移动项目的电池意识和离线功能设计"],"ja":["モバイルUXとタッチのインタラクションを検証する","プラットフォームに配慮した設計原則を適用する","バッテリー意識とオフライン機能設計のためのモバイルプロジェクトを監査する"],"ko":["모바일 UX 및 터치 상호 작용을 검증하는 것","플랫폼을尊重하는 디자인 원칙을 적용하는 것","배터리 의식 및 오프라인 기능 디자인을 위한 모바일 프로젝트를 감사하는 것"],"es":["Validar la UX móvil y las interacciones táctiles","Aplicar principios de diseño respetuosos con la plataforma","Auditar proyectos móviles para un diseño consciente de la batería y capaz de funcionar sin conexión"],"fr":["Valider l''UX mobile et les interactions tactiles","Appliquer des principes de conception respectueux de la plateforme","Auditer les projets mobiles pour une conception économe en batterie et capable de fonctionner hors ligne"],"de":["Überprüfen der mobilen UX und 