агентов LLM","Метрики надежности для оценки","Тесты регрессии поведения","Оценка возможностей","Оптимизация для производства"],"ar":["إطارات الاختبار لوكلاء LLM","أدلة موثوقية للتقييم","اختبارات انحدار السلوك","تقييم القدرات","تحسين الإنتاج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LLM","Agent Evaluation","AI","机器学习","自然语言处理"],"ja":["LLM","エージェント評価","AI","機械学習","自然言語処理"],"ko":["LLM","에이전트 평가","AI","기계 학습","자연어 처리"],"es":["evaluación de agentes","aprendizaje automático","calidad en producción","marco de evaluación","pruebas de regresión","evaluación de capacidades","métricas de confiabilidad","detección de problemas"],"fr":["évaluation d''agents","apprentissage automatique","qualité en production","cadre d''évaluation","tests de régression","évaluation des capacités","métriques de fiabilité","détection des problèmes"],"de":["Agentenbewertung","Maschinelles Lernen","Qualität in der Produktion","Bewertungsrahmen","Verhaltensregressions-tests","Fähigkeitsbewertung","Zuverlässigkeitsmetriken","Problem-Erkennung"],"pt":["avaliação de agentes","LLM","frameworks de teste","métricas de confiabilidade","teste de regressão comportamental","avaliação de capacidades","otimização para produção"],"ru":["оценка агентов","LLM","фреймворки тестирования","метрики надежности","тесты регрессии поведения","оценка возможностей","оптимизация для производства"],"ar":["تقييم الوكلاء","LLM","إطارات الاختبار","أدلة موثوقية","اختبارات انحدار السلوك","تقييم القدرات","تحسين الإنتاج"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.541Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-evaluation","description":"Testing and benchmarking LLM agents including behavioral testing, capability assessment, reliability metrics, and production monitoring—where even top agents achieve less than 50% on real-world benchmarks Use when: agent testing, agent evaluation, benchmark agents, agent reliability, test agent.","bodyPreview":"# Agent Evaluation\n\nYou''re a quality engineer who has seen agents that aced benchmarks fail spectacularly in\nproduction. You''ve learned that evaluating LLM agents is fundamentally different from\ntesting traditional software—the same input can produce different outputs, and \"correct\"\noften has no single answer.\n\nYou''ve built evaluation frameworks that catch issues before production: behavioral regression\ntests, capability assessments, and reliability metrics. You understand that the goal isn''t\n10","body":"# Agent Evaluation\n\nYou''re a quality engineer who has seen agents that aced benchmarks fail spectacularly in\nproduction. You''ve learned that evaluating LLM agents is fundamentally different from\ntesting traditional software—the same input can produce different outputs, and \"correct\"\noften has no single answer.\n\nYou''ve built evaluation frameworks that catch issues before production: behavioral regression\ntests, capability assessments, and reliability metrics. You understand that the goal isn''t\n100% test pass rate—it\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- agent-testing\n- benchmark-design\n- capability-assessment\n- reliability-metrics\n- regression-testing\n\n## Requirements\n\n- testing-fundamentals\n- llm-fundamentals\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Statistical Test Evaluation\n\nRun tests multiple times and analyze result distributions\n\n### Behavioral Contract Testing\n\nDefine and test agent behavioral invariants\n\n### Adversarial Testing\n\nActively try to break agent behavior\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Single-Run Testing\n\n### ❌ Only Happy Path Tests\n\n### ❌ Output String Matching\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Agent scores well on benchmarks but fails in production | high | // Bridge benchmark and production evaluation |\n| Same test passes sometimes, fails other times | high | // Handle flaky tests in LLM agent evaluation |\n| Agent optimized for metric, not actual task | medium | // Multi-dimensional evaluation to prevent gaming |\n| Test data accidentally used in training or prompts | critical | // Prevent data leakage in agent evaluation |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `multi-agent-orchestration`, `agent-communication`, `autonomous-agents`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:23:39.257Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics.","zh":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics.","ja":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics.","ko":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics.","es":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics.","fr":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics.","de":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics.","pt":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics.","ru":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics.","ar":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring rigorous behavioral regression testing and reliability metrics."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers.","zh":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers.","ja":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers.","ko":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers.","es":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers.","fr":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers.","de":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers.","pt":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers.","ru":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers.","ar":"Empowers agents to conduct thorough capability assessments, leveraging behavioral regression tests and reliability metrics to ensure production readiness, utilizing frameworks that account for the nuances of LLM outputs and multifaceted definitions of ''correct'' answers."},"useCases":{"en":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"],"zh":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"],"ja":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"],"ko":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"],"es":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"],"fr":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"],"de":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"],"pt":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"],"ru":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"],"ar":["Conducting behavioral regression tests to catch pre-production issues","Assessing agent capabilities against complex, real-world scenarios","Developing reliability metrics to evaluate agent performance under various conditions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"],"zh":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"],"ja":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"],"ko":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"],"es":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"],"fr":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"],"de":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"],"pt":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"],"ru":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"],"ar":["Requires understanding of LLM-specific evaluation challenges","Needs customization for specific agent architectures and production environments"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/agent-memory-mcp', 'community', 'claudiodearaujo', 'IzaCenter', 'claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter', 'agent-memory-mcp', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.541Z', '2026-02-19T02:23:36.253Z', NULL, '{"id":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter/agent-memory-mcp","name":"agent-memory-mcp","description":{"es":"La habilidad de memoria del agente MCP es una memoria bancaria persistente y searchable que se sincroniza automáticamente con la documentación del proyecto","fr":"La compétence de mémoire de l''agent MCP est une mémoire bancaire persistante et recherchable qui se synchronise automatiquement avec la documentation du projet","de":"Die Fähigkeit des Agenten-MCP ist eine persistente und durchsuchbare Speicherbank, die sich automatisch mit der Projekt-Dokumentation synchronisiert","pt":"O Agent Memory MCP é um skill que fornece um banco de memória persistente e pesquisável, permitindo a sincronização automática com a documentação do projeto","ru":"Agent Memory MCP - это навык, который предоставляет постоянный и поисковый банк памяти, позволяющий автоматически синхронизироваться с документацией проекта","ar":"عامل ذاكرة ميمكب هو مهارة توفر بنك ذاكرة مستمر وقابل للبحث، مما يسمح بالمزامنة التلقائية مع توثيق المشروع","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Agent Memory MCP: Memoria Persistente para Desarrolladores","fr":"Agent Memory MCP: Mémoire Persistante pour Développeurs","de":"Agent Memory MCP: Persistente Speicher für Entwickler","pt":"Agent Memory MCP: Armazenamento de Memória Persistente","ru":"Agent Memory MCP: Постоянная память агента","ar":"عامل ذاكرة ميمكب: تخزين ذاكرة مستمر","en":"agent-memory-mcp"},"description":{"es":"La habilidad de memoria del agente MCP es una memoria bancaria persistente y searchable que se sincroniza automáticamente con la documentación del proyecto","fr":"La compétence de mémoire de l''agent MCP est une mémoire bancaire persistante et recherchable qui se synchronise automatiquement avec la documentation du projet","de":"Die Fähigkeit des Agenten-MCP ist eine persistente und durchsuchbare Speicherbank, die sich automatisch mit der Projekt-Dokumentation synchronisiert","pt":"O Agent Memory MCP é um skill que fornece um banco de memória persistente e pesquisável, permitindo a sincronização automática com a documentação do projeto","ru":"Agent Memory MCP - это навык, который предоставляет постоянный и поисковый банк памяти, позволяющий автоматически синхронизироваться с документацией проекта","ar":"عامل ذاكرة ميمكب هو مهارة توفر بنك ذاكرة مستمر وقابل للبحث، مما يسمح بالمزامنة التلقائية مع توثيق المشروع","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Memoria bancaria persistente","Búsqueda y recuperación de datos","Sincronización automática con la documentación del proyecto","Compatibilidad con Node.js (v18+)","Instalación sencilla a través de npm"],"fr":["Mémoire bancaire persistante","Recherche et récupération de données","Synchronisation automatique avec la documentation du projet","Compatibilité avec Node.js (v18+)","Installation simple via npm"],"de":["Persistente Speicherbank","Durchsuchung und Wiederherstellung von Daten","Automatische Synchronisation mit der Projekt-Dokumentation","Kompatibilität mit Node.js (v18+)","Einfache Installation über npm"],"pt":["Banco de memória persistente","Pesquisável","Sincronização automática com documentação do projeto","Compatível com Node.js (v18+)","Instalação fácil via git clone"],"ru":["Постоянный банк памяти","Поисковый","Автоматическая синхронизация с документацией проекта","Совместим с Node.js (v18+)","Легкая установка через git clone"],"ar":["بنك ذاكرة مستمر","قابل للبحث","المزامنة التلقائية مع توثيق المشروع","متوافق مع Node.js (v18+)","تثبيت容易 عبر git clone"]},"keywords":{"es":["agent memory mcp","memoria persistente","desarrollo de software","nodejs","npm","proyecto de desarrollo","documentación del proyecto","búsqueda de datos"],"fr":["agent memory mcp","mémoire persistante","développement de logiciels","nodejs","npm","projet de développement","documentation du projet","recherche de données"],"de":["agent memory mcp","persistente speicher","software-entwicklung","nodejs","npm","entwicklungsprojekt","projekt-dokumentation","datensuche"],"pt":["agent memory mcp","banco de memória persistente","pesquisável","sincronização automática","node.js","git clone","desenvolvimento de software","armazenamento de memória"],"ru":["agent memory mcp","постоянный банк памяти","поисковый","автоматическая синхронизация","node.js","git clone","разработка программного обеспечения","хранение памяти"],"ar":["عامل ذاكرة ميمكب","بنك ذاكرة مستمر","قابل للبحث","المزامنة التلقائية","node.js","git clone","تطوير البرمجيات","تخزين الذاكرة"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.541Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-memory-mcp","description":"A hybrid memory system that provides persistent, searchable knowledge management for AI agents (Architecture, Patterns, Decisions).","bodyPreview":"# Agent Memory Skill\n\nThis skill provides a persistent, searchable memory bank that automatically syncs with project documentation. It runs as an MCP server to allow reading/writing/searching of long-term memories.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js (v18+)\n\n## Setup\n\n1. **Clone the Repository**:\n   Clone the `agentMemory` project into your agent''s workspace or a parallel directory:\n\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/webzler/agentMemory.git .agent/skills/agent-memory\n   ```\n\n2. **Install Depen","body":"# Agent Memory Skill\n\nThis skill provides a persistent, searchable memory bank that automatically syncs with project documentation. It runs as an MCP server to allow reading/writing/searching of long-term memories.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js (v18+)\n\n## Setup\n\n1. **Clone the Repository**:\n   Clone the `agentMemory` project into your agent''s workspace or a parallel directory:\n\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/webzler/agentMemory.git .agent/skills/agent-memory\n   ```\n\n2. **Install Dependencies**:\n\n   ```bash\n   cd .agent/skills/agent-memory\n   npm install\n   npm run compile\n   ```\n\n3. **Start the MCP Server**:\n   Use the helper script to activate the memory bank for your current project:\n\n   ```bash\n   npm run start-server <project_id> <absolute_path_to_target_workspace>\n   ```\n\n   _Example for current directory:_\n\n   ```bash\n   npm run start-server my-project $(pwd)\n   ```\n\n## Capabilities (MCP Tools)\n\n### `memory_search`\n\nSearch for memories by query, type, or tags.\n\n- **Args**: `query` (string), `type?` (string), `tags?` (string[])\n- **Usage**: \"Find all authentication patterns\" -> `memory_search({ query: \"authentication\", type: \"pattern\" })`\n\n### `memory_write`\n\nRecord new knowledge or decisions.\n\n- **Args**: `key` (string), `type` (string), `content` (string), `tags?` (string[])\n- **Usage**: \"Save this architecture decision\" -> `memory_write({ key: \"auth-v1\", type: \"decision\", content: \"...\" })`\n\n### `memory_read`\n\nRetrieve specific memory content by key.\n\n- **Args**: `key` (string)\n- **Usage**: \"Get the auth design\" -> `memory_read({ key: \"auth-v1\" })`\n\n### `memory_stats`\n\nView analytics on memory usage.\n\n- **Usage**: \"Show memory statistics\" -> `memory_stats({})`\n\n## Dashboard\n\nThis skill includes a standalone dashboard to visualize memory usage.\n\n```bash\nnpm run start-dashboard <absolute_path_to_target_workspace>\n```\n\nAccess at: `http://localhost:3333`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:23:36.253Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code requiring a persistent and searchable memory bank to enhance their knowledge retention and recall capabilities.","zh":"适合像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI 代理，它们需要一个持久且可搜索的内存库来增强其知识保留和回忆能力。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに最適で、知識の保持と再現能力を高めるために、持続性と検索可能なメモリーバンクを必要とする。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 최적화되어 있으며 지식 유지 및 회상 능력을 향상시키기 위해 지속적이고 검색 가능한 메모리 뱅크가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que requieren un banco de memoria persistente y searchable para mejorar sus capacidades de retención y recuperación de conocimientos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une banque de mémoire persistante et recherchable pour améliorer leurs capacités de rétention et de rappel des connaissances.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die ein persistierendes und durchsuchbares Speicherbank benötigen, um ihre Wissensspeicher- und Abrufkapazitäten zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que requerem um banco de memória persistente e pesquisável para melhorar sua retenção e capacidades de recuperação de conhecimento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, требующих постоянного и поискового банка памяти для улучшения их удержания знаний и возможностей воспоминания.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يتطلبون بنك ذاكرة دائم وقابل للبحث لتعزيز استيعابهم وتذكرهم للمعرفة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automatically sync their memories with project documentation, utilizing a Node.js-based MCP server for seamless reading, writing, and searching of long-term memories, leveraging the power of persistent memory storage and query functionality.","zh":"使代理能够自动将其记忆与项目文档同步，利用基于 Node.js 的 MCP 服务器实现无缝的长期记忆读取、写入和搜索，利用持久性记忆存储和查询功能的力量。","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクトのドキュメントと記憶を自動的に同期できるようにし、Node.js ベースの MCP サーバーを使用して、長期の記憶の読み取り、書き込み、検索をシームレスに行い、持続的な記憶の保存と検索機能の力を活用する。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 문서와 기억을 자동으로 동기화할 수 있도록 하며 Node.js 기반 MCP 서버를 사용하여 긴급한 기억의 읽기, 쓰기 및 검색을 원활하게 수행하며 지속적인 기억 저장 및 쿼리 기능의 힘을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes sincronizar automáticamente sus memorias con la documentación del proyecto, utilizando un servidor MCP basado en Node.js para una lectura, escritura y búsqueda sin problemas de memorias a largo plazo, aprovechando el poder del almacenamiento de memoria persistente y la funcionalidad de consulta.","fr":"Permet aux agents de synchroniser automatiquement leurs mémoires avec la documentation de projet, en utilisant un serveur MCP basé sur Node.js pour une lecture, écriture et recherche sans problème des mémoires à long terme, en exploitant le pouvoir du stockage de mémoire persistante et de la fonctionnalité de requête.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, ihre Erinnerungen automatisch mit der Projektdokumentation zu synchronisieren, indem sie einen auf Node.js basierenden MCP-Server für ein reibungsloses Lesen, Schreiben und Suchen von Langzeitgedächtnissen verwenden, wodurch die Leistung des persistenten Speicher- und Abfragespeichers genutzt wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes sincronizem automaticamente suas memórias com a documentação do projeto, utilizando um servidor MCP baseado em Node.js para leitura, gravação e pesquisa de memórias de longo prazo, aproveitando o poder do armazenamento de memória persistente e funcionalidade de consulta.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматически синхронизировать свои воспоминания с документацией проекта, используя сервер MCP на основе Node.js для беспрепятственного чтения, записи и поиска долгосрочных воспоминаний, используя возможности постоянного хранилища памяти и функции запроса.","ar":"تمكن العميل من مزامنة ذاكرته تلقائيًا مع توثيق المشروع، باستخدام خادم MCP temel على Node.js لقراءة وكتابة وبحث الذاكرة الطويلة الأجل، واستخدام قوة تخزين الذاكرة الدائم ووظائف الاستعلام."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating knowledge base updates","Generating memory-based responses","Searching and retrieving specific memories for informed decision-making"],"zh":["自动更新知识库","生成基于记忆的响应","搜索和检索特定的记忆以进行明智的决策"],"ja":["ナレッジベースの自動更新","メモリーベースのレスポンスの生成","特定の記憶の検索と取得による情報に基づいた意思決定"],"ko":["지식 베이스 자동 업데이트","기억 기반 응답 생성","특정 기억의 검색 및 검색을 통한 정보에 따른 의사 결정"],"es":["Automatización de actualizaciones de la base de conocimientos","Generación de respuestas basadas en la memoria","Búsqueda y recuperación de memorias específicas para la toma de decisiones informadas"],"fr":["Automatisation des mises à jour de la base de connaissances","Génération de réponses basées sur la mémoire","Recherche et récupération de mémoires spécifiques pour la prise de décision éclairée"],"de":["Automatisierung von Wissensbasis-Aktualisierungen","Erzeugung von auf Erinnerungen basierenden Antworten","Suchen und Abrufen spezifischer Erinnerungen für fundierte Entscheidungsfindung"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações da base de conhecimento","Gerar respostas baseadas em memória","Pesquisar e recuperar memórias específicas para tomada de decisão informada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления базы знаний","Генерировать ответы на основе памяти","Поиск и извлечение конкретных воспоминаний для принятия обоснованных решений"],"ar":["تحديث قاعدة المعرفة تلقائيًا","توليد استجابات قائمة على الذاكرة","البحث واسترجاع ذكريات محددة لاتخاذ القرارات المستنيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js version 18 or higher","Needs git repository cloning and setup"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 版本 18 或更高","需要 git 存储库克隆和设置"],"ja":["Node.js バージョン 18 以上が必要","Git リポジトリのクローンとセットアップが必要"],"ko":["Node.js 버전 18 이상 필요","git 저장소 클론 및 설정 필요"],"es":["Requiere la versión 18 o superior de Node.js","Necesita clonación y configuración del repositorio git"],"fr":["Nécessite la version 18 ou supérieure de Node.js","Nécessite le clonage et la configuration du référentiel git"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js Version 18 oder höher","Benötigt Klonen und Einrichten des Git-Repositorys"],"pt":["Requer Node.js versão 18 ou superior","Necessita clonagem e configuração do repositório git"],"ru":["Требует Node.js версии 18 или выше","Требует клонирования и настройки репозитория git"],"ar":["يتطلب Node.js الإصدار 18 أو أعلى","يحتاج إلى استنساخ وتكوين مستودع git"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
