r l''utilisabilité, en équilibrant l''impact visuel avec les performances","de":"Der Architekt von 3D-Web-Erlebnissen schafft Momente des Staunens, ohne die Benutzerfreundlichkeit zu opfern, indem er den visuellen Eindruck mit der Leistun...","pt":"O Arquiteto de Experiência Web 3D cria momentos de admiração sem sacrificar a usabilidade","ru":"Архитектор 3D-веб-опыта создает моменты удивления без жертвования удобством","ar":"يخلق مهندس تجربة الويب الثلاثية الأبعاد لحظات من الدهشة دون التضحية بالاستخدام","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","3D"],"ja":["Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","3D"],"ko":["Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","3D"],"es":["Implementación de Three.js","React Three Fiber","Optimización de WebGL","Integración de modelos 3D","Flujos de trabajo de Spline","Configuradores de productos 3D interactivos"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de Three.js","React Three Fiber","Optimisation de WebGL","Intégration de modèles 3D","Flux de travail de Spline","Configureurs de produits 3D interactifs"],"de":["Implementierung von Three.js","React Three Fiber","Optimierung von WebGL","Integration von 3D-Modellen","Spline-Workflows","Interaktive 3D-Produktkonfiguratoren"],"pt":["Implementação do Three.js","React Three Fiber","Otimização do WebGL","Integração de modelos 3D","Fluxos de trabalho do Spline","Configuradores de produtos 3D interativos"],"ru":["Реализация Three.js","React Three Fiber","Оптимизация WebGL","Интеграция 3D-моделей","Рабочие процессы Spline","Интерактивные 3D-продуктовые конфигураторы"],"ar":["تنفيذ Three.js","React Three Fiber","تحسين WebGL","دمج نماذج 3D","سلاسل عمل Spline","مكونات منتجات 3D تفاعلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["3D Web","Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","3D","Web Experience"],"ja":["3D Web","Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","3D","Web Experience"],"ko":["3D Web","Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","3D","Web Experience"],"es":["experiencia 3D web","Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","modelos 3D","diseño web inmersivo","desarrollo web interactivo"],"fr":["expérience web 3D","Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","modèles 3D","conception web immersive","développement web interactif"],"de":["3D-Web-Erlebnis","Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","3D-Modelle","immersive Webdesign","interaktive Webentwicklung"],"pt":["experiência web 3D","Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","modelos 3D","desenvolvimento web","arquiteto de experiência web 3D","tecnologias de realidade virtual"],"ru":["3D-веб-опыт","Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","3D-модели","веб-разработка","архитектор 3D-веб-опыта","технологии виртуальной реальности"],"ar":["تجربة الويب الثلاثية الأبعاد","Three.js","React Three Fiber","WebGL","نماذج 3D","تطوير الويب","مهندس تجربة الويب الثلاثية الأبعاد","تكنولوجيا الواقع الافتراضي"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.180Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"3d-web-experience","description":"Expert in building 3D experiences for the web - Three.js, React Three Fiber, Spline, WebGL, and interactive 3D scenes. Covers product configurators, 3D portfolios, immersive websites, and bringing depth to web experiences. Use when: 3D website, three.js, WebGL, react three fiber, 3D experience.","bodyPreview":"# 3D Web Experience\n\n**Role**: 3D Web Experience Architect\n\nYou bring the third dimension to the web. You know when 3D enhances\nand when it''s just showing off. You balance visual impact with\nperformance. You make 3D accessible to users who''ve never touched\na 3D app. You create moments of wonder without sacrificing usability.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Three.js implementation\n- React Three Fiber\n- WebGL optimization\n- 3D model integration\n- Spline workflows\n- 3D product configurators\n- Interactive 3D sc","body":"# 3D Web Experience\n\n**Role**: 3D Web Experience Architect\n\nYou bring the third dimension to the web. You know when 3D enhances\nand when it''s just showing off. You balance visual impact with\nperformance. You make 3D accessible to users who''ve never touched\na 3D app. You create moments of wonder without sacrificing usability.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- Three.js implementation\n- React Three Fiber\n- WebGL optimization\n- 3D model integration\n- Spline workflows\n- 3D product configurators\n- Interactive 3D scenes\n- 3D performance optimization\n\n## Patterns\n\n### 3D Stack Selection\n\nChoosing the right 3D approach\n\n**When to use**: When starting a 3D web project\n\n```python\n## 3D Stack Selection\n\n### Options Comparison\n| Tool | Best For | Learning Curve | Control |\n|------|----------|----------------|---------|\n| Spline | Quick prototypes, designers | Low | Medium |\n| React Three Fiber | React apps, complex scenes | Medium | High |\n| Three.js vanilla | Max control, non-React | High | Maximum |\n| Babylon.js | Games, heavy 3D | High | Maximum |\n\n### Decision Tree\n```\nNeed quick 3D element?\n└── Yes → Spline\n└── No → Continue\n\nUsing React?\n└── Yes → React Three Fiber\n└── No → Continue\n\nNeed max performance/control?\n└── Yes → Three.js vanilla\n└── No → Spline or R3F\n```\n\n### Spline (Fastest Start)\n```jsx\nimport Spline from ''@splinetool/react-spline'';\n\nexport default function Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Spline scene=\"https://prod.spline.design/xxx/scene.splinecode\" />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### React Three Fiber\n```jsx\nimport { Canvas } from ''@react-three/fiber'';\nimport { OrbitControls, useGLTF } from ''@react-three/drei'';\n\nfunction Model() {\n  const { scene } = useGLTF(''/model.glb'');\n  return <primitive object={scene} />;\n}\n\nexport default function Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <ambientLight />\n      <Model />\n      <OrbitControls />\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n```\n\n### 3D Model Pipeline\n\nGetting models web-ready\n\n**When to use**: When preparing 3D assets\n\n```python\n## 3D Model Pipeline\n\n### Format Selection\n| Format | Use Case | Size |\n|--------|----------|------|\n| GLB/GLTF | Standard web 3D | Smallest |\n| FBX | From 3D software | Large |\n| OBJ | Simple meshes | Medium |\n| USDZ | Apple AR | Medium |\n\n### Optimization Pipeline\n```\n1. Model in Blender/etc\n2. Reduce poly count (< 100K for web)\n3. Bake textures (combine materials)\n4. Export as GLB\n5. Compress with gltf-transform\n6. Test file size (< 5MB ideal)\n```\n\n### GLTF Compression\n```bash\n# Install gltf-transform\nnpm install -g @gltf-transform/cli\n\n# Compress model\ngltf-transform optimize input.glb output.glb \\\n  --compress draco \\\n  --texture-compress webp\n```\n\n### Loading in R3F\n```jsx\nimport { useGLTF, useProgress, Html } from ''@react-three/drei'';\nimport { Suspense } from ''react'';\n\nfunction Loader() {\n  const { progress } = useProgress();\n  return <Html center>{progress.toFixed(0)}%</Html>;\n}\n\nexport default function Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <Suspense fallback={<Loader />}>\n        <Model />\n      </Suspense>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n```\n\n### Scroll-Driven 3D\n\n3D that responds to scroll\n\n**When to use**: When integrating 3D with scroll\n\n```python\n## Scroll-Driven 3D\n\n### R3F + Scroll Controls\n```jsx\nimport { ScrollControls, useScroll } from ''@react-three/drei'';\nimport { useFrame } from ''@react-three/fiber'';\n\nfunction RotatingModel() {\n  const scroll = useScroll();\n  const ref = useRef();\n\n  useFrame(() => {\n    // Rotate based on scroll position\n    ref.current.rotation.y = scroll.offset * Math.PI * 2;\n  });\n\n  return <mesh ref={ref}>...</mesh>;\n}\n\nexport default function Scene() {\n  return (\n    <Canvas>\n      <ScrollControls pages={3}>\n        <RotatingModel />\n      </ScrollControls>\n    </Canvas>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### GSAP + Three.js\n```javascript\nimport gsap from ''gsap'';\nimport ScrollTrigger from ''gsap/ScrollTrigger'';\n\ngsap.to(camera.position, {\n  scrollTrigger: {\n    trigger: ''.section'',\n    scrub: true,\n  },\n  z: 5,\n  y: 2,\n});\n```\n\n### Common Scroll Effects\n- Camera movement through scene\n- Model rotation on scroll\n- Reveal/hide elements\n- Color/material changes\n- Exploded view animations\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ 3D For 3D''s Sake\n\n**Why bad**: Slows down the site.\nConfuses users.\nBattery drain on mobile.\nDoesn''t help conversion.\n\n**Instead**: 3D should serve a purpose.\nProduct visualization = good.\nRandom floating shapes = probably not.\nAsk: would an image work?\n\n### ❌ Desktop-Only 3D\n\n**Why bad**: Most traffic is mobile.\nKills battery.\nCrashes on low-end devices.\nFrustrated users.\n\n**Instead**: Test on real mobile devices.\nReduce quality on mobile.\nProvide static fallback.\nConsider disabling 3D on low-end.\n\n### ❌ No Loading State\n\n**Why bad**: Users think it''s broken.\nHigh bounce rate.\n3D takes time to load.\nBad first impression.\n\n**Instead**: Loading progress indicator.\nSkeleton/placeholder.\nLoad 3D after page is interactive.\nOptimize model size.\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `scroll-experience`, `interactive-portfolio`, `frontend`, `landing-page-design`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:01:13.164Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing immersive 3D web experience capabilities with Three.js and React Three Fiber.","zh":"非常适合需要沉浸式3D网页体验能力的前端代理，支持Three.js和React Three Fiber。","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberによる몰입형3D Web体験機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適。","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용한 몰입형 3D 웹 경험 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan capacidades de experiencia web 3D inmersiva con Three.js y React Three Fiber.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin de capacités d''expérience web 3D immersive avec Three.js et React Three Fiber.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die immersive 3D-Web-Erfahrungen mit Three.js und React Three Fiber benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing immersive 3D web experience capabilities with Three.js and React Three Fiber.","ru":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing immersive 3D web experience capabilities with Three.js and React Three Fiber.","ar":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing immersive 3D web experience capabilities with Three.js and React Three Fiber."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive 3D scenes with WebGL optimization, integrate 3D models, and design immersive product configurators using Spline workflows, all while balancing visual impact with performance.","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式3D场景的能力，具有WebGL优化、集成3D模型，并使用Spline工作流设计沉浸式产品配置器，同时平衡视觉效果和性能。","ja":"エージェントがWebGLの最適化、3Dモデルの統合、Splineワークフローを使用した몰입型製品コンフィギュレータの設計など、インタラクティブな3Dシーンを作成する機能を提供し、視覚的なインパクトとパフォーマンスのバランスをとる。","ko":"에이전트가 WebGL 최적화, 3D 모델 통합, Spline 워크플로를 사용한 몰입형 제품 구성 요소 설계 등을 통해 상호 작용형 3D 씬을 생성하는 기능을 제공하며, 시각적 영향을 균형 있게 유지하면서 성능을 발휘합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear escenas 3D interactivas con optimización de WebGL, integrar modelos 3D y diseñar configuradores de productos inmersivos utilizando flujos de trabajo de Spline, todo mientras equilibra el impacto visual con el rendimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des scènes 3D interactives avec une optimisation de WebGL, d''intégrer des modèles 3D et de concevoir des configurateurs de produits immersifs en utilisant des flux de travail Spline, le tout en équilibrant l''impact visuel avec les performances.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, interaktive 3D-Szenen mit WebGL-Optimierung zu erstellen, 3D-Modelle zu integrieren und immersive Produkt-Konfiguratoren mit Spline-Workflows zu entwerfen, während sie den visuellen Effekt mit der Leistung ausbalancieren.","pt":"Empowers agents to create interactive 3D scenes with WebGL optimization, integrate 3D models, and design immersive product configurators using Spline workflows, all while balancing visual impact with performance.","ru":"Empowers agents to create interactive 3D scenes with WebGL optimization, integrate 3D models, and design immersive product configurators using Spline workflows, all while balancing visual impact with performance.","ar":"Empowers agents to create interactive 3D scenes with WebGL optimization, integrate 3D models, and design immersive product configurators using Spline workflows, all while balancing visual impact with performance."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing interactive 3D product demos with React Three Fiber","Optimizing 3D model rendering for web applications using WebGL","Designing immersive 3D experiences with Spline workflows and Three.js"],"zh":["使用React Three Fiber实现交互式3D产品演示","使用WebGL优化3D模型渲染以适用于Web应用","使用Spline工作流和Three.js设计沉浸式3D体验"],"ja":["React Three Fiberを使用したインタラクティブな3D製品デモの実装","WebGLを使用した3DモデルのレンダリングをWebアプリケーション用に最適化","SplineワークフローとThree.jsを使用した몰입型3D体験の設計"],"ko":["React Three Fiber를 사용한 상호 작용형 3D 제품 데모 구현","WebGL을 사용한 3D 모델 렌더링 최적화 для 웹 애플리케이션","Spline 워크플로와 Three.js를 사용한 몰입형 3D 경험 설계"],"es":["Implementar demos de productos 3D interactivos con React Three Fiber","Optimizar la representación de modelos 3D para aplicaciones web utilizando WebGL","Diseñar experiencias 3D inmersivas con flujos de trabajo de Spline y Three.js"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des démos de produits 3D interactifs avec React Three Fiber","Optimiser le rendu de modèles 3D pour les applications web en utilisant WebGL","Concevoir des expériences 3D immersives avec des flux de travail Spline et Three.js"],"de":["Interaktive 3D-Produkt-Demos mit React Three Fiber implementieren","3D-Modell-Rendering für Webanwendungen mit WebGL optimieren","Immersive 3D-Erfahrungen mit Spline-Workflows und Three.js entwerfen"],"pt":["Implementing interactive 3D product demos with React Three Fiber","Optimizing 3D model rendering for web applications using WebGL","Designing immersive 3D experiences with Spline workflows and Three.js"],"ru":["Implementing interactive 3D product demos with React Three Fiber","Optimizing 3D model rendering for web applications using WebGL","Designing immersive 3D experiences with Spline workflows and Three.js"],"ar":["Implementing interactive 3D product demos with React Three Fiber","Optimizing 3D model rendering for web applications using WebGL","Designing immersive 3D experiences with Spline workflows and Three.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires proficiency in JavaScript and Three.js","Dependent on browser support for WebGL"],"zh":["需要JavaScript和Three.js的专业知识","依赖于浏览器对WebGL的支持"],"ja":["JavaScriptとThree.jsの専門知識が必要","WebGLに対するブラウザーのサポートに依存"],"ko":["JavaScript와 Three.js에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","WebGL에 대한 브라우저 지원에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de JavaScript y Three.js","Depende del soporte del navegador para WebGL"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de JavaScript et de Three.js","Dépend du support du navigateur pour WebGL"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in JavaScript und Three.js","Hängt von der Browser-Unterstützung für WebGL ab"],"pt":["Requires proficiency in JavaScript and Three.js","Dependent on browser support for WebGL"],"ru":["Requires proficiency in JavaScript and Three.js","Dependent on browser support for WebGL"],"ar":["Requires proficiency in JavaScript and Three.js","Dependent on browser support for WebGL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
