Vorschau von Änderungen","Anpassbare Deploy-Prinzipien","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Princípios de implantação","Adaptação de procedimentos para plataformas","Entendimento do porquê de cada etapa","Uso de AI para sugestão de patches","Visualização de patches antes da aplicação"],"ru":["Принципы развертывания","Адаптация процедур для платформ","Понимание причин каждого этапа","Использование ИИ для предложения патчей","Просмотр патчей перед применением"],"ar":["مبادئ النشر","تعديل الإجراءات لمنصات","فهم سبب كل مرحلة","استخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي لاقتراح التصحيحات","معاينة التصحيحات قبل التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["部署程序","部署原则","AI模型","LLM","ChatGPT","生产发布","安全性","生产力"],"ja":["デプロイ手順","デプロイの原則","AIモデル","LLM","ChatGPT","プロダクションリリース","セキュリティ","生産性"],"ko":["배포 절차","배포 원칙","AI 모델","LLM","ChatGPT","프로덕션 릴리스","보안성","생산성"],"es":["despliegue de código","seguridad en la producción","parches de IA","principios de despliegue","plataformas de despliegue","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","devops"],"fr":["déploiement de code","sécurité en production","correctifs IA","principes de déploiement","plateformes de déploiement","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","devops"],"de":["Code-Bereitstellung","Sicherheit in der Produktion","AI-Patches","Deploy-Prinzipien","Bereitstellungsplattformen","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","devops"],"pt":["implantação de código","procedimentos de implantação","AI para desenvolvimento","segurança de implantação","plataformas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["развертывание кода","процедуры развертывания","ИИ для разработки","безопасность развертывания","платформы разработки","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["نشر الكود","إجراءات النشر","ذكاء اصطناعي للتنمية","أمان النشر","منصات التنمية","تنمية البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"HaoNgo232","repo":"Synapse-Desktop","repoPath":"HaoNgo232/Synapse-Desktop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.540Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deployment-procedures","description":"Production deployment principles and decision-making. Safe deployment workflows, rollback strategies, and verification. Teaches thinking, not scripts.","bodyPreview":"# Deployment Procedures\n\n> Deployment principles and decision-making for safe production releases.\n> **Learn to THINK, not memorize scripts.**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ How to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill teaches **deployment principles**, not bash scripts to copy.\n\n- Every deployment is unique\n- Understand the WHY behind each step\n- Adapt procedures to your platform\n\n---\n\n## 1. Platform Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat are you deploying?\n│\n├── Static site / JAMstack\n│   └── Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pa","body":"# Deployment Procedures\n\n> Deployment principles and decision-making for safe production releases.\n> **Learn to THINK, not memorize scripts.**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ How to Use This Skill\n\nThis skill teaches **deployment principles**, not bash scripts to copy.\n\n- Every deployment is unique\n- Understand the WHY behind each step\n- Adapt procedures to your platform\n\n---\n\n## 1. Platform Selection\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nWhat are you deploying?\n│\n├── Static site / JAMstack\n│   └── Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages\n│\n├── Simple web app\n│   ├── Managed → Railway, Render, Fly.io\n│   └── Control → VPS + PM2/Docker\n│\n├── Microservices\n│   └── Container orchestration\n│\n└── Serverless\n    └── Edge functions, Lambda\n```\n\n### Each Platform Has Different Procedures\n\n| Platform | Deployment Method |\n|----------|------------------|\n| **Vercel/Netlify** | Git push, auto-deploy |\n| **Railway/Render** | Git push or CLI |\n| **VPS + PM2** | SSH + manual steps |\n| **Docker** | Image push + orchestration |\n| **Kubernetes** | kubectl apply |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Pre-Deployment Principles\n\n### The 4 Verification Categories\n\n| Category | What to Check |\n|----------|--------------|\n| **Code Quality** | Tests passing, linting clean, reviewed |\n| **Build** | Production build works, no warnings |\n| **Environment** | Env vars set, secrets current |\n| **Safety** | Backup done, rollback plan ready |\n\n### Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n- [ ] All tests passing\n- [ ] Code reviewed and approved\n- [ ] Production build successful\n- [ ] Environment variables verified\n- [ ] Database migrations ready (if any)\n- [ ] Rollback plan documented\n- [ ] Team notified\n- [ ] Monitoring ready\n\n---\n\n## 3. Deployment Workflow Principles\n\n### The 5-Phase Process\n\n```\n1. PREPARE\n   └── Verify code, build, env vars\n\n2. BACKUP\n   └── Save current state before changing\n\n3. DEPLOY\n   └── Execute with monitoring open\n\n4. VERIFY\n   └── Health check, logs, key flows\n\n5. CONFIRM or ROLLBACK\n   └── All good? Confirm. Issues? Rollback.\n```\n\n### Phase Principles\n\n| Phase | Principle |\n|-------|-----------|\n| **Prepare** | Never deploy untested code |\n| **Backup** | Can''t rollback without backup |\n| **Deploy** | Watch it happen, don''t walk away |\n| **Verify** | Trust but verify |\n| **Confirm** | Have rollback trigger ready |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Post-Deployment Verification\n\n### What to Verify\n\n| Check | Why |\n|-------|-----|\n| **Health endpoint** | Service is running |\n| **Error logs** | No new errors |\n| **Key user flows** | Critical features work |\n| **Performance** | Response times acceptable |\n\n### Verification Window\n\n- **First 5 minutes**: Active monitoring\n- **15 minutes**: Confirm stable\n- **1 hour**: Final verification\n- **Next day**: Review metrics\n\n---\n\n## 5. Rollback Principles\n\n### When to Rollback\n\n| Symptom | Action |\n|---------|--------|\n| Service down | Rollback immediately |\n| Critical errors | Rollback |\n| Performance >50% degraded | Consider rollback |\n| Minor issues | Fix forward if quick |\n\n### Rollback Strategy by Platform\n\n| Platform | Rollback Method |\n|----------|----------------|\n| **Vercel/Netlify** | Redeploy previous commit |\n| **Railway/Render** | Rollback in dashboard |\n| **VPS + PM2** | Restore backup, restart |\n| **Docker** | Previous image tag |\n| **K8s** | kubectl rollout undo |\n\n### Rollback Principles\n\n1. **Speed over perfection**: Rollback first, debug later\n2. **Don''t compound errors**: One rollback, not multiple changes\n3. **Communicate**: Tell team what happened\n4. **Post-mortem**: Understand why after stable\n\n---\n\n## 6. Zero-Downtime Deployment\n\n### Strategies\n\n| Strategy | How It Works |\n|----------|--------------|\n| **Rolling** | Replace instances one by one |\n| **Blue-Green** | Switch traffic between environments |\n| **Canary** | Gradual traffic shift |\n\n### Selection Principles\n\n| Scenario | Strategy |\n|----------|----------|\n| Standard release | Rolling |\n| High-risk change | Blue-green (easy rollback) |\n| Need validation | Canary (test with real traffic) |\n\n---\n\n## 7. Emergency Procedures\n\n### Service Down Priority\n\n1. **Assess**: What''s the symptom?\n2. **Quick fix**: Restart if unclear\n3. **Rollback**: If restart doesn''t help\n4. **Investigate**: After stable\n\n### Investigation Order\n\n| Check | Common Issues |\n|-------|--------------|\n| **Logs** | Errors, exceptions |\n| **Resources** | Disk full, memory |\n| **Network** | DNS, firewall |\n| **Dependencies** | Database, APIs |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| Deploy on Friday | Deploy early in week |\n| Rush deployment | Follow the process |\n| Skip staging | Always test first |\n| Deploy without backup | Backup before deploy |\n| Walk away after deploy | Monitor for 15+ min |\n| Multiple changes at once | One change at a time |\n\n---\n\n## 9. Decision Checklist\n\nBefore deploying:\n\n- [ ] **Platform-appropriate procedure?**\n- [ ] **Backup strategy ready?**\n- [ ] **Rollback plan documented?**\n- [ ] **Monitoring configured?**\n- [ ] **Team notified?**\n- [ ] **Time to monitor after?**\n\n---\n\n## 10. Best Practices\n\n1. **Small, frequent deploys** over big releases\n2. **Feature flags** for risky changes\n3. **Automate** repetitive steps\n4. **Document** every deployment\n5. **Review** what went wrong after issues\n6. **Test rollback** before you need it\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Every deployment is a risk. Minimize risk through preparation, not speed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T02:01:47.214Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced deployment strategy and patch management capabilities.","zh":"適合於像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code等需要先進部署策略和補丁管理能力的AI代理","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Codeなどの高度な展開戦略とパッチ管理機能を必要とするAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 고급 배포 전략 및 패치 관리 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una estrategia de implementación avanzada y capacidades de administración de parches.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une stratégie de déploiement avancée et des capacités de gestion de correctifs.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine erweiterte Bereitstellungsstrategie und Patch-Management-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de estratégias avançadas de implantação e capacidades de gerenciamento de patches.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которые требуют продвинутой стратегии развертывания и возможностей управления исправлениями.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات وكيلات الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى استراتيجية نشر متقدمة وقدرات إدارة التصحيحات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract codebase context for any LLM and safely apply AI-suggested patches with preview, leveraging deployment principles and decision-making for safe production releases using platforms like Vercel, Netlify, and Cloudflare.","zh":"賦予代理從任何LLM中提取代碼庫上下文的能力，並使用預覽安全地應用AI建議的補丁，利用部署原則和決策以安全地發布生產版本，使用像Vercel、Netlify和Cloudflare等平臺","ja":"任意のLLMからコードベースのコンテキストを抽出してAIが提案したパッチをプレビューを使用して安全に適用する機能をエージェントに与え、Vercel、Netlify、Cloudflareなどのプラットフォームを使用して展開の原則と意思決定を使用して安全に生产バージョンをリリースする","ko":"임의의 LLM에서 코드베이스 컨텍스트를 추출하여 AI가 제안한 패치를 미리 보기를 사용하여 안전하게 적용할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하여 Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare 등의 플랫폼을 사용하여 배포 원칙과 의사 결정을 사용하여 안전하게 프로덕션 버전을 배포합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes extraer el contexto de la base de código para cualquier LLM y aplicar de forma segura parches sugeridos por la IA con vista previa, aprovechando los principios de implementación y la toma de decisiones para lanzamientos de producción seguros utilizando plataformas como Vercel, Netlify y Cloudflare.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire le contexte de la base de code pour n''importe quel LLM et d''appliquer en toute sécurité des correctifs suggérés par l''IA avec aperçu, en exploitant les principes de déploiement et la prise de décision pour des versions de production sécurisées en utilisant des plateformes comme Vercel, Netlify et Cloudflare.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, den Kontext der Codebasis für jedes LLM zu extrahieren und vorgeschlagene KI-Patches mit Vorschau sicher anzuwenden, indem es die Bereitstellungsgrundsätze und Entscheidungsfindung für sichere Produktionsversionen unter Verwendung von Plattformen wie Vercel, Netlify und Cloudflare nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair o contexto do código para qualquer LLM e aplicar patches sugeridos por IA com visualização, aproveitando os princípios de implantação e a tomada de decisões para lançamentos de produção seguros usando plataformas como Vercel, Netlify e Cloudflare.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать контекст кодовой базы для любого LLM и безопасно применять исправления, предложенные ИИ, с предварительным просмотром, используя принципы развертывания и принятие решений для безопасных выпусков в производство с использованием платформ như Vercel, Netlify и Cloudflare.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استخراج سياق قاعدة الشفرة لأي LLM وتطبيق التصحيحات المقترحة بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي مع معاينة، واستخدام مبادئ النشر و اتخاذ القرارات من أجل إصدارات الإنتاج الآمنة باستخدام منصات مثل Vercel و Netlify و Cloudflare."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating deployment procedures for unique platforms","Generating patch previews for LLMs like ChatGPT and Gemini","Adapting deployment procedures to specific platform requirements"],"zh":["自動化針對獨特平臺的部署程序","為ChatGPT和Gemini等LLM生成補丁預覽","根據特定平臺的要求適應部署程序"],"ja":["ユニークなプラットフォーム向けの展開手順の自動化","ChatGPTやGeminiなどのLLMのパッチプレビューの生成","特定のプラットフォームの要件に応じた展開手順の適応"],"ko":["고유한 플랫폼을 위한 배포 절차 자동화","ChatGPT와 Gemini 등의 LLM을 위한 패치 미리 보기 생성","특정 플랫폼의 요구 사항에 따른 배포 절차 적응"],"es":["Automatizar procedimientos de implementación para plataformas únicas","Generar vistas previas de parches para LLM como ChatGPT y Gemini","Adaptar procedimientos de implementación a requisitos específicos de la plataforma"],"fr":["Automatiser les procédures de déploiement pour des plateformes uniques","Générer des aperçus de correctifs pour des LLM comme ChatGPT et Gemini","Adapter les procédures de déploiement aux exigences spécifiques de la plateforme"],"de":["Automatisierung von Bereitstellungsverfahren für einzigartige Plattformen","Erzeugen von Vorschauen für LLM-Patches wie ChatGPT und Gemini","Anpassen von Bereitstellungsverfahren an plataformspezifische Anforderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar procedimentos de implantação para plataformas únicas","Gerar visualizações de patches para LLMs como ChatGPT e Gemini","Adaptar procedimentos de implantação a requisitos específicos de plataforma"],"ru":["Автоматизировать процедуры развертывания для уникальных платформ","Генерировать предварительные просмотры исправлений для LLM, таких как ChatGPT и Gemini","Адаптировать процедуры развертывания к конкретным требованиям платформы"],"ar":["أتمتة إجراءات النشر لمنصات فريدة","генерация معاينة لتصحيحات LLMs مثل ChatGPT و Gemini","تكييف إجراءات النشر مع متطلبات منصة محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of deployment principles and decision-making","Adaptation to platform-specific requirements necessary","Limited to LLMs like ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini"],"zh":["需要了解部署原則和決策","需要適應平臺特定的要求","僅限於ChatGPT、Claude和Gemini等LLM"],"ja":["展開の原則と意思決定の理解が必要","プラットフォーム特有の要件への適応が必要","ChatGPT、Claude、GeminiなどのLLMのみに限定"],"ko":["배포 원칙과 의사 결정의 이해가 필요합니다","플랫폼 특정 요구 사항에 대한 적응이 필요합니다","ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini 등의 LLM에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de implementación y toma de decisiones","Se requiere adaptación a los requisitos específicos de la plataforma","Limitado a LLM como ChatGPT, Claude y Gemini"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de déploiement et de la prise de décision","L''adaptation aux exigences spécifiques de la plateforme est nécessaire","Limité à des LLM comme ChatGPT, Claude et Gemini"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Bereitstellungsgrundsätze und Entscheidungsfindung","Anpassung an plataformspezifische Anforderungen erforderlich","Begrenzt auf LLM wie ChatGPT, Claude und Gemini"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios de implantação e tomada de decisões","Adaptação aos requisitos específicos da plataforma necessária","Limitado a LLMs como ChatGPT, Claude e Gemini"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов развертывания и принятия решений","Необходимо адаптироваться к конкретным требованиям платформы","Ограничен LLM, такими как ChatGPT, Claude и Gemini"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ النشر و اتخاذ القرارات","التكيف مع متطلبات منصة محددة ضروري","محدود بالـ LLMs مثل ChatGPT و Claude و Gemini"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
