ageMagick","Sharp"],"ar":["ضغط الصور","تحسين سرعة التحميل","أدوات التطوير","baoyu-compress-image","sips","cwebp","ImageMagick","Sharp"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.542Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-compress-image","description":"Compresses images to WebP (default) or PNG with automatic tool selection. Use when user asks to compress image, optimize image, convert to webp, or reduce image file size.","bodyPreview":"# Image Compressor\n\nCompresses images using best available tool (sips → cwebp → ImageMagick → Sharp).\n\n## Script Directory\n\nScripts in `scripts/` subdirectory. Replace `${SKILL_DIR}` with this SKILL.md''s directory path.\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | Image compression CLI |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-compress-image/EXTEND.md && echo \"project","body":"# Image Compressor\n\nCompresses images using best available tool (sips → cwebp → ImageMagick → Sharp).\n\n## Script Directory\n\nScripts in `scripts/` subdirectory. Replace `${SKILL_DIR}` with this SKILL.md''s directory path.\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | Image compression CLI |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-compress-image/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-compress-image/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                          Path                          │     Location      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-compress-image/EXTEND.md           │ Project directory │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-compress-image/EXTEND.md     │ User home         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default format | Default quality | Keep original preference\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <input> [options]\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Short | Description | Default |\n|--------|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `<input>` | | File or directory | Required |\n| `--output` | `-o` | Output path | Same path, new ext |\n| `--format` | `-f` | webp, png, jpeg | webp |\n| `--quality` | `-q` | Quality 0-100 | 80 |\n| `--keep` | `-k` | Keep original | false |\n| `--recursive` | `-r` | Process subdirs | false |\n| `--json` | | JSON output | false |\n\n## Examples\n\n```bash\n# Single file → WebP (replaces original)\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts image.png\n\n# Keep PNG format\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts image.png -f png --keep\n\n# Directory recursive\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts ./images/ -r -q 75\n\n# JSON output\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts image.png --json\n```\n\n**Output**:\n```\nimage.png → image.webp (245KB → 89KB, 64% reduction)\n```\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T03:59:07.754Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp.","zh":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp.","ja":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp.","ko":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp.","es":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp.","fr":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp.","de":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp.","pt":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp.","ru":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp.","ar":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents requiring efficient image compression using tools like sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration.","zh":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration.","ja":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration.","ko":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration.","es":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration.","fr":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration.","de":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration.","pt":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration.","ru":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration.","ar":"Empowers agents to compress images using the best available tools, supporting various image formats through command-line interfaces like `scripts/main.ts`, and leveraging preferences configured in EXTEND.md for seamless integration."},"useCases":{"en":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"],"zh":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"],"ja":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"],"ko":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"],"es":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"],"fr":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"],"de":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"],"pt":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"],"ru":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"],"ar":["Compressing web images for faster page loads","Optimizing image storage using cwebp and ImageMagick","Automating image compression tasks with Bash scripts"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"],"zh":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"],"ja":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"],"ko":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"],"es":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"],"fr":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"],"de":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"],"pt":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"],"ru":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"],"ar":["Requires Bash for EXTEND.md checks","Dependent on availability of sips, cwebp, ImageMagick, and Sharp tools"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
