ne learning models from notebooks to src/ layout","Implementing a Hybrid Paradigm with OOP structure and Functional purity for model development","Enforcing Strict Configuration for model scalability, security, and maintainability"],"ko":["Productionizing machine learning models from notebooks to src/ layout","Implementing a Hybrid Paradigm with OOP structure and Functional purity for model development","Enforcing Strict Configuration for model scalability, security, and maintainability"],"es":["Productionizing machine learning models from notebooks to src/ layout","Implementing a Hybrid Paradigm with OOP structure and Functional purity for model development","Enforcing Strict Configuration for model scalability, security, and maintainability"],"fr":["Productionizing machine learning models from notebooks to src/ layout","Implementing a Hybrid Paradigm with OOP structure and Functional purity for model development","Enforcing Strict Configuration for model scalability, security, and maintainability"],"de":["Productionizing machine learning models from notebooks to src/ layout","Implementing a Hybrid Paradigm with OOP structure and Functional purity for model development","Enforcing Strict Configuration for model scalability, security, and maintainability"],"pt":["Productionizing machine learning models from notebooks to src/ layout","Implementing a Hybrid Paradigm with OOP structure and Functional purity for model development","Enforcing Strict Configuration for model scalability, security, and maintainability"],"ru":["Productionizing machine learning models from notebooks to src/ layout","Implementing a Hybrid Paradigm with OOP structure and Functional purity for model development","Enforcing Strict Configuration for model scalability, security, and maintainability"],"ar":["Productionizing machine learning models from notebooks to src/ layout","Implementing a Hybrid Paradigm with OOP structure and Functional purity for model development","Enforcing Strict Configura