roteger tu código con pruebas de seguridad estáticas","fr":"La configuration SAST vous permet de protéger votre code avec des tests de sécurité statiques","de":"Die SAST-Konfiguration ermöglicht es Ihnen, Ihren Code mit statischen Sicherheitstests zu schützen","pt":"O SAST é uma ferramenta de segurança de aplicativos que ajuda a detectar vulnerabilidades no código. Aprenda a configurá-lo","ru":"SAST - это инструмент безопасности приложений, который помогает обнаруживать уязвимости в коде. Узнайте, как его настроить","ar":"SAST هي أداة أمن التطبيقات التي تساعد في اكتشاف الثغرات في الشفرة. تعلم كيفية تكوينها","en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"definition":{"en":"AesopIDE with Antigravity-inspired UI\""},"features":{"zh":["SAST工具设置和配置","创建自定义安全规则","配置质量门槛和合规性","支持多种编程语言","集成CI/CD管道"],"ja":["SASTツールの設定と構成","カスタムセキュリティルールの作成","品質ゲートとコンプライアンスの構成","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","CI/CDパイプラインとの統合"],"ko":["SAST 도구 설정 및 구성","사용자 지정 보안 규칙 생성","품질 게이트 및 규정 준수 구성","다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원","CI/CD 파이프라인 통합"],"es":["Configuración de herramientas SAST","Creación de reglas de seguridad personalizadas","Integración con pipelines de CI/CD","Análisis de código en múltiples lenguajes de programación","Configuración de puertas de calidad y cumplimiento"],"fr":["Configuration des outils SAST","Création de règles de sécurité personnalisées","Intégration avec les pipelines de CI/CD","Analyse de code dans plusieurs langages de programmation","Configuration des portes de qualité et de conformité"],"de":["Konfiguration von SAST-Tools","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Sicherheitsregeln","Integration mit CI/CD-Pipelines","Code-Analyse in mehreren Programmiersprachen","Konfiguration von Qualitäts- und Compliance-Toren"],"pt":["Configuração de ferramentas SAST","Criação de regras de segurança personalizadas","Integração com pipelines de CI/CD","Análise de código em várias linguagens","Configuração de portas de qualidade e conformidade"],"ru":["Настройка инструментов SAST","Создание пользовательских правил безопасности","Интеграция с конвейерами CI/CD","Анализ кода на нескольких языках","Настройка ворот качества и соответствия"],"ar":["تكوين أدوات SAST","إنشاء قواعد أمان مخصصة","التكامل مع أنابيب CI/CD","تحليل الشفرة في لغات متعددة","تكوين بوابات الجودة والامتثال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SAST","静态应用程序安全测试","代码安全扫描","Semgrep","SonarQube","CodeQL","CI/CD管道"],"ja":["SAST","静的アプリケーションセキュリティテスト","コードセキュリティスキャン","Semgrep","SonarQube","CodeQL","CI/CDパイプライン"],"ko":["SAST","정적 애플리케이션 보안 테스트","코드 보안 스캔","Semgrep","SonarQube","CodeQL","CI/CD 파이프라인"],"es":["pruebas de seguridad estáticas","SAST","configuración de SAST","herramientas de seguridad","seguridad de código","pruebas de código","integración con CI/CD","reglas de seguridad personalizadas"],"fr":["tests de sécurité statiques","SAST","configuration SAST","outils de sécurité","sécurité de code","tests de code","intégration avec CI/CD","règles de sécurité personnalisées"],"de":["statische Sicherheitstests","SAST","SAST-Konfiguration","Sicherheitstools","Codesicherheit","Code-Tests","Integration mit CI/CD","benutzerdefinierte Sicherheitsregeln"],"pt":["SAST","segurança de aplicativos","teste de segurança","ferramentas SAST","configuração SAST","regras de segurança","CI/CD","análise de código"],"ru":["SAST","безопасность приложений","тестирование безопасности","инструменты SAST","настройка SAST","правила безопасности","CI/CD","анализ кода"],"ar":["SAST","أمن التطبيقات","اختبار الأمان","أدوات SAST","تكوين SAST","قواعد الأمان","CI/CD","تحليل الشفرة"]}},"owner":"Dknight203","repo":"AesopIDE","repoPath":"Dknight203/AesopIDE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.542Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sast-configuration","description":"Configure Static Application Security Testing (SAST) tools for automated vulnerability detection in application code. Use when setting up security scanning, implementing DevSecOps practices, or automating code vulnerability detection.","bodyPreview":"# SAST Configuration\n\nStatic Application Security Testing (SAST) tool setup, configuration, and custom rule creation for comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for setting up and configuring SAST tools including Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL. Use this skill when you need to:\n\n- Set up SAST scanning in CI/CD pipelines\n- Create custom security rules for your codebase\n- Configure quality gates and compliance p","body":"# SAST Configuration\n\nStatic Application Security Testing (SAST) tool setup, configuration, and custom rule creation for comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive guidance for setting up and configuring SAST tools including Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL. Use this skill when you need to:\n\n- Set up SAST scanning in CI/CD pipelines\n- Create custom security rules for your codebase\n- Configure quality gates and compliance policies\n- Optimize scan performance and reduce false positives\n- Integrate multiple SAST tools for defense-in-depth\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Semgrep Configuration\n\n- Custom rule creation with pattern matching\n- Language-specific security rules (Python, JavaScript, Go, Java, etc.)\n- CI/CD integration (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins)\n- False positive tuning and rule optimization\n- Organizational policy enforcement\n\n### 2. SonarQube Setup\n\n- Quality gate configuration\n- Security hotspot analysis\n- Code coverage and technical debt tracking\n- Custom quality profiles for languages\n- Enterprise integration with LDAP/SAML\n\n### 3. CodeQL Analysis\n\n- GitHub Advanced Security integration\n- Custom query development\n- Vulnerability variant analysis\n- Security research workflows\n- SARIF result processing\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Initial Assessment\n\n1. Identify primary programming languages in your codebase\n2. Determine compliance requirements (PCI-DSS, SOC 2, etc.)\n3. Choose SAST tool based on language support and integration needs\n4. Review baseline scan to understand current security posture\n\n### Basic Setup\n\n```bash\n# Semgrep quick start\npip install semgrep\nsemgrep --config=auto --error\n\n# SonarQube with Docker\ndocker run -d --name sonarqube -p 9000:9000 sonarqube:latest\n\n# CodeQL CLI setup\ngh extension install github/gh-codeql\ncodeql database create mydb --language=python\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n- [Semgrep Rule Creation](references/semgrep-rules.md) - Pattern-based security rule development\n- [SonarQube Configuration](references/sonarqube-config.md) - Quality gates and profiles\n- [CodeQL Setup Guide](references/codeql-setup.md) - Query development and workflows\n\n## Templates & Assets\n\n- [semgrep-config.yml](assets/semgrep-config.yml) - Production-ready Semgrep configuration\n- [sonarqube-settings.xml](assets/sonarqube-settings.xml) - SonarQube quality profile template\n- [run-sast.sh](scripts/run-sast.sh) - Automated SAST execution script\n\n## Integration Patterns\n\n### CI/CD Pipeline Integration\n\n```yaml\n# GitHub Actions example\n- name: Run Semgrep\n  uses: returntocorp/semgrep-action@v1\n  with:\n    config: >-\n      p/security-audit\n      p/owasp-top-ten\n```\n\n### Pre-commit Hook\n\n```bash\n# .pre-commit-config.yaml\n- repo: https://github.com/returntocorp/semgrep\n  rev: v1.45.0\n  hooks:\n    - id: semgrep\n      args: [''--config=auto'', ''--error'']\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Start with Baseline**\n   - Run initial scan to establish security baseline\n   - Prioritize critical and high severity findings\n   - Create remediation roadmap\n\n2. **Incremental Adoption**\n   - Begin with security-focused rules\n   - Gradually add code quality rules\n   - Implement blocking only for critical issues\n\n3. **False Positive Management**\n   - Document legitimate suppressions\n   - Create allow lists for known safe patterns\n   - Regularly review suppressed findings\n\n4. **Performance Optimization**\n   - Exclude test files and generated code\n   - Use incremental scanning for large codebases\n   - Cache scan results in CI/CD\n\n5. **Team Enablement**\n   - Provide security training for developers\n   - Create internal documentation for common patterns\n   - Establish security champions program\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n### New Project Setup\n\n```bash\n./scripts/run-sast.sh --setup --language python --tools semgrep,sonarqube\n```\n\n### Custom Rule Development\n\n```yaml\n# See references/semgrep-rules.md for detailed examples\nrules:\n  - id: hardcoded-jwt-secret\n    pattern: jwt.encode($DATA, \"...\", ...)\n    message: JWT secret should not be hardcoded\n    severity: ERROR\n```\n\n### Compliance Scanning\n\n```bash\n# PCI-DSS focused scan\nsemgrep --config p/pci-dss --json -o pci-scan-results.json\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### High False Positive Rate\n\n- Review and tune rule sensitivity\n- Add path filters to exclude test files\n- Use nostmt metadata for noisy patterns\n- Create organization-specific rule exceptions\n\n### Performance Issues\n\n- Enable incremental scanning\n- Parallelize scans across modules\n- Optimize rule patterns for efficiency\n- Cache dependencies and scan results\n\n### Integration Failures\n\n- Verify API tokens and credentials\n- Check network connectivity and proxy settings\n- Review SARIF output format compatibility\n- Validate CI/CD runner permissions\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [OWASP Top 10 Checklist](../owasp-top10-checklist/SKILL.md)\n- [Container Security](../container-security/SKILL.md)\n- [Dependency Scanning](../dependency-scanning/SKILL.md)\n\n## Tool Comparison\n\n| Tool      | Best For                 | Language Support | Cost            | Integration   |\n| --------- | ------------------------ | ---------------- | --------------- | ------------- |\n| Semgrep   | Custom rules, fast scans | 30+ languages    | Free/Enterprise | Excellent     |\n| SonarQube | Code quality + security  | 25+ languages    | Free/Commercial | Good          |\n| CodeQL    | Deep analysis, research  | 10+ languages    | Free (OSS)      | GitHub native |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Complete initial SAST tool setup\n2. Run baseline security scan\n3. Create custom rules for organization-specific patterns\n4. Integrate into CI/CD pipeline\n5. Establish security gate policies\n6. Train development team on findings and remediation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T05:00:05.661Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities.","zh":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities.","ja":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities.","ko":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities.","es":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities.","fr":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities.","de":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities.","pt":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Security Agents needing advanced Static Application Security Testing (SAST) configuration and custom rule creation capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and customize SAST tools like Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL, enabling comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages, and creating custom security rules for codebases, while configuring quality gates and compliance protocols.","zh":"Empowers agents to configure and customize SAST tools like Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL, enabling comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages, and creating custom security rules for codebases, while configuring quality gates and compliance protocols.","ja":"Empowers agents to configure and customize SAST tools like Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL, enabling comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages, and creating custom security rules for codebases, while configuring quality gates and compliance protocols.","ko":"Empowers agents to configure and customize SAST tools like Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL, enabling comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages, and creating custom security rules for codebases, while configuring quality gates and compliance protocols.","es":"Empowers agents to configure and customize SAST tools like Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL, enabling comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages, and creating custom security rules for codebases, while configuring quality gates and compliance protocols.","fr":"Empowers agents to configure and customize SAST tools like Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL, enabling comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages, and creating custom security rules for codebases, while configuring quality gates and compliance protocols.","de":"Empowers agents to configure and customize SAST tools like Semgrep, SonarQube, and CodeQL, enabling comprehensive security scanning across multiple programming languages, and creating custom security rules for codebases, while configuring quality gates and co