割和服务配置等功能","ja":"Linkerd PatternsはKubernetes用の軽量級サービスメッシュソリューションで、自動mTLS、トラフィック分割、サービス構成などの機能を提供","ko":"Linkerd Patterns는 Kubernetes용 경량 서비스 메시 솔루션으로 자동 mTLS, 트래픽 분할, 서비스 구성 등의 기능을 제공","es":"Linkerd es un service mesh ligero y seguro para Kubernetes que permite implementar patrones de producción para mejorar la seguridad y el rendimiento","fr":"Linkerd est un service mesh léger et sécurisé pour Kubernetes qui permet de mettre en œuvre des modèles de production pour améliorer la sécurité et les perfo...","de":"Linkerd ist ein leichtes und sicheres Service-Mesh für Kubernetes, das die Implementierung von Produktionsmustern zur Verbesserung von Sicherheit und Leistun...","pt":"Linkerd Patterns fornece padrões de produção para a mesh de serviço leve e segura para Kubernetes","ru":"Шаблоны Linkerd предоставляют шаблоны производства для легковесной служебной сетки для Kubernetes","ar":"أنماط Linkerd توفر أنماط الإنتاج لشبكة الخدمات الخفيفة والأمن لمجموعة Kubernetes","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动mTLS","流量分割","服务配置","重试和超时","多集群服务网格"],"ja":["自動mTLS","トラフィック分割","サービス構成","リトライとタイムアウト","マルチクラスター サービスメッシュ"],"ko":["자동 mTLS","트래픽 분할","서비스 구성","재시도 및 시간 초과","다중 클러스터 서비스 메시"],"es":["Implementación de mTLS automático","Configuración de splits de tráfico para implementaciones de canary","Configuración de perfiles de servicio para métricas por ruta","Implementación de reintentos y timeouts","Soporte para service mesh multi-cluster"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de mTLS automatique","Configuration de splits de trafic pour les déploiements de canary","Configuration de profils de service pour les métriques par route","Mise en œuvre de réessais et de délais d''attente","Prise en charge du service mesh multi-cluster"],"de":["Implementierung von automatischem mTLS","Konfiguration von Trafficsplits für Canary-Deployments","Konfiguration von Service-Profilen für pro-Routen-Metriken","Implementierung von Wiederholungen und Timeouts","Unterstützung für Multi-Cluster-Service-Mesh"],"pt":["Configuração de mesh de serviço leve","Implementação de mTLS automático","Divisão de tráfego para implantações canary","Configuração de perfis de serviço para métricas por rota","Implementação de retries e timeouts","Mesh de serviço multi-cluster"],"ru":["Настройка легковесной служебной сетки","Реализация автоматического mTLS","Разделение трафика для канареечных развертываний","Настройка профилей служб для метрик по маршруту","Реализация повторных запросов и таймаутов","Служебная сетка для нескольких кластеров"],"ar":["تكوين شبكة الخدمات الخفيفة","تنفيذ مTLS التلقائي","تقسيم حركة المرور لتنصيب Canary","تكوين ملفات تعريف الخدمة لمقاييس المسار","تنفيذ إعادة المحاولات والتناقي","شبكة الخدمات متعددة العنقود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Linkerd Patterns","Kubernetes服务网格","轻量级服务网格","自动mTLS","流量分割","服务配置"],"ja":["Linkerd Patterns","Kubernetesサービスメッシュ","軽量級サービスメッシュ","自動mTLS","トラフィック分割","サービス構成"],"ko":["Linkerd Patterns","Kubernetes 서비스 메시","경량 서비스 메시","자동 mTLS","트래픽 분할","서비스 구성"],"es":["Linkerd","Service Mesh","Kubernetes","mTLS","canary deployments","métricas por ruta","reintentos","timeouts","service mesh multi-cluster"],"fr":["Linkerd","Service Mesh","Kubernetes","mTLS","déploiements de canary","métriques par route","réessais","délais d''attente","service mesh multi-cluster"],"de":["Linkerd","Service-Mesh","Kubernetes","mTLS","Canary-Deployments","pro-Routen-Metriken","Wiederholungen","Timeouts","Multi-Cluster-Service-Mesh"],"pt":["Linkerd","mesh de serviço","Kubernetes","mTLS","canary deployments","service profiles","retries e timeouts","multi-cluster"],"ru":["Linkerd","служебная сетка","Kubernetes","mTLS","канареечные развертывания","профили служб","повторные запросы и таймауты","служебная сетка для нескольких кластеров"],"ar":["Linkerd","شبكة الخدمات","Kubernetes","mTLS","تنصيب Canary","ملفات تعريف الخدمة","إعادة المحاولات والتناقي","شبكة الخدمات متعددة العنقود"]}},"owner":"haxllo","repo":"repolens","repoPath":"haxllo/repolens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.181Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"linkerd-patterns","description":"Implement Linkerd service mesh patterns for lightweight, security-focused service mesh deployments. Use when setting up Linkerd, configuring traffic policies, or implementing zero-trust networking with minimal overhead.","bodyPreview":"# Linkerd Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Linkerd service mesh - the lightweight, security-first service mesh for Kubernetes.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up a lightweight service mesh\n- Implementing automatic mTLS\n- Configuring traffic splits for canary deployments\n- Setting up service profiles for per-route metrics\n- Implementing retries and timeouts\n- Multi-cluster service mesh\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Linkerd Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│","body":"# Linkerd Patterns\n\nProduction patterns for Linkerd service mesh - the lightweight, security-first service mesh for Kubernetes.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Setting up a lightweight service mesh\n- Implementing automatic mTLS\n- Configuring traffic splits for canary deployments\n- Setting up service profiles for per-route metrics\n- Implementing retries and timeouts\n- Multi-cluster service mesh\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Linkerd Architecture\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                Control Plane                 │\n│  ┌─────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────────┐ │\n│  │ destiny │ │ identity │ │ proxy-inject │ │\n│  └─────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────────┘ │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                      │\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                 Data Plane                   │\n│  ┌─────┐    ┌─────┐    ┌─────┐             │\n│  │proxy│────│proxy│────│proxy│             │\n│  └─────┘    └─────┘    └─────┘             │\n│     │           │           │               │\n│  ┌──┴──┐    ┌──┴──┐    ┌──┴──┐            │\n│  │ app │    │ app │    │ app │            │\n│  └─────┘    └─────┘    └─────┘            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 2. Key Resources\n\n| Resource                | Purpose                              |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| **ServiceProfile**      | Per-route metrics, retries, timeouts |\n| **TrafficSplit**        | Canary deployments, A/B testing      |\n| **Server**              | Define server-side policies          |\n| **ServerAuthorization** | Access control policies              |\n\n## Templates\n\n### Template 1: Mesh Installation\n\n```bash\n# Install CLI\ncurl --proto ''=https'' --tlsv1.2 -sSfL https://run.linkerd.io/install | sh\n\n# Validate cluster\nlinkerd check --pre\n\n# Install CRDs\nlinkerd install --crds | kubectl apply -f -\n\n# Install control plane\nlinkerd install | kubectl apply -f -\n\n# Verify installation\nlinkerd check\n\n# Install viz extension (optional)\nlinkerd viz install | kubectl apply -f -\n```\n\n### Template 2: Inject Namespace\n\n```yaml\n# Automatic injection for namespace\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: my-app\n  annotations:\n    linkerd.io/inject: enabled\n---\n# Or inject specific deployment\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: my-app\n  annotations:\n    linkerd.io/inject: enabled\nspec:\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      annotations:\n        linkerd.io/inject: enabled\n```\n\n### Template 3: Service Profile with Retries\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: linkerd.io/v1alpha2\nkind: ServiceProfile\nmetadata:\n  name: my-service.my-namespace.svc.cluster.local\n  namespace: my-namespace\nspec:\n  routes:\n    - name: GET /api/users\n      condition:\n        method: GET\n        pathRegex: /api/users\n      responseClasses:\n        - condition:\n            status:\n              min: 500\n              max: 599\n          isFailure: true\n      isRetryable: true\n    - name: POST /api/users\n      condition:\n        method: POST\n        pathRegex: /api/users\n      # POST not retryable by default\n      isRetryable: false\n    - name: GET /api/users/{id}\n      condition:\n        method: GET\n        pathRegex: /api/users/[^/]+\n      timeout: 5s\n      isRetryable: true\n  retryBudget:\n    retryRatio: 0.2\n    minRetriesPerSecond: 10\n    ttl: 10s\n```\n\n### Template 4: Traffic Split (Canary)\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: split.smi-spec.io/v1alpha1\nkind: TrafficSplit\nmetadata:\n  name: my-service-canary\n  namespace: my-namespace\nspec:\n  service: my-service\n  backends:\n    - service: my-service-stable\n      weight: 900m # 90%\n    - service: my-service-canary\n      weight: 100m # 10%\n```\n\n### Template 5: Server Authorization Policy\n\n```yaml\n# Define the server\napiVersion: policy.linkerd.io/v1beta1\nkind: Server\nmetadata:\n  name: my-service-http\n  namespace: my-namespace\nspec:\n  podSelector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: my-service\n  port: http\n  proxyProtocol: HTTP/1\n---\n# Allow traffic from specific clients\napiVersion: policy.linkerd.io/v1beta1\nkind: ServerAuthorization\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-frontend\n  namespace: my-namespace\nspec:\n  server:\n    name: my-service-http\n  client:\n    meshTLS:\n      serviceAccounts:\n        - name: frontend\n          namespace: my-namespace\n---\n# Allow unauthenticated traffic (e.g., from ingress)\napiVersion: policy.linkerd.io/v1beta1\nkind: ServerAuthorization\nmetadata:\n  name: allow-ingress\n  namespace: my-namespace\nspec:\n  server:\n    name: my-service-http\n  client:\n    unauthenticated: true\n    networks:\n      - cidr: 10.0.0.0/8\n```\n\n### Template 6: HTTPRoute for Advanced Routing\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: policy.linkerd.io/v1beta2\nkind: HTTPRoute\nmetadata:\n  name: my-route\n  namespace: my-namespace\nspec:\n  parentRefs:\n    - name: my-service\n      kind: Service\n      group: core\n      port: 8080\n  rules:\n    - matches:\n        - path:\n            type: PathPrefix\n            value: /api/v2\n        - headers:\n            - name: x-api-version\n              value: v2\n      backendRefs:\n        - name: my-service-v2\n          port: 8080\n    - matches:\n        - path:\n            type: PathPrefix\n            value: /api\n      backendRefs:\n        - name: my-service-v1\n          port: 8080\n```\n\n### Template 7: Multi-cluster Setup\n\n```bash\n# On each cluster, install with cluster credentials\nlinkerd multicluster install | kubectl apply -f -\n\n# Link clusters\nlinkerd multicluster link --cluster-name west \\\n  --api-server-address https://west.example.com:6443 \\\n  | kubectl apply -f -\n\n# Export a service to other clusters\nkubectl label svc/my-service mirror.linkerd.io/exported=true\n\n# Verify cross-cluster connectivity\nlinkerd multicluster check\nlinkerd multicluster gateways\n```\n\n## Monitoring Commands\n\n```bash\n# Live traffic view\nlinkerd viz top deploy/my-app\n\n# Per-route metrics\nlinkerd viz routes deploy/my-app\n\n# Check proxy status\nlinkerd viz stat deploy -n my-namespace\n\n# View service dependencies\nlinkerd viz edges deploy -n my-namespace\n\n# Dashboard\nlinkerd viz dashboard\n```\n\n## Debugging\n\n```bash\n# Check injection status\nlinkerd check --proxy -n my-namespace\n\n# View proxy logs\nkubectl logs deploy/my-app -c linkerd-proxy\n\n# Debug identity/TLS\nlinkerd identity -n my-namespace\n\n# Tap traffic (live)\nlinkerd viz tap deploy/my-app --to deploy/my-backend\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Do''s\n\n- **Enable mTLS everywhere** - It''s automatic with Linkerd\n- **Use ServiceProfiles** - Get per-route metrics and retries\n- **Set retry budgets** - Prevent retry storms\n- **Monitor golden metrics** - Success rate, latency, throughput\n\n### Don''ts\n\n- **Don''t skip check** - Always run `linkerd check` after changes\n- **Don''t over-configure** - Linkerd defaults are sensible\n- **Don''t ignore ServiceProfiles** - They unlock advanced features\n- **Don''t forget timeouts** - Set appropriate values per route\n\n## Resources\n\n- [Linkerd Documentation](https://linkerd.io/2.14/overview/)\n- [Service Profiles](https://linkerd.io/2.14/features/service-profiles/)\n- [Authorization Policy](https://linkerd.io/2.14/features/server-policy/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T03:59:09.534Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities.","zh":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities.","ja":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities.","ko":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities.","es":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities.","fr":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities.","de":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities.","pt":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities.","ru":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities.","ar":"Ideal for Kubernetes-focused AI Agents requiring lightweight service mesh integration and automatic mTLS capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement advanced service mesh patterns, including traffic splits for canary deployments, service profiles for per-route metrics, and retries with timeouts, all while leveraging Linkerd''s security-first approach and multi-cluster support.","zh":"Empowers agents to implement advanced service mesh patterns, including traffic splits for canary deployments, service profiles for per-route metrics, and retries with timeouts, all while leveraging Linkerd''s security-first approach and multi-cluster support.","ja":"Empowers agents to implement advanced service mesh patterns, including traffic splits for canary deployments, service profiles for per-route metrics, and retries with timeouts, all while leveraging Linkerd''s security-first approach and multi-cluster support.","ko":"Empowers agents to implement advanced service mesh patterns, including traffic splits for canary deployments, service profiles for per-route metrics, and retries with timeouts, all while leveraging Linkerd''s security-first approach and multi-cluster support.","es":"Empowers agents to implement advanced service mesh patterns, including traffic splits for canary deployments, service profiles for per-route metrics, and retries with timeouts, all while leveraging Linkerd''s security-first approach and multi-cluster support.","fr":"Empowers agents to implement advanced service mesh patterns, including traffic splits for canary deployments, service profiles for per-route metrics, and retries with timeouts, all while leveraging Linkerd''s security-first approach and multi-cluster support.","de":"Empowers agents to implement advanced service mesh patterns, including traffic splits for canary deployments, service profiles for per-route metrics, and retries with timeouts, all while leveraging Linkerd''s security-first approach and multi-cluster support.","pt":"Empowers agents to implement advanced service mesh patterns, including traffic splits for canary deployments, service profiles for per-route metrics, and retries with timeouts, all while leveraging Linkerd''s security-first approach and multi-cluster support.","ru":"Empowers agents to implement advanced service mesh patterns, including traffic splits for canary deployments, service profiles for per-route metrics, and retries with timeouts, all while leveraging Linkerd''s security-first approach and multi-cluste