with 99 guidelines and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks, leveraging searchable databases with priority-based recommendations.","de":"Empowers agents to generate high-performance UI components using 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring UX consistency with 99 guidelines and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks, leveraging searchable databases with priority-based recommendations.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate high-performance UI components using 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring UX consistency with 99 guidelines and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks, leveraging searchable databases with priority-based recommendations.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate high-performance UI components using 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring UX consistency with 99 guidelines and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks, leveraging searchable databases with priority-based recommendations.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate high-performance UI components using 50+ styles, 97 color palettes, and 57 font pairings, while ensuring UX consistency with 99 guidelines and 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks, leveraging searchable databases with priority-based recommendations."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing new UI components or pages with optimized color palettes and typography","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing 99 UX guidelines","Building landing pages or dashboards with 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks"],"zh":["Designing new UI components or pages with optimized color palettes and typography","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing 99 UX guidelines","Building landing pages or dashboards with 25 chart types across 9 technology stacks"],"ja":["Designing new UI components or pages with optimized color palettes and typography","Reviewing code for UX issues and implementing 99 UX guidelines","Building landing pages or dashboards with 25 chart 