n- Moving to next task\n- Delegating to agents\n\n**Rule applies to:**\n- Exact phrases\n- Paraphrases and synonyms\n- Implications of success\n- ANY communication suggesting completion/correctness\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**No shortcuts for verification.**\n\nRun the command. Read the output. THEN claim the result.\n\nThis is non-negotiable.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:17:37.448Z","qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ecojrsg/ecojrsg.dev/brainstorming', 'community', 'ecojrsg', 'ecojrsg.dev', 'ecojrsg/ecojrsg.dev', 'brainstorming', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.544Z', '2026-02-19T07:02:08.744Z', NULL, '{"id":"ecojrsg/ecojrsg.dev/brainstorming","name":"brainstorming","description":{"zh":"脑力激荡技能可以帮助开发者将想法转化为完整的设计和规格","ja":"ブレーンストーミングスキルは、アイデアを完全なデザインと仕様に変えるのに役立ちます","ko":"브레인스토밍 기술은 아이디어를 완전한 디자인과 사양으로 변환하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El brainstorming es una técnica para generar ideas y convertirlas en diseños y especificaciones a través de un diálogo colaborativo","fr":"Le brainstorming est une technique pour générer des idées et les convertir en conceptions et spécifications à travers un dialogue collaboratif","de":"Brainstorming ist eine Technik, um Ideen zu generieren und in Entwürfe und Spezifikationen umzuwandeln, indem man einen kollaborativen Dialog führt","pt":"O brainstorming é uma técnica colaborativa para desenvolver ideias em projetos de software","ru":"Мозговой штурм - это совместный метод для разработки идей в проектах программного обеспечения","ar":"عصف الذهن هو تقنية تعاونية لتطوير الأفكار في مشاريع البرمجيات","en":"Eco_Page | Portfolio personal y blog tipo Bento. Stack: Astro, React y Tailwind. Enfocado en ingeniería de software, infraestructura y entusiasta del hardware."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"脑力激荡技能：将想法转化为设计","ja":"ブレーンストーミングスキル：アイデアをデザインに","ko":"브레인스토밍 기술: 아이디어를 디자인으로","es":"Generador de Ideas: Brainstorming para Desarrolladores","fr":"Générateur d''Idées: Brainstorming pour Développeurs","de":"Ideen-Generator: Brainstorming für Entwickler","pt":"Brainstorming: Desenvolvimento de Ideias em Projetos","ru":"Мозговой штурм: разработка идей в проектах","ar":"عصف الذهن: تطوير الأفكار في المشاريع","en":"brainstorming"},"description":{"zh":"脑力激荡技能可以帮助开发者将想法转化为完整的设计和规格","ja":"ブレーンストーミングスキルは、アイデアを完全なデザインと仕様に変えるのに役立ちます","ko":"브레인스토밍 기술은 아이디어를 완전한 디자인과 사양으로 변환하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El brainstorming es una técnica para generar ideas y convertirlas en diseños y especificaciones a través de un diálogo colaborativo","fr":"Le brainstorming est une technique pour générer des idées et les convertir en conceptions et spécifications à travers un dialogue collaboratif","de":"Brainstorming ist eine Technik, um Ideen zu generieren und in Entwürfe und Spezifikationen umzuwandeln, indem man einen kollaborativen Dialog führt","pt":"O brainstorming é uma técnica colaborativa para desenvolver ideias em projetos de software","ru":"Мозговой штурм - это совместный метод для разработки идей в проектах программного обеспечения","ar":"عصف الذهن هو تقنية تعاونية لتطوير الأفكار في مشاريع البرمجيات","en":"Eco_Page | Portfolio personal y blog tipo Bento. Stack: Astro, React y Tailwind. Enfocado en ingeniería de software, infraestructura y entusiasta del hardware."},"definition":{"en":"Eco_Page | Portfolio personal y blog tipo Bento. Stack: Astro, React y Tailwind. Enfocado en ingeniería de software, infraestructura y entusiasta del hardware."},"features":{"zh":["协作对话","项目背景理解","问题驱动的设计","增量式设计呈现","实时反馈"],"ja":["コラボレーションディアログ","プロジェクトの背景理解","質問駆動のデザイン","インクリメンタルなデザインの提示","リアルタイムのフィードバック"],"ko":["협력 대화","프로젝트 배경 이해","질문 주도 디자인","증분식 디자인 제시","실시간 피드백"],"es":["Generación de ideas a través del diálogo colaborativo","Desarrollo de diseños y especificaciones","Iteración y refinamiento de ideas","Presentación de diseños en secciones","Verificación de la precisión del diseño"],"fr":["Génération d''idées à travers le dialogue collaboratif","Développement de conceptions et de spécifications","Itération et affinement des idées","Présentation des conceptions en sections","Vérification de la précision de la conception"],"de":["Generierung von Ideen durch kollaborativen Dialog","Entwicklung von Entwürfen und Spezifikationen","Iterierung und Verfeinerung von Ideen","Präsentation von Entwürfen in Abschnitten","Überprüfung der Genauigkeit des Entwurfs"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de ideias em projetos de software","Técnica colaborativa para gerar soluções","Refinamento de ideias por meio de diálogo","Apresentação de designs em seções","Verificação de progresso em cada etapa"],"ru":["Разработка идей в проектах программного обеспечения","Совместный метод для генерации решений","Уточнение идей посредством диалога","Презентация дизайнов по секциям","Проверка прогресса на каждом этапе"],"ar":["تطوير الأفكار في مشاريع البرمجيات","تقنية تعاونية لتحفيز الحلول","تحسين الأفكار من خلال الحوار","عرض التصاميم في أقسام","التحقق من التقدم في كل مرحلة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["脑力激荡","设计","开发","协作","项目管理","软件开发","产品设计"],"ja":["ブレーンストーミング","デザイン","開発","コラボレーション","プロジェクトマネジメント","ソフトウェア開発","製品設計"],"ko":["브레인스토밍","디자인","개발","협력","프로젝트 관리","소프트웨어 개발","제품 디자인"],"es":["brainstorming para desarrolladores","generador de ideas","diseño colaborativo","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software","infraestructura","hardware"],"fr":["brainstorming pour développeurs","générateur d''idées","conception collaborative","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels","infrastructure","matériel"],"de":["brainstorming für entwickler","ideen-generator","kollaborativer entwurf","software-entwicklung","software-ingeneering","infrastruktur","hardware"],"pt":["brainstorming para desenvolvedores","desenvolvimento de ideias","técnica colaborativa","projetos de software","geração de soluções","refinamento de ideias"],"ru":["мозговой штурм для разработчиков","разработка идей","совместный метод","проекты программного обеспечения","генерация решений","уточнение идей"],"ar":["عصف الذهن للمطورين","تطوير الأفكار","تقنية تعاونية","مشاريع البرمجيات","تحفيز الحلول","تحسين الأفكار"]}},"owner":"ecojrsg","repo":"ecojrsg.dev","repoPath":"ecojrsg/ecojrsg.dev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.544Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"brainstorming","description":"You MUST use this before any creative work - creating features, building components, adding functionality, or modifying behavior. Explores user intent, requirements and design before implementation.","bodyPreview":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs\n\n## Overview\n\nHelp turn ideas into fully formed designs and specs through natural collaborative dialogue.\n\nStart by understanding the current project context, then ask questions one at a time to refine the idea. Once you understand what you''re building, present the design in small sections (200-300 words), checking after each section whether it looks right so far.\n\n## The Process\n\n**Understanding the idea:**\n- Check out the current project state first (files, d","body":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs\n\n## Overview\n\nHelp turn ideas into fully formed designs and specs through natural collaborative dialogue.\n\nStart by understanding the current project context, then ask questions one at a time to refine the idea. Once you understand what you''re building, present the design in small sections (200-300 words), checking after each section whether it looks right so far.\n\n## The Process\n\n**Understanding the idea:**\n- Check out the current project state first (files, docs, recent commits)\n- Ask questions one at a time to refine the idea\n- Prefer multiple choice questions when possible, but open-ended is fine too\n- Only one question per message - if a topic needs more exploration, break it into multiple questions\n- Focus on understanding: purpose, constraints, success criteria\n\n**Exploring approaches:**\n- Propose 2-3 different approaches with trade-offs\n- Present options conversationally with your recommendation and reasoning\n- Lead with your recommended option and explain why\n\n**Presenting the design:**\n- Once you believe you understand what you''re building, present the design\n- Break it into sections of 200-300 words\n- Ask after each section whether it looks right so far\n- Cover: architecture, components, data flow, error handling, testing\n- Be ready to go back and clarify if something doesn''t make sense\n\n## After the Design\n\n**Documentation:**\n- Write the validated design to `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-design.md`\n- Use elements-of-style:writing-clearly-and-concisely skill if available\n- Commit the design document to git\n\n**Implementation (if continuing):**\n- Ask: \"Ready to set up for implementation?\"\n- Use superpowers:using-git-worktrees to create isolated workspace\n- Use superpowers:writing-plans to create detailed implementation plan\n\n## Key Principles\n\n- **One question at a time** - Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions\n- **Multiple choice preferred** - Easier to answer than open-ended when possible\n- **YAGNI ruthlessly** - Remove unnecessary features from all designs\n- **Explore alternatives** - Always propose 2-3 approaches before settling\n- **Incremental validation** - Present design in sections, validate each\n- **Be flexible** - Go back and clarify when something doesn''t make sense\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:02:08.744Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities.","zh":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities.","ja":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities.","ko":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities.","es":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities.","fr":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities.","de":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities.","pt":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities.","ru":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities.","ar":"Ideal for Conversational Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing collaborative idea refinement and design specification capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration.","zh":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration.","ja":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration.","ko":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration.","es":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration.","fr":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration.","de":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration.","pt":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration.","ru":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration.","ar":"Empowers agents to facilitate natural collaborative dialogue, refining ideas into fully formed designs and specs through iterative questioning and feedback, utilizing technologies like Astro, React, and Tailwind for seamless integration."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"],"zh":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"],"ja":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"],"ko":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"],"es":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"],"fr":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"],"de":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"],"pt":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"],"ru":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"],"ar":["Refining project concepts through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating on software engineering and infrastructure projects"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"],"zh":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"],"ja":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"],"ko":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"],"es":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"],"fr":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"],"de":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"],"pt":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"],"ru":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"],"ar":["Requires understanding of current project context","Limited to text-based dialogue and design presentation"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
