"コード品質と開発効率を向上させる","オープンソースおよびカスタマイズ可能"],"ko":["로컬 개발과 리모트 풀 리퀘스트 지원","전문적인 코드 리뷰 수행","다중 프로그래밍 언어 지원","터미널에 통합","코드 품질과 개발 효율성을 향상시키는","오픈소스 및 사용자 정의 가능"],"es":["Revisión de código profesional y exhaustiva","Compatibilidad con desarrollo local y solicitudes de extracción remotas","Integración con la terminal para una experiencia de usuario fluida","Detección automática de errores y problemas de código","Análisis de código personalizable para satisfacer las necesidades del equipo"],"fr":["Révision de code professionnelle et exhaustive","Compatibilité avec le développement local et les demandes d''extraction à distance","Intégration avec le terminal pour une expérience utilisateur fluide","Détection automatique des erreurs et des problèmes de code","Analyse de code personnalisable pour répondre aux besoins de l''équipe"],"de":["Professionelle und umfassende Code-Überprüfung","Kompatibilität mit lokaler Entwicklung und Remote-Pull-Requests","Integration mit der Terminal für eine flüssige Benutzererfahrung","Automatische Erkennung von Fehlern und Code-Problemen","Anpassbare Code-Analyse, um die Bedürfnisse des Teams zu erfüllen"],"pt":["Revisão de código automatizada","Detecção de erros e melhorias","Suporte a código local e solicitações de pull request remoto","Integração com o terminal","Análise de legibilidade e manutenção do código"],"ru":["Автоматизированная проверка кода","Обнаружение ошибок и улучшений","Поддержка локального кода и удаленных запросов на включение","Интеграция с терминалом","Анализ читаемости и поддержки кода"],"ar":["مراجعة الشفرة الآلية","كشف الأخطاء وتحسينها","دعم الشفرة المحلية والطلبات البعيدة للاستبدال","التكامل مع الطرفية","تحليل القراءة و دعم الشفرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查器","AI代理","代码审查","代码评估","本地开发","远程Pull Request","代码质量","开发效率"],"ja":["コードレビューア","AIエージェント","コードレビュー","コード評価","ローカル開発","リモートプルリクエスト","コード品質","開発効率"],"ko":["코드 리뷰어","AI 에이전트","코드 리뷰","코드 평가","로컬 개발","리모트 풀 리퀘스트","코드 품질","개발 효율성"],"es":["revisión de código","desarrollo de software","IA para desarrollo","Code Reviewer","terminal","desarrollo local","solicitudes de extracción remotas"],"fr":["révision de code","développement de logiciels","IA pour le développement","Code Reviewer","terminal","développement local","demandes d''extraction à distance"],"de":["Code-Überprüfung","Software-Entwicklung","KI für die Entwicklung","Code Reviewer","Terminal","lokale Entwicklung","Remote-Pull-Requests"],"pt":["revisão de código","inteligência artificial","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade do código","legibilidade do código","detecção de erros"],"ru":["проверка кода","искусственный интеллект","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","читаемость кода","обнаружение ошибок"],"ar":["مراجعة الشفرة","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الشفرة","قراءة الشفرة","كشف الأخطاء"]}},"owner":"google-gemini","repo":"gemini-cli","repoPath":"google-gemini/gemini-cli","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.544Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"code-reviewer","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Code Reviewer\n\nThis skill guides the agent in conducting professional and thorough code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Determine Review Target\n*   **Remote PR**: If the user provides a PR number or URL (e.g., \"Review PR #123\"), target that remote PR.\n*   **Local Changes**: If no specific PR is mentioned, or if the user asks to \"review my changes\", target the current local file system states (staged and unstaged changes).\n\n### 2. Preparation\n\n#","body":"# Code Reviewer\n\nThis skill guides the agent in conducting professional and thorough code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Determine Review Target\n*   **Remote PR**: If the user provides a PR number or URL (e.g., \"Review PR #123\"), target that remote PR.\n*   **Local Changes**: If no specific PR is mentioned, or if the user asks to \"review my changes\", target the current local file system states (staged and unstaged changes).\n\n### 2. Preparation\n\n#### For Remote PRs:\n1.  **Checkout**: Use the GitHub CLI to checkout the PR.\n    ```bash\n    gh pr checkout <PR_NUMBER>\n    ```\n2.  **Preflight**: Execute the project''s standard verification suite to catch automated failures early.\n    ```bash\n    npm run preflight\n    ```\n3.  **Context**: Read the PR description and any existing comments to understand the goal and history.\n\n#### For Local Changes:\n1.  **Identify Changes**:\n    *   Check status: `git status`\n    *   Read diffs: `git diff` (working tree) and/or `git diff --staged` (staged).\n2.  **Preflight (Optional)**: If the changes are substantial, ask the user if they want to run `npm run preflight` before reviewing.\n\n### 3. In-Depth Analysis\nAnalyze the code changes based on the following pillars:\n\n*   **Correctness**: Does the code achieve its stated purpose without bugs or logical errors?\n*   **Maintainability**: Is the code clean, well-structured, and easy to understand and modify in the future? Consider factors like code clarity, modularity, and adherence to established design patterns.\n*   **Readability**: Is the code well-commented (where necessary) and consistently formatted according to our project''s coding style guidelines?\n*   **Efficiency**: Are there any obvious performance bottlenecks or resource inefficiencies introduced by the changes?\n*   **Security**: Are there any potential security vulnerabilities or insecure coding practices?\n*   **Edge Cases and Error Handling**: Does the code appropriately handle edge cases and potential errors?\n*   **Testability**: Is the new or modified code adequately covered by tests (even if preflight checks pass)? Suggest additional test cases that would improve coverage or robustness.\n\n### 4. Provide Feedback\n\n#### Structure\n*   **Summary**: A high-level overview of the review.\n*   **Findings**:\n    *   **Critical**: Bugs, security issues, or breaking changes.\n    *   **Improvements**: Suggestions for better code quality or performance.\n    *   **Nitpicks**: Formatting or minor style issues (optional).\n*   **Conclusion**: Clear recommendation (Approved / Request Changes).\n\n#### Tone\n*   Be constructive, professional, and friendly.\n*   Explain *why* a change is requested.\n*   For approvals, acknowledge the specific value of the contribution.\n\n### 5. Cleanup (Remote PRs only)\n*   After the review, ask the user if they want to switch back to the default branch (e.g., `main` or `master`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:19:24.978Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories.","zh":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories.","ja":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories.","ko":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories.","es":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories.","fr":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories.","de":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories.","pt":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories.","ru":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories.","ar":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring thorough code examination and review capabilities for local and remote repositories."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration.","zh":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration.","ja":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration.","ko":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration.","es":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration.","fr":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration.","de":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration.","pt":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration.","ru":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration.","ar":"Empowers agents to conduct professional code reviews for both local development and remote Pull Requests, utilizing features like PR number or URL targeting and analysis of staged and unstaged changes, thereby enhancing collaboration and code quality through efficient review workflows and GitHub integration."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing remote Pull Requests for validation and quality assurance","Analyzing local changes for adherence to coding standards and best practices","Streamlining development workflows through automated code review processes"],"zh":["Reviewing remote Pull Requests for validation and quality assurance","Analyzing local changes for adherence to coding standards and best practices","Streamlining development workflows through automated code review processes"],"ja":["Reviewing remote Pull Requests for validation and quality assurance","Analyzing local changes for adherence to coding standards and best practices","Streamlining development workflows through automated code review processes"],"ko":["Reviewing remote Pull Requests for validation and quality assurance","Analyzing local changes for adherence to coding standa