ля выявления неудач","Исправление неудачных тестов эффективно"],"ar":["تحديد الاختبارات الفاشلة بشكل منهجي","استخدام استراتيجيات التجميع الذكية","تشغيل الاختبارات باستخدام أوامر مثل ''make test''","تحليل الإخراج لتحديد الفشل","تحسين الاختبارات الفاشلة بفعالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["测试修复","失败测试","智能分组","开发效率","CI/CD","自动化测试","软件开发","测试自动化"],"ja":["テスト修復","失敗したテスト","スマートグループ","開発効率","CI/CD","自動テスト","ソフトウェア開発","テスト自動化"],"ko":["테스트 수정","실패한 테스트","스마트 그룹","개발 효율성","CI/CD","자동 테스트","소프트웨어 개발","테스트 자동화"],"es":["reparación de pruebas","tests fallidos","estrategias de agrupación","CI/CD","desarrollo de software","pruebas automatizadas"],"fr":["correction de tests","tests échoués","stratégies de regroupement","CI/CD","développement de logiciels","tests automatisés"],"de":["Testbehebung","fehlgeschlagene Tests","Gruppierungsstrategien","CI/CD","Softwareentwicklung","automatisierte Tests"],"pt":["correção de testes","ferramenta de correção de testes","teste de software","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de software","testes automatizados"],"ru":["исправление тестов","система исправления тестов","тестирование программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","качество программного обеспечения","автоматизированное тестирование"],"ar":["إصلاح الاختبارات","أداة إصلاح الاختبارات","اختبار البرمجيات","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة البرمجيات","اختبارات آلية"]}},"owner":"claudiodearaujo","repo":"IzaCenter","repoPath":"claudiodearaujo/IzaCenter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.544Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"test-fixing","description":"Run tests and systematically fix all failing tests using smart error grouping. Use when user asks to fix failing tests, mentions test failures, runs test suite and failures occur, or requests to make tests pass.","bodyPreview":"# Test Fixing\n\nSystematically identify and fix all failing tests using smart grouping strategies.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Explicitly asks to fix tests (\"fix these tests\", \"make tests pass\")\n- Reports test failures (\"tests are failing\", \"test suite is broken\")\n- Completes implementation and wants tests passing\n- Mentions CI/CD failures due to tests\n\n## Systematic Approach\n\n### 1. Initial Test Run\n\nRun `make test` to identify all failing tests.\n\nAnalyze output for:\n\n- Total number of failures\n- Error t","body":"# Test Fixing\n\nSystematically identify and fix all failing tests using smart grouping strategies.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Explicitly asks to fix tests (\"fix these tests\", \"make tests pass\")\n- Reports test failures (\"tests are failing\", \"test suite is broken\")\n- Completes implementation and wants tests passing\n- Mentions CI/CD failures due to tests\n\n## Systematic Approach\n\n### 1. Initial Test Run\n\nRun `make test` to identify all failing tests.\n\nAnalyze output for:\n\n- Total number of failures\n- Error types and patterns\n- Affected modules/files\n\n### 2. Smart Error Grouping\n\nGroup similar failures by:\n\n- **Error type**: ImportError, AttributeError, AssertionError, etc.\n- **Module/file**: Same file causing multiple test failure\n- **Root cause**: Missing dependencies, API changes, refactoring impacts\n\nPrioritize groups by:\n\n- Number of affected tests (highest impact first)\n- Dependency order (fix infrastructure before functionality)\n\n### 3. Systematic Fixing Process\n\nFor each group (starting with highest impact):\n\n1. **Identify root cause**\n\n   - Read relevant code\n   - Check recent changes with `git diff`\n   - Understand the error pattern\n\n2. **Implement fix**\n\n   - Use Edit tool for code changes\n   - Follow project conventions (see CLAUDE.md)\n   - Make minimal, focused changes\n\n3. **Verify fix**\n\n   - Run subset of tests for this group\n   - Use pytest markers or file patterns:\n     ```bash\n     uv run pytest tests/path/to/test_file.py -v\n     uv run pytest -k \"pattern\" -v\n     ```\n   - Ensure group passes before moving on\n\n4. **Move to next group**\n\n### 4. Fix Order Strategy\n\n**Infrastructure first:**\n\n- Import errors\n- Missing dependencies\n- Configuration issues\n\n**Then API changes:**\n\n- Function signature changes\n- Module reorganization\n- Renamed variables/functions\n\n**Finally, logic issues:**\n\n- Assertion failures\n- Business logic bugs\n- Edge case handling\n\n### 5. Final Verification\n\nAfter all groups fixed:\n\n- Run complete test suite: `make test`\n- Verify no regressions\n- Check test coverage remains intact\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Fix one group at a time\n- Run focused tests after each fix\n- Use `git diff` to understand recent changes\n- Look for patterns in failures\n- Don''t move to next group until current passes\n- Keep changes minimal and focused\n\n## Example Workflow\n\nUser: \"The tests are failing after my refactor\"\n\n1. Run `make test` → 15 failures identified\n2. Group errors:\n   - 8 ImportErrors (module renamed)\n   - 5 AttributeErrors (function signature changed)\n   - 2 AssertionErrors (logic bugs)\n3. Fix ImportErrors first → Run subset → Verify\n4. Fix AttributeErrors → Run subset → Verify\n5. Fix AssertionErrors → Run subset → Verify\n6. Run full suite → All pass ✓\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T07:19:15.454Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing systematic test suite debugging and repair capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要系统测试套件调试和维修功能的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが体系的なテストスイートのデバッグと修復機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"시스템 테스트套件 디버깅 및 수리 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing systematic test suite debugging and repair capabilities.","fr":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing systematic test suite debugging and repair capabilities.","de":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing systematic test suite debugging and repair capabilities.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades de depuração e reparo sistemáticas de conjuntos de testes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, требующих системных возможностей отладки и ремонта наборов тестов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات فحص وتصحيح إصدارات الاختبار بشكل منهجي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to systematically identify and fix failing tests using smart grouping strategies. It provides automated test execution, failure analysis, and targeted repair workflows for CI/CD environments.","zh":"使代理能够使用智能分组策略系统地识别和修复失败的测试。它为CI/CD环境提供自动测试执行、故障分析和有针对性的修复工作流。","ja":"スマートグループ化戦略を使用してエージェントが失敗したテストを体系的に識別および修復できるようにします。CI/CD環境向けの自動テスト実行、障害分析、およびターゲット修復ワークフローを提供します。","ko":"스마트 그룹화 전략을 사용하여 에이전트가 실패한 테스트를 체계적으로 식별하고 수정할 수 있도록 합니다. CI/CD 환경을 위한 자동 테스트 실행, 오류 분석 및 대상 修復 작업 흐름을 제공합니다.","es":"Enables agents to systematically identify and fix failing tests using smart grouping strategies. It provides automated test execution, failure analysis, and targeted repair workflows for CI/CD environments.","fr":"Enables agents to systematically identify and fix failing tests using smart grouping strategies. It provides automated test execution, failure analysis, and targeted repair workflows for CI/CD environments.","de":"Enables agents to systematically identify and fix failing tests using smart grouping strategies. It provides automated test execution, failure analysis, and targeted repair workflows for CI/CD environments.","pt":"Permite que os agentes identifiquem e corrijam testes com falha de forma sistemática, utilizando estratégias de agrupamento inteligentes. Fornece execução de teste automatizada, análise de falhas e fluxos de trabalho de reparo direcionados para ambientes de CI/CD.","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически выявлять и исправлять неудачные тесты, используя умные стратегии группировки. Обеспечивает автоматизированное выполнение тестов, анализ неудач и нацеленные рабочие процессы ремонта для сред CI/CD.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تحديد الاختبارات الفاشلة وتصحيحها بشكل منهجي باستخدام استراتيجيات التجميع الذكية. يوفر تنفيذ الاختبارات الآلي وتحليل الأعطال وعمليات إصلاح مستهدفة للبيئات CI/CD."},"useCases":{"en":["Running comprehensive test suites to identify failures","Analyzing test output for error patterns and grouping strategies","Fixing multiple test failures systematically","Resolving CI/CD pipeline failures due to test issues"],"zh":["运行综合测试套件以识别故障","分析测试输出以获取错误模式和分组策略","系统地修复多个测试故障","解决由于测试问题导致的CI/CD管道故障"],"ja":["失敗を識別するための包括的なテストスイートの実行","エラーパターンとグループ化戦略のためのテスト出力の分析","複数のテスト失敗を体系的に修復する","テストの問題により発生したCI/CDパイプラインの失敗を解決する"],"ko":["실패를 식별하기 위한 포괄적인 테스트套件 실행","오류 패턴 및 그룹화 전략을 위한 테스트 출력 분석","다수의 테스트 실패를 체계적으로 수정","테스트 문제로 인한 CI/CD 파이프라인 실패를 해결"],"es":["Running comprehensive test suites to identify failures","Analyzing test output for error patterns and grouping strategies","Fixing multiple test failures systematically","Resolving CI/CD pipeline failures due to test issues"],"fr":["Running comprehensive test suites to identify failures","Analyzing test output for error patterns and grouping strategies","Fixing multiple test failures systematically","Resolving CI/CD pipeline failures due to test issues"],"de":["Running comprehensive test suites to identify failures","Analyzing test output for error patterns and grouping strategies","Fixing multiple test failures systematically","Resolving CI/CD pipeline failures due to test issues"],"pt":["Executar conjuntos de testes abrangentes para identificar falhas","Analizar a saída do teste para padrões de erro e estratégias de agrupamento","Corrigir várias falhas de teste de forma sistemática","Resolver falhas do pipeline CI/CD devido a problemas de teste"],"ru":["Выполнение комплексных наборов тестов для выявления неудач","Анализ вывода теста на наличие закономерностей ошибок и стратегий группировки","Систематическое исправление нескольких неудач тестов","Исправление неудач в конвейере CI/CD, вызванных проблемами с тестами"],"ar":["تشغيل إصدارات الاختبار الشاملة لتحديد الفشل","تحليل مخرجات الاختبار لأنماط الخطأ واستراتيجيات التجميع","إصلاح عدة فشل في الاختبار بشكل منهجي","حل مشاكل انبوبة CI/CD بسبب مشاكل الاختبار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires test execution environment (make test)","Depends on proper test output analysis","Needs access to test codebase for repairs"],"zh":["需要测试执行环境（make test）","依赖于适当的测试输出分析","需要访问测试代码库以进行维修"],"ja":["テスト実行環境（make test）が必要","適切なテスト出力分析に依存","修復のためにテストコードベースへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["테스트 실행 환경（make test）가 필요","적절한 테스트 출력 분석에 의존","수리가 위해 테스트 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requires test execution environment (make test)","Depends on proper test output analysis","Needs access to test codebase for repairs"],"fr":["Requires test execution environment (make test)","Depends on proper test output analysis","Needs access to test codebase for repairs"],"de":["Requires test execution environment (make test)","Depends on proper test output analysis","Needs access to test codebase for repairs"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de execução de teste (make test)","Depende da análise adequada da saída do teste","Necessita acesso ao código-fonte do teste para reparos"],"ru":["Требуется среда выполнения теста (make test)","Зависит от правильного анализа вывода теста","Требуется доступ к кодовой базе теста для ремонта"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تشغيل الاختبار (make test)","يعتمد على تحليل الإنتاج المناسب للاختبار","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة للاختبار لإصلاح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
