ployment d''App","de":"App Freigabe: Werkzeug für App-Deployment","pt":"Lançar Aplicativo","ru":"Выпуск приложения","ar":"إصدار التطبيق","en":"release-app"},"description":{"zh":"release-app技能是用于发布macOS应用的工具，支持macOS 14+ Sonoma。它可以提取应用版本、验证应用存在并重命名应用","ja":"release-appスキルは、macOSアプリを发布するためのツールです。macOS 14+ Sonomaに対応しています。アプリのバージョンを抽出、アプリの存在を確認、アプリの名前を変更することができます","ko":"release-app 스킬은 macOS 애플리케이션을发布하는 도구입니다. macOS 14+ Sonoma를 지원하며, 애플리케이션 버전을 추출하고, 애플리케이션 존재를 확인하고, 애플리케이션 이름을 변경할 수 있습니다","es":"La herramienta de implementación de app ''release-app'' es una solución para desarrolladores que necesitan automatizar el lanzamiento de aplicaciones en macOS ...","fr":"L''outil de déploiement d''app ''release-app'' est une solution pour les développeurs qui ont besoin d''automatiser le lancement d''applications sur macOS 14+ Sonoma.","de":"Das App-Deployment-Tool ''release-app'' ist eine Lösung für Entwickler, die den Prozess der App-Veröffentlichung auf macOS 14+ Sonoma automatisieren müssen.","pt":"O skill release-app é uma ferramenta simples para lançar aplicativos, extraia versões de nomes de arquivos e renomeie aplicativos com facilidade.","ru":"Навык release-app - это простой инструмент для выпуска приложений, извлечения версий из имен файлов и переименования приложений.","ar":"مهارة release-app هي أداة بسيطة لإصدار التطبيقات، واستخراج الإصدارات من أسماء الملفات وإعادة تسمية التطبيقات بسهولة.","en":"Bộ gõ tiếng Việt đơn giản nhất (native cho mac, viết bằng Swift, support macOS 14+ Sonoma trở lên)"},"definition":{"en":"Bộ gõ tiếng Việt đơn giản nhất (native cho mac, viết bằng Swift, support macOS 14+ Sonoma trở lên)"},"features":{"zh":["提取应用版本","验证应用存在","重命名应用","支持macOS 14+ Sonoma"],"ja":["アプリのバージョンを抽出","アプリの存在を確認","アプリの名前を変更","macOS 14+ Sonomaに対応"],"ko":["애플리케이션 버전 추출","애플리케이션 존재 확인","애플리케이션 이름 변경","macOS 14+ Sonoma 지원"],"es":["Extrae la versión de la aplicación del nombre del archivo","Verifica la existencia de la aplicación","Renombra la aplicación a ''Caffee.app''","Compatible con macOS 14+ Sonoma","Automatiza el proceso de lanzamiento de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Extrait la version de l''application du nom du fichier","Vérifie l''existence de l''application","Renomme l''application en ''Caffee.app''","Compatible avec macOS 14+ Sonoma","Automatise le processus de lancement d''applications"],"de":["Extrahiert die Version der App aus dem Dateinamen","Überprüft die Existenz der App","Benennt die App in ''Caffee.app'' um","Kompatibel mit macOS 14+ Sonoma","Automatisiert den Prozess der App-Veröffentlichung"],"pt":["Extraia versões de nomes de arquivos","Renomeie aplicativos com facilidade","Verifique se o aplicativo existe","Copie e renomeie o aplicativo","Suporte a macOS 14+ Sonoma"],"ru":["Извлеките версии из имен файлов","Переименуйте приложения легко","Проверьте, существует ли приложение","Скопируйте и переименуйте приложение","Поддержка macOS 14+ Sonoma"],"ar":["استخراج الإصدارات من أسماء الملفات","إعادة تسمية التطبيقات بسهولة","تحقق من وجود التطبيق","نسخ وإعادة تسمية التطبيق","دعم macOS 14+ Sonoma"]},"keywords":{"zh":["macOS应用发布","release-app","macOS 14+ Sonoma","应用版本提取","应用存在验证"],"ja":["macOSアプリの发布","release-app","macOS 14+ Sonoma","アプリのバージョン抽出","アプリの存在確認"],"ko":["macOS 애플리케이션发布","release-app","macOS 14+ Sonoma","애플리케이션 버전 추출","애플리케이션 존재 확인"],"es":["herramienta de implementación de app","macOS 14+ Sonoma","automatización de lanzamiento de aplicaciones","desarrollo de aplicaciones","deploy de aplicaciones","release-app"],"fr":["outil de déploiement d''app","macOS 14+ Sonoma","automatisation du lancement d''applications","développement d''applications","déploiement d''applications","release-app"],"de":["App-Deployment-Tool","macOS 14+ Sonoma","Automatisierung der App-Veröffentlichung","App-Entwicklung","App-Deploy","release-app"],"pt":["lançar aplicativo","extraia versões","renomeie aplicativos","macOS 14+ Sonoma","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["выпуск приложения","извлечь версии","переименовать приложения","macOS 14+ Sonoma","разработка приложений","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["إصدار التطبيق","استخراج الإصدارات","إعادة تسمية التطبيقات","macOS 14+ Sonoma","تطوير التطبيقات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"khanhicetea","repo":"Caffee","repoPath":"khanhicetea/Caffee","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.183Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-app","description":"Automate the release process for Caffee app.","bodyPreview":"## Instructions\n\nWhen the user invokes this skill with an app path:\n\n1. **Extract version from filename**\n   - The app filename format is `Caffee-v{VERSION}.app` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.app`)\n   - Extract the version string including the ''v'' prefix (e.g., `v1.18.0`)\n   - Also extract just the number part for display (e.g., `1.18.0`)\n\n2. **Verify the app exists**\n   - Check if the provided app path exists\n   - If not, report error and stop\n\n3. **Rename app to Caffee.app**\n   - Copy/rename the app","body":"## Instructions\n\nWhen the user invokes this skill with an app path:\n\n1. **Extract version from filename**\n   - The app filename format is `Caffee-v{VERSION}.app` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.app`)\n   - Extract the version string including the ''v'' prefix (e.g., `v1.18.0`)\n   - Also extract just the number part for display (e.g., `1.18.0`)\n\n2. **Verify the app exists**\n   - Check if the provided app path exists\n   - If not, report error and stop\n\n3. **Rename app to Caffee.app**\n   - Copy/rename the app to `Caffee.app` in the same directory\n   - This ensures consistent naming when users install the app\n   - Example: `cp -R ~/Documents/Caffee-v1.18.0 ~/Documents/Caffee.app`\n\n4. **Create DMG**\n   - Run: `create-dmg Caffee.app .` (use the renamed Caffee.app)  (use which for get path)\n   - This creates a DMG in the current directory\n   - Rename the output to `Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg` (e.g., `Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg`)\n   - Clean up: remove the temporary Caffee.app copy\n\n5. **Sign the DMG**\n   - Run: `sign_update Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg` (use which for get path)\n   - Capture the output which contains:\n     - `sparkle:edSignature=\"...\"`\n     - `length=\"...\"`\n   - Parse and extract the signature and file size\n\n6. **Get file size and checksum**\n   - Get file size: `stat -f%z Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n   - Get SHA256 checksum: `shasum -a 256 Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n\n7. **Update web/appcast.xml**\n   - Add a new `<item>` element at the top of the channel (before existing items)\n   - Use current date in RFC 2822 format for pubDate\n   - The download URL format: `https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/{VERSION}/Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n   - Include the signature and length from sign_update output\n   - If release notes provided, use them; otherwise generate from git log since previous version\n   - the <sparkle:version> should be integer, e.g., 11901 (1.19.1 => 1*10000 + 19*100 + 1)\n\n8. **Update web/index.html**\n   - Update the download button version text and link\n   - Add new release notes entry in the Release Notes section with checksum\n   - Release notes (changelogs) translate into Vietnamese\n\n9. **Update web/download.html**\n   - Update the meta refresh URL to point to the new DMG release\n   - Update the direct download link in the body\n   - URL format: `https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/{VERSION}/Caffee-{VERSION}.dmg`\n\n10. **Summary**\n   - Show summary of what was done\n   - Show the DMG path for upload to GitHub\n   - Remind user to:\n     - Upload DMG to GitHub releases at the tag `{VERSION}`\n     - Deploy updated web files\n\n## Example appcast.xml item format\n\n```xml\n<item>\n  <title>Version 1.18.0</title>\n  <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>\n  <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.18.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>\n  <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2026 12:00:00 +0700</pubDate>\n  <enclosure\n    url=\"https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n    sparkle:edSignature=\"SIGNATURE_HERE\"\n    length=\"12345678\"\n    type=\"application/octet-stream\"\n  />\n  <description><![CDATA[\n    <h2>What''s New</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Release notes here</li>\n    </ul>\n  ]]></description>\n</item>\n```\n\n## Example index.html updates\n\nDownload button (around line 64):\n```html\n<button class=\"secondary\" onclick=\"location.href=''/download.html?v=1.18.0''\">\n    Tải app tại đây (v1.18.0)\n</button>\n```\n\nRelease notes section (after line 240):\n```html\n<div>\n    <h5>v1.18.0</h5>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Checksum sha256 (Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg) :\n            <code>CHECKSUM_HERE</code>\n        </li>\n        <li>Release notes here</li>\n    </ul>\n    <hr />\n</div>\n```\n\n## Example download.html updates\n\nMeta refresh tag (line 9):\n```html\n<meta\n    http-equiv=\"refresh\"\n    content=\"2; URL=https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n/>\n```\n\nDirect download link (line 24):\n```html\n<a\n    href=\"https://github.com/khanhicetea/Caffee/releases/download/v1.18.0/Caffee-v1.18.0.dmg\"\n    >bấm vào đây để tải ngay</a\n>\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T06:01:06.047Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning.","zh":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning.","ja":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning.","ko":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning.","es":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning.","fr":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning.","de":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning.","pt":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning.","ru":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning.","ar":"Ideal for macOS-focused AI Agents requiring streamlined app release management and versioning."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display.","zh":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display.","ja":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display.","ko":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display.","es":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display.","fr":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display.","de":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display.","pt":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display.","ru":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display.","ar":"Empowers agents to automate app renaming and version extraction using Swift, supporting macOS 14+ Sonoma and beyond, with precise filename parsing for ''v'' prefixed version strings and numerical display."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"],"zh":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"],"ja":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"],"ko":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"],"es":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"],"fr":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"],"de":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"],"pt":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"],"ru":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"],"ar":["Automating app versioning for macOS releases","Extracting version numbers from filenames for logging","Renaming apps to standardized formats for distribution"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"zh":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"ja":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"ko":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"es":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"fr":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"de":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"pt":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"ru":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"],"ar":["Requires macOS 14+ Sonoma or later","Limited to Swift-compatible environments","App filename must follow ''Caffee-v{VERSION}.app'' format"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
