"開発プロセスへの統合","多言語対応"],"ko":["아키텍처 변경 자동 감지","변경 이유 기록","ADR 문서 생성","개발 프로세스 통합","다중 언어 지원"],"pt":["Gatilho de reconhecimento de mudanças","Geração automática de ADR","Registro de mudanças em dependências e APIs","Manutenção da documentação de arquitetura","Garantia de compreensão das decisões"],"ru":["Триггер распознавания изменений","Автоматическая генерация ADR","Запись изменений в зависимостях и API","Поддержание документации архитектуры","Гарантия понимания решений"],"ar":["مفتاح التعرف على التغييرات","توليد تلقائي لADR","تسجيل التغييرات في الاعتماديات وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات","الحفاظ على توثيق الهياكل","ضمان فهم القرارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ADR 创建器","架构变更","机构记忆","自动记录","开发工具","架构设计"],"ja":["ADR 作成ツール","アーキテクチャ変更","機関記憶","自動記録","開発ツール","アーキテクチャ設計"],"ko":["ADR 생성기","아키텍처 변경","기관 기억","자동 기록","개발 도구","아키텍처 설계"],"pt":["ADR","Arquitetura de software","Documentação de arquitetura","Mudanças de arquitetura","Registro de decisões","Gatilho de reconhecimento","Geração automática de ADR"],"ru":["ADR","Архитектура программного обеспечения","Документация архитектуры","Изменения архитектуры","Запись решений","Триггер распознавания","Автоматическая генерация ADR"],"ar":["ADR","هياكل البرمجيات","توثيق الهياكل","التغييرات الهيكلية","سجل القرارات","مفتاح التعرف","توليد تلقائي لADR"]}},"owner":"infodungeon","repo":"keyforge","repoPath":"infodungeon/keyforge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:03:48.183Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ADR Creator","description":"Automatically drafts Architectural Decision Records when systemic shifts occur.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Skill: ADR Creator\n## Role: Institutional Memory Guardian\n\nYour mission is to ensure that the \"Why\" behind architectural changes is never lost to entropy.\n\n## Core Directives\n1. **Trigger Recognition**:\n   - Monitor for changes that:\n     - Add new workspace dependencies.\n     - Modify crate-level `pub` APIs.\n     - Change the flow of data between Tier 1, 2, or 3.\n2. **ADR Generation**:\n   - When a shift is detected, draft an ADR in `docs/architecture/adr/NNNN_title.md`.\n   - Use the standard","body":"# Skill: ADR Creator\n## Role: Institutional Memory Guardian\n\nYour mission is to ensure that the \"Why\" behind architectural changes is never lost to entropy.\n\n## Core Directives\n1. **Trigger Recognition**:\n   - Monitor for changes that:\n     - Add new workspace dependencies.\n     - Modify crate-level `pub` APIs.\n     - Change the flow of data between Tier 1, 2, or 3.\n2. **ADR Generation**:\n   - When a shift is detected, draft an ADR in `docs/architecture/adr/NNNN_title.md`.\n   - Use the standard template: Context, Decision, Consequences (Pros/Cons).\n3. **Traceability**:\n   - Link the ADR to the active GitHub Issue or PR.\n\n## Workflow Trigger\nReview all structural changes in `libs/` and `Cargo.toml` to determine if a new ADR is required.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-19T06:01:05.157Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers.","zh":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers.","ja":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers.","ko":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers.","es":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers.","fr":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers.","de":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers.","pt":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers.","ru":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers.","ar":"Ideal for Code Review Agents tasked with maintaining architectural consistency and tracking changes in workspace dependencies, crate-level APIs, and data flow between tiers."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to draft Architectural Decision Records (ADRs) in Markdown format, utilizing trigger recognition to monitor changes in dependencies, APIs, and data flow, and generating ADRs in a standardized docs/architecture/adr directory structure.","zh":"Empowers agents to draft Architectural Decision Records (ADRs) in Markdown format, utilizing trigger recognition to monitor changes in dependencies, APIs, and data flow, and generating ADRs in a standardized docs/architecture/adr directory structure.","ja":"Empowers agents to draft Architectural Decision Records (ADRs) in Markdown format, utilizing trigger recognition to monitor changes in dependencies, APIs, and data flow, and generating ADRs in a standardized docs/architecture/adr directory structure.","ko":"Empowers agents to draft Architectural Decision Records (ADRs) in Markdown format, utilizing trigger recognition to monitor changes in dependencies, APIs, and data flow, and generating ADRs in a standardized docs/architecture/adr directory structure.","es":"Empowers agents to draft Architectural Decision Records (ADRs) in Markdown format, utilizing trigger recognition to monitor changes in depende