stion and randomized batching on retake, all aligned with evals-aligned questions and the ''Specs Are the New Syntax'' protocol.","fr":"Empowers agents to generate interactive college-level quizzes with 50 total questions, leveraging automated answer redistribution and intelligent explanation regeneration, while providing immediate feedback per question and randomized batching on retake, all aligned with evals-aligned questions and the ''Specs Are the New Syntax'' protocol.","de":"Empowers agents to generate interactive college-level quizzes with 50 total questions, leveraging automated answer redistribution and intelligent explanation regeneration, while providing immediate feedback per question and randomized batching on retake, all aligned with evals-aligned questions and the ''Specs Are the New Syntax'' protocol.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate interactive college-level quizzes with 50 total questions, leveraging automated answer redistribution and intelligent explanation regeneration, while providing immediate feedback per question and randomized batching on retake, all aligned with evals-aligned questions and the ''Specs Are the New Syntax'' protocol.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate interactive college-level quizzes with 50 total questions, leveraging automated answer redistribution and intelligent explanation regeneration, while providing immediate feedback per question and randomized batching on retake, all aligned with evals-aligned questions and the ''Specs Are the New Syntax'' protocol.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate interactive college-level quizzes with 50 total questions, leveraging automated answer redistribution and intelligent explanation regeneration, while providing immediate feedback per question and randomized batching on retake, all aligned with evals-aligned questions and the ''Specs Are the New Syntax'' protocol."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating interactive chapter assessments for college-level courses","Automating answer redistribution with intelligent explanation regeneration for enhanced student feedback","Creating randomized quiz batches for retake assessments to minimize cheating and promote authentic learning"],"zh":["Generating interactive chapter assessments for college-level courses","Automating answer redistribution with intelligent explanation regeneration for enhanced student feedback","Creating randomized quiz batches for retake assessments to minimize cheating and promote authentic learning"],"ja":["Generating interactive chapter assessments for college-level courses","Automating answer redistribution with intelligent explanation regeneration for enhanced student feedback","Creating randomized quiz batches for retake assessments to minimize cheating and promote authentic learning"],"ko":["Generating interactive chapter assessments for college-level courses","Automating answer redistribution with intelligent explanation regeneration for enhanced student feedback","Creating randomized quiz batches for retake assessments to minimize cheating and promote authentic learning"],"es":["Generating interactive chapter assessments for college-level courses","Automating answer redistribution with intelligent explanation regeneration for enhanced student feedback","Creating randomized quiz batches for retake assessments to minimize cheating and promote authentic learning"],"fr":["Generating interactive chapter assessments for college-level courses","Automating answer redistribution with intelligent explanation regeneration for enhanced student feedback","Creating randomized quiz batches for retake assessments to minimize cheating and promote authentic learning"],"de":["Generating interactive chapter assessments for college-level courses","Automating answer redistribution with intelligent explanation regeneration for enhanced student feedback","Creating randomized quiz batches for retake assessments to minimize cheating and promote authentic learning"],"pt":["Generating interactive chapter asse